window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2101,"title":"Chapter 2101 New skill idea","paragraphs":["2101 New skill idea","When he had swallowed the dragon pearl earlier, it got stuck in his throat.","If the wisdom fruit also got stuck in his throat, it would be a huge waste. Because of that, the black-skinned Soft Feather could not help but voice her concerns.","Song Shuhang: “...”","It was fine until the black-skinned Soft Feather didn’t mention it, but when she did, Song Shuhang felt his throat clog up.","!!","It was as if a stick had been shoved down his throat.","“It really did get stuck in Senior Song’s throat. What a waste. Why don’t you give it to me? No, wait, I’m an inner demon, so I might not be able to eat it either. Senior Song, how about you give it to Sixteen?” the black-skinned Soft Feather suggested.","Song Shuhang, while choking, raised his head and looked up at the sky. He was seriously considering pushing out the wisdom fruit.","“It’s okay, don’t panic,” Pavilion Master Chu comforted Song Shuhang, her expression solemn. “Since this fruit contains wisdom and knowledge, maybe you can digest it despite your condition.”","Song Shuhang looked puzzled.","“After all, it is the brain that consumes knowledge. You can try to digest the fruit with your brain,” Pavilion Master Chu said seriously. She then added, “Unless... you have no brain.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Whose brain can digest food? Senior Chu, you’re just pushing me into a corner and forcing me to say that I have no brain. I’m being serious when I said that I was pretty good at studies!","The wisdom fruit was still stuck in his throat, which left him somewhat uncomfortable.","Forget it. It seems that I’ve got no luck with this treasure.","I can only push it back out.","Song Shuhang brought his hands to his throat, ready to push out the fruit.","But then, the fruit melted on its own, turning into strands of energy that merged into Song Shuhang’s head.","With the energy from the fruit, Song Shuhang felt his head become much clearer. At the same time, a lot of “knowledge” poured into his mind.","Some of this knowledge was already present in Song Shuhang’s mind, but with the integration of the wisdom fruit’s energy, he seemed to have been suddenly enlightened on some of the bits he could not understand beforehand.","There was also a large amount of cultivation-related theoretical knowledge, which belonged to the wooden body, that poured into Song Shuhang’s mind.","This wooden body was truly special.","It had been personally collected by the Heavenly Emperor, and before it lost its head, it should have been in the Eighth Stage Realm at the very least. The amount of knowledge stored inside it was pretty high.","Additionally, it seemed to be able to sense Song Shuhang’s current state as the knowledge passed on from the wisdom fruit was very targeted—it was exactly the pieces of knowledge that Song Shuhang was lacking and needed desperately.","The knowledge that appeared in his mind could only be used to understand the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and nothing else. The amount of knowledge that could be stored inside a wisdom fruit was limited, so it didn’t add anything extra.","It appeared that in the depths of the wooden body, there were still traces of its old consciousness.","Heh, maybe I can rend Senior Chu’s heart in a while. After all, I’m digesting the wisdom fruit with my mind!","Still, it’s a pity that the knowledge that can be stored inside the wisdom fruit is limited. Otherwise, I could’ve become a knowledgeable senior in one go.","“No, I shouldn’t be too greedy.” Song Shuhang shook his head.","Greed is a part of human nature. Once you have something, you naturally come to want more.","Having greed for knowledge was a good thing but sometimes, one’s greed must be restrained.","Obtaining knowledge through wisdom fruit was not the proper way, after all. True knowledge must be learned by oneself, and so he should not rely too much on such means.","But it was no problem to use it occasionally to assist him, similar to how he borrowed those CPUs in the past.","While Song Shuhang was in thought, the entire wisdom fruit was absorbed by him.","“It worked.” Song Shuhang smiled.","Sister White Dragon nodded slightly. “It seems that this wisdom fruit does not need to be digested. Its structure seems to be similar to pure energy.”","“Does that mean I can eat it too?” The black-skinned Soft Feather’s eyes lit up. Her eyes then refocused on Song Shuhang’s waist.","Sixteen also looked at the waist of Song Shuhang’s wooden body.","There, two small flower buds had begun growing where the wisdom fruit had been plucked off.","The rate at which they were growing was very slow, clearly different from the fruits on other branches.","It seems that these two buds were also wisdom fruit.","After plucking one, two could be born.","After picking two in the future, would there then be four?","“Senior Chu.” Song Shuhang laughed and was about to rend Pavilion Master Chu’s heart.","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “What’s up?”","Song Shuhang said seriously, “N-nothing. I just wanted to say that my knowledge reserve seems to have become very rich. I might be able to understand the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? now. Senior Chu, Sister White Dragon, let’s try to continue with our deduction.”","The main reason he changed his mind was that Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair was still on his head. For an instant, it was no longer soft but became as sharp as a blade, and there was a faint sense of danger that assaulted his senses.","Song Shuhang felt his scalp turn numb, so he immediately changed his wording.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair had many abilities, and it should not be underestimated.","This was the hair of an Immortal, and when necessary, spiritual energy could be poured into it, and it could become as sharp as a divine weapon.","When he fought against enemies in the future, he could consider crashing into them head-first.","Before his head reached the enemy, he could pour spiritual energy into Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, making it as sharp as a sword.","Watch me poke you to death!","An Immortal’s hair came with its own defense-breaking ability, and ordinary defenses of the Sixth, or even Seventh, Stage would not be able to hold against it.","The more Song Shuhang thought about it, the more he liked the idea.","...","Sister White Dragon suddenly said, “Someone is coming.”","Two and a half days after Song Shuhang and his group entered this small world made of crystals, the first trial taker finally appeared.","This just went to show how valuable the passage opened by Senior Divine Dragon was.","It saved Song Shuhang a day or two.","Someone else is here. Song Shuhang cheered up.","In a while, the other trial takers will also have to arrange the crystals, right?","After Song Shuhang’s consciousness went to see the owner of the crystal room, the crystals in this place returned to their original state and went back to being all over the place, waiting for the next trial taker to arrange them.","It should take quite some time for them to arrange the one hundred thousand crystals correctly, right?","He, the first Sage in a thousand years, had a secret technique that could quickly arrange the crystals in the correct order.","It would take a single Ninth Stage spirit stone to pay for his service.","So, how about considering the caring service of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?","...","Song Shuhang came up with several other lines in his mind in an attempt to imitate the Almighty Merchant.","This was another reason he wanted to stay and wait for other trial takers.","Anyway, amid the sharp sound of crystals moving about, a new trial taker appeared.","It turned out to be an old acquaintance, Daoist Turntable.","Old acquaintances were wonderful as it was easier to trade with them. Song Shuhang had a bright smile on his face, ready to meet the other party.","At this time, a sphere appeared around him and Sixteen. Then, spatial energy was activated.","After being transferred to this special spherical space, they stayed suspended in the air, isolated from the rest of the world.","“F*ck, just when I came up with an idea to make money.” Song Shuhang’s heart felt stifled."]},{"number":2102,"title":"Chapter 2102 Seeing again the Learning God System","paragraphs":["2102 Seeing again the Learning God System","Am I doomed to have no talent for doing business?","Am I overlooking something?","Song Shuhang thought hard about the differences between himself and the Almighty Merchant.","While Daoist Turntable carefully arranged the 100,000 crystals, Song Shuhang’s eyes suddenly lit up.","!!","“I feel as if you’re thinking of something foolish, Shuhang,” said Pavilion Master Chu. Due to her strand of hair being placed on top of Song Shuhang’s head, she could, at times, intercept his brain waves and get to know what he was thinking.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pulled out a sheet from his magic bracelet, which he then wrapped around his body. This sheet was an imitation of the Almighty Merchant’s sheet made by Senior White Two. As a product of a ruler of the Netherworld, its quality was pretty high.","The sheet was big enough to completely cover his huge wooden body. Only his eyes and Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair were left outside.","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Su Clan’s Sixteen: “...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","“Does Senior Song like this sheet as much as my main body?” the black-skinned Soft Feather said with slight worry. “Actually, I feel a little frustrated after seeing this sheet.”","Her main body felt that the Almighty Merchant looked very appealing when he was wrapped up in this sheet, so she bought a similar sheet and give it to her dad.","When thinking about her main body and their father sitting side by side while rolled up in this kind of sheet, the black-skinned Soft Feather felt that their father’s handsome bearing was completely ruined.","Song Shuhang sighed. “In this era where emotions have gone cold, only this sheet can bring me some warmth.”","Sister White Dragon said, “Stupid.”","“I was just trying to imitate the Almighty Merchant’s tone, although I changed my tone a little.” Song Shuhang smiled slightly and said, “When I need warmth, I don’t need a sheet.”","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “Do you rely on love to keep yourself warm?”","Song Shuhang said proudly, “No, I can simply shine like a star and emit heat.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather sighed. “Senior Song, you are hopeless.”","Song Shuhang said, “Context is important. Although I do have a thick face, I’m not really that unhinged.”","Sixteen quietly changed the subject. “Then Shuhang, why did you wrap that sheet around your body?”","Song Shuhang said, “Actually, I just want to be a businessman.”","Unfortunately, even if he put on the special sheet made by Senior White Two, he could not change professions.","“A businessman?” The black-skinned Soft Feather looked at Song Shuhang curiously.","Song Shuhang sighed. “A man cannot be without money.”","While money wasn’t everything, one couldn’t do much without it.","Song Shuhang did not want too much. He just hoped that his pockets weren’t always so empty. At the very least, he wanted to have a few spirit stones, enough for daily expenses.","During the Chinese New Year, when he would have to give gifts to his juniors and disciples, he hoped to have enough spirit stones.","His request was so small that it would make other people feel pity for him.","Sixteen asked curiously, “What are you going to sell?”","“I’m going to sell skills,” Song Shuhang said seriously. “My ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? can arrange the 100,000 crystals in a short period of time. If I were to offer my services for one Ninth Stage spirit stone, do you think that Daoist Turntable would be willing to buy my service?”","Sister White Dragon said slowly, “If you stare at Daoist Turntable with that gaze of yours, he will definitely be willing to pay you.”","Considering that Daoist Turntable was a Seventh Stage Venerable, he definitely had a rich knowledge of magical techniques, way higher than what Song Shuhang thought.","There was no way he was going to arrange the 100,000 crystals one by one with his hands.","For this reason, he would never pay a Ninth Stage spirit stone for a method to arrange the crystals.","That was, of course, unless Song Shuhang pressured him with his gaze, forcing him to buy his service.","While they were chatting, Daoist Turntable began using a magical technique.","He stretched out his hand and lightly touched his forehead.","A rune similar to the character [王] appeared on his forehead. He was a tiger cultivator, and this rune was a magical technique he created by making use of his innate skills.","After the rune appeared, it began dividing itself, turning into smaller runes.","Within a few breaths, over ten thousand small runes had appeared.","“Go!” Daoist Turntable stretched out his hand, and the over ten thousand runes floated toward the 100,000 crystals.","A few seconds later, the 100,000 crystals were all arranged correctly.","A real Seventh Stage Venerable would be respected and regarded as a “Senior” regardless of where he was. They knew a lot about magical techniques and had hundreds of techniques at their disposal.","“See?” Pavilion Master Chu said, “Those are means that a Seventh Stage Venerable should have.”","Sister White Dragon added, “No matter what, you’re already close to ascending to the Seventh Stage Realm and your way to condense a nascent soul. You can’t just continue relying on only the Lightning Palm and the Lightning Drawing Technique.”","Song Shuhang silently grabbed his sheet and buried his head inside it. Fortunately, he did not sell his services to Daoist Turntable, or he would have simply embarrassed himself.","I’m sorry. I’ve brought shame to all Sixth Stage True Monarchs.","And not too long from now, I might bring shame to Seventh Stage Venerables as well.","“Buzz~”","The sound of crystals resonating could be heard.","After the one hundred thousand crystals were correctly arranged, they began to resonate, and then formed the basic volume of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","Sixteen, the black-skinned Soft Feather, Sister White Dragon, and Pavilion Master Chu once again saw the full version of this body-tempering technique, which was famous across the universe.","Sixteen asked, “Are we stealing the technique by doing this?”","...","She had seen the content of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? twice, and with her memory as a cultivator, she had naturally memorized the whole cultivation technique. As long as she was willing, she could start practicing this cultivation technique later.","The same was true for the black-skinned Soft Feather. Although she was an inner demon, she could pass on the content of this cultivation technique to her main body, and her main body could then practice the technique.","It was even more so for Sister White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu. With them having reached the Immortal Realm, after reading it once, as long as they wanted to practice the technique, they could quickly cultivate it to a very high level.","“It should not count as such. We entered Garre Holy Mountain’s trial without cheating, and we obtained the complete ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? through proper means,” Song Shuhang said. “Sixteen, Soft Feather, you can both try to practice this cultivation technique. Once you start, I’ll see if I can get you a holy ape from Senior White Two, so that you can start practicing the technique right away.”","This way, the hard work of having to condense the first holy ape could be skipped directly.","While speaking, Song Shuhang stared at the shining crystals.","He wanted to see if he could enter that crystal room again and meet that senior.","In doing so, his mental energy gathered.","In his consciousness, a three-dimensional Calabash brother emerged.","“Huh?” Song Shuhang raised his eyebrows.","Isn’t this the Learning God System that Senior White branded on my body before?","...","It was originally branded on my waist... Do I still have the Learning God System even though my body is gone?"]},{"number":2103,"title":"Chapter 2103 The holy apes give birth to dragons","paragraphs":["2103 The holy apes give birth to dragons","Song Shuhang’s entire cultivation system had been stored inside the blood of the Scholarly Sage.","However, the same was not true for the Learning God System.","Theoretically speaking, it should have been destroyed by the Heavenly Punishment along with his original body.","Yet, this creation of Senior White turned out to be really special.","It was not simply branded on his waist, and even if Song Shuhang’s body was completely obliterated, it still remained with him.","“Anyway, I did not activate the Learning God System, so why did it suddenly appear?” Song Shuhang mused.","While he was in thought, the 3D figure in his mind spread out.","Song Shuhang was brought into the Learning God System.","When he was in, he understood why the Learning God System was activated; it was due to the colorful wisdom fruit.","At the center of the Learning God System’s inner space, a projection of the colorful wisdom fruit was spinning around.","It was as if a USB flash drive full of learning materials had been connected to the Learning God System to enrich its library.","“I understand now.”","That fruit contained some of the knowledge in Song Shuhang’s mind, and after the wooden body processed it, its knowledge was also added to the mix.","While it was at it, it also got a hold of Senior White’s Learning God System, which was once branded on his waist.","The fundamental knowledge of the wooden body that Shuhang got from the wisdom fruit was systematically sorted out once again.","The profound knowledge in Song Shuhang’s mind was initially interpreted and transformed by the wooden body, and then further processed by the Learning God System.","The Learning God System started, and the learning mode was activated.","[Beginning to import foreign learning materials. Entering the first course. To build a top-notch student, the Learning God System is at your service.]","The voice was dubbed by Senior White himself.","If one failed, the Learning God System would punish the user according to their endurance.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Song Shuhang’s eyes lost focus, and he fell into a trance again.","Sister White Dragon said softly, “Shuhang’s consciousness has drifted somewhere else.”","Pavilion Master Chu guessed, “His consciousness did not enter that crystal room again, did it?”","Sister White Dragon said, “It doesn’t feel like it. Perhaps he comprehended something...”","The black-skinned Soft Feather thought for a while and said, “Could it be that Senior Song got infected by the mind-wandering disease that Senior White has? He’s recently been falling into this state where his mind wanders quite frequently.”","Sixteen comforted her, “Don’t worry. Shuhang at least doesn’t fall to the ground, so we don’t have to be too wary of him getting distracted.”","Song Shuhang was distracted for nearly an hour.","Daoist Turntable was the same. His eyes lost focus, and his consciousness entered the secret crystal room.","The small crystal world returned to silence.","<img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" /><img class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/13.1.0/svg/2744.svg\" alt=\"??\" />","Sixteen was bored. She gazed at the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? in the air, but because she did not start practicing it, she could not enter the crystal room.","The black-skinned Soft Feather looked at Song Shuhang curiously, seemingly engrossed with his state.","Time passed little by little.","“Huh? Look, something’s changed with Senior Song,” the black-skinned Soft Feather said all of a sudden.","Song Shuhang’s head slowly floated up, leaving the wooden body. The scene looked particularly frightening.","Above his head, a group of holy ape projections appeared.","The number of holy apes had increased again, going from 108 to 123; this was the result of listening to the old man’s lecture while peeping into the past. Song Shuhang’s knowledge was constantly increasing, and this greatly contributed to his comprehension of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","Since the number had risen to 123 in a single breath, the large holy ape didn’t have the time to come up with a new formation; it had no choice but to use a very basic one. The large holy ape placed itself in the center, and the other smaller holy apes arranged themselves into two rows, forming a cross formation.","After getting into formation, the large holy ape unfurled its scholarly scripture and got ready to start chanting. However, its words got stuck in its throat as it tried reading the first sentence in the language of the ancient era.","After a short while, the large holy ape waved his hand at the others.","A group of small holy apes formed a circle around the big holy ape to protect its privacy.","Inside the circle, the big holy ape carefully unbuttoned his scholarly clothing and bared his chest.","Sister White Dragon raised her head and asked, “Is there any point to what they’re doing?”","No matter how well the ape circle surrounded the large holy ape, she and the others could still see everything that was happening from their position. What they were doing was practically pointless.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “Whether there’s any use or not, they have already carried out the procedure. Now, it’s more about face.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Tradition is very important.”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","In the air, the large holy ape lifted its scholarly clothing and cautiously looked underneath.","Immediately afterward, it closed its eyes and turned its head around, a pained expression on its face.","That expression of misery on its face was truly realistic.","It was as if it no longer believed in love and could not bring itself to believe in the truth. It only felt despair.","The expression on its ape face was constantly changing. It twisted and wriggled about, its body language very exaggerated.","Its skills were on par with an actor’s.","...","Sister White Dragon had the urge to applaud it.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “What did it see?”","The large holy ape took a deep breath, carefully lifted its clothes, and looked inside one more time.","After a while, it silently covered itself again, then crouched down with its head in its hands.","It seemed as if it had fallen into absolute despair.","The more pained the large holy ape looked, the more curious the black-skinned Soft Feather became.","Pavilion Master Chu guessed, “Could it be that the tattoo on its body has changed?”","She remembered that during the trial of the divine dragon, all the trial takers who were acknowledged would get a dragon tattoo on their holy apes.","In the meantime, a long dragon roar echoed from the large holy ape’s body.","Sister White Dragon said, “It seems you guessed right.”","In the next moment, a lifelike dragon projection emerged from the body of the large holy ape, the dragon’s head protruding from the scholarly robe.","...","The large holy ape desperately tried to push it back.","However, the dragon projection was very nimble. Its head swayed lightly, avoiding the palm of the large holy ape. It moved around fluidly and left the body of the large holy ape.","The newborn dragon projection was not big, merely about the size of an ordinary tattoo. It hovered beside the large holy ape, spinning around it.","Seeing this, all the small holy apes stretched out their hands to undo their robes, carefully glancing underneath their clothes.","In the next second, they also turned their heads, a pained expression on their faces.","There was no doubt that the dragon tattoos on their bodies had also turned into projections and were about to come to life.","Sixteen asked curiously, “Is this a sign that the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? is beginning to change?”","The figure of the virtuous lamia also emerged from Song Shuhang’s body.","She looked at the holy apes in the sky.","Then, she lowered her head and found herself looking at her chest, which was too big and affected her vision.","However, she did not have a similar dragon pattern on her body, which left her slightly dejected."]},{"number":2104,"title":"Chapter 2104 Suppression","paragraphs":["2104 Suppression","Sister White Dragon saw the virtuous lamia looking at her own chest while gazing at the holy ape in the sky. She quickly reminded her, “Fairy@#%×, don’t do anything stupid.”","She was afraid that the virtuous lamia would imitate the holy apes.","“Huh? Look, Senior Song is starting to grow flesh!” the black-skinned Soft Feather said.","Song Shuhang’s head was floating in the air, and the process of “rebirth” began from where his neck was.","!!","The speed at which this “rebirth” was taking place was quite impressive. His flesh was regrowing almost at a speed visible to the naked eye.","Sister White Dragon sighed and said, “For some reason, it feels as if I’m watching a horror movie.”","While Song Shuhang’s head was floating in the air, the sheet was atop his head, and his hair twirled around him unceasingly.","If this scene was taking place in the main world, there would be countless people who would have nightmares just from the sight of it.","“Oh, the effect of the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? is better than I thought.” Pavilion Master Chu’s tone was full of joy.","She and Song Shuhang were in similar states at the moment. She had been soaking in the pool under the living spring for so long, yet her body had only regrown until her collarbone at the moment.","She thus wondered if the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? would have any effect on her. Could it increase the speed at which her body regrew?","She was used to staying at home, and she had no problems staying in the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion for thousands of years without going out once. However, staying at home with your entire body and staying at home with only your head were two different things.","After she regained her complete body, she did hope to look for a quiet place where she could cozy up.","Sister White Dragon said happily, “You’re hopeless. You only have your head left, so how are you supposed to practice the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique??”","Pavilion Master Chu replied with an inscrutable smile, “Technically speaking, I don’t only have my head left, and it’s not hard for me to practice the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?. Fairy White Dragon, compared to me, your state is even worse. Your current state is similar to Fairy @#%×, and you have not even entered the resurrection stage yet.”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","“If I can recover my body one step earlier, I will always be one step ahead of you.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair swayed in the wind.","“Talk to me after you’ve recovered your body,” the corners of Sister White Dragon’s mouth curled up, “and don’t ask for my help at that time.”","Pavilion Master Chu wanted to practice the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, but she was forgetting that she was the Ancestral Golden Dragon.","At this time, Sixteen said, “The regrowth of Shuhang’s body has slowed down.”","At the beginning, Song Shuhang’s body grew fast, with his flesh swiftly reaching his neck and then his shoulders. But after his shoulders regrew, the process seemed to have come to a halt.","Sister White Dragon turned her head and said, “Could it be that he has run out of energy and needs to rest?”","Pavilion Master Chu guessed, “It might also be that Shuhang is still comprehending the next portion of the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?. This technique is very profound and complicated, and it needs to be comprehended one step at a time.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Then, should we feed Senior Song some medicinal pills?”","The virtuous lamia’s eyes lit up when she heard this. She held Song Shuhang’s mouth with both of her hands and opened it.","Sixteen took out the Seventh Stage medicinal pills that Shuhang had received from Senior White before, carefully placing one inside his mouth.","The virtuous lamia grabbed Song Shuhang’s chin and helped him chew the pill.","“Is it possible to eat it like this?” the black-skinned Soft Feather asked with some concern.","Sister White Dragon said, “He managed to absorb the wisdom fruit, so maybe a medicinal pill can work as well.”","And it really did work.","After Song Shuhang “ate” the medicinal pill, the speed at which his body was regrowing increased slightly.","?????","And so, Soft Feather and Sixteen worked together with the virtuous lamia to feed Song Shuhang medicinal pills.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair paid attention to Song Shuhang’s state, making sure that he would not get overwhelmed by the pills.","Suddenly, Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair turned to their 8 o’clock and shook slightly. “A new trial taker has arrived.”","Sister White Dragon said, “The trial takers should not be able to see us.”","They were currently in a small spherical space independent of the crystal world. It was a world within a world.","They could see the trial takers, but the same could not be said of the opposite.","“However, some of our aura should still be seeping through,” said Pavilion Master Chu. It was through this aura that had passed through that she became aware of the arrival of the new trial taker.","Moreover, this new trial taker possessed a certain kind of power that felt familiar to her and made her uncomfortable.","As a result, Pavilion Master Chu’s hair twitched slightly.","The sheet covering Song Shuhang was fully unfolded. It now covered his wooden body, Sixteen, Fairy White Dragon, and the black-skinned Soft Feather.","All of their auras were completely erased by the sheet.","Sister White Dragon helped Sixteen, huddling close to Song Shuhang.","“Is there anything unusual?” Sister White Dragon asked through voice transmission.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “I sensed an uncomfortable power from them. For now, let’s just conceal ourselves and see what happens.”","?????","Inside the crystal world.","The new trial taker who had just come in was a thin man carrying a spear and wearing silver-colored light armor.","His racial characteristics were not apparent from his appearance.","When he stepped into the trial ground, Daoist Turntable, who was still in a trance, was wrapped by spatial energy and sent to another room.","The thin man in light armor glanced at where Daoist Turntable had been.","His gaze seemed to have penetrated through space itself, directly glancing at Daoist Turntable who was in a world within a world.","The thin man in light armor said softly, “It’s that tiger cultivator.”","...","He turned his head and looked around again, but he could not find Song Shuhang’s group which was covered by the sheet.","“Not bad, the timing is just right.” The thin man in light armor nodded slightly.","He raised his spear and took a deep breath.","He then put some strength in his arm and broke that unordinary-looking spear.","Inside the spear shaft was a broken dark ring that emitted a dark mist.","The man in light armor grabbed the ring and put it on his finger.","All around, there seemed to be murmuring voices ringing in his ears.","The voices were full of temptation. They spoke as if they could give people everything, tempting them to fall into darkness.","The thin man seemed to be tempted and his eyes blurred.","He murmured, “There is only one thing I need, and that is strength. I want to break through to the Sixth Stage Realm and continue living despite my already exhausted lifespan.”","He seemed to be making a wish, but at the same time making a deal with the devil.","...","The whispers of temptation in the air seemed to get stronger and stronger.","Just when the pitch-black mist was about to swallow him, the man in light armor suddenly gritted his teeth and took off the ring from his finger.","“Hehe.” He put the ring back into the spear, then sealed it.","“Sure enough, it’s just some low-level temptation. How can something like this get me?” He picked up his spear again and walked around inside the crystal world. He appeared to be looking for something.","?????","In the Beast Realm.","In a swamp full of black crows stood a large stele made of pitch-black stone.","It was the same stone structure that was stabbed by Senior White’s disposable flying sword some time ago","After it received those messages about White, it moved from its original place to this swamp.","The stone stele said slowly, “All living things are naturally greedy, and as long as you exploit their greed, you can easily achieve your goals.”","Garre Holy Mountain’s trial was important for its experiment in the Beast Realm, but there was something on the trial grounds that was steadily suppressing it, leaving it helpless.","As such, it began to entice some intelligent beast cultivators to look for the source of the suppression to see if it could find any way to get rid of it."]},{"number":2105,"title":"Chapter 2105 The secret of the former Wielder of the Heaven’s Will","paragraphs":["2105 The secret of the former Wielder of the Heaven’s Will","By understanding their greed, one would be able to better control and make use of humans.","Usually, the kind of people who believed themselves to be the smartest in the room were the easiest to make use of.","The black stele’s plans in the Beast Realm were proceeding rather smoothly so far. Other than when it was stabbed by White’s long-range sword attack, everything was going well.","In the air, pitch-black spatial passages appeared one after another. Five figures wrapped in black mist made of evil energy of the Netherworld stepped out of these spatial passages, landing in front of the pitch-black stele.","!!","They were all experts that belonged to the Beast Realm who had been infected by the evil energy, becoming evil demons.","The strength of these fallen beast cultivators had yet to reach the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, and they relied on the power of the pitch-black stele, which aided them in creating the spatial passages, to come over.","The black stele asked, “Have all the evil treasures been distributed?”","A lizard-looking beast cultivator nodded and said, “Yes, the batch was distributed across the North Frontier of the Beast Realm. However, the Beast Realm is now more equipped to deal with the treasures than it was in the past. After people find them, they are swiftly taken away and sealed. The number of infected is continuously decreasing.”","“It doesn’t matter,” the black stele said calmly. “We only need to continue distributing evil treasures. At this stage, infecting more creatures is no longer my main purpose, so everything is going according to the plan.”","“What should we do next?” asked a beast cultivator with black scales.","“We just need to wait patiently,” the black stele said slowly. “Before entering the final stage of my plan, I must eliminate a rather troublesome thing in Garre Holy Mountain. A pawn of mine has already entered the trial grounds of the holy mountain.”","The lizard beast cultivator asked, “There are powerful guardians in Garre Holy Mountain. Will that pawn succeed?”","The black stele replied, “The purpose of that pawn is to acquire information on the source of suppression in Garre Holy Mountain. It is only after I know its ins and outs that I would be able to design a solid plan to destroy it. Of course, if the pawn can directly take away, or destroy, the source of suppression, even better.”","“Do you need us to make a move?” asked the black-scaled beast cultivator.","The stele said calmly, “There’s no need to be in such a rush. The guardians of the holy mountain are not easy to deal with. It is not yet time to confront them.”","“Then... What are we going to do after the source of suppression is removed?” a skinny beast cultivator asked in a hoarse voice.","The stele said, “At that time, the entire Beast Realm will be under my control, and the mysteries hidden in this world by the previous Wielder of the Heaven’s Will will fall into my hands.”","The previous Wielder of the Will, the one who corresponded to Netherworld Ruler White, could be said to be a very willful existence.","Just because he was bored of being the Wielder of the Will, he abandoned his position and disappeared.","However, there were various signs implying that this Wielder of the Will had discovered something, which led him to make all kinds of preparations.","And he’d left something here in the Beast Realm, something related to “time.”","There was even a chance that it was information on how to “break free” from the shackles of his position.","After the former Wielder of the Will got bored, he resigned forcibly. As a result, the top existences in the universe were all left speculating if he had found a way to smoothly leave his position.","Therefore, in addition to controlling the Beast Realm, the black stele wanted to uncover the mysteries left behind by this previous Wielder of the Will.","?????","Inside the crystal world.","The thin man with the spear walked slowly, checking every inch of the ground under his feet.","The power of the evil ring sealed in the spear was seeping out, whispering in his ear.","However, this level of murmuring did not affect him in the slightest.","Beast cultivators infected by the evil energy of the Netherworld would normally degenerate into demons and become slaves of the evil treasures.","However, people like him who had a strong will and managed to stop the infection could instead gain some information from the source of the evil energy.","In the past few months, he had gained a lot of benefits by deciphering the information hidden in the treasure.","This time, the target of the thin man was a magical treasure left on the trial grounds of Garre Holy Mountain.","The magical treasure was a Tribulation Transcender-level divine weapon that was currently without an owner.","It did not originate from Garre Holy Mountain, and it was unknown as to who had left it in the holy mountain.","And if taking this magical treasure could somehow affect Garre Holy Mountain... that was of no interest to him.","Although he lived in the Beast Realm, he was not a beast cultivator.","After taking the magic treasure, he could just leave the Beast Realm.","The thin man’s consciousness expanded to its limits. It penetrated into the depths of the crystal world, searching through it inch by inch.","He was pretty lucky, as half an hour later, he sensed the aura of the treasure!","“Found it!” The thin man smiled.","Coincidentally, the treasure appeared to be trying to break free.","Through his mental scan, he could tell that the treasure should have been buried deeper in the crystal world.","But for some reason, it decided to emerge from the ground today.","According to rumors, once a magical treasure reached the Eighth or Ninth Stage, it was possible for them to birth their own consciousness.","Natural treasures were meant for those who were fated with them.","Could it be that this treasure sensed that it had fate with me and started emerging from the ground?","It seems that this opportunity is truly meant for me!","The thin man laughed, clearly in a good mood.","He took out his spear and slammed it into the ground.","The spear spun, creating a hole that led all the way to the location of the magical treasure.","The thin man jumped into the hole, excited to see the treasure.","?????","Song Shuhang, who was in a state of deep meditation from which he could not extricate himself, suddenly sensed something.","...","He was still muddle-headed as he was still slowly regrowing his body, but under the influence of Song Shuhang’s mind, the wooden body began to make hand seals and cast the technique that Senior White Two taught him to control the stone tablet.","The stone tablet at the bottom of the crystal world was summoned once again. It vibrated vigorously, and then it began rushing upward.","?????","“The divine weapon is coming to me!” The thin man was overjoyed when he sensed that the divine weapon below him was emitting light and seemingly actively greeting him.","I am indeed the destined master of this divine weapon.","It is actively approaching me!","It’s mine!","“Come! Join me as I rise to the top of the world.” The thin man opened his arms, welcoming the magical treasure."]},{"number":2106,"title":"Chapter 2106 If you don’t keep up with the times, you will be left behind and eliminated","paragraphs":["2106 If you don’t keep up with the times, you will be left behind and eliminated","I, Yingda, am going to reach a new peak in my life today!","The thin man opened his arms. At the same time, he activated all of his defenses, strengthened his physique, and activated the protection of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","While it was a great joy that a treasure had selected him as its owner, it should not be forgotten that this treasure was a Tribulation Transcender-level divine weapon. Even if its quality might have declined due to it having been in the ground for so long, it should have still retained the might of a Profound Sage-level magical treasure.","If a magic treasure of such a level were to crash into him, the impact would be quite strong, so he could not allow himself to get hit by such a divine weapon without setting up any defenses.","After all, he did not want to end up on the first page of the Beast Realm’s Daily Cultivator tomorrow.","While it was a good thing to be in the headlines, the reason was a factor that had to be considered.","If the reason was positive, then countless beast cultivators would look up to you, and you could become a star in one fell swoop.","However, if the reason was negative, then you could become a laughingstock in the eyes of the Beast Realm’s people for a period of time.","Yingda was a man with some experience.","Although he had never come across a Tribulation Transcender-level divine weapon before, it did not mean that he had no idea as to what it might be capable of.","With his defenses fully activated and set up, Yingda happily welcomed the treasure.","As the treasure was unearthing itself, it created loud, rumbling sounds. The earth shook tremendously, and it seemed as if the world could flip upside down at any moment.","Fortunately, Yingda had artificially created a passage for the treasure to go up through. The treasure only needed to move up along this passage, greatly reducing the vibration and tremors as it unearthed itself.","“I can see it.” As the treasure approached him, Yingda saw the appearance of the treasure.","It was an ordinary-looking stone tablet, which matched Yingda’s preferences.","“Boom!”","The stone tablet crashed into Yingda.","The protective magical technique on Yingda’s body was smashed apart. Next, the spiritual energy and magical treasures that protected his body also broke down.","However, with so many layers of cushioning, Yingda got to touch the tablet without dying. The final layer of protection that he had set up using the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? allowed him to survive.","“Hahaha! Little thing, you’re really enthusiastic,” Yingda laughed and said. His entire body lay on the stone tablet as he stroked it with his arms.","“A Tribulation Transcender-level divine weapon! A genuine Tribulation Transcender-level divine weapon!” Yingda quickly reached this conclusion.","He came to this conclusion as he had once come across a Profound Sage-level magical treasure and been exposed to its pressure—and its pressure was far less than that of this stone tablet!","He stroked the stone tablet happily.","Mine, mine, it’s mine...","Today is truly a lucky day.","?????","In fact, Yingda’s luck today was truly good.","After the stone tablet was drawn over by the magical technique being cast by Song Shuhang’s wooden body, it had only broken through the ground with ordinary speed and power. The speed at which it was being pulled was not that fast, and the true power of the stone tablet was not activated.","Otherwise, with it being a magical treasure that Senior White Two had forged before becoming the Wielder of the Will, if its full power were activated, even a slight bump from it would have been enough to annihilate Yingda.","After the stone tablet crashed into Yingda’s body, its momentum did not diminish, and it continued to rush toward the surface.","“Okay, okay, stop acting like a child. You can stop moving.” Yingda stretched out his hand and placed it on the stone tablet. Then, he poured his spiritual energy into it.","No matter what item a cultivator encountered, as long as they scanned it with their mental energy and poured their spiritual energy into it, things would generally work out for them. This was common everywhere in the universe.","However, when Yingda poured his spiritual energy into the stone tablet, he discovered that his energy was rejected.","This stone tablet did not accept his spiritual energy.","Yingda looked confused.","What’s going on?","Didn’t this stone tablet choose me as its master and even jump into my arms?","Then, why isn’t it accepting my spiritual energy?","It’s almost as if this stone tablet is being summoned by another force...","Wait, could it be that it didn’t choose me as its master?","This thought suddenly appeared in Yingda’s mind.","But if it didn’t recognize me as its master, then who is summoning it?","Who else is here besides me?","“Daoist Turntable!” Yingda quickly thought of the tiger cultivator, Daoist Turntable.","Besides him, there was only Daoist Turntable in this crystal world.","If it was not him, then it had to be Daoist Turntable.","“No, it can’t be him. Daoist Turntable is in the middle of comprehending the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?. How could he be the one summoning this stone tablet?” Yingda frowned again.","So, what the hell is going on here?","Could it be that there are still people hiding in the dark, waiting to reap the rewards?","“Stop!” Yingda placed both of his hands on the stone tablet, trying to suppress it.","It was reckless for him to do so, and he knew it himself.","But at this time, he had started to lose his reason.","The murmuring from the evil ring broke through the seal of the spear and reached his ears.","“Do you want power? Do you want longevity? Do you want to break through? Wear me, and you can have everything you desire.” The whispers from the ring were filled with evil temptation.","This level of temptation seemed to have gone up a notch.","According to Yingda’s previous answers, it began to use “longevity” to tempt him further.","Yingda gritted his teeth and shouted, “Get out of my head! I’m still far away from old age and death. My lifespan is still long. I don’t need anything from you!”","While it was true that he wanted to advance, the part about his lifespan coming to an end was a lie.","His answers had been a mixture of truth and falsehood.","Otherwise, how could he have resisted the evil treasure’s temptation and regained his composure so quickly?","The murmuring stopped.","After a while, the voice sounded again, “So, what you want is a partner?”","It was a new line.","The evil treasures now had the ability to collect data from all the “infected”, which helped form a large database.","In this way, the lines were no longer as predictable as before and were ever-changing.","For example, like when facing Yingda, the evil treasure would first ask the usual question, [Do you want power?]","And after being rejected, it would search through its huge database in an attempt to find a similar “event” and take on the next step to tempt Yingda.","The world is constantly progressing. If you don’t keep up with the times, you will be left behind and eliminated!","“It seems that you really do want a woman. Wear the ring, and you will have the most beautiful girl in the universe.” The murmurings became very magnetic.","Yingda: “...”","Do you think I’m a pervert?","What I want is the power to suppress this stone tablet! I want this stone tablet!","“Wait... If I put on the ring, I can ‘borrow’ the power from the ring to suppress this stone tablet.","“As long as I can quickly suppress the stone tablet and then take off the ring, the evil energy of the Netherworld should not be able to devour me.","“Yes, as long as I’m fast enough, my will should be able to hold on.”","This idea came to Yingda’s mind.","While he was thinking this, his body had already moved.","The spear broke apart once more.","The ring floated out, hovering in front of Yingda."]},{"number":2107,"title":"Chapter 2107 Let me just ask, are you afraid?","paragraphs":["2107 Let me just ask, are you afraid?","Yingda stretched out his hand and put the ring on his finger.","In the next moment, the evil energy of the Netherworld, which had been ready to act at any moment, came out of the ring. It attached itself to his body, forcibly stimulated his potential, and endowed him with incomparably mighty power.","This is the feeling!","Now, as long as I persevere, I should be able to suppress... this... stone... tablet...","All of a sudden, Yingda found that his brain had become sluggish, and a strong sense of sleepiness surged within him.","The rationality he was so proud of swiftly deteriorated, and he could not stop the evil energy of the Netherworld from influencing him.","After two breaths, everything in Yingda’s eyes became a blur. Then, he vaguely saw several metal balls spinning above his head and making strange noises.","These metal balls seemed to have a hypnotizing effect. They spun faster and faster, making Yingda feel dizzy and nauseous.","It was a feeling similar to motion sickness.","Then, he lost consciousness.","The vast evil energy of the Netherworld completely enveloped Yingda’s body.","A phantom came out of his shadow, baring its teeth and letting out a shrill cry.","It took control of Yingda’s body, then stretched out its palms confidently, pressing them on the stone tablet in an attempt to stop it.","“Zizizi~”","The power of the phantom clashed against the stone tablet’s, creating a shrill friction sound.","In the next moment, the phantom let out a scream as its palms were being melted continuously. Also, its action activated the defense mechanism of the stone tablet.","?????","Inside the sheet.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said, “So it was the evil energy of the Netherworld. No wonder it felt both uncomfortable and strangely familiar.”","The evil energy of the Netherworld was the opposite of spiritual energy, and it carried the sound of temptation, which caused Pavilion Master Chu to feel uncomfortable.","However, because Pavilion Master Chu Two had now become a demon and settled in the Netherworld, Pavilion Master Chu felt a sense of familiarity toward the evil energy.","Sixteen said softly, “Is it going to crash into us?”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “We’re inside a small independent space. Can that stone tablet come in here?”","“Yes,” said Sister White Dragon.","The stone tablet was, after all, a Tribulation Transcender-level divine weapon, so it possessed the ability to break through space.","“Boom~”","As soon as Sister White Dragon finished speaking, the stone tablet crashed into the sphere that housed Song Shuhang and the others.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair rolled up the sheet and pushed everyone backward to avoid the impact.","“Thud!” The huge stone tablet fell inside the small independent space.","Yingda and the phantom in his shadow were also brought in.","The phantom slowly raised its head and looked at where Song Shuhang and the others were, its eyes glowing red.","“Formation!” Sister White Dragon raised her finger and shook it lightly.","A large formation formed, instantly wrapping the small independent space.","Space was locked, making most ways of communication useless.","In this way, the phantom would not be able to transmit any information to the outside world.","As the formation formed, Sister White Dragon’s strength received a boost.","“Roar~” The phantom arched its body and lay on the stone tablet, looking at Song Shuhang and his party vigilantly.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “Get rid of it.”","Sister White Dragon asked back, “Who’s going to do it? Are you going to do it, or should I?”","“I’ll do it!” Song Shuhang’s voice suddenly sounded.","Sixteen turned her head and looked back. “Shuhang, you’re awake... Eh?”","Song Shuhang, who had been unable to extricate himself from that deep state of meditation, woke up because of the resonance with the stone tablet.","When he opened his eyes, he saw the phantom.","Although he did not clearly know what had taken place, Song Shuhang knew that he had to act.","As soon as he realized that the phantom was a body infected with evil energy, he took out Silver Trigram’s mask and stuck it to his face.","When he raised his head, he had assumed the appearance of a great figure that was talked about in the ancient textbooks of demonic sects, Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Sixteen had been met with Demon Emperor Hezhi’s face just now. That was why she was taken aback.","?????","At this moment, Song Shuhang’s physical body had regrown until the upper half of his chest muscles.","The wooden body stepped forward, grabbed Song Shuhang, and put him on its shoulders.","Song Shuhang mused, “Hmm, this is a bit awkward.”","Sixteen: “...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","The black-skinned Soft Feather described the sight before her, “Senior Song looks like he accidentally ended up with two shoulders when using photoshop to change his height.”","“Don’t mind my current appearance.” Song Shuhang waved his hand and said, “Sister White Dragon, Sixteen, please see if your consciousness can access the [Cultivation] group. If it can, please record this scene for me.”","Sister White Dragon asked, “What do you want to do?”","“I want you to help me upload something on my stories,” said Song Shuhang as he walked in front of the phantom.","The phantom seemed to sense that Song Shuhang was the mastermind behind the summoning of the stone tablet. It growled at him repeatedly, ready to make a move at any moment.","Song Shuhang said slowly, “I just comprehended a new skill, and you arrived just in time to let me test it out.”","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “Have you learned something from the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique??”","Song Shuhang replied, “Mm-hm, it is indeed related to the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.”","He then circulated his three top-tier body-tempering cultivation techniques.","The ?Variant Steel Hands Technique? added a dark, metallic luster to his head, while the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and the ?Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha? greatly enhanced its strength.","He was now all ready.","Song Shuhang had the wooden body place its hands behind its back and said calmly, “This move is called...”","Behind him, Sixteen and Sister White Dragon were testing out the functions of the [Cultivation] group and trying to capture the scene.","Song Shuhang felt that he was a natural-born actor. When the camera was rolling, he was quickly able to get into character.","Unfortunately, the phantom opposite him wasn’t that cooperative.","Before Song Shuhang could finish his lines, it rushed forward. Evil energy of the Netherworld that was as thick as a liquid rushed over to him like a wave.","If such a person were to play the supporting role, they had no hope of being given any compliment after the shooting!","Song Shuhang sighed. He stretched out his hand to take off his head, poured all his strength into the hand of the wooden body, and hurled his head at the phantom.","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Sixteen: “...”","The black-skinned Soft Feather face-palmed, unable to look at the scene.","Due to the short distance, Song Shuhang’s head reached the phantom in an instant.","The phantom roared and tried to cover Song Shuhang with a huge wave of evil energy.","Song Shuhang said angrily, “Die!”","He then poured a large amount of spiritual energy into Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, which caused it to straighten and harden; even its hidden parts were exposed.","Are you afraid of this three-meter-long Immortal-level hair?!","Pavilion Master Chu was shocked by this sudden turn of events."]},{"number":2108,"title":"Chapter 2108 It is your honor to die by an Immortal’s hair","paragraphs":["2108 It is your honor to die by an Immortal’s hair","Song Shuhang’s new skill caught Pavilion Master Chu by surprise.","She had completely underestimated Song Shuhang’s ability to seek death and didn’t expect him to go as far as to throw his head at the enemy.","Because of how unexpected it was, she was unable to react.","In the next moment, Pavilion Master Chu’s three-meter-long strand of hair pierced the phantom’s body like a blade. This attack method reminded one of a nasty switchblade. Just as the handle, or head in this case, was about to reach the enemy, the blade popped out, leaving the enemy no way to avoid the attack.","A single drop of blood, or even a strand of hair, of an Immortal possessed the power to move seas and set rivers ablaze.","Moreover, Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair was even more insidious as her main body specialized in using her hair for offensive means.","“Heh, have a taste of my strand of hair!” said Song Shuhang while attacking.","His head began rolling in the air, and it looked as if he were “headbanging.”","Song Shuhang had never done it in the past, but he knew a little trick that helped him.","He just had to move his head as if he were writing in the air. As a result, his hair began moving around as if he were headbanging.","It was just that simple.","After getting pierced a few times, the phantom was cut into numerous pieces. Under Pavilion Master Chu’s Immortal aura, the shadow was completely obliterated.","This was the power of the hair of an Immortal. Shuhang kind of got addicted to it, which made him want to use it again. Even knowing that he was seeking death, he could not help but wish to use this move again in the future.","Song Shuhang stopped moving his head. Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair lost its influx of spiritual energy and softened.","Shuhang threw it behind his head and said, “It’s your honor to die by an Immortal’s hair!”","Song Shuhang spoke in a calm voice. Since he could not perfectly imitate the voice of Demon Emperor Hezhi, he simply said less. As long as the enemy did not recognize him, he was okay with it.","“I can’t bear watching this anymore.” The black-skinned Soft Feather covered her face with her hands.","“I think it’s fine,” Sister White Dragon said slowly. “Although this move seems absurd, it’s actually very practical. While his enemies are given the impression that he’s planning to headbutt them, he’s actually going to kill them with that strand of hair. Moreover, this is the best way to make use of this otherwise useless strand of hair.”","Sister White Dragon spoke very slowly. This was because she really had a hard time making up this bullsh*t.","She needed to rack her brain hard to come up with a “reasonable” explanation.","After Sister White Dragon spoke, everyone grew silent.","Song Shuhang’s head was still. He knew that he would have to face Pavilion Master Chu’s anger next.","Soft Feather once said that they were all adults, so they had to bear the consequence of their actions.","Song Shuhang was not afraid to bear the consequences of his actions, but he tried his best to control the degree to which he sought death.","“Hehehehe,” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair chuckled. “It’s your honor to die by an Immortal’s hair... I like this line.”","Eh? Pavilion Master Chu’s not angry, and she even praised me...","Song Shuhang felt relieved. “Hahaha, Senior Chu, do you feel the same? I’ve been thinking of that line for a long time, but I’m still surprised that I said it out loud.”","Pavilion Master Chu said calmly, “Mm-hm, how about I give you that honor as well?”","“Huh?” Song Shuhang shouted, “Wait, Senior Chu... Aahhh!”","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair wrapped around his neck, and then tightened","The power of an Immortal’s hair, even a single strand of it, was enough to split mountains and seas!","When his neck was caught in a grip, Song Shuhang seemed to see his grandfather riding a crane toward the west, smiling at him.","I’m going to die, I’m going to die, I’m going to die...","Sister White Dragon asked just in case, “Do you want me to record this part too?”","Song Shuhang’s wooden body waved his hands vigorously. Cut... cut off this part!","He regretted his actions a lot now.","In addition, he regretted having regrown his neck so quickly.","If his neck was absent, then Pavilion Master Chu would have no way of strangling him!","“Any last words?” Pavilion Master Chu’s voice rang in his ears.","Yes... I want to live another five hundred years!","Of course, Song Shuhang only thought about this line and did not say it out loud. He did not want to continue seeking death. What if Pavilion Master Chu got annoyed and really strangled him to death?","He did not want to waste a precious resurrection opportunity on something silly like this!","“None, right?” Pavilion Master Chu’s long hair tightened again.","I must teach Song Shuhang a lesson this time. At the very least, I must let him experience how it feels to suffocate to death.","“Ahem,” said Song Shuhang with difficulty, “Senior Chu, um, are you a little happier now?”","Pavilion Master Chu asked in puzzlement, “What?”","“Ever since you entered Garre Holy Mountain, you’ve been looking downcast. So, I wanted to make you a bit happier,” Song Shuhang continued. “Now, it seems that you’re a bit more lively.”","“Me? Downcast?” Pavilion Master Chu was taken aback.","When did this happen? Why don’t I know that I’ve been feeling down?","But...","Did that mean that Song Shuhang used her hair to pierce the phantom in order to cheer her up? Did he direct the scene earlier to change her mood?","At times, he was simply seeking death; but at other times, he seemed to be carefully paying attention to the mood of the people around him.","You would not even know if he was simply seeking death or pretending to do so to conceal his care for you.","This kind of personality...","...","Pavilion Master Chu slowly loosened her grip on Song Shuhang’s neck.","She could not help but feel a little moved.","She thought of that guy with the same surname who also sought death very regularly.","Song Shuhang let out a breath of relief after feeling the grip on his neck loosen.","I’m so clever! I actually managed to come up with this life-saving plan. Song Shuhang gave himself a pat on the back for his wit.","In addition, to prevent his “honest face” from disclosing the truth, he tried his best to keep grimacing.","A serious or deadpan expression did not suit him, and only an expression of pain could help him with this disguise.","Sister White Dragon also seemed to fall into thought and said nothing.","The black-skinned Soft Feather simply blinked her eyes.","Although she did not have the ability to read faces, she knew that Senior Song was definitely talking nonsense.","“Shuhang,” Sixteen pointed at the stone tablet, “what should we do with this stone tablet?”","...","“Let’s store it somewhere for now.” Song Shuhang rubbed his neck.","He did not want to experience how it felt to suffocate to death a second time as he still needed to get used to it.","Song Shuhang approached the stone tablet.","His hair turned into hands, and he prepared to use the method Senior White Two taught him to store away the stone tablet.","However, when he pressed his hands on the stone tablet and tried to store it inside his body like a normal magical treasure, the tablet began to resist.","It refused to enter Song Shuhang’s body.","Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback.","Then, he turned his head to look at the wooden body.","Although he had been using the summoning technique the entire time, it was actually his wooden body that had been performing the hand signs."]},{"number":2109,"title":"Chapter 2109 You are a saber! Everyone is a saber!","paragraphs":["2109 You are a saber! Everyone is a saber!","Does that mean that the wooden body has to be the one to store the stone tablet?","However, the wooden body is only a temporary body of mine. If it takes away the stone tablet, will everything still work out?","Sixteen suggested, “Can you not store it inside a cosmos bag?”","“I’ll give that a try.” Song Shuhang summoned his magical bracelet and waved it at the stone tablet.","The stone tablet shook slightly, but it was ultimately not brought into the cosmos bag.","“It doesn’t work.” Song Shuhang shook his head.","After thinking for a while, he controlled the wooden body to make the hand seals. After the wooden body stores the stone tablet, I’ll just put it inside the size-reducing purse.","The size-reducing purse could hold Lady Onion without problems, so it should be possible to place the wooden body inside it.","The wooden body made some hand seals, casting the magical technique on the stone tablet.","The stone tablet shook slightly but ultimately refused to enter the wooden body.","Instead, it was the wooden body that was pulled toward the stone tablet, almost getting swallowed by it.","Song Shuhang quickly stopped the wooden body from casting the technique.","Even the wooden body can’t do it.","Could it be that Senior White Two taught me the wrong technique?","Should I try contacting Senior White Two and ask him what I’m doing wrong?","While he was thinking to himself, the stone tablet rose up and sent Yingda, who was lying unconscious on top of it, flying away.","Afterward, the runes on the stone tablet brightened up, and its body started vibrating.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Is it dancing?”","Song Shuhang made a guess. “It seems that it wants to communicate with us. Does anyone know what it’s trying to say?”","Sister White Dragon shook her head.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair also shook.","The stone tablet had no face, and it was not Song Shuhang, so they could not read the thoughts it wanted to express by looking at its surface.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “It would be great if the Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was here.”","The black Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was a magical treasure with a mind.","As a divine weapon itself, it might be able to communicate with this stone tablet.","When the virtuous lamia heard the words “Scarlet Heaven Sword,” her eyes shone. After all, she had placed a mark on the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","If she coordinated with Song Shuhang’s ?Divine Weapon Appraisal?, she could lock onto its location. By doing so, she could also lock onto Senior White’s location.","The stone tablet was still vibrating and flickering constantly. It was struggling to convey its feelings.","Unfortunately, it was unable to communicate with them in the end.","“Can you use the mind reading technique on it?” Song Shuhang looked at Sister White Dragon.","“My mind reading technique has not reached the point where I can use it on magical treasures.” Sister White Dragon rolled her eyes. Unfortunately, she still had Sixteen’s appearance. Otherwise, when she rolled her eyes, her whole body would have expressed her feelings thoroughly.","“If that doesn’t work, then I can only do this.” Song Shuhang’s long hair fluttered, filled with momentum.","The black-skinned Soft Feather wondered, “The secret appraisal technique?”","Sixteen mused, “The Saber-Nurturing Technique?”","“Wrong!” Song Shuhang created two hands made of hair. “Kids can only choose one of the two, but as an adult, I choose both!”","“Adult?” Sister White Dragon felt strange when she heard this word.","The virtuous lamia finally found a chance to speak, and could not wait to say aloud to Sister White Dragon, “I’m Tyrannical Song, 18 years old, please guide me. If I have offended you, you can come and fight me!”","Right, that’s the reason I got that strange feeling...","Song Shuhang’s two hair-hands landed on the stone tablet.","The price of the secret appraisal technique was the first one to kick in.","A tiny blood stain appeared on Song Shuhang’s face. Whenever he used the secret appraisal technique lately, the price that he would have to pay was always very small, and Song Shuhang could barely feel this kind of pain.","This left him very uncomfortable for some reason.","[Strange stone tablet: A magic treasure that White wielded before becoming the Wielder of the Will. It was later borrowed by a phoenix of the Beast Realm and settled inside Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.]","This was information that Song Shuhang knew already because of Senior White Two. Therefore, the price he had to pay for the appraisal was very low.","Anyway, no more information could be obtained from the secret appraisal technique.","On the other hand, when the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? landed on the stone tablet, the surface glowed slightly. The effect was clearly not that great.","“It failed?” The black-skinned Soft Feather looked at the stone tablet in surprise.","“Even an evil technique like the Saber-Nurturing Technique didn’t work?” Sister White Dragon looked over curiously, which was really rare.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and said, “It should be that my ‘love’ is not enough.”","When nurturing the seven Nascent Soul Fetuses in his body, his understanding of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? had reached a new level.","The effects of an ordinary instance of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? and one that was filled with “love” were completely different.","Shuhang pressed his palm made of hair on the stone tablet again. “Actually, I hope to use the effects of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? to achieve the One With the Saber Realm with the stone tablet. If I succeed, I’ll be able to sense what it wants to say.”","The One With the Saber Realm, similar to saber intent, was a skill that only genuine, first-rate saber cultivators could master.","Pavilion Master Chu reminded him, “But that’s a stone tablet.”","...","So, stop dreaming.","It’s not a saber.","Song Shuhang said, “A saber in my heart, a saber in my hand. As long as I affirm it in my heart, then in my hands, everything is a saber.”","When he received the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?, he also acquired theoretical knowledge on saber techniques through the ?Three Thousand Sabers Scripture? in the dreamland.","His foundation when it came to other types of theoretical knowledge might be quite weak, but his knowledge of the saber path was quite good.","As long as I believe it to be a saber in my heart, no matter if it is a blade of grass, a branch, or a tree, they are all sabers in my hand!","Even this stone tablet... is a saber!","Song Shuhang cast the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? on the stone tablet again while muttering, “You are a saber! You are a saber!”","The stone tablet vibrated continuously.","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","...","A mix of brainwashing and hypnosis?","An evil technique combined with hypnosis was truly terrifying.","After a while, Song Shuhang entered a state of meditation.","Sister White Dragon said, “Is he really going to achieve the One With the Saber Realm?”","“One With the Tablet,” Pavilion Master Chu corrected.","The black-skinned Soft Feather guessed, “Perhaps he has entered ‘study mode’ again. Senior Song was originally in that learning state, and it was only because of the influence of the stone tablet that he woke up.”","Several people formed a circle to watch Song Shuhang and the stone tablet.","After a long, long time... Song Shuhang kept still.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “We can’t just continue staring at him like this, can we?”","Sister White Dragon said slowly, “Mm-hm, that’s why I’ve been taking advantage of my free time to go through the messages in the stories section of the Cultivation group. The one named [Heh, take my hair!] is pretty interesting. It’s a pity that there is no way to tag people. Otherwise, I would have already pinged you.”","Pavilion Master Chu: “!!!”","She quickly entered the stories section of the Cultivation group."]},{"number":2110,"title":"Chapter 2110 Mulan weaves by the door","paragraphs":["2110 Mulan weaves by the door","In the Cultivation group, another story appeared after Demon Emperor Hezhi’s post.","Similar to Demon Emperor Hezhi’s post, this second post also attracted everyone’s attention.","After all, people loved new things.","Title: [Heh, take my hair!]","!!","The author was “Ancestral Golden Dragon” Fairy White Dragon.","Looking at their username, they seemed to be another peerless big shot.","[Reliable Friend] Northern River Loose Cultivator: “This time, I’m the victor!”","The throne belonged to him, the always online warrior. As he had to keep an eye on both the Nine Provinces Number One Group and the Cultivation group now, he was rather busy as of late.","[Man Who Loves Making Vows] Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman: “If I remember correctly, the Ancestral Golden Dragon should be a legendary existence from the dragon race. Summon Senior Tyrant Flood Dragon!”","Wait, WTF? What the hell is with this nickname? Little friend Song Shuhang has been very naughty recently!","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman had received a request from a senior of his due to a favor they owed since the Immortal Feast, and he was to send little friend Shuhang a batch of treasures.","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman knew that Song Shuhang was in need of spirit stones, so he was thinking about sending Song Shuhang a large batch of spirit stones. But when he thought about it again, he felt that it was more practical to convert the spirit stones into suitable treasures.","Anyway, little friend Shuhang would not be able to keep the spirit stones. At least if they were treasures, maybe they could stay in his hands for a while longer.","[Blacklist] Venerable Yellow Mountain: “The signal this time seems to be a bit bad. Anyway, it seems like a video. I haven’t opened it yet. What’s it about?”","[Documents Friend] Cave Master Snow Wolf: “I’ve watched it, and it’s indeed a video. I don’t recognize the man in the video, but this fellow daoist’s hair is truly amazing.]","[Driving Goddess] Dongfang Six: “Is that... Demon Emperor Hezhi?”","[Blacklist] Demon Emperor Hezhi: “WTF?”","Am I not in the Infernal Realm? How did I end up in this video?","The person in the video looked exactly like him.","More specifically, it was him if he had only his shoulders and head left.","In addition, the person in the video was using a very shameful means of attack while fighting a phantom formed from filthy Netherworld energy.","I can destroy an entire army of such evil phantoms in a single breath, okay?","Why in the world would I shake my head around and use my hair to kill it?","“So, is that Demon Emperor Hezhi?” [Seven Dragon Balls] Senior Divine Dragon said in surprise. “I’ve only heard of his name before, and I did not think that I would actually get to see him. Fellow Daoist Hezhi’s strand of hair is truly amazing!”","No, that isn’t me! Stop talking nonsense! I don’t have such hair! Demon Emperor Hezhi almost suffered an internal injury as he saw the comments. However, in order to maintain his dignity as a Demon Emperor, he did not reply.","He knew that he had fallen into a difficult position, and he would not be able to explain himself, so it was better for him to keep quiet.","Speaking of which, he and this “Ancestral Golden Dragon” were not even acquainted, so why did the Ancestral Golden Dragon hate him so much?","There was one more thing that concerned him.","The QR code Golden Core Composition was still active.","This was not a good thing.","[Beautiful Forehead] Pavilion Master Chu: “Fellow Daoist Hezhi, are you angry?”","“Naive, how can this level of provocation cause me to lose my mind?” Demon Emperor Hezhi ignored the message.","He had never heard of this Pavilion Master Chu either.","[Beautiful Forehead] Pavilion Master Chu said: “If you’re angry, let’s join hands to kill the Ancestral Golden Dragon.”","Demon Emperor Hezhi: “...”","This person must be trying to trick me!","?????","Inside the crystal world.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair was wrapped around Song Shuhang’s neck again. If Song Shuhang did not change her nickname, Beautiful Forehead, right away, he would not leave this place alive!","However, seeing that Song Shuhang was still in a state of meditation, she had no choice but to give up for now.","It was common sense not to disturb practitioners who were meditating.","As such, she decided to strangle him when he left his meditative state.","Sister White Dragon said, “It really does look like the One With the Saber Realm, doesn’t it?”","She said this because Song Shuhang’s breathing seemed to perfectly match the vibrations of the stone tablet.","The two were clearly on the same channel.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “Can this stone tablet really be used as a saber?”","Sister White Dragon replied, “Shuhang’s saber talent is really quite outrageous.”","After he regarded the stone tablet as a saber in his heart, he could actually achieve the One With the Saber Realm with it.","Sixteen said, “If Shuhang really does manage to pull it off, will he be able to understand what the stone tablet is trying to say?”","At this time, in Song Shuhang’s spiritual world.","His True Self was holding a huge stone tablet.","When it came to ordinary versions of the One With the Saber Realm, the saber would be lying on the laps of the True Self, but the stone tablet was simply too big. The volume of its projection in the spiritual world was also huge.","Song Shuhang could only hold it with both arms and try to communicate with it in this way.","However, his attempts were not going too smoothly so far.","...","Song Shuhang asked, “Is there something you want to tell me?”","The stone tablet replied, “Duckling, duckling... Quack, quack.”","Song Shuhang: “???”","The stone tablet continued, “Kitty, kitty... Meow, meow.”","Song Shuhang said, “Stop messing around. The One With the Saber Realm has a time limit, and it’s the first time you and I have entered this state. Don’t waste any more time.”","The stone tablet continued, “Chick, chick?”","“I can’t understand anything of what you said.” Song Shuhang patted the stone tablet lightly.","The stone tablet continued, “Chick, Chick... Chirp...”","Song Shuhang quickly answered, “Chirp, chirp. Mulan weaves by the door. The sound of the loom cannot be heard over the sighs of the young maiden.”","The stone tablet: “...”","After a while, the stone tablet said, “I was simply... importing your... language in order to... make it more convenient to communicate with you.”","...","“Importing my language?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","The stone tablet said slowly, “Your Learning God... System. I made use of it a little bit. We have a common origin.”","This stone tablet is a creation of Senior White Two, that is, the work of the Wielder of the Will White.","The Learning God System is also the work of Senior White.","So, it has been trying to learn my language since the beginning?","“I’ve been suppressing something recently, so I can’t leave this place yet.” The stone tablet became increasingly fluent as it spoke.","Song Shuhang asked curiously, “What have you been suppressing? A monster?”","If it is a monster, how strong is it?","The stone tablet said slowly, “It’s something left by my master.”","Song Shuhang interjected, “That makes no sense. Senior White Two asked me to take you back. Unless...”","Unless this thing you’re talking about was left here by Wielder of the Will White, so after he and Netherworld’s Senior White Two became two different entities.","Because of that, Senior White Two doesn’t know that the tablet is suppressing something in this place...","In Song Shuhang’s mind, several clues strung together to make up a sensible sequence of events.","The phoenix borrowed the stone tablet from Senior White, and then placed it in the trial area of Garre Holy Mountain.","Then, after becoming enlightened, Wielder of the Will White left another thing here.","The main world’s Senior White once mentioned that his “hometown” might be near Garre Holy Mountain.","After entering the holy mountain, Senior White and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword entered a hidden area...","Song “Master Detective” Shuhang was onto something!"]},{"number":2111,"title":"Chapter 2111 Regretting not having met earlier","paragraphs":["2111 Regretting not having met earlier","Song Shuhang speculated that the hidden area the main world’s Senior White had entered with his heaven-defying luck was the secret realm that Wielder of the Will White left behind back then.","Furthermore, he suspected that it was what the stone tablet had been constantly suppressing.","Song Shuhang recalled that when Senior White Two and Senior White exchanged information with each other, the former mentioned that Wielder of the Will White once joked about leaving a younger sister for Senior White Two.","Song Shuhang said wittily, “It seems that after Senior White goes in, Young Sis White will come out.”","!!","The stone tablet asked in puzzlement, “What?”","“It’s nothing. I’m just joking around. Don’t mind me.” Song Shuhang’s desire to live suddenly burst out, and he forcibly suppressed the rampant speculations flashing through his mind.","Some thoughts could only be relegated to the depths of one’s mind and never shared with others.","Otherwise, those thoughts could bring you death.","The stone tablet: “...”","Song Shuhang asked, “So, it’s because you have to suppress whatever this thing is that you cannot leave this place, right?”","They could now communicate with one another, so he wanted to confirm things through the stone tablet’s reply.","When the time came, he would report this matter to Senior White Two.","The stone tablet replied, “Yes, I cannot follow you back until my mission is over.”","Song Shuhang said “Then, I’ll cast a technique to push you back into the ground. Afterward, I will tell Senior White Two about your situation.”","“White Rabbit? Who is White Rabbit?” The stone tablet found itself confused.","“You misheard me. I didn’t say white rabbit,” Song Shuhang said seriously. “I’m talking about Senior White of the Netherworld, your master.”","The stone tablet replied, “Oh, Black White.”","Song Shuhang asked, “What?”","“It’s nothing, it’s nothing. I misspoke. Actually, you misheard,” the stone tablet also said seriously. “Yes, you misheard.”","Song Shuhang hugged the stone tablet and stared at it.","Although the stone tablet did not have any eyes, it seemed to be also “watching” Song Shuhang.","After a while, both of them suddenly let out a hearty laughter.","Whether it was White Rabbit or Black White, they were both nicknames that could not be mentioned in front of Netherworld’s Senior White.","After looking at each other and smiling, Song Shuhang and the stone tablet found that they matched each other well. As a result, the duration of the One With the Saber Realm increased slightly.","The stone tablet said, “After I finish my mission, let’s work together.”","“I was thinking the same.” Song Shuhang nodded and said, “In the future, when I go to fight big shots, I hope to bring you with me. I feel like we’re very compatible.”","The stone tablet reminisced. “Fighting big shots, how nostalgic. Back then, my master took me to battle everywhere, and every twenty or so years, we would challenge a big shot. Back in those days, I had quite the reputation throughout the entire universe.”","As soon as one reached a certain age, they would start missing the past.","Magical treasures were no exception to this phenomenon.","After reminiscing, the stone tablet asked, “Do you also like to fight big shots? Have you fought against a lot of them?”","“More or less, but I haven’t really gone against that many.” Song Shuhang gestured with his hand and said, “And to be honest, I don’t really like going against big shots that much, but I just end up having to confront them out of nowhere. Sometimes, it’s not even my fault. I’d just be chilling at home when a random big shot appears out of nowhere.”","Nonetheless, it was really exciting whenever he went against a big shot.","“It seems like there’s a problem with your luck,” the stone tablet said. “Speaking of which, on average, do you go against a big shot once every few decades?”","Once every few decades?","This question stumped Song Shuhang.","“On average, I’d say once every... year?” Song Shuhang said with a guilty conscience.","Even Wielder of the Will White would have intervals of around 20 years between his fights with big shots. It seemed like there really was something wrong with him.","“Once every year? This frequency is a bit too high,” the stone tablet commented.","Then, it paid closer attention to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was currently between the Sixth and Seventh Stage Realm.","I see.","Since he’s at the Sixth Stage Realm, then the “big shots” this guy should be fighting should be Seventh Stage Venerables or Eighth Stage Profound Sages, right?","In that case, this frequency is a bit more understandable.","The stone tablet said confidently, “I roughly understand your situation. However, it doesn’t matter that much. As your strength improves, you will find stronger enemies. At that time, I will be with you, and you can fight whichever big shot you wish. Then, I will take you to fight against real big shots, those that are at the pinnacle of the universe.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Stronger enemies?","He could not help but glance at his blacklist.","Demon Emperor Hezhi, the Indestructible Lord.","There was also the Heavenly Emperor, who claimed to be neutral.","And there were also the fat ball and the big-eyed planet, who were currently not on the blacklist.","Big shots who are even more powerful than those on the list... Does it mean that I have to fight the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will?!","Song Shuhang said firmly, “Alright, it’s a deal then.”","If one day in the future, a little cultivator like him had the opportunity to fight against the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will, then he would definitely bring this stone tablet with him.","The stone tablet said boldly, “A gentleman can’t go back on his word. I have a hunch that my mission will end within a year. At that time, we can bravely venture into the outside world together.”","...","As Song Shuhang and the stone tablet chatted, the relationship between the two grew closer.","The One With the Saber Realm strengthened, and the duration kept on increasing.","Song Shuhang said, “Then, see you in a year.”","“I wanted to chat with you for a while longer. Unfortunately, I have a mission to accomplish.” The stone tablet sighed.","They both felt as if the other was a close friend. The more they talked, the more they wanted to continue talking, feeling reluctant to part.","Song Shuhang said enthusiastically, “Then, I’ll be sending Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet back.”","The stone tablet replied, “There must come a time for parting. Little friend Song, you don’t need to bother. I shall take my leave myself.”","With that, the One With the Saber Realm came to an end.","Song Shuhang and the stone tablet’s consciousnesses returned to their bodies.","The stone tablet shook slightly several times.","Song Shuhang’s head floated up, and his arms made of hair performed the “cupping hands” gesture as a way to send the other party off.","...","“Fwoo~”","The stone tablet rose automatically, broke through the space of the world within a world, and returned to the crystal world.","In the next moment, it crashed back into the hole it came from.","“Ah! I forgot to ask if Senior White entered the secret realm that the tablet is suppressing...” Song Shuhang suddenly remembered.","He hastily stretched out his hand to stop the stone tablet—","“Whoosh~”","At that moment, something whooshed past him.","It was the wooden body, which seemed to be attracted by some kind of force.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","He quickly stretched out his arms made of hair and grabbed the hands of the wooden body.","The wooden body also grabbed back at Song Shuhang.","A huge suction force exploded from the wooden body.","Song Shuhang and it were pulled out of the world within a world, falling towards the hole that the stone tablet went into.","The wooden body was being drawn by the stone tablet!","Song Shuhang: “...”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, this isn’t very kind of you. Why are you taking my wooden body with you as you leave?!"]},{"number":2112,"title":"Chapter 2112 Do not join repeatedly","paragraphs":["2112 Do not join repeatedly","People who appreciate each other regret not having met earlier.","In one’s life, one encounters all kinds of different people. One could simply pass by them, glance at them once, or become acquaintances with them.","Among the many encounters, there’s a chance that two people could become close friends, discovering that they have endless common topics and share the same interests and hobbies.","A find such as this was always possible, but it was rare nevertheless.","However...","This action of taking advantage of every opportunity to benefit yourself is not something that I, surnamed Song, approve of! Song Shuhang thought to himself as he grabbed the wooden body, getting dragged away with it.","How could I have been so mistaken about Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet?","The person— Ugh, the magic treasure that I regretted not having met earlier, how did it turn out to be the type of treasure that plucks up the feathers of wild geese whenever it passes them by?","Could it be that I was mistaken about it?","No, there must be some other reason.","After investigating the matter carefully, Song Shuhang noticed that it was not the stone tablet that was pulling the wooden body, but the wooden body that was closely clinging to the stone tablet!","It’s actually the wooden body that took the initiative to follow the stone tablet?","I blamed Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet for nothing.","“What is the wooden body doing?” Song Shuhang quickly gave the wooden body an order to leave the stone tablet alone.","The wooden body made a seal with its hands, but it was useless.","A strong attraction had been generated between it and the stone tablet, causing them to pull at each other.","At this moment, Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair on Song Shuhang’s head said, “It’s because of the previous technique.”","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","Pavilion Master Chu explained, “When you were in that sphere before, you controlled the wooden body to use a technique to collect the stone tablet. However, due to the resistance of the stone tablet, you failed to collect it. Now, the wooden body suffered the backlash of the technique, and it is being sucked toward the stone tablet.”","At that time, if Song Shuhang had not been quick to stop the wooden body from making hand seals, perhaps the wooden body would’ve already been sucked into the stone tablet.","However, a faint connection was established between the wooden body and the stone tablet. When the distance between the two grew closer, they would start attracting the other.","And because the strength of the stone tablet was much higher than that of the wooden body, when the stone tablet drilled into the ground, the wooden body was also dragged into the ground.","Song Shuhang: “...”","In other words, my wooden body cannot leave the stone tablet for the time being...","How troublesome.","Song Shuhang had been planning to regrow his body until his arms and then combine with the wooden body to form a four-armed body. If he added the virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and his ghost spirit to the mix, he could even construct a perfect, ten-armed body!","If he added his twenty arms made of hair, then he could create a thirty-armed body!","At that time, he would be able to launch thirty different attacks all at once. Who in the same realm as him would be able to stop him?","He would become the strongest True Monarch, or maybe even the strongest Venerable later on!","It felt very compelling to him.","Before Su Clan’s Seven advanced to the Sixth Stage, he was recognized by Earth’s cultivation forces as the strongest Spirit Emperor, and he was unmatched in the Fifth Stage.","As long as people on Earth mentioned Su Clan’s Seven, the first thoughts that came to their minds were “the strongest in the Fifth Stage”, “greatest Spirit Emperor”, and so on.","Senior Seven was about 1.9 meters tall, but his aura made him out to be at least 2.8 meters!","If I can also become the strongest True Monarch or Venerable...","Hmm, but now that I think about it, it wouldn’t make much sense.","After all, the name Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is already notorious.","What a pity. I feel like I missed such a great opportunity to make a grand impression on everyone.","Pavilion Master Chu guessed, “However, the backlash of this kind of magical technique should not be permanent. After a month or two at most, this connection should disappear.”","Song Shuhang sighed. “But I can’t just leave my wooden body here for a month or two.”","This was the trial area of the Beast Realm’s Garre Holy Mountain. It was a sacred location and not his backyard. At the very least, with Song Shuhang’s current strength, he could not come and go as he wished in this place.","If the wooden body was left here, only the heavens knew when he would have an opportunity to take it back.","It would have been really great if he could use his Inner World.","As long as he put the wooden body inside the Inner World, he would have no need to worry about the attraction that the stone tablet exerted on it.","The size-reducing purse in Song Shuhang’s hand could also hold the wooden body, but that was also pointless. The wooden body would probably be pulled toward the stone tablet, dragging the size-reducing purse together with it.","And as for the magical bracelet, it could not hold the wooden body; the wooden body was a living item and not an inanimate object.","“Boom~”","At this time, the stone tablet finally reached the bottom of the pit, returning to its original position.","“Huh? Little friend Song, why did you follow me?” The stone tablet looked curiously at Song Shuhang.","After it landed, the wooden body and Song Shuhang’s head fell on it.","Could it be that little friend Song is reluctant to part with me and wants to continue talking with me?","“It’s a long story.” Song Shuhang sighed.","The wooden body sat upright. It lifted Song Shuhang’s shoulders, placing him on its own shoulders.","Song Shuhang simply explained the current state of his wooden body to the stone tablet.","“It seems that there is indeed fate between us.” The stone tablet was in a good mood. “Why don’t you just stay with me for a month or two, little friend Song? I can send you away after the backlash from the magical technique disappears.”","...","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “Although I really want to continue talking with Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, I still have a lot of things to deal with. I will ask Senior White Two and see if he can deal with the backlash of the technique. ”","The stone tablet asked curiously, “You can get in touch with Black White? He’s in the Netherworld, so how could it be so convenient for you to communicate with him?”","Song Shuhang said, “I have a special chat group called Cultivation. It’s a great tool. Right, I wonder if Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet can join this chat group. Do you want to try?”","He had not added a magical treasure to his chat group yet.","He wanted to add Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword to the group, but the QR code Golden Core Composition was not perfect at that time. In addition, there were also the restrictions of the Black Dragon World, so he never got to add it as a friend.","As he spoke, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and summoned a QR code projection.","“What is this?” The stone tablet released its mental energy and scanned the QR code.","[Beep~ You have already joined the Cultivation group, please do not join repeatedly.]","The stone tablet: “???”","At the same time, Song Shuhang received a similar message.","Yet, the name of the stone tablet was clearly not on his friend list.","...","“Strange, I failed to add it.” Song Shuhang frowned.","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “What’s going on?”","Song Shuhang told Pavilion Master Chu about how he failed to add the stone tablet as a friend.","“There are two possibilities.” Pavilion Master Chu analyzed, “The first possibility is that you and it have become one through the One with the Saber Realm, so it has become your friend by default.”","The stone tablet retorted, “Mind you, I’m a stone tablet.”","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “But it’s not in my friend list.”","Pavilion Master Chu continued, “Then, the second possibility is that the mental fluctuations of the magical treasure are the same as its master. Could it be that the Cultivation group has defaulted the stone tablet to someone in your friend list?”","This possibility was very high!","??????","Meanwhile, somewhere in the Beast Realm","In a swamp full of crows, powerful black energy exuded from a black stele.","“What’s going on? I clearly sensed that the source of the suppression was moving. Why did it go back?” the big black stele mused.","Did that infected called Yingda fail to take the item away?","But even if he failed, some information should have been sent over, right?","The information transmission technology attached to Yingda was so advanced that it could break the information into thousands of small fragments, so it was almost impossible for it to be completely intercepted.","While it was in thought, a fragment of information was transmitted to it.","It was a message from Yingda.","The big black stele read the piece of information.","A screen appeared.","On the screen, a head was swinging wildly, and the hair on the top of this head slashed fiercely, destroying the phantom.","Although it was just a fragment, fortunately, the quality was good enough that the face was recognizable.","The big black stele said in a deep voice, “Who’s head is that? Check the information in the database.”"]},{"number":2113,"title":"Chapter 2113 I can lend you a hand","paragraphs":["2113 I can lend you a hand","The black stele wanted to discover whose head was that.","Although it was merely a fragment of information, the black stele could sense that this head, or the attack that resulted from the head using that strand of hair, was extremely powerful.","It was an attack close to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm in terms of power.","With the vast amount of records in its database, as long as it had a good look at the other party’s face, it could figure out their identity.","It would not let this matter rest until it was dealt with.","With the command issued by the black stele, the huge database at its disposal was scanned in an attempt to find the owner of the head.","This is the era of data and information!","Don’t think that you can get away after messing with me!","In addition, it’s time to proceed with the next stage of my plan in regards to the source of suppression in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","That item had left for a short moment.","Although it had returned immediately, the black stele managed to make use of that small window to advance its plans.","??????","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang went through his friend list again, confirming that he had not added the stone tablet.","“If the second possibility that Senior Pavilion Master Chu mentioned is correct, perhaps Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s mental energy is considered to be the same as that of ‘Senior White’ or ‘Senior White Two.’ Maybe you can already log into your account,” Song Shuhang looked at the stone tablet, asking it to give it a try.","The stone tablet’s body vibrated like a phone that had received a text message. “I can’t.”","“It seems that I can only wait for my Cultivation group to be upgraded again.” Song Shuhang sighed regretfully.","The stone tablet also vibrated regretfully. It and little friend Song had hit it off so well, and they both felt regret for not having met earlier.","Without a way to remotely communicate with each other, who knows when they would have another opportunity to chat!","Song Shuhang said, “Senior Stone Tablet, please keep this QR code. Next month, you can try scanning it again. If my Cultivation group has been upgraded by then, it might be able to distinguish you from Senior White or Senior White Two. At that time, you can add me as a friend, and we can chat anytime. If not, just try scanning it every... Hm, every other month.”","Seven Nascent Soul Fetuses had taken form inside his body.","Next, all that he needed to do was to master the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and regrow the rest of his body. Then, he would be able to produce seven Nascent Souls in one go.","As soon as he birthed those Nascent Souls, he could step into the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, and the Cultivation group would definitely receive another round of upgrades.","“Sure!” The stone tablet seemed as if it had entered vibration mode, as it would vibrate non-stop every time it answered.","Song Shuhang said, “I’ll try to contact Senior White Two now.”","Let’s see if Senior White Two can help me deal with this attraction between the wooden body and the stone tablet.","Song Shuhang used the energy-transmission function of the Cultivation group to transfer 1 point of energy to Senior White Two with the following message attached to it, [Senior White, are you there?]","[Beep~ No Tyrannical Song has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Senior White, are you there?] The stone tablet shook slightly. It had received a message.","The stone tablet: “...”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Both felt the point of energy leaving Song Shuhang’s body and entering the stone tablet’s body.","Due to this point of energy, the connection between them became even stronger.","Song Shuhang said with mild vexation, “It seems that you are on Senior White Two’s account.”","It seemed that due to them being so close, the stone tablet had intercepted the energy that Song Shuhang meant to transmit to Senior White Two.","Ugh, doesn’t that mean that it’s impossible for me to contact Senior White Two?","Pavilion Master Chu said, “Since Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet can receive energy, can it use the function to send a point of energy to the Netherworld’s Senior White?”","The stone tablet shook its body and replied, “No, I don’t have a user interface. I don’t think I can do anything other than passively receive messages.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","This was truly troublesome. It did not have access to any operational functions, and it could only passively receive messages. It was pretty much just interfering with how things currently stood.","Song Shuhang said, “Unfortunately, I cannot access my Inner World right now. Otherwise, I could have contacted Senior White Two directly.”","“Inner World? Do you mean a small world?” The stone tablet was startled. “Black... No, no, no, Netherworld Ruler White... lives in your small world?”","Little friend Song, you bastard!","Black White has incredible powers. If he’s really staying in your small world, then he would definitely be able to hear every word between us.","Although Garre Holy Mountain’s space confinement is powerful, how can it block the senses of Netherworld Ruler Black White?","You and I are done for!","Moreover, why does a little cultivator like you at the Sixth Stage have something as incredible as a small world?","The stone tablet felt as if it had been implicated by little friend Song.","Because the two of them had similar interests and had a great time chatting, it may have overlooked a lot of things.","After it calmed down and thought about things carefully, it felt that little friend Song may have put it in a lot of trouble.","Song Shuhang said, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, don’t worry, Black... White Two, lives in the ‘world of the black lotus’ in the Netherworld Realm. He is the ruler of the Netherworld, how can he live in my small world?”","The stone tablet heaved a sigh of relief.","That was right, Black White was the ruler of the Netherworld, and he could not enter the main world. It had nearly forgotten about that fact.","“The reason I can contact Senior White Two through my Inner World is that my Inner World is connected to Senior White Two’s world of the black lotus.” Song Shuhang explained.","“F*ck!” The stone tablet’s heart skipped a beat. Little friend Song, you are a big fool! If two small worlds are connected, what’s the difference?!","Song Shuhang added, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, don’t worry. Recently, Senior White Two has fallen into a trap of the other ruler of the Netherworld. Because of that, he is in a sealed state, and it will take many years for him to free himself.”","...","In fact, it was not only Senior White Two’s main body that had been sealed by the fat ball, a clone of his was also sealed.","Senior White Two’s consciousness was bound to a crystal in the world of the black lotus.","The stone tablet’s heart settled down again. “Next time, when you have something to say, say everything at once. Don’t beat around the bush. When people get older, their hearts can’t handle such things.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Do you have a heart?”","The stone tablet glanced at Song Shuhang and sneered, “Don’t you have one too?”","After the two finished speaking, they stared at each other.","After a while, the man and the tablet laughed heartily.","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","The stone tablet said, “Little friend Song, if you want to open your Inner World, I can lend you a hand.”"]},{"number":2114,"title":"Chapter 2114 Holding a rice bowl made of gold yet begging for food","paragraphs":["2114 Holding a rice bowl made of gold yet begging for food","“Lend me a hand?” Song Shuhang’s eyes scanned the stone tablet’s body.","Rending hearts was a kind of disease, but when this disease flared up, it was very refreshing; it made people fall into a state of being unable to extricate themselves from it.","Among many, a famous victim of this very phenomenon was the Heavy Metal Sect that Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue belonged to.","That sect was obsessed with rending the hearts of its customers, and it was famous all over the world for its exquisite heart-rending skills and forging mastery. For them, the happiness of rending hearts was something that outsiders had no way of understanding.","“Stop, I know what you’re thinking.” The stone tablet laughed. “But I actually do have arms!”","Then, a large number of arms emerged from behind the stone tablet, making it look like it was imitating the Thousand Hands Guanyin.","Song Shuhang said with heartfelt admiration, “You’re amazing, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Song Shuhang asked, “Right, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, can you get rid of the spatial confinement?”","The stone tablet smiled slightly and said, “I have been in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area for so long that I’ve practically become part of it. I couldn’t be any more familiar with the spatial confinement here.”","Song Shuhang said happily, “Are you saying that you can undo the spatial lock?”","If he could access his Inner World, he could do a lot more.","“I don’t have that authority as I’m not a trial officer,” the stone tablet said slowly. “However, I do have a way to help you sense the spatial confinement. Afterward, you and I must enter the One With the Tablet mode so that I can lend you some of my power. There will be a short period of time where the spatial confinement affecting you will be disturbed, and you can use that small window to open your Inner World. The process is slightly difficult, so you must grasp that opportunity to open your Inner World.”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “I didn’t understand everything, but okay.”","Anyway, everything that the stone tablet said sounded pretty cool.","“You’re going to help him sense the spatial confinement? Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, are you saying that you can help Song Shuhang sense spatial energy in advance?” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, which had returned to its normal length, rose up slightly.","Spatial abilities were abilities that only Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders had access to. If the stone tablet could allow Song Shuhang to “sense” spatial energy while he was only in the Sixth Stage Realm, the means at its disposal were simply heaven-defying.","Song Shuhang said curiously, “Is it difficult to sense spatial energy in advance?”","Pavilion Master Chu replied, “Of course it is! If it’s not difficult, then how can it be that only Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders can use it?”","Song Shuhang said, “But I seem to remember that Soft Feather’s father, Venerable Spirit Butterfly... Well, he’s now a Sage, but anyway, Senior Spirit Butterfly mastered a part of the principles of space when he was still a Seventh Stage Venerable. At that time, he could already interfere with spatial teleportation.”","There was also Senior White, who awakened his spatial innate skill when he was a Seventh Stage Venerable, and he could use spatial abilities with ease.","There was also Venerable Tornado, the man who most loved the limelight in the world of cultivation, who could interfere with space when he borrowed the power of the magical treasure of his sect.","“Don’t treat those special cases as common occurrences.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair tapped Song Shuhang’s head lightly. “The world is so big, so there will always be some people who are special. However, that does not mean that everyone is special and can just influence space when they are at the Seventh Stage.”","“I understand.” Song Shuhang nodded, and said to the stone tablet seriously, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, please teach me.”","Song Shuhang sat down solemnly.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair swayed slightly, while the virtuous lamia floated above Song Shuhang’s head.","The virtuous fat whale was propped behind her so that she could lie down comfortably.","Fairy Creation also sat next to Song Shuhang, watching with great interest.","The stone tablet cleared its throat and began to explain the method to sense the spatial confinement. “Little friend Song, have you experienced spatial teleportation? Entering a small world does not count.”","This experience is very important. If he has never experienced spatial teleportation in the past, the following steps will not be easy to carry out.","“Mm-hm, quite often,” Song Shuhang nodded and said. Besides frequently using the spatial passages that Senior White and other big shots created, he had the magical treasure [Ancestral Witch’s Blessing], which allowed him to carry out a 500-meter-range spatial jump.","The stone tablet: “...”","Which Sixth Stage cultivator can experience spatial teleportation quite often? Besides that, do you really think that Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders all have nothing to do and would just open spatial passages for you every day?!","The stone tablet continued to ask him questions, “It’s good that you have experienced it. Then, when you experienced spatial teleportation, did you gain any insights?”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “Yes.”","There were spatial passages that took quite a long to get through, and he gained some insights from them.","In addition, after he swapped places with his clone when he was in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, he gained some understanding of principles of space.","That bit of knowledge was presumably some feedback given to him by the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation.","Moreover, his [Ancestral Witch’s Blessing] glove itself could enhance the wearer’s affinity for space.","And so, Song Shuhang briefly described his understanding of space to the stone tablet.","His sentences were all over the place as he had not learned this knowledge about space systematically.","Pavilion Master Chu said with some surprise, “You actually have quite a bit of understanding of space...”","She knew that Song Shuhang’s theoretical knowledge with regard to cultivation was a complete mess, so she did not expect him to have so many insights into a high-level subject such as space.","Song Shuhang said modestly, “I’ve seen a lot, and I learned something while I was at it.”","“That should be enough,” the stone tablet replied. “Since you have such a deep understanding of space, it should be fine if you simply want to interfere with space.”","The stone tablet continued, “Next, I will apply a magical technique to your eyes so that you can see the elements of the world. Make use of your understanding of space to try and distinguish the element of space from the other elements.”","Song Shuhang asked curiously, “What magical technique are you going to use?”","The stone tablet said, “I don’t remember its name, but it’s a magical technique that does just what I said. Are you ready?”","Song Shuhang nodded. “Yep.”","The many palms behind the stone tablet moved, and one of them pressed against Song Shuhang’s eyes.","Just when the stone tablet’s hand was about to press on Song Shuhang’s eyes, Shuhang’s left eye lit up!","A dazzling golden light was released from the left eye.","Even the stone tablet’s heart skipped a beat when it sensed the power coming from this golden light.","The stone tablet yelled, “What’s wrong with your eye?!”","...","Song Shuhang suddenly remembered the peculiarity of his left eye and quickly apologized, “I’m sorry, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, I forgot to tell you. This eye is the Scholarly Sage’s eye.”","“You cheater.” The stone tablet felt exasperated.","Although it had been carrying out its mission in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area all this while, it still knew of the Scholarly Sage. The trial takers who entered the crystal world in the ancient era would all talk about the Scholarly Sage, who suppressed the entire universe.","Although I do not know why the eye of the incredible Scholarly Sage is installed in the eye socket of little friend Song...","If you have such a powerful eye, why are you not making good use of it?","Can’t you develop the ability of this eye and use it to see the elements of space?","You are holding a rice bowl made of gold yet begging for food!"]},{"number":2115,"title":"Chapter 2115 VIP label","paragraphs":["2115 VIP label","The stone tablet said in exasperation, “Why don’t you try to fully develop the abilities of the Scholarly Sage’s eye?”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, if your words reached the ears of the people in the main world, they would all hunt you down and beat you up.","Practitioners from all over the universe tremble just from hearing about Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s Expert’s Appraisal Technique. They wish for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to never use the abilities of the Scholarly Sage’s eye again.","Yet, you are persuading him to research and further develop the abilities of the Sage’s eye.","If Song Shuhang developed the abilities of the Scholarly Sage’s eye even further and managed to come up with Twins Impregnation, Triplets Impregnation, or even an Abortion Gaze, practitioners from all over the universe would definitely curse you.","Song Shuhang explained, “Actually, I’m still trying to ‘adapt’ to the Scholarly Sage’s eye. After all, it hasn’t even been a few months since I obtained it.”","Moreover, the Scholarly Sage’s eye was a fully automated weapon. He did not need to develop anything as the eye would activate on its own when the time was right.","This was the case for functions such as the Impregnating Gaze, the strengthening of Song Shuhang’s vision, or the “Weak Point Locator”, which automatically marked down Demon Emperor Hezhi’s weak points.","The stone tablet replied, “I see. If it’s only been a few months since you’ve obtained it, then I understand.”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","She wanted to rant, but her words got stuck in her throat, and she was simply left speechless.","Song Shuhang asked, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, what color is the space element? Is there anything special about it?”","While he spoke with the stone tablet, the Scholarly Sage’s eye had already finished upgrading. After being affected by the stone tablet’s magical technique, the Sage’s eye unlocked a new function and now had the ability to see elements.","Song Shuhang could thus see the various elements between heaven and earth.","All kinds of elements filled the world. They came in different colors and shapes, and every element moved around him in a rather lively manner. The world had become very colorful in Song Shuhang’s eyes, and it was not easy to locate the space element among the many other elements in the area.","“Nobody can help you distinguish the space element from the others,” the stone tablet said solemnly. “The ways by which the elements appear in the eyes of a practitioner are always different. Even something as ordinary as the flame element, in the eyes of a thousand different practitioners, will come in a thousand different forms. The elements in the world are very active, and they show different sides to different people. Only you will be able to pick out the space element in your vision through your understanding of space.”","However, there was one thing that the stone tablet did not mention. Unless they had an incredible affinity with the space element, people with a good understanding of space would still take half a month to distinguish it from the other elements.","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “I see.”","No wonder Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked me about my understanding of space.","If a person does not understand enough about space, trying to distinguish the space element from the others is tantamount to finding a needle in a haystack...","“Hehehe.” At this moment, Fairy Creation laughed sweetly.","She jumped lightly and landed in front of Song Shuhang.","The virtuous lamia was taken aback for a moment. She immediately landed behind Fairy Creation, not willing to be outdone.","The two fairies assumed the “white crane spreading its wings while standing on one leg” pose.","Fairy Creation sang, “Please~ Please~ Just ask me~ I’ll help you~”","Song Shuhang asked her for help without hesitation, “Fairy Creation, do you have a way to help me? Can you help me?”","He was a man with no shame, after all.","When he needed to give up something like face, he would do so without hesitation.","Fairy Creation grinned, leaned forward, and reached out to press her hand on Song Shuhang’s eye socket.","The Sage’s eye lit up slightly; a new function had been unlocked.","Although the elements of the world looked different to everyone, Song Shuhang was now ‘seeing’ them with the help of the Sage’s eye.","In Song Shuhang’s field of vision, all the elements were now labeled.","Fire and lightning, these two elements were the most active around Song Shuhang due to the high affinity he had with them.","Other elements such as earth, water, and the elements from the periodic table leisurely floated before Song Shuhang’s eyes.","Searching through the many labels, Song Shuhang quickly found the space element.","He was able to quickly find it mainly due to the label coming with a VIP shining effect.","Did it feel good to have cheats?","Yes, it did!","“Found it.” Song Shuhang laughed. “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, what do we need to do to interfere with the spatial confinement?”","The stone tablet: “...”","What? Aren’t you supposed to take around half a month to sense the space element?","Little friend Song, you aren’t following the script at all!","Fortunately, I didn’t mention that it was supposed to take around half a month to find the space element; otherwise, my face would be all swollen.","Sure enough, when dealing with cheaters like this guy, some words should be kept to oneself.","If you talk too much, it is easy to get slapped in the face. I seem to recall that my master, White, was like this back then, slapping those practitioners who spoke too much in their faces again and again.","Because of that, the stone tablet had some experience in this regard.","After sighing inwardly, it said seriously, “Next, we will enter the One With the Tablet state. With my power, you will be able to ‘see’ the spatial confinement and open it temporarily. The time will be short, so make use of it to open your Inner World.”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “No problem.”","He and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet were on the same wavelength.","With the current level of synchronization between the two, it was very easy for them to enter the One With the Tablet state.","The Sage’s eye was still firmly locked onto the space element and had marked it brightly.","Song Shuhang controlled the wooden body and hugged the stone tablet.","The stone tablet asked, “Ready?”","...","“3, 2, 1, One With the Tablet!” Song Shuhang shouted solemnly.","At the same time, he muttered in his mind, “One With the Saber.”","The spiritual energy of the stone tablet and Song Shuhang synchronized, and their minds worked together to enter the One With the Tablet state.","This time, there was a slight change in Song Shuhang’s spiritual world.","Song Shuhang had become an indomitable giant, and he grasped the stone tablet as if grasping a slate.","The stone tablet exclaimed, “F*ck, you startled me. Why did you grow so big?”","“It’s probably because of the activation of the Scholarly Sage’s eye and its blessing that my spiritual body has become bigger,” Song Shuhang guessed.","The stone tablet: “...”","Anyhow, it was not the time to be talking about the size of their body.","The stone tablet said seriously, “Hold on to me. I will take you to experience spatial energy for yourself.”","Outside the spiritual world, the virtuous lamia stretched out her arm.","...","The virtuous fat whale jumped up and landed on Song Shuhang. In its body, a small object shone brightly."]},{"number":2116,"title":"Chapter 2116 Dear enemy, it’s me again!","paragraphs":["2116 Dear enemy, it’s me again!","This small object looked like a bone.","After the virtuous fat whale landed on Song Shuhang, it merged with his head.","Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia also returned to Song Shuhang’s body with a pretty dive, accompanied by the faint sound of splashing water.","At the same time, in Shuhang’s spiritual world.","The stone tablet said, “Are you ready, little friend Song?”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “I’m ready, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.”","“Next, I will unleash my ‘space authority’ so that you can temporarily touch spatial energy. Time is of the essence, and you have to seize the moment when I release it. In theory, you have no need to worry too much. As long as we are in the One With the Tablet State, we can keep trying without having to worry about failure,” said the stone tablet.","Song Shuhang said, relieved, “Okay, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet!”","He guessed that the stone tablet’s ability to allow him to “touch space” was similar to Venerable Tornado’s ability to cut space when he used the Space Cutting Mother-Child Wheel.","Using the Ninth Stage magical treasure, Tornado could also touch upon spatial energy.","The effect was stronger than his [Ancestral Witch’s Blessing], which made use of spiritual power to perform a simple spatial jump.","The stone tablet exclaimed, “Ready, 3, 2, 1... Initializing the connection!”","Song Shuhang concentrated.","Thanks to the One With the Tablet State, there was extreme compatibility between him and the stone tablet.","The moment the stone tablet released its authority, Song Shuhang successfully connected to its core.","After a while, Song Shuhang asked, “Did it work?”","The stone tablet replied, “Mm-hm, it succeeded. The connection between us is really strong, and it seems like it would be more difficult for us to fail than to succeed.”","Although little friend Song was a bit of a mess, their compatibility was very high.","Still, the stone tablet felt that there was something weird about the entire situation.","During the process, the stone tablet was supposed to play the role of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender’s Tribulation Bone. The Tribulation Bone was known as a “space-travel pass”, and it was something produced in the body of Profound Sages after they ascended to the Ninth Stage Realm.","Without a Tribulation Bone, cultivators couldn’t even sniff the space element.","Through the One With the Tablet State, the stone tablet would release its authority and act as a Tribulation Bone, allowing Song Shuhang to come in contact with the space element for a short time.","Yet, before it even got started, Shuhang instinctively came in contact with the space element.","He did not appear like a novice at all.","Is this guy really a Sixth Stage True Monarch?","Could he be a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender in disguise?","Song Shuhang said happily, “I saw it, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. I sensed the power of space and felt that I could touch it with my hand! This ability is simply amazing!”","He was looking forward to his future cooperation with the stone tablet more and more.","“Hahaha...” The stone tablet laughed heartily.","Because it did not know how else to reply other than by laughing.","Song Shuhang asked, “How do we bypass Garre Holy Mountain’s spatial confinement?”","Back to his physical body, the Sage’s eye glanced around.","With the help of the stone tablet, Song Shuhang saw a deeper level of spatial power. The spatial confinement power of Garre Holy Mountain was like a sea, and it filled every corner of the trial area.","There are no obvious loopholes.","How can I overcome this spatial confinement that seems to be all around me?","Song Shuhang sighed and said, “Is this the confinement of the holy mountain? It’s like a sea. It is everywhere and boundless. Can we really break through it?”","The stone tablet said calmly, “Haha, no matter how powerful a confinement is, there will be loopholes and ways to break it.”","Nonetheless, its heart was in turmoil. It had not even gotten to start introducing anything, yet Song Shuhang had already even noticed Garre Holy Mountain’s spatial confinement.","Don’t you know that if you’re so proficient with things, the bus driver will feel useless?","Can’t you let me carry you along?","“Cough!” The stone tablet cleared its throat and said, “The next step is to create an interference and open a gap. You must seize that small window and open your Inner World.”","Song Shuhang asked, “How am I supposed to interfere with space?”","“There are many methods to do that, but for now, let’s use the simplest and crudest one,” said the stone tablet. “The simplest method is to use my ability and choose a place in the spatial confinement, suppressing it forcefully. By doing that, you will create a gap in the confinement. Before the confinement fills it, access your Inner World.”","Its main function was to suppress things, and when it got serious, everything could be suppressed.","The stone tablet said passionately, “Come, use the method Black White taught you!”","Song Shuhang responded with the same enthusiasm, “Okay, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet!”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","These two guys feel like they are on the same wavelength.","The wooden body performed the hand seals for the magical technique.","The huge stone tablet rose up, targeted a node in the void, and suppressed it. There was a weaker link in the spatial confinement which they had found through the Scholarly Sage’s eye, and they made use of it.","“Boom!”","The stone tablet suppressed the node.","At that small node, the power of the spatial confinement was repelled, forming a gap.","This gap would be filled in one breath of time at most, so they had to be quick.","...","The stone tablet called out, “Now!”","“Inner World, open!” Song Shuhang reached out and pressed against the gap.","The cowardly Inner World opened smoothly.","It worked!","A feeling of joy welled up in the hearts of Song Shuhang and the stone tablet.","??????","At the same time, in a swamp full of crows.","The black stele said, “It’s time!”","While it was paying attention to the information in its database to identify the “head,” it was also manipulating the node left by Yingda in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","??????","When the Inner World opened, countless roots emerged from it.","...","The stone tablet asked, “What’s this?”","Song Shuhang mused, “These are the roots of my Inner World, but I did not summon them. Why did they come out?”","Countless roots brushed past Song Shuhang and the stone tablet, plunging into the void behind them.","There was a small spatial node that was opening there.","A special, hidden type of evil energy of the Netherworld was slowly flowing out of this small node.","The roots of the Inner World joyfully plunged themselves into the evil energy that was flowing out.","The pure evil energy was quickly absorbed by the roots and became nutrition for the Inner World.","“Evil energy of the Netherworld? How did it get here?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Could it be that the thin man left it behind?","??????","In the swamp full of crows.","The black stele said loudly, “What’s going on? What’s going on?!”","The evil energy it had worked so hard to deliver to Garre Holy Mountain seemed to be swallowed by someone.","Who is it? Who dares?!","Pass the information to me immediately!","After a while, fragments of information reached the black stele.","The message formed a picture.","In the picture were a large stone tablet and a familiar head.","There were countless tentacles sticking out from behind the head, stabbing into the evil energy of the Netherworld.","“It’s him again!” The black stele roared angrily.","Opponents were always fated to meet."]},{"number":2117,"title":"Chapter 2117 Shuhang, do you know how to become One With the Tablet?","paragraphs":["2117 Shuhang, do you know how to become One With the Tablet?","That guy had sabotaged the black stele’s plans time and time again. It was as if it was targeting it purposefully.","The black stele gritted its teeth and accelerated the speed at which it checked its database.","If it did not find this guy’s information today, it would lose its mind.","The huge database at its disposal was fully scanned through a multi-threaded effort.","!!","Not long after, it found some information about that head in its database.","This information came from a textbook written by an ancient demonic sect that had been collected by an evil demon of the Netherworld who had gone to the main world.","In the textbook, there was a portrait of a man with only his head and shoulders visible. The stele could not tell if there was that strand of hair or not because, in the portrait, the top of Demon Emperor Hezhi’s head was not visible.","“A source of inspiration for all demonic sects and a great figure of the ancient era, Demon Emperor Hezhi. With only eight dragon patterns, he managed to ultimately step onto a path to immortality, becoming a peak existence even among Immortals. It is rumored that he fought for the position of Wielder of the Heaven’s Will in the past.” The black stele read through the information.","F*ck! This guy even competed for the position of Wielder of the Heaven’s Will!","According to the textbook, it was not as simple as being present while the fight to become the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will took place. It referred to a proper battle for the position, like the one between the Scholarly Sage and the liquid metal ball.","Could it be that Demon Emperor Hezhi has discovered the secret the previous Wielder of the Will left in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area?","That makes sense... Only this kind of secret which is related to a Wielder of the Heaven’s Will would be able to attract someone who’s a peak existence even among Immortals. It is, after all, these peak Immortals who aim to become the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will and attain eternity.","The black stele said in a deep voice, “This guy is difficult to deal with.”","An existence of this level is second only to monsters like the Scholarly Sage. With tens of thousands, if not millions of years having passed, he might have achieved a breakthrough as well, reaching the level of the Scholarly Sage.","If that’s the case, it’s almost impossible to deal with him without bringing him into the Netherworld Realm, the black stele thought to itself.","It quickly sorted out the information and passed it to the Netherworld Realm, asking its master to make a decision.","Opponents at this level were beyond the scope of what it could handle.","However, it was unwilling to give up.","According to the fragmented information it received, Demon Emperor Hezhi was in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area, and he had come in contact with the source of suppression, a very handsome stone tablet!","Such a handsome tablet was simply a rarity among stone monuments!","If Demon Emperor Hezhi managed to impress that handsome stone tablet and obtained the secrets of the previous Wielder of the Will, all of its plans and efforts would have been for naught.","The black stele said firmly, “I won’t give up just like that. The secrets of the previous Wielder of the Will have yet to be uncovered. I still have a chance.”","??????","Meanwhile, the stone tablet stared at the small spatial node, annoyed. “It seems that just after I left my post, someone tampered with this place, setting up this spatial node and remotely transferring some evil energy of the Netherworld here.”","The quality of this evil energy is extremely high. If it were compared to spiritual energy, it would be equivalent to Eighth or Ninth Stage spiritual energy at the very least.","It then looked at Song Shuhang.","Little friend Song is not only a cheater, but also a freak.","His Inner World can directly absorb the evil energy...","This is the evil energy of the Netherworld we’re talking about. It is the complete opposite of the spiritual energy used by cultivators.","For practitioners, the evil energy of the Netherworld was like poison.","Song Shuhang, who was in the One With the Saber state, sensed the gaze of the stone tablet and even its inner thoughts to some extent.","He laughed and said, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, don’t be surprised. After all, I’m from the plant kingdom. Inhaling carbon dioxide and exhaling oxygen are basic operations for me.”","“That makes sense.” The stone tablet was convinced by Song Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Just putting a wooden body under your head makes you part of the plant kingdom? Then, is my body that’s soaked in water all day long part of the fish kingdom?","While they were speaking, the evil energy of the Netherworld stopped flowing out of the spatial node, with the node shrinking and collapsing.","This happened due to the other party forcing the spatial node to self-destruct, lest Song Shuhang’s roots follow the spatial node and reach the source.","Song Shuhang said regretfully, “I thought I could absorb some more evil energy.”","The quality of this wave of evil energy was pretty great, and the Inner World was very satisfied with it.","After the countless lotus projection roots circled around the now-defunct node, they began to retreat slowly.","Song Shuhang reminded the stone tablet, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, be careful with this node.”","Since the evil energy of the Netherworld had appeared, they needed to be careful and take precautions.","Perhaps the culprit had other helpers who could open up new nodes.","“Yeah, I was thinking the same.” The stone tablet laughed.","Their minds were on the same wavelength.","With that said, it urged its suppressing power to cover the surrounding area, forming a personal domain.","It then said to Song Shuhang, “It’s done. Anyway, stop wasting time. Before your Inner World closes again, contact Black... Yo, you don’t understand my heart~ Ohohoho~”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Song Shuhang: “...”","He silently gave Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet a thumbs up.","It had a strong desire to survive, just like him.","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul left his body and entered the Inner World.","At first, he wanted to directly send his wooden body or head into the Inner World, but the entrance turned out to be too small.","As such, he could only settle for the next best thing, letting his primordial soul enter and head to the world of the black lotus to seek Senior White Two’s assistance.","...","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul entered the Inner World, finding itself in the Palace of Winter.","He was not too far from the entrance to the world of the black lotus.","“I need to hurry up or the Inner World will close. If it closes before I leave, my primordial soul will be stranded in the Inner World,” Song Shuhang muttered to himself.","In the next moment, his primordial soul disappeared. Using his authority, he had moved to the entrance of the world of the black lotus.","At the entrance of the world of the black lotus, there was a patch of plants.","It was a type of spiritual plant that Song Shuhang had never seen before, and it did not seem to be from the main world.","Could it be that it’s a plant of the Netherworld Realm placed here by Senior White Two? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","At the same time, he got a strange feeling and turned his head at 6 o’clock, where he saw a familiar figure.","It was a handsome man. By simply standing there, he made the rest of the world lose its colors.","Senior White Two?","“Senior White, why are you here?” Song Shuhang asked in surprise.","...","Last time, didn’t you say that you were sealed and could not leave?","You said that neither your main body nor clone could move.","Senior White Two stood up and replied, “This is my ‘research clone.’ It has no combat power and is specially used for studying magical techniques, magical treasures, and technology.”","He put down the shovel in his hand.","In the grove under his feet, there was a big hole.","Senior White Two asked, “Shuhang, do you know how to become One With the Tablet?”","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “I do. I’m in that state right now.”"]},{"number":2118,"title":"Chapter 2118 Twerking and dancing","paragraphs":["2118 Twerking and dancing","Senior White Two’s research clone smiled slightly. “Shuhang, the primordial soul is a very fragile thing. Every time you have your primordial soul leave your body, you must pay attention to your safety.”","Song Shuhang replied, “I know, Senior White. In the past, whenever I had my primordial soul leave my body, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword would always be by my side to protect me. As for this time, the only reason I had my primordial soul leave my body was to enter the Inner World, so it’s still quite safe.”","After he finished speaking, he glanced at the dense patch of Netherworld plants and asked, “Senior White, are you planting spirit plants?”","“Mm-hm, this is a research project assigned to this clone. I am trying to transplant some Netherworld plants into the main world to see what happens to them. Then, I’ll use these changes to experiment with a magical technique.” Senior White Two’s research clone smiled slightly.","Senior White Two had a lot of research clones.","Song Shuhang squatted by the edge of a big hole and asked doubtfully, “Then, what about this hole? It’s so big. What do you want to plant here?”","Senior White Two laughed and said, “Hmm, how about a Tyrannical Song?”","Song Shuhang: “???”","If I remember correctly, I am Tyrannical Song, right?","Oh, shiet!","Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat. He abruptly jumped to his right and rolled away.","His form was perfect, and he rolled very smoothly.","“Bang!” However, a shovel slammed down on Song Shuhang’s head, who was tactically rolling away.","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul trembled, and he fell to the ground weakly.","Despite his efforts, he could not avoid the shovel.","Even if it was a research clone with no offensive power, that was only in comparison to Senior White Two’s main body.","If they really did not have any power, how could these clones even research magical techniques?","“Shuhang, the primordial soul is very fragile. You need to be more careful.” Senior White Two’s research clone smiled gently. Then, with a light flick of the shovel, he sent Song Shuhang’s primordial soul into the big pit.","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul stretched out its hand tremblingly. “Senior White... I’m not like my wooden body. I can’t grow fruits.”","“Mm-hm, I know.” Senior White Two began to fill the pit with soil.","“Senior White, when... did you come to my Inner World?” Song Shuhang asked tremblingly. He had more or less guessed what had happened.","“Around two days ago.” Senior White Two smiled brightly and sent down a large clod of soil. “Look, I even brought over all these spirit plants and planted them one by one.”","Senior White Two must have heard the exchange between me and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet...","“Don’t worry, you won’t be alone.” Senior White Two’s research clone skillfully filled the hole with soil.","Song Shuhang’s vision began to grow darker as the pit continued to be filled.","Does that mean that someone is going to accompany me?","At such a time, the only one who can accompany me is Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, right?","It turns out that Senior White Two is pretty fair.","For some reason, Song Shuhang became slightly more accepting of his situation.","[No, no, how can I have such bad thoughts? Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and I are friends. I can’t let it suffer like that. So, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, please hurry up and sense my thoughts!]","Song Shuhang and the stone tablet were still in the One With the Tablet state. As such, he hoped that Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet could sense his thoughts and prepare itself mentally.","Senior White Two swung his shovel and buried Song Shuhang’s primordial soul.","After burying Song Shuhang, he left the shovel stuck into the soil and murmured, “I forgot that I could have just used the Ground Leveling Spell.”","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul, which was in the pit, used its authority over the Inner World to quietly watch the development of the situation. He did not even dare to use his mental energy to scan around, afraid of making Senior White Two even angrier.","Senior White Two stretched out his hand. In the next moment, the stone tablet’s spirit was forcibly pulled into the Inner World.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet only had one thought on its mind right now, that little friend Song was such a troublemaker!","In the One With the Tablet state, it did receive Song Shuhang’s warnings.","However, did those warnings even have any use?","Netherworld Ruler White only needed to stretch out his hand, and its spirit was immediately pulled over.","“Thank you for your hard work all these years.” Senior White Two’s research clone grasped the stone tablet. He then found a good location and inserted the tablet’s spirit into the soil.","The stone tablet said passionately, “Even if my body were to be smashed to pieces, I will complete the mission that my master has given me!”","Senior White Two’s research clone said gently, “Since your mission is not over, you may continue to guard the Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area. After you complete your mission, I will find someone to take you back.”","While he was speaking, he squatted down in front of the stone tablet. Then, using his finger as a pen, he began to carve some words onto it.","Large font: [Grave of Song Shuhang]","Small font: [Profound Sage Tyrannical Song died here on November 27, 2019]","Small font: [Erected by Netherworld White]","At the bottom, there was also a small pattern, Shuhang’s QR code Golden Core Composition.","There was a note next to the QR code: [Scan the code to sweep the grave for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song]","After engraving these words, Senior White Two nodded with satisfaction.","The stone tablet asked weakly, “Master, is this really okay?”","No matter what, it was still a very handsome tablet!","“Seems pretty okay to me.” Senior White Two patted the stone tablet lightly and said, “From today onwards, you will be renamed to ‘Tyrannical Song’s Gravestone.’ After you complete your mission, I will allow you to join Song Shuhang and form a team with him. But I have a request, every time Shuhang summons you to face an enemy, you must shout out your new name loudly.”","The stone tablet: “...”","Song Shuhang: “...”","...","Thanks to the One With the Tablet state, a picture appeared in their minds at the same time.","Song Shuhang’s enemy, sword unsheathed, exuded a majestic aura, their sword qi covering the entire area.","On the opposite side, Song Shuhang suddenly summoned a large tablet and shouted, “Bastard, take this attack!” with the stone tablet yelling at the same time, “Tyrannical Song’s Gravestone!”","[Don’t offend me! If you do, I’ll crawl out of the ground, lift my gravestone, and smash you to death with it!]","Senior White Two said with satisfaction, “I feel much better now.”","He waved his hand again.","A demonic hamster, an orangutan, a mirage dragon, and a monster tree with a beautiful face came out of the world of the black lotus.","Senior White Two asked, “Which one of you wants to dance on Tyrannical Song’s grave?”","“Master, allow me!” The demonic hamster burst into joy.","It jumped toward Song Shuhang’s grave, twerking as it danced with joy.","White Two yawned and left the Inner World in satisfaction.","...","After Senior White left, the mirage dragon smiled slightly and said, “No Tyrannical Song, you really became one with the gravestone.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Don’t look down on my master’s inscription, okay?” said the demonic hamster while shaking its butt. “My master’s inscription on the stone tablet means that you have been granted authority.”","Every word engraved by a ruler of the Netherworld would contain law-level powers.","Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","The stone tablet got the same feeling that Song Shuhang did.","The two “looked” at each other through the thick soil."]},{"number":2119,"title":"Chapter 2119 Space and the Divine Weapon Appraisal","paragraphs":["2119 Space and the Divine Weapon Appraisal","Did Senior White’s inscription on the spirit of the stone tablet imply that some kind of authority had been granted to them?","Was there some new ability that they had gained?","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s spirit looked at each other through the soil and smiled knowingly.","The demonic hamster was now sweating profusely. After several routines, it stopped dancing in satisfaction.","“How about burning some incense?” asked the orangutan general.","The mirage dragon said, “Let’s burn some.”","After all, they were here visiting a grave.","The demonic hamster flipped its robe handsomely and said, “But we did not bring any incense sticks.”","“Use my branches. It just so happens that some of my branches have aged and need to be replaced,” said the monster tree with a beautiful face. She shook herself, and a batch of old branches fell off her body.","In the meantime, Song Shuhang, who was underneath the ground, learned a new skill.","After a few minutes, the demonic hamster, the orangutan general, and the mirage dragon inserted “incense sticks” into Song Shuhang’s grave and lit them.","Since the “incense” came from the branches of a monster tree, it lingered for quite a long time after being lit.","The demonic hamster clasped its hands together and said, “No Tyrannical Song, on this day next year, I will come over to tend to your grave.”","Song Shuhang’s voice sounded from underneath the ground. “Don’t bother with it.”","How could I possibly be in this grave this same day next year?","“My master said that he’s going to bury you here again on this day next year to celebrate,” the demonic hamster added. “So, on this day next year, I will come to dance and burn incense for you again.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","The stone tablet: “...”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet wanted to laugh at first but realized that if Song Shuhang was going to get captured and buried again next year, it would have to act as his gravestone. Because of that, it didn’t like laughing anymore.","They were both in the same boat. If one prospers, they both prosper; if one fails, they both fail.","“See you next year.” The demonic hamster waved its paw and went back to the world of the black lotus.","“Live well.” The mirage dragon also pulled itself away and left.","“A burial today, a resurrection tomorrow. Don’t despair,” said the orangutan general as it patted the gravestone.","The beautiful-faced monster tree simply smiled and did not say anything.","??????","After Senior White Two’s pets left, the stone tablet sighed heavily.","Song Shuhang, who was under the grave, also sighed. “I thought I was going to die for real.”","“Me too,” the stone tablet said. “For the time being, we need to control our mouths.”","Song Shuhang said, “I agree.”","I did not expect Senior White Two to have something like research clones. I need to be more careful in the future.","After a few more minutes.","“Well, little friend Song, when are we leaving?” the stone tablet’s spirit asked. “Given the time, the exit of the Inner World should be closing soon, right?”","“How about right now?” Song Shuhang’s primordial soul emerged from the ground.","He was a primordial soul right now, so it was easy for him to pass through objects.","As such, he could naturally escape from the graveyard.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “Can’t you leave your grave normally? You just floated out of your grave like a ghost. That shocked me.”","“Come on, we’re cultivators. Why would we be afraid of ghosts?” Song Shuhang’s primordial soul patted the non-existent soil on his body and then said, “Besides, is there even an ordinary way to get out of a grave?”","The stone tablet shook slightly and said, “Now that you say that, you do have a point.”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Song Shuhang said, “Let’s go. We should leave the Inner World quickly.”","If they stayed here any longer, the Inner World would really clo—","Song Shuhang shouted, “F*ck!”","The stone tablet asked, “What happened?”","“The Inner World just closed,” Song Shuhang said with a stifled heart. “There was a fist-sized spatial exit until a moment ago, but it suddenly closed.”","The stone tablet “looked” at the sky.","Little friend Song, you’re really a troublemaker","Song Shuhang asked, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, what do we do?”","“You ask me, but who am I supposed to ask? I don’t know either.” The stone tablet felt that it was evolving. It felt as if it had a heart now, since it felt very stifled.","“Right, Senior Chu...” Song Shuhang suddenly remembered the strand of hair on the top of his head.","Pavilion Master Chu’s main body was in the Inner World.","Relying on her strength as an Immortal, she could probably forcibly open a spatial passage between the Inner World and Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","“I’m sorry, the Senior Chu you’re trying to call is taking a nap.” A robotic voice came from Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Pavilion Master Chu was obviously still angry, likely because he used her hair as a sword earlier.","...","With this being the case, Song Shuhang could only look for alternatives.","He said via voice transmission, “Senior Turtle, can you help me open a passage between the Inner World and Garre Holy Mountain?”","“Heavens~ Shuhang, I don’t have such power,” Senior Turtle replied via voice transmission.","Even if its strength had not been sealed by the Great Northern Emperor, it was just a normal Tribulation Transcender. It had no way of breaking through the spatial confinement of Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","In its current state, it was naturally much less capable of doing such a thing since its strength was only at the Eighth Stage Realm.","What do I do then?","Should I go back to the world of the black lotus and look for Senior White Two?","But what if I get buried again?","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked up at the sky.","The stone tablet accompanied him.","“It looks like we’re on our own,” said the stone tablet.","...","“Yeah, I was thinking the same thing,” Song Shuhang said. “It seems that people can only rely on themselves in the end.”","This was the result of everything he did earlier.","The stone tablet said passionately, “Little friend Song, let’s try once again with the One With the Tablet state!”","Song Shuhang said, “Let’s change... the words a bit. I feel like I’m becoming a little allergic to the name ‘One With the Tablet’.”","The stone tablet paused slightly and said, “Me too. What do we use then?”","“One With the Saber?” Song Shuhang suggested.","“You’re the saber!” the stone tablet retorted angrily. “I suggest Tablet With the Saber.”","Song Shuhang accepted it without making a fuss, “Okay, then the ‘Tablet With the Saber’ it is. Anyway, it’s just a name.”","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul and the stone tablet’s spirit resonated.","The two entered the Tablet With the Saber state.","Song Shuhang willed it, and the Inner World Assistant appeared between Song Shuhang and the stone tablet to assist them.","Song Shuhang said, “I can sense it, the space element...”","The stone tablet said, “Very good, let’s move on to the next step then. We need to find a way to form a connection with my main body and break the spatial confinement of the trial area again! Try any space-related means that you have.”","Song Shuhang muttered, “I’ll try. Inner World Assistant, prepare to open an exit out of the Inner World.”","The stone tablet suddenly called out, “Wait, what are you doing? My body feels a little cold.”","Song Shuhang said, “It’s the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal?, a spatial technique that I recently mastered. Rest assured, this is different from the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?, it is not a weird technique.”","This was also the only secret technique related to “space” that he knew.","He still had the ?Universe Hiding Sleeve? that Senior White gave him, but he didn’t know how to use it.","The stone tablet said, “Eh? It seems to be working. A spatial passage is being opened.”","“I can also feel it. Things are going well.” Song Shuhang laughed. He then stretched out his hand to explore the void.","His palm directly passed through the Inner World, and then grabbed a familiar saber handle.","It was his treasured saber Broken Tyrant."]},{"number":2120,"title":"Chapter 2120 Burial","paragraphs":["2120 Burial","Song Shuhang: “...”","From what he knew, Broken Tyrant should’ve been on Heavenly Field Island. When he last left the island, he accidentally left the saber there together with his disciple Chu Chu.","He planned on retrieving them after returning from the Beast Realm, but little did he expect that when he stretched his hand to explore the void, he would end up grabbing Broken Tyrant.","But now that he thought about it, Broken Tyrant had a ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? mark left on it by the virtuous lamia.","The ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? that Slow-Witted Song left him had a misleading name.","From the name, one would think that it was a magical technique meant for appraising divine weapons.","Yet, its function was to leave marks on magical treasures. Then, through the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal?, no matter where one was, they could lock onto the coordinates of the treasure and pull it toward them.","This was a secret technique that could only be used by big shots at the Tribulation Transcender Realm or certain geniuses who had a great affinity with space.","“Have I grasped the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal??” said Song Shuhang as he grabbed the handle of the treasured saber.","However, the truth was that he hadn’t truly mastered spatial powers.","It was only by relying on the Scholarly Sage’s Eye, Tyrannical Song’s Tombstone, the Inner World, and the support from the virtuous lamia that he managed to activate the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal?.","Moreover, since the Inner World was used as a transit, when Song Shuhang held the handle of Broken Tyrant, he felt that his body could follow his arm and directly reach the location of the treasured saber.","“This is great!” Song Shuhang chuckled.","“What happened this time?” the stone tablet wondered.","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “This ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? is really great. It’s much more interesting than I imagined.”","He always had to enter and exit his Inner World from the same location, and this made it easy for him to be targeted.","When he still had his clone, he could use its coordinates to open another exit out of the Inner World. However, after his clone got stranded in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, Song Shuhang lost this ability.","But today, the treasured saber Broken Tyrant gave him access to that ability once more as it could act as coordinates for an exit!","And it would be easy to create more such coordinates.","As long as the virtuous lamia left marks on some sturdy and durable objects and placed them in the right places, Song Shuhang could use the combination of the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? and the Inner World to create a whole network he could teleport to.","And if he further practiced with the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal?, he might even be able to use this magical technique in battle.","This was a magical technique with great potential.","The stone tablet asked, “Does this mean that we can go back to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area?”","Song Shuhang: “...” No, I can only take us to Heavenly Field Island right now.","The stone tablet said earnestly, “If so, stop messing around and let’s go.”","“Don’t worry. Just leave this to me, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.” Song Shuhang thought for a while, and his primordial soul, which was holding Broken Tyrant, let go of the saber.","He did not retrieve the treasured saber Broken Tyrant and let it stay where it was.","After he left Garre Holy Mountain, he could try to teleport to Heavenly Field Island by using Broken Tyrant’s coordinates.","Then, Song Shuhang cast the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? again.","This time, he got a much better feeling.","The stone tablet smiled and said, “I can feel the aura of Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.”","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul nodded.","He stretched out his arm and grabbed at the void with all his strength, grabbing another handle-shaped object.","“F*ck, who is it? That nearly frightened me to death! Don’t think I won’t cut you down!” the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword’s cute voice sounded. “If you want to die, die alone! Don’t drag me with you!”","Song Shuhang hurriedly called out, “Senior, please show mercy! It’s me, Song Shuhang!”","“If I had not detected your aura, I would have cut you up instantly.” While saying this, the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword forcefully moved away.","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul was pulled to where the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword was.","“Wait, don’t leave me!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said anxiously. Its spirit leaped and caught up to Song Shuhang’s primordial soul.","In the next moment, it and Song Shuhang were pulled to where the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword was.","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul was dragged out of the Inner World and crashed into a patch of yellow sand.","A desert?","Moreover, this desert is quite enthusiastic... There’s a sandstorm!","Song Shuhang shouted, “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, you tricked me!”","“Hehehe, don’t forget that I’m an inner demon,” the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword said cheerfully. “Besides, you were the one who tricked me first.”","Song Shuhang: “???”","The stone tablet: “...”","In short, I, an innocent stone tablet, unwittingly became involved in this mess.","A fierce wind blew over, and the yellow sand came at them like waves in the sea.","Not long after, Song Shuhang, the stone tablet, and Scarlet Heaven Sword were buried alive together.","The sandstorm came and went by quickly. This was obviously not a natural sandstorm.","After the storm, the desert returned to calm.","In the endless desert, there was a large stele, and beside the stele, there was an ancient black sword.","The desert, the stele, the ancient sword...","The whole place gave off a lonely vibe.","...","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul, which was buried in the sand, suffered a throbbing pain in its non-existent liver.","He was feeling sorry for himself for getting buried alive twice in quick succession.","He asked, “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, where’s Senior White?”","Sixteen and Sister White Dragon told him that Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword had disappeared with Senior White.","Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “He’s nearby... Before you caught me, he and I were avoiding the sandstorm. If you had not suddenly reached out and grabbed my sword hilt, I would have successfully avoided the sandstorm like Fellow Daoist White.”","That was why Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword felt a little dejected just now.","While hiding from the sandstorm, a hand suddenly grabbed it, causing it to be sucked into the storm.","“I’m sorry.” Song Shuhang was a man who knew when to admit mistakes.","“It’s alright. I have written down this grudge, and I will make you pay for it in the future,” the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword said cheerfully. “After all, I am an inner demon.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Huh? Shuhang?” While they were speaking, Senior White’s figure descended from the sky.","...","Senior White’s clothes were spotless. He had avoided the sandstorm masterfully. In addition, he was holding a pillar-like spirit stone in his hand. This was a small, sealed spirit vein that Senior White harvested during the sandstorm.","“Shuhang, how did you enter this place?” After landing, Senior White saw the stone tablet. “Is this your tombstone? Profound Sage Tyrannical Song died here on November 27, 2019... Pfft, Shuhang, is this a gravestone you bring with you when you seek death?”","Are you afraid that nobody will recognize you after you die and tend to your grave? Is that why you bring your own gravestone? Are you planning on being buried the moment you die?","It really feels like little friend Shuhang has been becoming a lot more self-conscious lately.","Senior White squatted in front of the gravestone, knocked on the stone tablet, and asked, “What are you playing at? Do you want me to dig you out?”","“Senior White, I’m not playing around,” Song Shuhang said solemnly. “It was just my artistic soul acting up.”","“What?” Senior White was puzzled.","“While buried under the sand, I thought of a poem,” Song Shuhang said. “Then homesickness took the shape of a grave. I am inside, and Senior White is outside.”","The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”"]},{"number":2121,"title":"Chapter 2121 Independent world","paragraphs":["2121 Independent world","As the old saying goes, if you do not seek death, you will not die. This was a simple truth, yet why was it that some people just couldn’t understand it?","The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword believed that it would not be excessive if Senior White took out Meteor Sword and stabbed it into the ground, piercing Song Shuhang’s primordial soul.","Senior White patted the stone tablet and said softly, “Don’t worry, Shuhang. When the time comes that you truly die, I will remember to sweep your grave every year. Now that I think about it, Sword Monarch Liu Er’s death anniversary isn’t too far off... If you pass away in the next few days, I can sweep yours and Sword Monarch Liu Er’s grave at the same time in the future. At that time, you’ll truly be inside the grave while I’ll be outside.”","Sword Monarch Liu Er was a good friend of Senior White, and several of the fellow daoists in the Nine Provinces Number One Group also knew him.","!!","He was a Sixth Stage True Monarch, and he fell to his inner demons when he tried to break into the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm thirty years ago. His body was reduced to ashes, and his soul was erased from the world.","When Senior White came out of his recent seclusion, he could only sigh after hearing from Yellow mountain that Sword Monarch Liu Er had failed to transcend his tribulation.","“If you want to die, then hurry up and choose one of these coming few days.” Senior White squatted down and patted the grave soil lightly.","Song Shuhang under the gravestone hastily shouted, “No, Senior White, please don’t say that!”","What if Senior White’s words actually came true?","It was already the 27th day of the month, and Song Shuhang’s small goal at the moment was to live safely until the end of this month.","“Fellow Daoist White, you don’t have to worry about his death anniversary.” The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword chuckled and said, “I have a hunch that the next time you end your seclusion, you can visit Song Shuhang’s grave no matter what day it is. There are only 365 days in a year, and every day might just end up becoming a death anniversary for Song Shuhang.”","Song Shuhang retorted angrily, “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, stop spouting nonsense. At most, I’m risking my life once every month. It’s simply too much to say that I might die every day of the year!”","The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword was speechless.","Despite being a heart-rending inner demon, it felt some pity for Song Shuhang at this moment.","Since it was joking earlier, it did not think about the matter too carefully. After all, having every day of a year as a possible death anniversary was simply too much.","However, when Shuhang said that he was risking his life once a month at most, that was actually quite close to the truth.","And the truth was often more heart-rending compared to jokes.","The stone tablet was also speechless.","Just what exactly did little friend Song go through before meeting me?","What kind of experiences would make a person admit the tragic possibility of dying once a month?","“See? You’re admitting it yourself.” Senior White did not know whether to cry or laugh. He patted the sand on the grave and said, “Are you still not going to come out? Do you plan to stay there until New Year?”","“Okay, I’m coming out.” Song Shuhang chuckled.","This time, his primordial soul lifted the sand before leaping out.","Every time I emerge from a grave, I have to change my approach.","A boring life only becomes more interesting once you change things up.","After his primordial soul came out, the first thing he did was to grab Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword and hang it behind his waist. He then stretched out his arms to embrace Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, pulling it out of the ground as well.","“Pfft, scan the code to sweep the grave. Keeping with the times, aren’t we?” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword could not help but laugh out loud when it saw the last line engraved on the stone tablet.","After the stone tablet shook slightly, it shrank rapidly.","It shrank to the size of a palm before landing beside Senior White, abandoning little friend Song.","“Eh?” Senior White reached out to catch the stone tablet’s spirit.","“This is Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, a work of Wielder of the Will White,” Song Shuhang explained.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet added, “My name is now Tyrannical Song’s Tombstone.”","“Pfft~ That’s a good name.” The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword could not help but laugh.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“I see.” Senior White nodded slightly. No wonder he felt a sense of familiarity when he came into contact with the stone tablet.","“This is the main world’s Senior White, and he is different from your master, Wielder of the Will White.” Song Shuhang introduced Senior White to the stone tablet so that it would not confuse Senior White with Wielder of the Will White.","The stone tablet vibrated slightly and “looked” at Senior White.","Sure enough, the man before its eyes was different from its master, and the difference between him and Netherworld Black White was even more apparent.","“Speaking of which, Senior White, what is this place?” Song Shuhang asked. He believed this place to be the one where Wielder of the Will White left his secrets and the place that the stone tablet was suppressing. Moreover, this desert was very likely Senior White’s hometown.","Senior White replied, “This might be my hometown.”","However, Senior White himself was not sure.","He failed to find anyone or anything other than this familiar, endless desert.","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, do you have any information that you can provide about this world?” Song Shuhang looked at the stone tablet in Senior White’s hand.","The former Wielder of the Heaven’s Will, White, allowed the stone tablet to continue guarding this place. Therefore, it might have a better understanding of this world.","The stone tablet said while feeling slightly emotional, “It seems that my mission will come to an end today.”","This world it had been suppressing for ages was in a “closed” state in the past. In fact, even without its suppression, nobody could enter this world.","Today, it opened on its own.","In other words, the mission entrusted to it by Wielder of the Will White was coming to an end.","“My master once said that this world is an ‘independent’ world in the truest sense of the word. It’s something that exists beyond space and time and doesn’t belong to this world,” said the stone tablet.","Song Shuhang’s eyes shone.","He remembered the information he got after using the secret appraisal technique on Senior White.","[White is a very special existence, and the origin of his existence is unordinary. Try to find White’s hometown to get more information.]","The clues matched.","He now felt confident that this was Senior White’s hometown.","...","That being the case... Was it now time for him to get more information?","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul squatted down. Afterward, he placed his right palm against the sand and shouted, “Have a taste of my secret appraisal technique!”","The secret appraisal technique was activated.","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul began to tremble, and an extreme pain assaulted his senses.","It was the kind of pain that he had not felt in quite a while.","Whenever he used the secret appraisal technique lately, the price he paid was rather small, and Song Shuhang barely felt any pain.","However, the price he paid this time managed to shake Song Shuhang to his core.","As his body kept shaking, half of his soul slowly sank into the sand.","Seeing the scene, the stone tablet was left speechless.","Whether it was the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?, the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal?, or the ?Secret Appraisal Technique? that Song Shuhang was currently using, none of them felt normal to it.","The result of the appraisal quickly appeared in Song Shuhang’s mind.","...","[Sands from 5 billion years ago. Every grain of sand contains the aura of time and antiquity. If you observe them carefully, you will find that they contain an indescribable charm.]"]},{"number":2122,"title":"Chapter 2122 The day the frozen world began to move again","paragraphs":["2122 The day the frozen world began to move again","Mother Earth was said to be 4.6 billion years old, yet these grains of sand were even older!","Song Shuhang sighed inwardly.","With the improvement of his strength, his mastery over the secret appraisal technique was also getting better and better. Right now, if he were to accidentally appraise Earth itself, he would probably survive.","However, even after paying such a steep price, all he managed to identify was that the sand was 5 billion years old. Wasn’t this akin to purposefully stifling his heart?","It would’ve been better if the appraisal just failed.","Could there be some other information that hasn’t been transmitted to my mind yet? Song Shuhang’s primordial soul didn’t move and kept using the secret appraisal technique.","After a while...","The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Did you find anything out?”","Song Shuhang raised his head and said with a serious face, “Yes, I got a very old piece of information.”","“What is it?” Senior White asked curiously. He was very interested in this place that he suspected to be his hometown.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said, “According to the information I got, the sand in this desert is five billion years old.”","Senior White: “...”","The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword took this opportunity to give Senior White a suggestion, “Since Shuhang is completely useless, why don’t we just bury him? Fellow Daoist White, you can use me to stab this guy to ensure that the cut is perfect. This should bring him the most extreme of pains.”","“Why am I being blamed for this? This is the information that was given by the secret appraisal technique. I’m also a victim as I suffered for nothing.” While Song Shuhang’s primordial soul spoke, his body was still jolting.","Because he was a primordial soul, there were no wounds on his body, but the price had been borne by the main body.","Of course, there was also a very small chance that the price would be borne by a “ghost spirit” or similar entity.","In the past, his first ghost spirit had been in so much pain that it had asked Shuhang to comfort it!","“However, besides its age, I did get some other information about the sand.” Song Shuhang’s primordial soul gradually stopped trembling. After adapting to the pain, he said seriously, “In addition to telling me that the sand is five billion years old... the secret appraisal technique told me that the sand is also particularly charming.”","“What the hell?” The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword raised its hilt slightly and “stared” at Song Shuhang. Is this what they mean when they say that after someone stays single for too long, everything starts to look charming?","“That’s all I got from the secret appraisal technique.” Song Shuhang squatted down again, picked up a handful of sand, and observed it carefully.","The fine, warm sand slowly slipped through his fingers.","Song Shuhang raised his hands and spread them apart.","The golden sand trickled down, with each grain of sand shining as it drifted through the wind, resulting in a beautiful scene. It was just as he had guessed. The sand in the desert had the same charm as Senior White, but this charm was spread throughout the entire desert, so it was not as overbearing as Senior White’s charm that was all gathered on his person.","The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Damn... Have I also been single for too long?”","When the sand was falling, it really did look charming. It wanted to stay in the desert and spend the rest of its life accompanying the sand.","After going back, it had to talk to its almost forgotten master, Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, and ask him if there was any intelligent sword spirit suitable to be its partner.","“The world, it has moved,” the stone tablet said in a deep, poetic voice.","Senior White also squatted down. He threw the spirit vein enclosed in the pillar-shaped spirit stone into the air and supported it with his mental energy. Afterward, he inserted his fingers into the sand and picked up a handful of it, watching as it slipped through his fingers.","As the fine sand slipped through Senior White’s fingers, everyone could feel the world shake slightly.","But again, it was not shaking physically.","Like an hourglass, it was turned over, and the sand began to fall again.","The frozen world began to move once again, coming back to life.","The sun rose slowly, and under the sunlight, the entire desert shone with a dazzling light.","Song Shuhang, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and the stone tablet all diverted their attention and looked toward the rising sun.","“Boom~”","At this time, a loud thud could be heard behind them.","As soon as Song Shuhang turned his head, he saw that the pillar-shaped spiritual vein that Senior White dug out before had crashed to the ground.","“Senior White?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Senior White disappeared again.","Under the pillar-shaped spiritual vein, where Senior White was originally standing, there was a robe. The robe was the same robe that Senior White used to wear.","The stone tablet asked in a daze, “He disappeared?”","It had been floating beside Senior White until a moment ago, but now he was gone.","Song Shuhang frowned. He stepped forward and stored Senior White’s pillar-shaped spiritual vein inside his magical bracelet, and then picked up his magical robe.","The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Can you sense Fellow Daoist White’s aura?”","“It’s everywhere,” the stone tablet replied. The whole world was filled with White’s aura, so it was impossible to lock onto his position through his aura.","Song Shuhang stored the robe inside his magical bracelet—if True Monarch White Crane were here, the first thing it would do would be to put on this robe, right?","Song Shuhang said calmly, “This desert is Senior White.”","Regarding White’s identity, Song Shuhang had several theories.","“Little White” was seemingly born from a desert.","The young man in green robes refined a desert and fused it with Little White to prevent him from disappearing.","However, the white horse that the young man in green robes was riding was also quite mysterious.","The disappearance of Senior White was obviously related to this desert.","“Let’s explore the desert.” Song Shuhang reached out and picked up the shrunken Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, hung Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword behind his waist, and strode toward the rising sun.","“Where are we going?” asked the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword.","...","Song Shuhang shook his head. “I don’t know. I will go where we need to go.”","The black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Is your artistic soul acting up again?”","“What does this have to do with an artist’s soul?” Song Shuhang did not know whether to laugh or cry. “I’m just going to head in a direction according to what my heart tells me.”","The stone tablet “looked” at Song Shuhang again.","At this time, Song Shuhang looked strangely reliable.","Apart from the sun in the sky, there was nothing else worth mentioning in this world.","Along the way, the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword tried using magical techniques to leave marks on the ground.","But every time they moved a certain distance, the marks would disappear...","Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Are we going to get lost?”","“Don’t worry, we won’t get lost,” said Song Shuhang.","With that, he leaped forward and stepped on a black lotus, using the scholarly faction’s ?Virtuous Man’s Ten Thousand Mile Walk? to rush forward.","...","Soon, a building appeared before his eyes.","The presence of a building implied that someone might live there."]},{"number":2123,"title":"Chapter 2123 To be alive... and to be happier than anyone else","paragraphs":["2123 To be alive... and to be happier than anyone else","The speed of a primordial soul was faster than that of a physical body. The speed Shuhang reached when using the movement technique was akin to traversing hundreds of miles in a flash.","In the blink of an eye, Song Shuhang arrived in front of the building.","“It’s a tomb.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword inspected the building.","The stone tablet: “...”","!!","Ever since it was renamed “Tyrannical Song’s Tombstone” by Netherworld Black White, it seemed to be constantly encountering things related to tombs.","“It looks new.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently touched the ancient tomb.","Overall, it looked like it was newly built.","The size of the tomb was not very large. It was basically composed of a grave mound and a gravestone.","On the gravestone were engraved many complicated characters. Song Shuhang could not recognize any of them.","It was not the language of the ancient era","Song Shuhang asked, “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, do either of you recognize these words?”","“Nope,” said the black-skinned Scarlet Heaven Sword.","The stone tablet said, “This script... looks familiar. However, I can’t read it. When I was created by my master, he used the language of the ancient era and another self-created script. This script should have been used by my master when he was young.”","The master it mentioned was naturally Wielder of the Will White.","What a pity. If I could contact Senior White Two at this time, I would be able to learn what’s written on the gravestone, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","The stone tablet moved and bumped the tomb lightly. “The tomb was built... no more than a year ago!”","It was unknown how it had reached such a conclusion, but it did anyway.","Song Shuhang reminded them, “The time in this world doesn’t flow according to the law of common sense.”","Everyone had felt it previously. When the sand slipped through Senior White’s fingers, the whole world seemed to have come alive.","According to the information left to the stone tablet by Wielder of the Will White, this world was unaffected by time or space; it was an independent world in the truest sense of the word.","Perhaps before Senior White came in, time wasn’t even flowing.","Song Shuhang asked the stone tablet, “Does this handwriting look like Senior White’s?”","The stone tablet nodded and said, “It’s somewhat similar, but the one I’m referring to is my master, White. This script is somewhat similar to his handwriting.”","“If this is really Senior White’s handwriting, maybe I know whose tomb this is,” said Song Shuhang as he stared at the stone tablet.","Senior White Two had written some words on the stone tablet not too long ago.","Song Shuhang compared the two handwritings.","Although the characters were different, the handwriting looked similar.","The stone tablet: “...”","It felt embarrassed when Song Shuhang stared at it like that.","Song Shuhang said, “I suppose that this gravestone was really set up by Senior White.”","This was, after all, Senior White’s hometown.","According to the main world’s Senior White’s memory, the tomb should contain the remains of the young man in green robes, the person who beat up Shuhang repeatedly in the illusory reality.","In the memory of the main world’s Senior White, the young man in green robes died eventually.","Song Shuhang muttered, “The young man in green robes riding a white horse...”","“Do you want to open this tomb and have a look?” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked. It was just performing its duty as an inner demon, enticing Song Shuhang to do something “interesting.”","“After opening it, I might be tempted to go in.” Song Shuhang smiled slightly. He saw right through the temptation of Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword. “I don’t want Senior White to come here to cut the grass on my grave on this day next year. ”","He then lowered his head to look at the dazzling sand below.","The desert right now may have become the embodiment of Senior White, so this was not a death that he would seek.","Song “Not Learning from Senior Thrice Reckless” Shuhang.","Moreover, if this was really a gravestone and tomb that Senior White himself erected, Song Shuhang would not dare to meddle with it even if there were no traps.","Whoever dug up the place would die!","After he finished speaking, he brought his palms together and bowed to the grave. “Senior, although you beat me up many times in the illusory reality, I don’t really mind it. Moreover, in Senior White Two’s memory, you were Senior White Two, so please forgive me for what I’m about to do...”","Song Shuhang suddenly wondered about the end of his former(?) mortal enemy, Young Master Hai. If one day, Young Master Hai died quietly and was buried, perhaps Shuhang would visit and sweep his grave...","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “Do you want to dance on the grave?”","“How could that be? Do you think I’m that kind of person?” Song Shuhang asked. After paying his respects, he stepped d toward the stone tablet, stretched out his hand, and placed it against it.","Song Shuhang said softly, “I used the secret appraisal technique on the desert before, and I don’t know how much damage my main body has suffered. So this time, I need to be careful. If the price of the appraisal is too high, I need to stop immediately.”","After all, only the head and shoulders of his main body were left, and the amount of blood that he had in store was limited. If the price of the appraisal was too high, he might just end up spewing out his brains.","He had to be careful.","Song Shuhang activated the secret appraisal technique. This time, he remained cautious throughout the entire process, strictly paying attention to the price he had to pay.","Fortunately, the price of the appraisal this time was very small.","The level of pain was about the same as the Expert’s Appraisal.","This degree of pain was within an acceptable range for Song Shuhang. He could now fully bear the pain of the Expert’s Appraisal even while fighting.","The information from the appraisal quickly reached his mind.","[Nameless Grave. The name of the owner of this gravestone is no longer remembered and has been erased. The stele was erected by White himself, but there is nothing inside the tomb.]","...","[Open the tomb, and you will see an empty coffin. Lie in it; maybe you will have unexpected gains.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","What, now even the secret appraisal technique is trying to trick me into lying in it?","Your tricks won’t work on me!","This is a tomb erected by Senior White himself.","I, Song Shuhang, the first Sage in a thousand years, do not want to die or do something like gravedigging!","The value of life is something that I know better than anyone else.","To be alive... and to be happier than anyone else is my goal this month!","With that said, Song Shuhang’s body slowly sank into the sand.","He was currently in the form of a primordial soul, and he could phase through things. As long as there were no restrictions or defenses left in the tomb, he could sneak in.","But just in case, when he was sneaking in, his other hand held the stone tablet firmly. The stone tablet was now in its spirit form, and it could also phase through things.","...","Also, he could activate the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? and use the black Scarlet Heaven Sword as coordinates should he ever need to escape.","If the situation was not right, they could escape directly to where Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was.","The infiltration process went smoothly, and they did not meet with any obstructions.","As expected, there was only an empty coffin in the tomb.","Song Shuhang carefully peeked into the coffin after some thought."]},{"number":2124,"title":"Chapter 2124 I’m not White Two!","paragraphs":["2124 I’m not White Two!","Even if Shuhang were beaten to death, he would never dig the grave that Senior White erected for the young man in green robes.","However... If he could enter without damaging the tomb, he would give it a try.","He wanted to remain safe, so he decided to be extra careful this time.","The stone tablet and Song Shuhang entered the empty coffin together.","!!","After stepping onto the path of cultivation, Song Shuhang went through another growth spurt, growing 7 cm in half a year. This resulted in him having a height of 182 cm, which left Sixteen quite envious.","With his new height, when he lay in the empty coffin, he fit perfectly.","Whether it was height or width, the coffin was a perfect match for his figure.","When he lay inside, he felt as if he had returned home.","Song Shuhang mused, “Other than being comfortable to lie down in, there doesn’t seem to be anything else special about this coffin...”","The secret appraisal technique had always been very accurate in its appraisals, and the hint it gave said that he would find something special after entering the empty coffin. However, Song Shuhang looked all over the empty coffin and did not find anything special.","He even observed the lid of the coffin, but he found no inscriptions or anything of the sort, which left him very disappointed.","If nothing is carved onto this coffin... Does this mean that there’s some kind of secret switch somewhere?","Song Shuhang entered a state of contemplation.","“I’ve... I’ve started to shake.” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who came in with him, began shaking all of a sudden.","Song Shuhang lowered his head and saw that Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had entered vibration mode again.","Right now, the stone tablet had shrunken down to the size of a phone, so when it vibrated, it didn’t look strange at all.","Of course, if the words “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone” written on it weren’t flashing repeatedly, it would be even better.","Song Shuhang asked cautiously. “What did you activate? Should we head out?”","The stone tablet said, “I did not activate anything, but it seems like I was activated. There is no need to go out. This should be a clue left by my master, so there should be no danger.”","When Song Shuhang heard that it was a clue left by Wielder of the Will White, he quickly got up and prepared to leave the empty coffin. Wielder of the Will White was a little unreliable at times. For the sake of research, he even cut Senior White Two’s leg once.","To save his legs, he felt that it would be better to leave the coffin immediately.","“Don’t leave me alone!” shouted the stone tablet. Its spirit suppressed Song Shuhang into the coffin.","The corners of Song Shuhang’s mouth twitched. “Didn’t you say that the clues left by Wielder of the Will White should not be dangerous? Why are you keeping me here?”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said seriously, “I... I’m afraid of being alone.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Didn’t you stay in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area for millions of years? Yet, you’re now scared of being alone... Can’t you come up with a better excuse?!","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “Little friend Song, as long as you don’t leave me, I will recognize you as a good brother of mine. From now on, no matter whether it is a mountain of swords or a sea of fire, I will accompany you. You will be my brother for life!”","“Our friendship is over,” said Song Shuhang. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s eloquence is too poor. How can you lure people with such a technique? The more you try to convince me, the more fearful I become!","“It’s too late. You’re now my good brother. I’ve already decided.” The stone tablet firmly stuck to Song Shuhang, suppressing his primordial soul and keeping it in the coffin.","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul said while in pain, “Let go of me. I’ll recognize you as a good brother after you let me go! You’re too heavy... I’m going to die...”","At the same time, the gravestone outside the tomb of the young man in green robes also began to vibrate. It resonated with Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who was inside the tomb.","Under the gaze of the black Scarlet Heaven Sword, the gravestone outside began to change.","The complex and unfamiliar characters on it transformed into Chinese characters.","The words “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone” emerged.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword was left speechless.","After a while, its sword hilt stretched out and turned into two arms, making the sign of the cross.","Afterward, it put its two palms together and prayed for Song Shuhang.","What is meant to come will eventually come.","What is meant to be buried will eventually be buried. This was fate.","??????","Inside the coffin.","A huge nebula was projected on the originally empty coffin lid. It felt like watching a movie with special effects.","Both Song Shuhang and the stone tablet calmed down.","They were past the activation phase, and the clues left by Wielder of the Will White would soon appear.","The stone tablet said gently, “Little friend Song, you’re a good brother!”","Song Shuhang: “...”","On the coffin lid, the nebula spun ten times before finally stabilizing.","“Buzz~”","A screechy sound echoed in their ears.","After a while.","“It’s really troublesome to record a Wielder’s voice. It has to go through conversions over and over again. All this trouble even though I just want to leave a message. Very good, the adjustment is over, and I will now start recording.”","“Buzz~”","“Hello, Netherly White. When you hear this message from me, great changes must have taken place in the universe. For example, I must have stepped down from the position of Wielder of the Heaven’s Will, while you are still in the Netherworld as a ruler of the Netherworld. Isn’t it incredible that you can keep your position as a Netherworld Ruler though I have already escaped from the Heaven’s Will? Are you surprised? Are you happy?”","This was indeed Wielder of the Will White’s voice.","...","The voices of Wielder of the Will White, Netherworld White, and the main world’s Senior White were very similar. Song Shuhang usually distinguished them from one another through their tone and mannerism.","Song Shuhang asked, “By the way... who is Netherly White?”","The stone tablet went silent for a moment before making a guess, “It should be Netherworld Black White. Only he would be nicknamed Netherly, which is somewhat related to Netherworld.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","The stone tablet said with lingering fear, “Let’s forget about his name. We must not even keep a trace of it in our minds. Otherwise, the next time we encounter Black White, if we accidentally blurt it out, only death awaits us.”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “I agree. We must seal this nickname away. It would be best if we could completely erase it from our minds.”","Wielder of the Will White said proudly, “I know that you never used your only chance to go the main world ever since taking up your post, so after you send someone to recover the stone tablet and find the clues I left with it, you definitely won’t be able to resist the urge to use your only chance to come to this special world I left behind. Everything is within my calculations. Netherly White, are you shocked?”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Excuse me, but I’m not Senior White Two.","In addition, if I remember correctly... Senior White Two already used up his chance to go to the main world.","He used it when he helped me draw nine dragon patterns on my Golden Core.","...","At the time, Song Shuhang had no idea that Senior White Two would use something so precious on him."]},{"number":2125,"title":"Chapter 2125 Sincerely, White, who has always missed you","paragraphs":["2125 Sincerely, White, who has always missed you","It was worth mentioning that the ability to make a trip to the main world was extremely valuable to a Netherworld Ruler.","Song Shuhang asked, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, do you have a recording function?”","The message on the coffin lid was a message from Wielder of the Will White to Senior White Two, so it was his responsibility to deliver it to Senior White Two.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said calmly, “Sorry, but I’m a stone tablet and not a phone. Don’t think that just because I can vibrate, I’m suddenly like a phone.”","“You disappoint me. How can you call yourself a tombstone without a camera?” Song Shuhang sighed. It seemed like there was nothing else he could do; he could only retell the story to Senior White Two.","Of course, in the process of retelling, he would have to pay special care to replace the nickname “Netherly White” with something else.","The stone tablet: “...”","Do tombstones in this era need to have a camera?","The nebula on the coffin lid continued to spin.","The voice of Wielder of the Will White echoed in their ears again.","“Now, let’s get to the main point. Since you have come to this desert and our gravestone, you must have entered this world with Little White, right? Are you happy? Also, I’m very sorry. Back then, I promised you that I would leave you a little sister, but it seems that I’m going to have to renege on my promise.”","Song Shuhang and the stone tablet entered a state of contemplation","With the info they got from the message, they wondered if it was possible that the main world’s Senior White was really the trump card that Wielder of the Will White left behind. Did Wielder of the Will White somehow fail to leave a little sister behind and left a little brother instead?","“Buzz~”","Wielder of the Will White continued, “Just now, were you wondering if Little White might be the sister I left for you? You must have thought about that in your mind, right? Unfortunately, Little White is not the sister I meant to leave you with.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","The stone tablet: “...”","Was he trying to bait them on purpose?","“Buzz~”","“Little White is Little White, a ‘White’ who has a different past and birth from us. He has nothing to do with my experiment, and I did not interfere with him in any way. However, he still appeared before my eyes in the end.”","“Buzz~”","“The ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? needs to be improved, but I have no time. It’s just another seed I casually planted. As for what interesting changes happen in the future, Netherly White, you will have to see that for yourself.”","“Buzz~”","“The current Wielder of the Heaven’s Will is the eighth one. Pay attention, because the next term will be extremely important. The world will change during the ninth term. The spiritual energy in the universe will be renewed, welcoming a new great era. Whether destruction befalls the world or a new era comes to life will depend on the fortune of the ninth Wielder of the Heaven’s Will.”","“Buzz~”","“Netherly White, I wish you joy every day. Sincerely, White, who has always missed you.”","“Buzz~”","After the last buzzing sound, the nebula on the coffin lid dissipated. Wielder of the Will White’s message had concluded.","Song Shuhang had a look of confusion on his face. “Is that it?”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “It seems so. That was the end.”","Song Shuhang frowned.","The “message” that Wielder of the Will White went through so much effort to leave was too brief, and it didn’t contain any important clue.","If this was the message, wouldn’t it have been fine to just get someone to send it to Senior White Two?","Song Shuhang said softly, “Considering that Senior White Two would use his only chance to enter the main world for these few lines, I really don’t think that Wielder of the Will White would play around in this kind of situation.”","There’s no way Wielder of the Will White could be so unreliable.","There should be a hidden message somewhere, something that only Wielder of the Will White and Senior White Two can understand...","Or is it possible that the real message can only be heard if Senior White Two lays down in this coffin himself?","Song Shuhang carefully recalled the content of the message and analyzed it.","“Little friend Song, don’t think too much about it.” The stone tablet sighed and said, “In fact, my master is truly capable of doing such a thing. His personality changed after he became the Wielder of the Will. According to his own words, shortly after becoming the Wielder of the Will, he went too far while playing around with his powers, resulting in some changes to his personality.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","He placed his hand on the coffin lid and asked the stone tablet, “Can the message be replayed?”","The stone tablet replied, “I don’t know as I was passively activated just now. I didn’t have an active hand in making the message appear.”","Song Shuhang’s hand kept stroking the coffin lid.","Seeing this, the stone tablet asked, “Do you want to use your secret appraisal technique again?”","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “I may have found a clue.”","When he carefully analyzed the message of Wielder of the Will White, he realized that the buzzing noises in the message were quite frequent.","The noise at the beginning was Wielder of the Will White adjusting the settings in order to allow his voice to be recorded. But then, every time between messages, there would be a strange buzzing sound.","With the ability of a Wielder of the Will, after adjusting the frequency once, it was impossible for there to be problems repeatedly, right?","So, could it be a clue that Wielder of the Will White left?","The real message should be encrypted in the buzzing sounds...","Song Shuhang sighed and said, “If I can listen to it again, I might be able to get the complete message that Wielder of the Will White wanted to leave to Senior White Two.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “I’ll try.”","Its body began to vibrate again, trying to recreate the resonance between the tomb and the coffin lid.","A while later, nothing happened other than Song Shuhang’s fragile primordial soul becoming numb from the shock.","...","“It seems people can only rely on themselves in the end,” Song Shuhang said with a sigh. A light shone from his palm, which was pressed against the coffin lid.","The secret appraisal technique was activated again.","What he wanted to appraise this time was the hidden information left by Wielder of the Will White, which might be directly related to the Heaven’s Will. The price that he would have to pay this time was obviously going to be large.","Song Shuhang carefully controlled the secret appraisal technique. If the price of the appraisal was too high, he would stop it forcibly.","After a while, he felt the price for the appraisal.","The price was completely beyond Song Shuhang’s expectations—it was so small that he hardly felt anything.","[An ordinary coffin lid that was once mysterious. Until a few minutes ago, it seemed to be hiding a big secret, but now that the secret has been revealed, the coffin lid has become a very ordinary coffin lid.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Sometimes, I really wonder what’s the point of having the secret appraisal technique!","If I really can’t do anything, then I might just have to take this coffin to the Inner World and see if Senior White Two can restore and obtain the information on it.","..."]},{"number":2126,"title":"Chapter 2126 I think I will be gone forever","paragraphs":["2126 I think I will be gone forever","No, if the coffin is moved, it would be no different from damaging the tomb.","There is no way I’m going to seek death just to see if my luck is good today, nor do I have any plans to test the effectiveness of my means of resurrection...","And so, as soon as the idea of moving the coffin came to his mind, Song Shuhang pushed it out of his head.","The Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “Did you learn anything useful from your appraisal?”","!!","Song Shuhang’s primordial soul shook its head.","“What now? Actually, why don’t you just transfer the coffin into your Inner World?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s way of thinking matched Song Shuhang’s, and the tacit understanding between the two was like that of twins.","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “No, it’s too risky to move the coffin. It’s better to ask Senior White Two to see if his research clone can enter the main world.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suggested, “If you don’t have any other options, why don’t you try circulating the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? and see if it allows you to resonate with the coffin lid?”","The original versions of the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? and the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure were created by Wielder of the Will White. This was something Shuhang got to know while trapped in the “enclosed space” of Heavenly Field Island when he spoke with Wielder of the Will White, who had crossed space and time.","The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure was a “seed” planted by Wielder of the Will White. As for whether it would end up in someone’s hands and bear fruit, it was up to that individual’s luck.","From ancient times to now, the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? has always been accompanied by chaos. In the era of the Ancient Heavenly City, this inheritance gave rise to the Divine Beast Department, which became an integral part of the Heavenly City.","And when the Ancient Heavenly City was about to fall, Slow-Witted Song passed down the inheritance by dividing it into two parts—one hidden in plain sight, and the other hidden in the dark.","This was so that the inheritance would not be lost during the coming turbulent era.","The first four volumes of the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? that Song Shuhang obtained were from a killer of the already declining Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Sect. These four volumes were then improved by the main world’s Senior White. The following content, due to the mismatch between the “hardware” and the cultivation technique, which resulted in Song Shuhang exploding, had to go through a lot of revisions and changes.","The ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? practiced by Song Shuhang was quite different from the original version, but its essence was the same.","“I’ll give it a try.” Song Shuhang circulated the cultivation technique.","However, nothing happened to the coffin.","As he knew from the secret appraisal technique, the coffin had reverted to an ordinary one.","But then...","In Song Shuhang’s mind, Wielder of the Will White’s message began to play automatically.","It started from the beginning, and the buzzing sounds were included.","The stone tablet looked at him nervously and asked, “Is it working?”","Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “Yes, it’s working.”","After listening to the message carefully, Song Shuhang really heard some words mixed with the buzzing sounds.","Sure enough, there was information hidden in the “noise.”","However, Song Shuhang could not understand the language used.","The words sounded like meaningless murmurs of Wielder of the Will White.","“In the end, we still have to find Senior White Two...” said Song Shuhang. He stretched out his hand and pressed it against the stone tablet’s spirit, and said, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, the time has come to put our friendship to test.”","Even if they were only a primordial soul and a spirit right now, they had to try and see if they could open the Inner World and send the information to Senior White Two.","[There’s no need. The barrier of the Inner World has begun to weaken in this special world. As such, my consciousness can pass through the Inner World and reach your primordial soul.] Senior White Two’s voice suddenly rang in Song Shuhang’s ear.","Song Shuhang’s tiny hands froze.","The fat ball’s sealing technique is so fucking unreliable!","Vile and useless fat ball, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and I are done for because of you!","“Shuhang, what’s wrong with you?” asked Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet nervously after sensing that Shuhang was frozen in place.","Could it be that there is a terrible revelation mixed in the “noise” from the message?","Song Shuhang asked cautiously, “Senior White, when did your consciousness get here?”","Hearing his words, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet immediately went silent.","Senior White Two said slowly, “When you were circulating the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?.”","Hearing this, Song Shuhang let out a breath of relief.","At that point in time, he and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet should not have said any taboo lines.","Senior White Two’s voice sounded again, “Circulate the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? again, and do it without getting distracted.”","When he sensed Song Shuhang’s call and came over, he had already missed the message engraved on the coffin lid.","Right now, he could only rely on Song Shuhang to receive the message that was meant for him.","“Senior White, are you going to use the mind-reading technique?” Song Shuhang became a little nervous.","He didn’t know who invented the mind-reading technique, but it was such an abominable magical technique. The person who invented it must have loathed privacy.","Senior White Two comforted him and said, “Don’t worry, there’s no need to use the mind-reading technique for something like this. You just have to keep your mind clear and circulate the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? at full strength. That will be enough.”","Hearing this, Song Shuhang felt relieved.","He started to circulate the cultivation technique.","In his mind, the message of Wielder of the Will White began to replay again.","At the same time, a small bit of Senior White Two’s consciousness possessed his primordial soul.","The lively voice of Wielder of the Will White sounded again.","When he finished his opening lines, the first buzz sounded.","This time, having been possessed by Senior White Two’s consciousness, Song Shuhang finally heard the message hidden in the noise.","Wielder of the Will White spoke slowly and seriously.","...","[If you can hear this message, it means that you are finally here, Netherly White.]","Senior White Two: “...”","Song Shuhang: “...”","No matter how serious his voice was, when he said the name “Netherly White,” the atmosphere was ruined.","[I failed. This is the second time in my life that I failed so thoroughly. The first time was when Little White began to dissipate, and the second time is now. After that brief moment of transcendence, when I got to meet you on the other shore of the river of time, I was pulled back by the power of the Heaven’s Will that I carry. This power is like a rope that binds me.]","[I left nine methods to transcend, but none of them worked.]","[Apologies, because I don’t think I’ll have an opportunity to leave a little sister for you.]","[Of course... it wasn’t all in vain. I am the first Wielder of the Heaven’s Will who almost achieved Transcension. Before me, there was no Wielder of the Heaven’s Will that could do what I did. Also, I have a very wild guess.]","[If there are two different individuals who can prove their path at the same time and inherit the position of Wielder of the Heaven’s Will... That could be the key to all this!]","[In the end, I think I will be gone forever, just like Fellow Daoist Virtue before me. I’m going to die with no hope of ever coming back. Farewell, Netherly White.]","..."]},{"number":2127,"title":"Chapter 2127 Take it as homework that I assigned to you, I will check your progress next month","paragraphs":["2127 Take it as homework that I assigned to you, I will check your progress next month","When Wielder of the Will White left a message saying that he was going to die thoroughly and had no chance of resurrecting, Song Shuhang didn’t say anything.","Instead, he felt like projecting his QR code Golden Core Composition in the air.","Whether or not you’re dead, use your mental energy to scan my QR code.","If you can add me, don’t talk about death to me!","The problem was that he had come in contact with many seniors who were thoroughly dead, in the middle of dying, dead for a long time, and half-dead.","There was the deader-than-dead Fairy Cheng Lin.","The Scholarly Sage, who was dead and no longer had any means to resurrect.","Sister White Dragon, who was currently in a death-like state.","And Fairy @#%×, who had died and become a light of virtue.","Song Shuhang felt that words like “gone forever” meant nothing to him now.","Senior White Two asked, “Is that it?”","Song Shuhang replied, “Yes, that’s it.”","Senior White Two: “...”","After a while, Senior White Two asked, “Do you remember the content of the message?”","Song Shuhang gestured with his hands as he replied, “I remem... Actually, I do not remember a single word, Senior White. I only have my brain left now. Without a heart that helps the blood circulate in my body, my brain has come to lack oxygen, so there are some things that I have trouble remembering.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet praised Song Shuhang inwardly.","Senior White Two said tiredly, “Stop speaking nonsense. If you had not memorized the message, how could I read it myself?”","Song Shuhang replied seriously, “It’s... temporary memory! Yes, temporary memory. It’s the kind of memory that gets reset when you turn around.”","Senior White Two sighed and said, “Forget it, just remember to control your mouth. Anyway, what do you think about the possibility of two different individuals proving their path at the same time that White spoke of?”","Song Shuhang said, “Senior White, to be honest, I’m just a little cultivator at the Sixth Stage Realm.”","There were several realms between something as grand as the Wielder of the Will and him.","His theoretical knowledge had not reached a level where he could talk about this subject.","He suspected that even if he were a few realms higher, he would still be unqualified to talk about the Heaven’s Will—unless he entered the dreamland of an Immortal who loved studying and got all of their knowledge on the subject.","This was a topic he was unable to give any input on.","Senior White Two suddenly asked, “Shuhang, have you ever thought about becoming the Wielder of the Will?”","Song Shuhang said honestly, “Not really. It’s probably because I’ve always felt that the position of Wielder of the Will is a kind of a trap. In addition, I’m not really one to carry the skies when they are falling. If possible, I hope to become an Immortal and watch as Wielders of the Will come and go. I want to survive until the finale, and perhaps even live to see a new world.”","Shuhang might be the Sixth Stage True Monarch who understood the Heaven’s Will the most in the entire universe.","Since he had a lot of inside information, he didn’t feel like becoming the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will.","If one day, the heavens really collapsed, he hoped that he could take shelter under the big boss who could shoulder the skies and live to see a new world.","“The Heaven’s Will is not a trap; it’s the fault of the person who becomes the Wielder of the Will,” Senior White Two said slowly. “If one doesn’t do anything stupid after becoming the Wielder of the Will, then they can live forever. Even if the universe were to come to an end, the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will will live to see the next chapter. These words were said by White himself. If you become the Wielder of the Will, do not go seeking death... Actually, just treat it as if I didn’t say anything.”","Was there even a possibility that Shuhang would not mess around after becoming the Wielder of the Will?","This topic had no research value at all.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The stone tablet asked, “Master, is it possible for two different individuals to prove their path and become enlightened at the same time?”","Senior White Two said, “I don’t know, and I don’t even have any idea how such a thing might happen. However, perhaps one can do something in the instant they ascend to become the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will.”","He recalled the first time he fought to become the Wielder of the Will.","When he won the fight for the Heaven’s Will the first time, he was still a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. Although he had envisioned his path to immortality, he had not taken the last step to become an Immortal.","When he was about to become the Wielder of the Will, his intuition told him that it was not the right time to be enlightened.","Therefore, he traded off his qualifications to become the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will to Daoist Priest Virtue.","White was indeed a special one among the various Wielders of the Will.","He was the only one to win the fight for the Heaven’s Will twice, and he was also the only one to escape the Heaven’s Will for a moment and reach transcendence.","After thinking about it carefully, Senior White Two felt that that small window where one inherited the Heaven’s Will was the only moment where one could do something about it.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said, “That is to say, one person shoulders the Heaven’s Will while the other gets carried and also becomes a Wielder of the Heaven’s Will?”","Senior White Two: “...”","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “Forget it, it is way too early for me to think about this matter.”","“It’s not early at all. Think about it when you have time, think about how two people can become Wielders of the Will at the same time,” Senior White Two said. “Take it as homework that I assigned to you, I will check your progress next month.”","“...” Song Shuhang: “Can I get external help?”","“Yes,” replied Senior White Two.","Without external assistance, how can you possibly complete this homework with your severely lacking theoretical knowledge of cultivation?","“Alright, if there’s nothing else, I will be leaving,” said Senior White Two as he broke the possession state.","“Wait, Senior White.” Song Shuhang hurriedly stretched out his hand. “There’s something I need to ask you. When I was in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area, my wooden body became stuck to Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet after using the summoning magical technique. I’m having trouble separating the two of them. Do you know how to solve this problem?”","He and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet tried so hard to enter the Inner World because they wanted to ask Senior White Two about this issue. However, they ended up angering Senior White Two and got buried instead.","Senior White Two said indifferently, “Just take your tombstone with you. After you die, it’s going to be yours anyway.”","“That’s right, my mission is over now. There is no need for me to keep suppressing this world anymore. When the time comes, I will just follow little friend Song,” said the stone tablet while vibrating.","...","The problem was easily solved!","When he saw how happy the stone tablet was, Senior White Two’s happiness value went down by one point.","“Senior White, there’s another thing,” Song Shuhang said. “The Senior White of the main world suddenly disappeared, leaving only his robe behind. I suspect that he has merged with the desert. How do we find him?”","“I’m the ruler of the Netherworld, why should I help you?” Senior White Two chuckled.","His consciousness then disappeared.","Song Shuhang was left standing in place, baffled."]},{"number":2128,"title":"Chapter 2128 Pay homage to yourself","paragraphs":["2128 Pay homage to yourself","“You must have offended my master again. That’s why he left without saying goodbye,” said the stone tablet righteously.","Song Shuhang replied, “Don’t throw the blame on me. If Senior White is angry, it’s because we both did something wrong. Neither of us should try to escape responsibility. Moreover, we’d better not continue with this topic. Otherwise, we will only end up suffering another loss.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet sighed. “Little friend Song, you’re right.”","If they kept discussing this topic, they would eventually start talking about the specifics of what happened, and Black— Emh, its master, White, could still be keeping an eye on Song Shuhang and the stone tablet through the Inner World.","!!","The stone tablet asked, “What do we do now?”","We aren’t just going to continue lying in this coffin, right?","Song Shuhang replied, “Let’s get out of this tomb for now. After that, we need to find a way to find Senior White. Then, we can leave this world.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet shook slightly. “Alright. When we return to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds, my body will follow you wherever you go as we previously agreed upon!”","“Deal,” said Song Shuhang, laughing.","He then grabbed the stone tablet’s spirit and “swam” upwards.","The grave did not try to stop him.","Song Shuhang and the stone tablet left the tomb without problems.","When the two got out, they just so happened to see the black Scarlet Heaven Sword’s hilt, which had turned into a pair of praying hands.","Song Shuhang asked, “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, what are you doing?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword replied in a low, sentimental tone, “I’m honoring a friend of mine.”","It then pointed at the gravestone.","Song Shuhang was puzzled. He turned his head to look at the tomb.","At some point, the words on the gravestone appeared to have changed to “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet thought for a while and said, “I’m guessing it changed when I resonated with the tomb.”","The words “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone” were engraved on its body by Netherworld Ruler White, and they must have synchronized with the gravestone outside.","“Actually, this is not bad,” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword said cheerfully. “With this tomb, you can save money since you won’t have to erect one yourself. Also, I think you should erect a new tomb every time you die to pay homage to yourself.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Do you want incense sticks or a bouquet of flowers? Also, does it feel good to pay homage to yourself?” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword took the opportunity to rend his heart again.","“I guess.” Song Shuhang replied.","His reply left the black Scarlet Heaven Sword slightly stunned.","Has Song Shuhang’s mental state become stronger again? Has he already become indifferent to such heart-rending words?","While it was in thought, Song Shuhang pressed his palm against the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","?Saber-Nurturing Technique? x10!","After ten instances of the Saber-Nurturing Technique, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword descended to the ground comfortably. It looked as if it had just experienced an extremely refreshing massage.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, could not help but quietly take a step back when it saw this scene.","This magical technique was so weird that it could not see its origins or the principles behind it!","Song Shuhang grabbed the black Scarlet Heaven Sword and stuck it into the ground before the tomb.","Without the wooden body, there was no way to gather “incense sticks”. As such, he decided to place the black Scarlet Heaven Sword before the tomb for perspective.","The important thing was the intent, after all.","After thinking for a while, Song Shuhang opened his mouth and spat something out. One after the other, white lotuses appeared in the air and descended toward the tomb.","The only thing he could produce right now were lotus flowers. Although it was weird to have a lotus flower shower during a funeral, his means were limited at the moment, so he did not have the luxury to worry about such things.","“May the dead rest in peace and the living continue to live tenaciously.” Song Shuhang put his hands together and said softly, “I, Song, will live tenaciously until the end of the world!”","After he finished paying homage, he waved his hand. “Let’s go!”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet floated up into the air, attracted the black Scarlet Heaven Sword like a magnet, and followed after Song Shuhang.","“We’re now going to look for the main world’s White, right? How do we do that?” the stone tablet asked.","“Since Senior White Two refused to help, we can only rely on our intuition,” Song Shuhang said.","The stone tablet shouted hastily, “Shut your mouth. Don’t call my master with a name like that!”","Song Shuhang hastily covered his mouth. “I’m sorry... Fortunately, I did not say anything too offensive.”","The man, the stone tablet, and the sword gradually disappeared into the vast desert.","Lotus flowers lay beside the tomb, swaying with the wind and emitting a strong fragrance.","The white lotus condensed through the Lotus Blossoming Tongue could reach the level of Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s cooking when it came to fragrance and taste.","The golden sand in the desert seemed to be attracted to the flowers.","A small patch of sand drifted over, approaching the white lotuses.","After a short while, the sand condensed into a small person.","The figure made of sand had the same build as the “Little White” found in Senior White’s illusory reality.","The Little White formed from sand squatted beside the white lotuses flowers. He held a white lotus in both of his hands, opened his mouth wide, and bit the whole bud in one bite.","He chewed and chewed, and then swallowed it down.","Afterward, Little White revealed a satisfied expression.","...","He picked up another white lotus, opened his mouth, and stuffed the entire thing inside.","His expression was one of glee.","Not long after, the large number of lotus flowers produced by Song Shuhang’s Lotus Blossoming Tongue was gone.","After the meal was finished, Little White dissipated and returned to being a puddle of golden sand.","The wind blew, blowing the golden sand back into the desert.","??????","Inside the desert, a man, a stone tablet, and a sword wandered aimlessly.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Did your intuition tell you anything? Have you sensed the position of Fellow Daoist White?”","Song Shuhang shook his head. He squatted down, lightly pressed his hand on the sand, and said, “In fact, the entire desert might be Senior White. He could be in any corner of this desert.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Then, what are we looking for exactly?”","Song Shuhang replied, “I’m trying to find an oasis. The probability of attracting Senior White should be the highest there.”","...","The oasis he was talking about was the place where the young man in green robes and Little White often practiced martial arts in the illusory reality.","That should be an important place in Senior White’s memories, and the chance of luring Senior White over would be higher there.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “After finding that place, how are you going to lure Fellow Daoist White?”","Song Shuhang said, “Right now, we can only rely on food.”","He could create lotus flowers through his Lotus Blossoming Tongue.","And as long as he and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet could enter his Inner World, he could get fresh spring water.","There was also a portion of Saber Intent Condensing Lotus Seeds stored in his Inner World, and there should also be some edible spiritual plants that should be ripe by now."]},{"number":2129,"title":"Chapter 2129 Why did this thing come here?","paragraphs":["2129 Why did this thing come here?","In fact, besides using food to attract Senior White, Song Shuhang knew a simpler method.","And this method was guaranteed to be effective.","However, considering that Senior White Two might be watching him from the Inner World, that Senior White was everywhere after merging with the desert, and that this world was a secret left behind by Wielder of the Will White... If he did use that method, Song Shuhang’s grave would probably be filled with his corpse in no time.","As such, he could only settle for the next best thing and rely on food to lure over Senior White.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “Are you sure?”","Song Shuhang said, “We can only try with this method. If we can’t lure Senior White, we will have to leave by ourselves.”","Their physical bodies were still in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area, and over there was a troublesome spatial node that could release evil energy at any time.","If not handled properly, that evil energy could cause some trouble to his main body and the stone tablet’s main body.","Fortunately, Sister White Dragon and Sixteen were watching over their bodies, so they didn’t need to worry too much.","“Is your intuition reliable?” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked. After all, their party of three had been walking in the desert for quite some time now, and they had not even seen the shadow of an oasis.","Song Shuhang said confidently, “It might not have been accurate before, but my intuition is very reliable today.”","Previously, had he not relied on his intuition to find the clues inside the tomb?","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “I’ll place my trust in you this one time. However, I will only give you ten minutes. If you take any longer, we have to go back. For some reason, I’m getting a bad feeling.”","Song Shuhang said cheerfully, “If it’s a bad premonition for an inner demon, it should be good fortune for us, right?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","At this moment, the stone tablet said, “An oasis! I see an oasis ahead of us!”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked curiously, “Where? I don’t see anything.”","“Follow me!” The stone tablet dropped Scarlet Heaven Sword and led the way.","In Senior White’s “hometown”, the stone tablet’s senses were much more powerful than that of Song Shuhang and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword—it was one of White’s magical treasures, after all.","Under the lead of the stone tablet, after around ten minutes, the three really arrived at an oasis.","The oasis was made up of a small lake, a few green plants that had never been seen on Earth, and a small patch of sparse grass.","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “This is the place.”","These sand dunes close to the oasis were where the young man in green robes gave him a good beating, again and again.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “I think that that location by the small lake is pretty good. Let’s set up our camp there and prepare the food to attract Fellow Daoist White, okay?”","Song Shuhang nodded and replied, “Sure.”","The Lotus Blossoming Tongue was an innate talent that he could use anytime and anywhere without any tools.","In addition to being delicious and allowing him to appear more ostentatious when delivering speeches, this was a skill that he could use to make money. The only problem was the speed at which it would make him money was rather slow. Even now, Song Shuhang had not managed to transform the box of Saber Intent Condensing Grass he got from Senior White into Saber Intent Condensing Lotus Seeds.","Anyway, with the increase of his strength, Song Shuhang was able to spawn lotus flowers at an extremely fast speed. In a short while, he condensed enough lotus flowers to completely cover five square meters of ground.","Song Shuhang called out, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, it’s time to put our friendship to test again!”","The stone tablet fell into his hands and reminded him, “By the way, call me Tyrannical Song’s Tombstone from now on.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","He did not hesitate to use two instances of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? on the stone tablet. His actions should not be mistaken here, as the intent behind this move was different from the vengeful ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? he would use after being bullied by Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","The goal here was to allow himself and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet to enter the Tablet With the Saber state much faster.","Song Shuhang had hypnotized himself and made himself believe he was the tablet.","As for Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who was in his hands, it was definitely the saber.","If it was not a saber, then how could he use the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? on it? And how was he able to enter the One With the Saber state with it?","Anyway, by borrowing Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s power, a passage that led to the Inner World opened once again.","The Inner World Assistant had been waiting for this moment.","A bucket of spring water from the living spring came out of the passage along with some spirit fruits that were ready to be picked.","In fact, Song Shuhang wanted to prepare a ?Braised Heavenly Tribulation?, but unfortunately, there was no one there who could help him.","A tablecloth was spread out on the sand, and the spirit fruits and spring water were placed on it.","Afterward, the entrance to the Inner World closed slowly.","Song Shuhang said, “Now, we can only wait and see if Senior White takes the bait.”","He had done his best.","??????","Meanwhile, in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","The more people worried about something, the more likely that something would happen.","Song Shuhang was worried that the spatial node would open again and release the evil energy of the Netherworld, and that’s exactly what happened.","Evil energy gushed out of the spatial node even more violently than before.","But this time, without the roots of the lotus projection, the evil energy was unstoppable and enveloped the bodies of Song Shuhang and the stone tablet.","Sixteen said nervously, “Sister White Dragon!”","Sister White Dragon smiled and said, “Don’t worry, I was already prepared for this.”","She stretched out her hand and forcibly opened the sphere that isolated them from the rest of the trial area. Then, she took Sixteen with her and jumped toward Song Shuhang’s position.","The evil energy of the Netherworld was like a tide as it submerged Song Shuhang and the stone tablet.","...","However, the dazzling light of virtue around Shuhang’s body resisted the tide of evil energy. It transformed into the Palace of Virtue and kept all the evil energy away.","The light of virtue could protect its master automatically, and Song Shuhang did not need to manually control it.","As for the stone tablet, a suppressive force surged from its body, firmly suppressing a portion of the evil energy.","“Dragon Seal!” Sister White Dragon shouted lightly.","Draconic power condensed and formed a big seal, which then confronted the evil energy of the Netherworld.","“Boom~”","Most of the evil energy was scattered.","However, there was still a small portion that penetrated into the secret realm suppressed by the stone tablet.","Given that some of it had already seeped into the secret realm when the stone tablet left its position due to Shuhang’s summon earlier, the secret world left behind by Wielder of the Heaven’s Will was opened in one fell swoop.","A black vortex appeared.","Song Shuhang, the stone tablet, the wooden body, and a portion of the evil energy were swallowed by the vortex.","...","“Shuhang!” Sixteen jumped forward and grabbed Shuhang, getting dragged into the vortex as well.","Sister White Dragon sighed. She could only choose to follow closely after Sixteen.","??????","In the oasis.","Song Shuhang said, “Here it is. Something has appeared!”","“Rumble~”","In the next moment, an emerald green branch emerged from the ground.","On the branches, there were attractive spiritual fruits.","This is not Senior White!","Song Shuhang’s eyes widened. “Isn’t this my wooden body?”","Why did this thing come here?"]},{"number":2130,"title":"Chapter 2130 Rending someone else’s heart but feeling pain, not worth it!","paragraphs":["2130 Rending someone else’s heart but feeling pain, not worth it!","The little branch extending out of the ground swayed in the wind, looking pleasing to the eye.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pulled on it.","The wooden body was violently pulled out of the sand, and underneath it were the physical bodies of Song Shuhang and the stone tablet.","With a single pull, three bodies were extracted.","!!","“This is bad.” Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat when he saw the bodies being pulled out.","Something must have happened in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area...","Is it because of that spatial node that was releasing evil energy?","It appears that even with Sister White Dragon and Sixteen watching over us, accidents could not be avoided.","Still, where did Sister White Dragon and Sixteen go? Why aren’t they here?","If they don’t come out as well, the chain of bodies would be broken!","Hmm, maybe they managed to avoid getting involved in this mess...","Song Shuhang’s mind was full of thoughts.","“Is that my stone body? What’s going on? How did it get here?!” the stone tablet’s spirit shouted. Without the suppression of its body, the secret world left by its master, Wielder of the Will White, might encounter some problems.","It had to leave this world immediately, return to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area, and suppress this secret world again.","With this thought in mind, the stone tablet’s spirit leaped forward and returned to its body.","When its spirit and body were reunited, Senior White Two’s inscription appeared on its body as well, and the words “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone” were particularly dazzling.","At the same time, Song Shuhang’s primordial soul also returned to his head.","The stone tablet said anxiously, “Little friend Song, you must help me return to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area!”","Song Shuhang asked in confusion, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, haven’t you already completed your mission?”","Why is it so anxious to go back?","The stone tablet said, “If things had played out normally, my mission would have ended today. However, this secret world has yet to transform, and that Senior White of yours also hasn’t returned to his normal state. For this reason, I need to continue to suppress this secret world and prevent other people or forces from prying into it. For example, that weird evil energy that came from the Netherworld... I absolutely cannot let it enter this world!”","“I understand, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. Then, let us enter the Tablet With the Saber state.” Song Shuhang’s head and shoulders flew above his wooden body, stretching out a hand toward the stone tablet.","“Tablet With the Saber!” The stone tablet flew over and approached the right hand of Song Shuhang’s wooden body.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword, who was floating in the air, vibrated slightly. It saw right through Song Shuhang’s thoughts when it heard him say the words “Tablet With the Saber.”","The word “tablet” was certainly not referring to Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, and the word “saber” was definitely not pointing at little friend Shuhang.","Having discovered this little secret, it was considering whether or not to take the opportunity to rend Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s heart.","After all, it was an inner demon!","“Boom~”","Just as Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet held hands, the desert began to tremble.","Evil energy of the Netherworld erupted from the ground like a volcano, all over the desert.","The stone tablet said anxiously, “How did so much evil energy of the Netherworld get here in the fraction of a time I was away? This simply doesn’t make any sense!”","The amount of evil energy that had appeared was simply too large, and it could not allow it to continue to increase!","The stone tablet called out in alarm, “Little friend Song, there is no time! Hurry up!”","“I’m ready,” Song Shuhang said. “There’s no way we are just going to allow Senior White’s hometown to be destroyed!”","Tablet With the Saber!","The primordial soul and spirit of the two entered a state of resonance.","With the teamwork of the man and the tablet, two spatial nodes emerged in the air.","The first node was connected to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area, while the other one was connected to Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","Song Shuhang shouted, “Inner World, attack!”","The Inner World, which had sensed its master’s will, stretched out its lotus roots at once.","Illusory roots instantly filled the field of vision of Song Shuhang and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Soon, the entire place became covered in lotus roots.","It was a map-wide AOE attack!","“H-How terrifying!” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword felt its body become numb.","It was unknown when Song Shuhang’s roots had grown to this number.","It was likely that with the improvement of his realm and the upgrades of his Inner World, these lotus roots also strengthened and multiplied.","Scarlet Heaven Sword, who originally wanted to rend Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s heart, silently put the thought aside.","It was afraid that if it tried to rend Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s heart now, Song Shuhang would use these lotus roots to pierce its body.","For it, between rending someone’s heart and having its body pierced, the second option was definitely the worse one.","Rending someone else’s heart but feeling the pain, totally not worth it.","The stone tablet said in a deep voice, “I’ll go on the other side first and suppress the evil energy of the Netherworld.”","Its body shrunk and rushed into the spatial node that was connected to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","However, the evil energy of the Netherworld gushed out of the spatial node like a torrent, directly pushing it back.","The stone tablet shouted hastily, “Little friend Song!”","...","“Don’t worry, just go. I have your back.” Song Shuhang waved his hand, and a large number of lotus roots shot toward the spatial node.","The lotus roots devoured all the evil energy that came pouring out.","While he was here, he would absolutely not allow the evil energy of the Netherworld to destroy Senior White’s hometown.","All this evil energy would become nutrition for his Inner World.","It came at just the right time, as the Inner World needed to evolve again.","??????","Meanwhile, in that swamp full of crows.","A human face had appeared on the black stele, and the expression on this face was a rather uncomfortable one.","It’s him again... The man from the textbook of that ancient demonic sect, Demon Emperor Hezhi.","When it finally got to deliver its energy inside the secret realm of the former Wielder of the Heaven’s Will, it found out that Demon Emperor Hezhi was waiting inside.","What worried it the most was that when its evil energy entered the secret realm of the former Wielder of the Will, a large amount of pure evil energy erupted from the ground of the desert.","...","For some reason, there seems to be a lot of evil energy hidden in the depths of that secret realm...","This aroused the interest of the black stele even further.","It summed up everything that had happened and sent a report to its master in the Netherworld Realm.","Afterward, it attempted to manipulate the flow of evil energy.","Theoretically speaking, as long as it was evil energy, it would have some control over it.","The attempt of the black stele succeeded to an extent.","As it used its evil energy to manipulate the evil energy in the secret realm, it felt that the two had merged seamlessly.","By willing it, it could control the resulting evil energy a little.","But overall, the powerful suction force spreading from the evil energy forced it to follow along."]},{"number":2131,"title":"Chapter 2131 Young Netherly White, do you prefer Little White, Teen White, or Adult White?","paragraphs":["2131 Young Netherly White, do you prefer Little White, Teen White, or Adult White?","The black stele felt as if it had fallen into a trap.","It was a little scared and decided to disconnect from the secret realm of Wielder of the Will White in an attempt to break the link with the evil energy of the Netherworld inside the secret realm.","Just as it was about to act, a burst of cheerful laughter rang in its ears.","[Young Netherly White, it looks like you have finally found the answer to the puzzle I left behind. Well done. It seems that your way of thinking can still keep up with mine. Now that you have discovered this secret, I won’t hide it anymore. Unleash all your power to complete this final step. Give it your all, and you’ll get what you want the most!]","The black stele was taken aback.","Is this the voice of Netherworld Ruler White? No, this is most likely a message from the former Wielder of the Heaven’s Will, White!","The black stele paused for a moment and then immediately reported this information to its master back in the Netherworld.","However, just as it finished compiling its report, a terrifying suction force came from the secret realm; it ignored the limitations of space and took control of its body.","The pure evil energy of the Netherworld in its body was plundered crazily, getting sucked into the secret realm.","Even the other bits of evil energy scattered all over the trial area were sucked in.","This evil energy was the very life of the black stele, so things weren’t looking good for it.","“This is bad!” The black stele tried to disconnect from the secret treasure, but it was too late. It had lost control of its body.","With the black stele as the center, a large network spread out. This network was a large formation composed of all the people infected by the evil energy of the Netherworld.","All of the Beast Realm’s infected were part of this big network.","The evil energy in the body of these infected was specially refined by the ruler of the Netherworld, and the hosts were also picked carefully.","As long as everything went smoothly, the Beast Realm would become a miniature Netherworld and the biggest base of the demons in the main world.","But now, all the evil energy in the bodies of the infected was sucked out and transferred back to the black stele. Then, through the black stele, it was poured into the secret realm.","The black stele felt extreme despair.","It could not cut off the connection, so it could watch as its energy was drained.","The black stele said in despair, “If I’m unable to get something useful out of that secret realm, this will really be the end of me.”","The infected were akin to its roots, and if something happened to them, it would be done for.","Its only hope was that its master would quickly tell it what to do next.","??????","Meanwhile, in the desert.","The stone tablet roared, “Come on, little friend Song!”","It was nearly done with its task, and half of its body was inside the spatial node. Even if the impact of the evil energy of the Netherworld increased, it would not be able to stop it.","It would return to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area soon, and once it was there, it would suppress the evil energy!","Just when Song Shuhang’s roots were fighting against the incoming evil energy and assisting the stone tablet, nobody noticed that there was a small pile of sand that had drifted to where the tablecloth was.","Similar to what happened earlier, the sand took on the appearance of Little White. Little White tilted his head while looking at the lotus flowers, living spring water, spiritual fruits, and Saber Intent Condensing Lotus Seeds on the tablecloth.","Probably due to him having already tasted the lotuses, after some thought, he moved toward the living spring water, taking a sip.","“Ooh~” He let out a satisfied moan.","Then, he took another sip, and then another one.","Eventually, he raised his head and looked at the man, tree, tablet, and sword fighting in the distance. He blinked before lowering his head again.","The wind blew and more sand drifted over.","Sand gathered next to Little White and began to take a humanoid shape.","Not long after, a “Teen White” appeared.","He glanced at Little White, picked up a Saber Intent Condensing Lotus Seed, licked it, and then stuffed it into his mouth.","“Mm~” The young man squinted his eyes in satisfaction. He sat cross-legged next to the lotus seeds and focused on stuffing them into his mouth.","Another gust of wind blew and more sand drifted over.","This time, there was more sand than before, and this sand then transformed into an “Adult White.”","After Adult White appeared, he smiled. He sat down beside the tablecloth and stretched out his hand to gather the remaining lotus flowers and spiritual fruits.","He did not try to take Little White’s or Teen White’s food.","Three different Whites had appeared.","After a while, a voice rang in everyone’s ears.","[Young Netherly White, it’s time for another multiple-choice question. The question is, do you prefer this cute Little White, this rather handsome Teen White, or this Adult White?]","Song Shuhang: “???”","The stone tablet: “???”","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword: “???”","All three of them turned around and looked toward the oasis, where they saw three Senior Whites in three different forms.","They had no idea when they had appeared.","“It’s Senior White, but why are there three of him?” Song Shuhang had a headache.","Plans could never keep up with the changes.","He had made extensive calculations, but he did not expect that three Senior Whites would appear.","And according to the message of Wielder of the Will White, among the three Senior Whites, it was very likely that only one was authentic.","...","According to the plot in movies, if they chose the right one, they would be able to get the real Senior White back. But if they got it wrong, who knew what would happen...","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “How do we choose?”","“Is there even a need to choose? It’s definitely the adult version of my master!” the stone tablet shouted while attempting to squeeze through the.","“But if it’s the adult version of Senior White, don’t you think that this multiple-choice question would be too easy?” Song Shuhang calmly analyzed.","At this time, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “I have a good plan.”","Song Shuhang pleased. “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, please tell us.”","“There are three of us. A man, a tablet, and a sword. The combination of the words tablet and sword sounds very similar to the word despicable in Mandarin. A despicable man, got it?” said the black Scarlet Heaven Sword with a laugh.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The stone tablet said, “I understand what Fellow Daoist Sword is trying to say. If each of us chooses one, then one of us will definitely get it right, right?”","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword is still reliable at critical times.” Song Shuhang smiled and said, “Then, who goes first?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “You, as your luck is relatively bad. We can use the elimination method to increase the chances for me and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet to win the prize.”","...","Song Shuhang: “...”","How are you so sure that I won’t choose the right one?","If I don’t prove you wrong, my name is not Shuhang!","Song Shuhang looked at Little White, Teen White, and Adult White.","After some thought, he pointed his finger at Little White. “It’s you, you’re Senior White!”","It wasn’t just because Little White was the cutest; Song Shuhang’s choice was actually based on facts and logic!","First of all, this secret world was the desert he saw in Senior White’s illusory reality.","And in the illusory reality, there was a Little White that was the same as the one in front of him.","So, Shuhang tried to follow White’s train of thought and made his choice.","He was pretty confident this time.","Why rely on blind luck when you can use facts and logic?","When Song Shuhang made his choice, the whole world began to shake, giving rise to a chain reaction.","“Shiet, did Shuhang actually get it right?” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword could not believe it.","“It’s the strength of logic!” Song Shuhang laughed and said, “I, Song, rely on calculations, not blind luck.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “I see. In other words, your luck is still as bad as before and is, therefore, not worth mentioning. Knowing this, I feel relieved.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","The adult Senior White beside the tablecloth, who was holding the lotus flowers and the spirit fruits, merged with the desert and disappeared.","The teen White, who was holding the Saber Intent Condensing Lotus Seeds, took a step back and dissipated into the wind.","Only Little White remained.","Song Shuhang asked, “Senior White, did I make the right choice?”","Little White did not answer.","He placed his hands together and rubbed them lightly. One after another, runes appeared on his body.","Following his actions, the entire desert world shook and cheered.","The stone tablet shouted, “Hahaha, my mission is over! I’m free now!”","When Song Shuhang made his choice, it sensed that the mission left to it by its master, Wielder of the Will White, had come to an end.","From now on, it was a free stone tablet.","It could leave this place and let the big shots of the universe remember its name once more...","Actually, its name had changed. As such, it was time for it to let the big shots of the universe learn its new name—Tyrannical Song’s Tombstone!","With its mission completed, it no longer needed to rush back to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area to suppress this secret realm.","The stone tablet left the spatial node and returned to Song Shuhang’s side.","Little White looked at Song Shuhang and said, “Everyone, get ready.”","The look in Little White’s eyes and his expression were gentle, making him look just like the Senior White they knew.","“The impact will be large, and you might enter a short coma. However, don’t worry.” Little White said slowly, “I will protect you.”","Under Little White’s guidance, the vast amount of evil energy turned into a source of power, and they had to thank the black stele for providing some energy of its own.","The whole desert was affected by a powerful magical technique now that there was a suitable source of energy.","The light of the magical technique enveloped Song Shuhang, the stone tablet, Scarlet Heaven Sword, as well as Sixteen and Sister White Dragon who were on the other side of the desert.","Song Shuhang felt a wave of dizziness overcome his senses.","This feels like motion sickness... Is it the path of time? Before he fully lost consciousness, this thought flashed through his mind.","It was similar to the magical technique of the owner of the crystal room.","That was also a time-based magical technique that transferred the subject’s consciousness to the past.","Could it be that just like the inheritance of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, Wielder of the Will White has a secret that cannot be recorded in words and can only be observed by going back into the past?"]},{"number":2132,"title":"Chapter 2132 Dragon liver and phoenix gallbladder","paragraphs":["2132 Dragon liver and phoenix gallbladder","If it’s really a time-type magical technique like the one I experienced in the crystal room, does that mean that I will get to see the era of the young Senior White?","That should be quite interesting...","While he was in thought, Song Shuhang’s consciousness began to blur.","??????","Garre Holy Mountain, inside the crystal room of the Inheritance Land.","The owner of the crystal room, with a smile on his face, smeared his ball of energy on the face of a beast cultivator.","Smearing things on people’s faces is really refreshing. I can’t stop myself from doing it!","Deep in his heart, he began to pray for the success of the trial takers. He hoped that more beast cultivators would complete the trials and reach his crystal room.","In this way, he could smear more faces.","Suddenly, his arm froze. He frowned as he began sensing the general situation in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","The owner of the crystal room murmured, “The path of time... Moreover, its principles are so profound.”","Who cast such a powerful time magical technique in Holy Mountain’s trial area?","He mobilized his authority as a trial officer and scanned through the trial area back and forth.","However, he found nothing.","Huh? Yet, the fluctuations caused by the power of time were so clear!","Could it be that in the depths of the trial area, there is a hidden area that even I do not know of?","Still, this trial area was their territory. How could there be a hidden area that even they did not know about?","When he thought of this, the owner of the crystal room sent a message to the divine dragon and the holy apes through their internal channel, reporting the incident along with his guesses.","??????","In the second trial area.","When the divine dragon received the message from the owner of the crystal room, its liver twitched.","It’s one thing if the spatial confinement is turned into a sieve, but now there are even people who left a secret realm in our trial area?","Dammit, does this trial area even belong to us?!","My liver hurts so much!","The divine dragon felt that if its liver was extracted at this moment, it would become a top-tier ingredient for the “dragon liver and phoenix gallbladder” dish. This was because this dish tasted the best when the liver used was of a dragon in great pain.","Back in the days, there used to be a large number of “dragon livers” on the black market, and every dragon liver was of the best quality.","Later, when an investigation was carried out, it turned out that the reason was a stupid dragon who liked to be abused. Whenever it was in pain, it would take out its liver and put it up for auction.","After all, for dragons of a certain realm, growing back their liver was just a matter of a nap.","The divine dragon felt its liver hurt even more when it thought of that shameful member of its dragon race.","??????","In the Netherworld Realm.","Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball sent an order to the black stele in the Beast Realm. [No matter the cost, find out everything about the secret realm left by the previous Wielder of the Will. Go inside and get your hands on the secrets concealed in the secret realm.]","At the same time, it sent a special demon pet that it had recently created to the location of the black stele to assist it.","This demon pet was something that Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball created through its research on the bone of eternity and Tyrannical Song’s necrotic kidney.","The pet came in the form of a small metal ball that had been permeated with the aura of eternity. To some extent, it was a remote-controlled clone of the fat ball.","At a critical moment, this demon pet could channel the energy of the fat ball and burst out with extreme combat power. But after this short burst, the precious pet would be reduced to ashes by the Heavenly Punishment.","After doing all this, the main body of the fat ball crossed through space and arrived outside the world of the black lotus.","It then cleared its throat and said, “Netherly White, come out! I know that you can hear me. Come out if you have the guts!”","The main body of the fat ball bounced on the ground as it shouted out loud.","The corners of the demonic hamster’s mouth, who was squatting by the entrance of the world of the black lotus, twitched.","“Netherly White, stop playing dead. Answer me! Let me tell you, I’m not here to fight today. I just want to chat with you,” said the fat ball while bouncing up and down.","The demonic hamster covered its ears and murmured, “I didn’t hear anything, I didn’t hear anything.”","The fat ball said cheerfully, “I didn’t expect your patience to be this good. [Sneer], it seems that you don’t recognize the name Netherly White. Whatever, it doesn’t matter. I have another name here, and you definitely will like this one. White Two, right? Is this how it’s pronounced? Do you like getting called White Two more than Netherly White?”","The demonic hamster sighed.","It knew that No Tyrannical Song would pay for what was happening.","Yep, No Tyrannical Song is going to die.","But how did the nickname White Two reach the ears of the fat ball?","Outside the world of the black lotus, the fat ball continued jumping up and down.","However, seeing that Netherly White was ignoring it, it eventually became a little bored, opened a spatial portal, and left.","After all, it was a busy ball.","Before the failure that was Wielder of the Will Fat Ball disappeared, it had to try its best to find a method to allow itself to keep living as a ruler of the Netherworld like Netherly White.","After seeing the fat ball leave, the demonic hamster silently sent a point of energy to No Tyrannical Song through the QR code Golden Core Composition.","Together with the point of energy, it left a message: May you be blessed, No Tyrannical Song.","[Beep~ Remote energy transmission failed. No Tyrannical Song is not in the service area.]","...","The demonic hamster was puzzled.","What the hell do you mean with “not in the service area”?","Has Profound Sage Tyrannical Song traveled through time and space?","??????","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang slowly regained consciousness.","He asked softly, “Have we arrived yet?”","Going back in time would cause one’s consciousness to go back to the past, and the process was usually very fast.","“No, not yet.” Scarlet Heaven Sword’s voice came from beside him.","As soon as Song Shuhang turned his head, he found that the black Scarlet Heaven Sword was standing guard beside him. They were still surrounded by the principles of time, and they were still in the process of going back in time.","Song Shuhang said gratefully, “Thank you, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword had a sharp tongue but a tender heart.","...","Although its mouth would often rend other people’s hearts, during important times, it would silently protect Song Shuhang and others.","“Huh? Where’s Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet?” Song Shuhang looked around, only to find that he and Scarlet Heaven Sword were the only ones present. The stone tablet was nowhere to be found.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “It did not come with us.”","Song Shuhang mused, “Why?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword guessed, “After the desert became part of the time technique, although the magical technique’s power covered Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, its consciousness was left in place. It became a coordinate we can return to. It should be something the creator of the technique planned ahead of time.”","Song Shuhang nodded slightly. It seemed like everything had happened according to the arrangements of Wielder of the Will White.","Song Shuhang asked, “How long will it take for us to leave this state?”","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword asked in return, “Do you want to hear the truth, or do you want me to lie?”","Song Shuhang’s heart turned cold. “...I want to hear the truth.”"]},{"number":2133,"title":"Chapter 2133 Am I going to die of old age during this time reversal?","paragraphs":["2133 Am I going to die of old age during this time reversal?","As soon as one heard a question such as “Do you want to hear the truth, or do you want me to lie?”, they would immediately be able to tell that there was something wrong.","As such, Song Shuhang got ready for the worst.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword smiled and said, “You’re the same as always, still a straightforward man.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","!!","Is that a compliment?","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword continued, “Before I tell you the truth, let me show you a new ability of mine. This is a small ability I acquired not long ago, and it’s very interesting.”","Song Shuhang: “???”","Why are you suddenly talking about a new ability of yours? Can’t you just cut to the chase?","The way the mind of an inner demon works is really impossible to figure out, especially if it’s a top-tier inner demon like Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Song Shuhang played along. “Fine, go ahead and tell me. What’s this new ability of yours?”","“Hehehe.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword showed its hilt to Song Shuhang. The cover opened, revealing a watch-like dial.","Song Shuhang: “...”","This is what you wanted to show me?","After a while, Song Shuhang praised it, “Hm, it does have quite a trendy style. Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, you have good taste.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Why are you looking at the style? Look at the hour hand!”","The hour hand on the dial was slowly moving counterclockwise.","Song Shuhang said, “There doesn’t seem to be anything wrong with it. We’re currently going back in time, so isn’t it normal that the hour hand is moving counterclockwise?”","“The problem is the speed at which the hour hand is moving.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword added, “It’s moving counterclockwise at normal speed, second by second. After the time technique took effect, the clock on my body began to move backward, going back by around an hour, which is about the same time we have spent in this technique.”","Song Shuhang thought for a while, and immediately understood what the black Scarlet Heaven Sword was implying. “In other words, we didn’t directly go to the era of the young Senior White. Instead, time is moving in reverse, but at normal speed...”","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword praised, “Yes, that’s what I was trying to tell you. Your comprehension ability is pretty good.”","Song Shuhang gasped. Is the time technique going to take us to when the main world’s Senior White was a child or all the way back to when Wielder of the Will White was a child?","If the target was Senior White, then it would be fine. However, if it was Wielder of the Will White...","Wielder of the Will White was the Wielder of the Will before the fat ball, and he came from an era that preceded the era of the Scholarly Sage.","If Shuhang was going to be in this time technique all the way until he was back in the era of Wielder of the Will White, he may have to be here for hundreds of millions of years.","By that time, he would be long dead. Even if a Sixth Stage True Monarch’s lifespan was multiplied by a hundred, he would not be able to survive!","“Am I going to die of old age during this time reversal?” Song Shuhang felt a throbbing pain in his liver.","Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said slowly, “Don’t worry, things aren’t that bad. It was only your ‘consciousness’ that was brought into this magical technique. Additionally, according to the principles of time reversal, even if the time reversal lasts for hundreds of millions of years, once the effect ends, your consciousness will return to your body and your lifespan would not have been affected at all.”","When he heard this, Song Shuhang let out a breath of relief. “If that’s the case, I guess it’s fine.”","“What’s fine? You, a big man, are going to stay with me, a big sword, all this time. You might have to stay with me for hundreds of millions of years. Even if you don’t go crazy, I will.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword covered its hilt again.","Song Shuhang sat cross-legged and asked, “Then, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, do you have a solution?”","“I do,” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword said calmly. “During this long period of time, in order to ensure that the two of us will not go crazy, once every hour, you should give me a vigorous rubbing with the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?. As long as I keep receiving a massage with the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?, I can last hundreds of millions of years.”","“...” Song Shuhang sighed. “At this time, it would be great if there were more people with us.”","Three people could play Fight the Landlord, and four people could play even more games.","While Shuhang was in thought, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword suddenly shouted, “Huh? There is a car coming our way. Be careful not to let it crash into you.”","Song Shuhang blurted out, “What?”","“Boom~”","Something hit him, and a familiar voice sounded in his ear. “Shuhang!”","As soon as Song Shuhang turned around, he saw Sister White Dragon and Sixteen.","Sixteen jumped toward Song Shuhang happily.","Song Shuhang hurriedly stretched out his arms and caught the petite Sixteen.","“Sixteen, why are you here?” Song Shuhang hugged her and spun around to reduce the force of the impact.","Since Sister White Dragon was protecting Sixteen, when the latter jumped toward him, she moved as fast as a cannonball.","Sister White Dragon explained, “We entered that desert along with your and the stone tablet’s physical bodies. Soon after we entered, we saw your tombstone. We were about to dig the grave to check inside when the desert became part of a time technique, drawing our consciousnesses into it.”","Sixteen asked, “Shuhang, what’s with this time technique?”","Song Shuhang explained, “My guess is that this technique will bring us to the time when Senior White was a child. However, I’m afraid the technique could cause us some inconvenience.”","Song Shuhang recounted the discussion between himself and Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","??????","Sister White Dragon said slowly, “That is to say, our consciousnesses might be stuck here for hundreds of millions of years... Well, for Shuhang, this is a great opportunity.”","Song Shuhang blurted out, “Huh?”","Sister White Dragon pushed up the nonexistent glasses on the bridge of her nose and said, “You can take advantage of this period to make up for your lack of cultivation-related knowledge, which honestly makes my heart ache.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Even if you want to teach him, it’s not going to take that long.”","“We can take things slowly and teach Shuhang and Sixteen one thing at a time.” Sister White Dragon then said to Song Shuhang, “Maybe after the effect of this time technique wears out, the amount of knowledge you have will be a proper match for your cultivation realm. So, do you want to learn?”","“Of course!” Song Shuhang nodded vigorously. One of his goals in life was to become a reliable and knowledgeable senior.","Now that an opportunity to learn was in front of him, how could he give it up?","...","??????","Song Shuhang felt that he could become a knowledgeable cultivator. After all, he had always been a good student. The only reason his cultivation knowledge was so poor was that he didn’t have the time to study.","He was confident as he began to learn from Sister White Dragon.","On the first day, Sister White Dragon taught him a lot of things, and Song Shuhang remembered everything.","But soon after, he discovered that he had forgotten everything.","Not only that, but many memories in his mind began to become vague.","Time continued to move backward little by little, and even Scarlet Heaven Sword and Sister White Dragon in front of him seemed to become unfamiliar..."]},{"number":2134,"title":"Chapter 2134 Hi, my name is Song Shuhang","paragraphs":["2134 Hi, my name is Song Shuhang","This was not a good thing.","He still had his memories of the black Scarlet Heaven Sword and Sister White Dragon, but they had started to become vague, which led to that strange feeling.","Song Shuhang frowned and asked, “Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, how long have we been inside the time technique?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword replied, “According to the clock on my body, we’ve spent about 30 hours here, so about a day and a half.”","“It’s only been 30 hours?” Song Shuhang rubbed his eyebrows. If that was the case, then why did his memories of Scarlet Heaven Sword and Sister White Dragon become blurry?","Even if time were to go back by a day, the relationship between him, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and Sister White Dragon was not much different.","Song Shuhang said, “Seniors, I have some bad news.”","Sister White Dragon glanced at Song Shuhang and said, “Don’t tell me that you’ve forgotten the things I’ve taught you...”","“Yes, that’s exactly the case. I’m sorry, Teacher White Dragon,” said Song Shuhang weakly.","Sister White Dragon sighed. “How much have you forgotten?”","“I’ve forgotten nearly everything.” Song Shuhang lowered his head, embarrassed.","“...” Sister White Dragon said, “Didn’t you say that you were admitted as a top student at Jiangnan University? How is your learning ability so bad? Did you attend cram school before you were admitted?”","“This has nothing to do with learning ability. I’m being affected by the time technique,” Song Shuhang explained. “Not only am I forgetting the things I’ve learned, but other things as well. For example, I feel as if there is some distance between Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword and me right now.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said proudly, “If there were no distance between us, you’d already be dead. I’m a very sharp sword, after all.”","If there was no distance between the two of them, it meant that it had pierced the other party’s body. With its power, which was that of an Immortal-level weapon, even if only the tip pierced Song Shuhang’s body, it could waste one of his chances to resurrect.","“...” Song Shuhang explained, “That’s not what I meant by distance. What I mean is that under the influence of the time technique, my memory has become a blur. I feel as if Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword has become a stranger.”","“What, a stranger?” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword was taken aback for a moment. It hurriedly said, “Then hurry up and use the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? to enhance the relationship between us. That should dispel that sense of unfamiliarity.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","This sword is truly hopeless.","“Even if your memory was influenced by the time reversal, it does not make sense for it to be affected so much in just a day and a half,” Sister White Dragon calmly analyzed. “But if that is really the case, then there is only one explanation. What’s happening to your memory is an intended effect of this time reversal technique.”","This time reversal technique was strange. When reversing time, it did not instantly bring its target to the destination. Instead, it reversed time very slowly, and there must be a reason for that.","Song Shuhang asked, “Has your memory also been affected, Senior?”","Sister White Dragon said calmly, “No. At my level, it is difficult for a magical technique to have any effect on my memory.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword added, “The same goes for me.”","“What about Sixteen?” Song Shuhang hurriedly looked at Sixteen, who was in his arms.","Among the people present, Sixteen was the weakest, and she was in the midst of the Spirit River Su Clan’s big trial, so she was not in great condition.","As soon as he lowered his head, he saw Sixteen looking at him in confusion.","Unfortunately, it seemed like she had been affected.","To what extent was her memory affected?","What if Sixteen no longer remembers even meeting me?","That was not something Song Shuhang wanted to see.","Should I try to do something?","When he thought of this, Song Shuhang showed Sixteen his best smile, which was labeled as a “harmless” smile by the seniors in the group.","Such a smile, although it would not arouse people’s goodwill, it wouldn’t arouse their disgust either.","Sixteen’s long eyelashes fluttered.","Song Shuhang said to Sixteen, “Hi, my name is Song Shuhang.”","He wanted to leave a strong impression on her.","As long as the impression was strong enough, even if she lost her memory, there would still be a sense of familiarity between them.","“Pfft~ What are you doing, Shuhang?” Sixteen could not help but laugh.","It seems that she has not been affected for the time being...","Song Shuhang said cheerfully, “I wanted to leave a strong impression on you so that you wouldn’t forget me.”","Could it be that I’m the only one with amnesia?","Isn’t it a bit too much?","Sister White Dragon looked up at the sky and said, disappointed, “I thought I could use this opportunity to turn you into an elite cultivator whose knowledge was on par with his realm, but it seems you had no fate with that knowledge.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword guessed, “That might not be the case. Perhaps at the end of the technique, Shuhang will remember everything he learned from Fellow Daoist White Dragon. So, you can continue with the follow-up chapter.”","Sister White Dragon shook her head and said, “Without the foundation, even if I teach him the follow-up chapter, he won’t understand anything.”","“It’s truly a pity then.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword looked at Song Shuhang again.","Suddenly, its blade shone brightly; it had thought of something.","If things were to continue like this and Song Shuhang completely forget about it, could it find a way to trick him into using the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? on it?","??????","The time technique continued its course.","Sister White Dragon asked, “Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, how long has it been?”","She felt bored and sleepy by now.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword replied, “I have not paid attention to the clock.”","...","Its entertainment right now mainly came from Song Shuhang and Sixteen.","“Hi, my name is Song Shuhang. Nice to meet you.” Song Shuhang and Sixteen sat side by side.","Sixteen supported her chin with her hands and replied, “I’m Su Clan’s Sixteen.”","After thinking for a while, Song Shuhang said seriously, “Sixteen, you look rather familiar. Have we met before? I’m not trying to strike up a conversation, but this is the impression I got.”","Sixteen replied patiently, “Mm-hm, we have met before.”","“What was our relationship before?” Song Shuhang asked nervously. “Sorry, but my memory is a bit fuzzy. I can’t seem to remember much.”","“We used to have a teacher-student relationship.” Sixteen turned her face to the side. There was a bright smile on her face, and her long eyelashes fluttered up and down, making her look quite charming.","“A teacher-student relationship? Then, was I the teacher?” Song Shuhang rubbed his temples.","I even forgot the fact that I was a teacher?","Sixteen replied, “No, I was the teacher.”","“Huh?” Song Shuhang looked at the petite girl in shock.","..."]},{"number":2135,"title":"Chapter 2135 Next!","paragraphs":["2135 Next!","Someone this young was my teacher?","How is that possible?","She looks like a high school student. Actually, she could be even younger...","After thinking it over, Song Shuhang carefully voiced out his doubts, “Sixteen, are you an adult?”","!!","“Yes, I’m an adult. Do you have any other questions, Shuhang?” Sixteen hugged her knees and looked at Song Shuhang with a smile.","Song Shuhang maintained a smiling face as he said, “Teacher Sixteen, you are so cute.”","Sixteen smiled sweetly and replied, “Thank you.”","Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief.","Song “I Survived Again Today” Shuhang.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword, who was floating nearby, watching the entire play, was already hurting internally from laughing.","This was a play that it would never tire of watching.","And every time, there would be something new.","It discovered that this little girl from the Su Clan was much more interesting than what it had imagined.","Previously, when it was staying with Song Shuhang, all it ever saw was the gentle and considerate side of Sixteen. After all, girls were usually very gentle toward the person they liked.","“By the way, Sixteen, did we really just have a teacher-student relationship?” Song Shuhang, who had been silent for a while, asked cautiously.","He felt that the relationship between him and Sixteen was not as simple as one between a teacher and a student.","Out of caution, he did not voice out his thoughts so bluntly and asked in a roundabout way.","Scarlet Heaven Sword shouted through sound transmission, [Fellow Daoist White Dragon, quickly come over! The script has changed again.]","Song Shuhang had already introduced himself to Sixteen three times.","Their current interaction was already the fourth one.","Anyway, Song Shuhang had not asked this question the past few times.","This gave the black Scarlet Heaven Sword a refreshing feeling, just as if it encountered a hidden plot.","Sister White Dragon opened her eyes wearily, glanced at Song Shuhang and Sixteen in the distance, and blocked Scarlet Heaven Sword with her tail, preventing it from disturbing them.","Sixteen was also slightly taken aback. She raised her head and nodded. “Yes, it’s not just as simple as teachers and students.”","Song Shuhang asked happily, “Then, what was our relationship?”","Sixteen smiled and did not answer.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said to Sister White Dragon, [I have a hunch that Song Shuhang is going to seek death next. Let’s try to simulate Song Shuhang’s train of thought. According to how he usually thinks, he’s first going to wonder if they are siblings. If he hadn’t confirmed earlier that Sixteen was an adult, he might have even considered the possibility of them being brother and sister or even father and daughter!]","Just when the black Scarlet Heaven Sword was trying to figure out what Song Shuhang was thinking, Song Shuhang stretched out his arms and gently pulled Sixteen into his embrace.","He was seriously lacking in information, so it was impossible for him to guess the exact relationship between him and Sixteen. However, what he was certain about was that their relationship was a close one.","As such, Song Shuhang chose to give her a hug.","Whether it was a relative, a close friend, or someone even closer, a hug would not appear too out of place.","He was cautious, but he did not lack the courage to take on a challenge at critical times.","This was Song Shuhang.","[Am I seeing things? After losing his memories, did Song Shuhang become wittier?] The black Scarlet Heaven Sword sent a voice transmission to Sister White Dragon.","[He has always been a witty little fellow,] Sister White Dragon said slowly. After all, she knew Shuhang since their encounter on the mysterious island.","Sixteen pursed her lips lightly and cuddled with Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang’s mental energy kept a close watch on Sixteen’s reaction.","If she showed any resistance, he would immediately let go of her.","Seeing that Sixteen did not resist, Song Shuhang was relieved. He followed his instincts and held this familiar yet unfamiliar girl tightly in his arms.","??????","The time technique continued its course. It was as if it was set on taking hundreds of millions of years to complete the process.","Song Shuhang, who was hugging Sixteen tightly, lost his memory again.","After a while, he looked at the petite girl in his arms and asked through gritted teeth, “Hello, may I ask... what’s my name?”","Sixteen blinked helplessly.","It had finally come to this.","Under the effect of the time reversal, Song Shuhang had forgotten even his name.","“Shuhang. Your name is Shuhang,” Sixteen replied patiently. She did not hate this kind of conversation and, in fact, even enjoyed it.","“I see...” Song Shuhang murmured his name, his arms still around Sixteen.","When he could not even remember his name, he felt helpless.","It seemed that the whole world was out of tune with him.","And in this world that he knew nothing about, only the familiar yet unfamiliar girl in his arms could bring him a little bit of warmth.","Song Shuhang asked cautiously, “May I take the liberty to ask you a question?”","Sixteen replied, “My name is Su Clan’s Sixteen.”","Huh? How did this girl know that I wanted to ask her name? Are we that close?","...","Song Shuhang asked, “Su Clan’s Sixteen... So, is your surname Su? Su Hang... Su Hang... I see. My surname is also Su. Are we related?”","“Pfft~” Sixteen could not help but laugh out loud.","Sister White Dragon and Scarlet Heaven Sword held themselves back from laughing with great difficulty and tried not to make a sound. The sword and the dragon could only continue to play the role of a decorative background.","Sixteen said softly, “In the past, I did think of having you change your surname to Su. But now, I no longer have that thought. No one can force you to change your surname now.”","Song Shuhang was already known as the first Sage in a thousand years, and there was no person in the universe who didn’t know him.","Although he was a fake, no one in the Spirit River Su Clan knew it other than her and Seven.","With how famous Song Shuhang was, which elder of the Spirit River Su Clan was daring enough to ask him to change his surname? Who would have the guts to look him in the eyes and speak those words?","Song Shuhang asked, puzzled, “My surname is not Su? Then, what is my surname?”","Sixteen replied, “Your surname is Song.”","“That’s not a cool surname,” Song Shuhang pinched his chin, “but it’s pretty good when combined with the name Su Hang.”","Song Shuhang asked, “By the way, Sixteen, what is our relationship?”","...","“Of course it’s... Huh?” Sixteen stopped halfway through her sentence.","She left Song Shuhang’s embrace and shouted to Sister White Dragon, “Sister White Dragon, my memory is also being affected.”","“Heavens, is the amnesia going to get us one by one and wipe our memories?” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword raised its hilt and looked up to the sky."]},{"number":2136,"title":"Chapter 2136 Memory Cloud Storage Technique","paragraphs":["2136 Memory Cloud Storage Technique","Sister White Dragon comforted her gently, “Don’t be afraid. The loss of memory you’re experiencing is only temporary, and you can take advantage of this opportunity to form a scatterbrain duo with Song Shuhang. Perhaps once the time reversal ends, the two of you will recall everything that happened. Wouldn’t that be very interesting?”","Sixteen: “...”","She rubbed the space between her brows and calmly analyzed the situation. “Sister White Dragon, I’m losing my memory much faster than Shuhang.”","Song Shuhang had been able to talk to her four times, and it was only during the fifth time that his memory was wiped clean.","!!","Yet, her memory was disappearing at a much faster pace.","Earlier, when she was preparing to answer Song Shuhang’s question to explain their relationship, all the answers she had come up with disappeared from her mind before she could speak.","Everything she was thinking until a moment ago was wiped out in the next second.","Sister White Dragon said gently, “Don’t worry. Just let nature take its course. Since this time reversal was created by the previous Wielder of the Heaven’s Will, it is definitely not simple. The blurring of one’s memory should be a key part of this magical technique, so don’t resist it.”","Sixteen was about to say something when Song Shuhang wrapped his hands around her waist from behind.","In this strange world, only Sixteen could bring Shuhang a sense of familiarity and warmth. He felt uncomfortable when Sixteen left his arms, so he seized the opportunity to embrace her again.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Sixteen: “...”","She turned her head and looked at Song Shuhang.","After about three breaths, Song Shuhang asked, “Um, hello, what’s my name?”","“Shu... Eh?” Sixteen’s eyebrows rose in confusion.","“Shu Eh? This name is a bit strange.” Song Shuhang hugged the girl in his arms tightly. “What’s your name?”","“Su... Eh?” Sixteen frowned.","“Su Eh? Your name is as weird as mine.” Song Shuhang laughed.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Sixteen’s memory was almost gone by this point.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword was already shaking from laughter. If it was not for it being a sword, it would have laughed until it was shedding tears.","But as it was laughing, it suddenly stopped.","Sister White Dragon glanced at it, having guessed the most probable reason as to why it stopped laughing. “Are you also starting to lose your memory?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said bitterly, “Heavens, my memory was also affected. For example, I’ve already forgotten who my master is. Damn it... I thought that since I was a divine weapon, I would not be affected.”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Did you even remember your master before losing your memory? I thought you had long forgotten your previous master and recognized little friend Song Shuhang as your new master.","??????","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword lost its memories even faster than Sixteen did.","After only five breaths, its memory was wiped clean. It floated beside Song Shuhang in bewilderment and instinctively moved closer to him.","After losing awareness of the world, whether it was a creature or a magical treasure, they would instinctively approach those they were “familiar” with.","Sister White Dragon said slowly, “I should be next, right?”","As expected, after the black Scarlet Heaven Sword’s memory was wiped clean, hers was also affected.","Actually, given Sister White Dragon’s strength, even if this was just her clone and her main body was in the process of resurrecting, she could still resist the memory loss.","As an Immortal, she had stepped onto a path, so she naturally had some methods to counter the effect of the technique.","However, she let the time technique take its course, putting up no resistance.","She was not worried about her memories being wiped clean as she was something akin to light of virtue at the moment. Even if her memory was erased, her main body, which was buried in a coffin on the mysterious island, had a complete backup.","As long as she returned to Earth, she would be able to synchronize with her main body and restore her memories.","It was a memory cloud storage technique of sorts.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword should have a similar function as well.","??????","After a long time, Sister White Dragon’s memories were also wiped out.","After losing her memory, she did not panic and continued to hover in the air.","Below, Song Shuhang was holding Sixteen and carrying the black Scarlet Heaven Sword on his back.","Sixteen seemed to feel something and looked up at Sister White Dragon. Even if they had lost their memories, the symbiotic relationship between them did not disappear.","After some thought, Sister White Dragon shrunk and moved beside Sixteen.","All four of them were amnesiacs now.","Song Shuhang suddenly said, “I’m a little hungry. How about you?”","Sixteen replied, “I’m also hungry. Is there anything to eat?”","This time, the four did not ask each other their names. Perhaps their intuition told them that it was useless to ask, so they did not bother wasting any effort doing so.","Sister White Dragon looked around and shook her head. “I don’t see anything edible.”","Song Shuhang glanced at Sister White Dragon, and after a little thought, he waved his hand and said, “Let me tell you in advance, I don’t taste good.”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","After Song Shuhang finished speaking, he turned his head to look at the black Scarlet Heaven Sword. “Can you be eaten? You look deliciously crunchy.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said angrily, “I am a saber. Can’t you see? Can a saber be eaten?”","...","“What’s a saber?” asked Sixteen.","Song Shuhang said seriously, “A saber is something that cannot be eaten.”","After he finished speaking, he looked at Sister White Dragon.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","She swore that if this guy dared to eat her, she would strike first and bite his stupid head off.","Song Shuhang asked, “You look delicious. Can you be eaten?”","Sister White Dragon opened her mouth wide, revealing her sharp teeth.","“Wait, Sister Long White Strip, I’m not asking you.” Song Shuhang waved his hands repeatedly, then pointed at a location next to Sister White Dragon. “I’m asking that thing.”","Everyone looked in the direction Song Shuhang was pointing.","A dumpling-like object was hovering in the air, looking soft and delicious.","It floated in the air without making a sound.","...","Song Shuhang said, “It didn’t answer, and it looks edible.”","After saying that, he stepped forward, grabbed the white dumpling, and handed it to Sister White Dragon, “Sister, do you want to eat it?”","Although he had lost his memories, the language pack and parts of the common sense pack remained.","It was best not to eat unknown objects, and if he really wanted to eat them, it was best to test if they were poisonous first. Only then would he eat them.","Sister White Dragon smiled slightly. She took the white dumpling and flicked her small claw, leaving an afterimage as the dumpling was stuffed into Song Shuhang’s mouth.","This guy’s face seemed to say, “I don’t know if this thing can be eaten, so I’ll let Sister Long White Strip try it and see if it’s poisonous.” It was the first time that she saw a creature with a face that was so easy to read."]},{"number":2137,"title":"Chapter 2137 VIP channel, unimpeded","paragraphs":["2137 VIP channel, unimpeded","Honestly, this is already beyond having an “easy to read” facial expression. It’s as if there are subtitles that come with his face.","“Wuuu! Song Shuhang struggled symbolically.","It was unknown what ingredients were used to make the small dumpling, but it melted in his mouth immediately, sliding down his throat.","Before he could even react, the dumpling was gone.","!!","It had to be noted that Song Shuhang and the others were just spiritual bodies at the moment.","Sister White Dragon looked at him curiously. “Does it taste good?”","Song Shuhang replied honestly, “It’s delicious. It melted in my mouth and left a pleasant aftertaste.”","Before he could savor it properly, the small dumpling slid into his belly. However, he could still feel the lingering aftertaste.","With how good it tasted, Song Shuhang wanted to eat another even if it was poisonous.","If he got a chance to eat another dumpling like that, he would taste it carefully and not waste any bit of it.","“Do you want to eat more?” Sixteen’s voice sounded from behind him.","When Song Shuhang turned his head, he saw that the petite girl was holding several dumpling-shaped objects in her hands. The big ones were as large as a fist, and the small ones were only as big as a lychee.","“So many?” Song Shuhang asked in surprise.","Sixteen replied, “They appear in the air from time to time. I just picked up a few.”","After thinking about it, Song Shuhang said bravely, “Let me eat another one. If I’m not dead in a few minutes, you guys can try them too!”","After all, he had already eaten one, and eating another one would not change anything.","If he was going to die, he would at least help the others.","Song Shuhang took a fist-sized dumpling from the hands of the petite girl. This time, he would taste it carefully.","As a proper food tester, he would judge the look, smell, and taste.","First, he carefully took in the shape of the dumpling.","Song Shuhang squeezed it and looked at it affectionately.","It looks both very cute and delicious.","Then, he smelled it.","The dumpling itself had no smell, and it was likely that its fragrance would only be released when it melted in one’s mouth. Yet, it seemed to be tainted with a faint fragrance.","Hmm, it’s the scent of the petite girl in front of me.","The last step was to taste it.","Because he was worried that it would melt in his mouth and he would not be able to taste it properly, Song Shuhang decided to lick it first.","He pinched the dumpling and held it high, sticking out his tongue and licking it.","Then... the small dumpling melted along his tongue, slid into his mouth, and flowed into his stomach.","The whole process was very fast, Song Shuhang’s throat seemed to have opened a VIP channel for the small dumpling, allowing it to move unimpeded.","Song Shuhang: “...”","F*ck, I didn’t get to taste anything.","While sighing, Song Shuhang sat down cross-legged and said to the long white strip and the petite girl, “Let’s wait for a few minutes and see if I die from poisoning.”","Sister White Dragon and Sixteen nodded.","Sister White Dragon had nothing to do, so she also picked some dumplings from the air.","??????","A few minutes later...","Sixteen was hugging a pile of white dumplings, a confused look on her face.","Sister White Dragon was coiled around another pile of white dumplings, her expression also one of puzzlement.","“Where is this place?”","“What am I doing?”","“What are these white dumplings?”","“Why am I picking these white dumplings?”","The two found themselves filled with doubts.","Song Shuhang frowned and stood up. He thought for a while and guessed, “I suspect that these white balls are some kind of food.”","Scarlet Heaven Sword on his back asked worriedly, “Can they be eaten? What if they’re poisonous?”","Sister White Dragon and Sixteen also looked at the white dumplings worriedly.","Song Shuhang gritted his teeth and said, “We must be careful of unknown food. There are four of us here. How about... How about you let me test if they are poisonous? I will eat one first. Everyone can wait for a while and see if I get poisoned. If I eat it and I’m fine afterwards, then you guys can eat them as well.”","Sixteen said, “Okay.”","After she said that, she came to Song Shuhang’s side and motioned for him to take a dumpling from her arms.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and picked up a fist-sized dumpling.","Holding the dumpling, he sized it up and smelled it. Then, he raised his head and pinched the fruit, licking it lightly.","The white dumpling turned into liquid and deftly followed the VIP channel in Song Shuhang’s throat down into his stomach.","Song Shuhang: “...”","...","“I feel a strong sense of déjà vu.” Sixteen wrinkled her little nose.","Sister White Dragon nodded and said, “Me too.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword patted Song Shuhang with its hilt. “How is it? Do you feel anything? Does your stomach hurt?”","Song Shuhang said seriously, “It tastes delicious, but nothing else. Let’s wait a little longer. If I’m fine, it means that the white dumplings are edible.”","He then sat cross-legged and waited for the effect of the dumpling.","Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, and Scarlet Heaven Sword watched from the sidelines.","“Hmm, I seem to feel something.” Song Shuhang began to calmly analyze his state. “My body, from shoulders to chest, feels itchy.”","“Does that mean that the dumplings are poisonous?” Scarlet Heaven Sword exclaimed.","Song Shuhang said, “No, they do not look poisonous. This feeling is different from poisoning. This itchy feeling is pretty comfortable. I feel as if I’m being reborn.”","Sixteen said, “Are the dumplings edible? I feel a little hungry.”","Sister White Dragon waved her claws and said calmly, “Let’s wait for a while longer. It’s often after the itchy and comfortable sensation that the poison kicks in. The itching and pleasure might be illusions brought about by the flaring of the poison.”","...","And so, everyone began watching Song Shuhang again.","??????","Meanwhile, in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","Two days had passed since Song Shuhang and the others were drawn into the secret realm, and it was already November 29th in China.","Inside the secret realm left behind by Wielder of the Will White, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet silently guarded Song Shuhang and his wooden body.","Because the wooden body had no consciousness of its own, it was not affected by the time reversal.","In addition, within the past two days, the stone tablet also found the bodies of White Dragon and Sixteen and brought them under its protection.","The method by which it protected the bodies was simple and crude. It dug a large hole, created a sealed space within it, and stuffed Song Shuhang and the others into it.","Finally, it placed its body on top, forming a perfect defense.","A gravestone, a tree, and a treasure sword... A sense of loneliness pervaded the air.","“Huh? Shuhang’s aura has changed...” The stone tablet ‘looked’ into the tomb.","Song Shuhang’s physical body, which only had a head and shoulders left, began to grow rapidly.","In a few breaths, he had regrown his body until his chest.","Now, he finally had a chest that people could rely on.","At the same time, a drop of blood emerged from the wooden body.","Beneath this drop of blood was a net, and a seven-colored light came from it.","The drop of blood plunged into the grave and merged with Song Shuhang’s body."]},{"number":2138,"title":"Chapter 2138 A body like lustrous glass","paragraphs":["2138 A body like lustrous glass","After the Sage’s blood entered Song Shuhang’s body, the “valuable objects” stored inside it were returned to their original owner alongside the large amount of vitality it had recently accumulated.","The colorful light was ready, and the same was true for his cultivation organs; everything inside Song Shuhang’s body was connected seamlessly.","With that, Song Shuhang’s recovery speed doubled.","The ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? was activated automatically.","!!","123 holy ape projections appeared above Song Shuhang’s body. As he was inside a “grave” at this moment, when the projections emerged, they hovered above the grave.","Headed by the large holy ape, the remaining 122 holy apes arranged themselves in a rectangular formation.","A shrunken true dragon was wrapped around each holy ape, a genuine manifestation of the holy ape dragon power!","After the leading holy ape glanced at the gravestone with Shuhang’s name on it, its body recoiled in shock.","Song Shuhang’s Tombstone?","The 122 smaller holy apes also took a step backward, their expressions one of shock.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","Are they dancing?","The large holy ape managed to regain its composure after some time.","It stretched out its hands tremblingly and took out a scholarly scripture.","The projection of the true dragon wrapped around its body moved in front of it. The dragon lowered its head, and the horns became a stand.","The large holy ape solemnly placed the scholarly scripture on top of the true dragon’s head, and the 122 smaller holy apes followed suit.","Neatness had its own beauty.","Once something was done neatly, the entire display would look ceremonial.","The large holy ape clasped its hands together. Then, like an eminent monk, it recited, “An offering to the dead~”","The smaller holy apes in the back kept up with it. “An offering to the dead~”","Their majestic voice echoed over Song Shuhang’s grave.","Other than the desert, the gravestone, the old tree, and the broken sword... There were now 123 monk-like holy apes.","A sorrowful atmosphere permeated the area.","Just being in contact with this kind of atmosphere would stimulate one’s tear glands and make them cry.","This gave Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet the illusion that Song Shuhang was really dead.","??????","Although the holy apes looked unreliable, they were helping a lot.","After they appeared, they circulated the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? at full power, which automatically enhanced the regeneration speed of Shuhang’s body.","The large holy ape that led the group was especially helpful.","It was a gift from Senior White Two, and it contained his understanding of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","In the past, Song Shuhang’s realm was too low, and he hadn’t learned the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?. For this reason, the large holy ape secretly trained the smaller holy apes so that they could help Shuhang circulate the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? without problems.","But now, Song Shuhang’s understanding of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? was good enough, and he had even obtained the General Principles Inheritance Chapter. As such, the large holy ape slowly began to share Senior White Two’s knowledge about the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? with Song Shuhang.","Senior White Two had never learned the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, but he was the ruler of the Netherworld, and he had reached his own understanding of the follow-up chapter of the cultivation technique.","After the knowledge was passed on to Song Shuhang, it helped him greatly, and the recovery speed of his body increased again.","After the pectoral muscles, Shuhang’s spine fully took shape, and from there the rest of his body.","The Scholarly Sage’s blood traveled up and down his spine, strengthening the recovery effect along with his physical body.","The ?Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha? was activated, and it began working in conjunction with the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?.","The ?Steel Hands Technique? and the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? followed suit.","The various cultivation techniques that Song Shuhang had practiced began to activate on their own.","His innate skills were also unleashed one by one.","On the gravestone, white and black lotus flowers bloomed.","During this period of time, there was also the sound of murmurs. This was not the singing voices of the holy apes, but the effect of ?Ksitigarbha’s Soul Ferrying Scripture? and the ?Diary of the Ascetic Senior Monk?.","Next was the ?Three Thousand Sabers Scripture? that Song Shuhang learned from entering a dreamland, and the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? that he learned together with it.","After that came the fundamental volume of the ?Daoist Canon? from Cheng Lin’s speech.","All the knowledge that Song Shuhang had come in contact with had merged into the murmurs, becoming the voice of the Great Way.","At this time, if someone were to pass by the gravestone and listened to these murmurs, they would definitely receive significant benefits.","??????","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet sighed and said, “The setup for this resurrection is something else.”","No, wait. This isn’t a resurrection but merely the regrowth of a body!","Yet, it feels as if a natural treasure capable of changing heaven and earth is being born.","Fortunately, this is Wielder of the Will White’s secret realm, and there are no outsiders here. Otherwise, these phenomena would have attracted countless practitioners.","“Buzz~”","Song Shuhang’s body was growing well, and soon, even his waist had regrown. As his waist appeared, the seven-colored light returned to its place and let out a happy cry.","“Any further down and it will be a restricted zone,” said Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet gently. It mobilized the nearby sand, preparing to cover Song Shuhang when the time came.","...","While it was in thought, the virtuous lamia emerged from Song Shuhang’s body.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked in confusion, “Eh? Fairy, were you not involved in the time reversal?”","This virtuous fairy maiden has a mind of her own, and she’s different from the wooden body.","Why was she not affected by the magical technique?","The virtuous lamia shook her head slightly. Then, her wings expanded, enveloping Song Shuhang.","Fairy Creation also emerged from Song Shuhang’s body. She was similarly not taken away by the time technique.","After she appeared, she plucked the Scholarly Sage’s eye out of Shuhang’s eye socket.","However, she did not put Song Shuhang’s original eye back in. Song Shuhang’s body was regrowing, so she became curious and started to wonder if he would grow another eye.","After the appearance of the two fairies, Song Shuhang’s body received light of virtue from the virtuous lamia and scholarly energy from Fairy Creation. Coupled with the effect of the various body tempering techniques he practiced, his body began to change, starting to become transparent.","“A body like lustrous glass...” The stone tablet looked at Song Shuhang in surprise.","This was a characteristic that a physique would take on after a practitioner reached a certain level of body tempering.","...","This meant that Song Shuhang had reached a very high level in terms of physique.","“Still missing~ A little more~” sang Fairy Creation.","As the sound of her voice faded, Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit slowly emerged from his body."]},{"number":2139,"title":"Chapter 2139 Salted fish flips over","paragraphs":["2139 Salted fish flips over","The stone tablet said softly, “Little friend Song even has a ghost spirit...”","This guy’s equipment is too high-end.","The virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, the black-skinned Soft Feather, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword, and now even a ghost spirit that seemed to be a high-rank one.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet began to wonder what Song Shuhang really meant when he mentioned having faced off against “big shots.”","!!","It had a feeling that those big shots Shuhang provoked might not be as weak as it initially imagined.","It wanted to take Song Shuhang on a trip and harass some Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders once they left the Beast Realm.","But now, after seeing Song Shuhang’s equipment... As long as he made use of everything decently, he should be able to go against a relatively powerful big shot without much of a problem.","While Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was deep in thought, Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit began to strengthen his newborn body with the help of the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation.","Shuhang’s ghost spirit is quite strange. She seems to only be in the Sixth Stage Realm, but the methods she is using to cooperate with the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation are not ones that are available to True Monarchs!","The emergence of the ghost spirit filled the last gap, and Song Shuhang’s body became like lustrous glass.","“The sun has come out~ Rejoice~” Fairy Creation sang suddenly.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s attention was drawn to her.","Fairy Creation was kneeling on Song Shuhang’s chest, her hand pressed on the edge of his left eye socket. There, a brand new eyeball had grown out.","Fairy Creation’s experiment was a success.","This eye also seemed to be made of lustrous glass and reminded one of a beautiful gem.","After Fairy Creation finished singing, she giggled and caressed Song Shuhang’s left eye socket, plucking out the newly-grown eyeball.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","W-What is this fairy doing?","Song Shuhang used to have the Scholarly Sage’s eyes installed in his eye socket, so it was fine even if it was removed. But now that Song Shuhang regrew his own eye, why did you have to pluck it out?","Fairy Creation carefully put away Shuhang’s eyeball. She was preparing some spare eyes for Song Shuhang in case his eyes were damaged.","Whenever Song Shuhang overused the Scholarly Sage’s eye, the temperature in his eye sockets would rise sharply. If the Sage’s eye was removed and replaced with Song Shuhang’s original eye, the latter would be quickly ravaged by the remnant energy in the eye socket.","Song Shuhang’s original eye was once injured because of this, and this would always remain a possible danger.","Therefore, Fairy Creation planned to collect a few spare eyes for Song Shuhang by taking advantage of this opportunity.","??????","At this time, a series of knocks came from Song Shuhang’s abdominal area.","It was his ghost spirit.","She was squatting beside Song Shuhang with one hand pressed against his body, helping strengthen it. As for her other hand, she was using it to knock on Song Shuhang’s almost transparent abdomen.","A seven-colored light could be vaguely seen in that area along with Shuhang’s original dantian, which was protected by the Scholarly Sage’s blood.","The Sage’s blood was a foreign object, and it could not merge with Song Shuhang’s body. Similar to the Sage’s eyeball, it could leave Song Shuhang’s body at any time.","Its main job right now was to protect Song Shuhang’s cultivation organs. If Song Shuhang’s body were annihilated, it could save them and escape, minimizing the losses.","The original dantian of a cultivator was an abstract object, something that could not be seen with the naked eye. However, due to it having been wrapped by the Scholarly Sage’s blood, everyone could glimpse it through Song Shuhang’s transparent abdomen.","Song Shuhang’s original dantian looked unusually big.","Inside was a fat whale, whose belly was turned upward.","The stone tablet asked in confusion, “Huh? Is that a golden core?”","Song Shuhang is at the Sixth Stage Realm, so why is there still a golden core in his original dantian?","Unless he also has a patternless golden core...","Only a patternless golden core would not require a Golden Core Composition or a finishing touch. Even during the Sixth Stage Realm, one would not have to haggle with things like the Laketop Life Wheel, the Ten Heavenly Layers, or the Lotus Formation phase.","There was no need to worry about anything while going from the Fifth to the Seventh Stage except for devoting one’s mind to cultivating.","When they reached the Sixth Stage Realm, their golden core would spray out water and form a spirit lake.","Then, when they reached the Seventh Stage Realm, the golden core would sink and turn into seeds, which would eventually bloom into lotus flowers and form a nascent soul.","Therefore, only when the cultivator had a patternless golden core would they still have a golden core during the Sixth Stage Realm. For normal cultivators, once they ascended to the Sixth Stage from the Fifth Stage, their golden core would melt and form a spirit lake.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet murmured to itself, “However, that can’t be the case. Unless I’m blind, this golden core seems to have nine dragon patterns. Each of these nine dragon patterns is terrific, and they’re all real. It’s not a patternless golden core at all!”","At this time, a soft voice replied, “That’s because those patterns were painted on it.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet exclaimed, “What, painted on it?”","“Mm-hm, Senior Song said that his dragon patterns were drawn by that Senior White from the Netherworld.” The black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from Song Shuhang’s shadow, sitting next to Song Shuhang in a very ladylike manner.","For some reason, she was also unaffected by the time reversal.","“So, was his original golden core patternless?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet mused.","Could that be why this guy knew Black White even though he’s only a Sixth Stage cultivator?","Maybe he took a liking to Shuhang because he also had a patternless golden core.","Otherwise, why would someone as fearsome as the ruler of the Netherworld take special care of a little cultivator who is only at the Sixth Stage Realm?","The black-skinned Soft Feather shook her head and replied, “I heard from Senior Song that he had some dragon patterns when his golden core came to be. I seem to recall him saying that he had three...”","“Only three dragon patterns? So trash?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet looked Song Shuhang up and down. “Maybe there is something else to it. However, since he had some dragon patterns, his golden core wasn’t patternless. Well, that makes sense. Since ancient times, there has only been one person who had a patternless golden core, and that was my master. My master is a unique existence.”","“Senior,” the black-skinned Soft Feather smiled brightly and pointed to herself, “I also have a patternless golden core.”","The stone table felt as if its heart had been rent by a peerless swordsman. The cut was precise and ruthless!","...","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","Can’t we have a normal conversation?","“It feels as if Senior Song’s golden core is going to die.” The black-skinned Soft Feather changed the subject after she was done rending the stone tablet’s heart.","In Song Shuhang’s original dantian, the fat whale was like a goldfish that had eaten too much. It floated in the spirit lake with its belly pointing upward, and it looked in great pain.","“Did it eat something to end up this way?” asked the stone tablet. But as soon as it finished saying that, it scolded itself for being so silly.","Although it looks weird, this is still a golden core.","When was a golden core ever able to eat anything?"]},{"number":2140,"title":"Chapter 2140 Big-bellied fat whale","paragraphs":["2140 Big-bellied fat whale","Just when the stone tablet was mumbling to itself, inside Song Shuhang’s spirit lake, the fat whale slapped its tail against the surface of the lake, splashing water everywhere.","In the next moment, its figure was propelled upward. It then opened its mouth and bit at the air.","There seemed to be a small, whitish ball that was swallowed by the fat whale when it bit down.","After swallowing the white object, the fat whale’s belly became even bigger.","As its body lost momentum, it fell back into the spirit lake with a splash.","Then, the silly whale continued to float in the spirit lake with its belly pointing upward, seemingly in great pain.","It wasn’t in this position because it wanted to.","The reason was the buoyancy of the item it swallowed into its stomach, which made it exceedingly difficult for the fat whale to flip back over.","As such, it could only float with its belly pointing upward like a salted whale.","In a way, it was similar to how creatures with large breasts could float in the water more easily.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","Did you have to slap me in the face so quickly? My face is going to be all swollen at this pace, okay?","Is this fat whale really a golden core?","Why can a golden core jump up and swallow things?","What kind of golden core is this? What are the principles behind it?","This does not make any sense at all!","Could I be dreaming?","Wait, can I even dream? I’m just a stone tablet!","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s imagination began running so wild that it could easily come up with a 24-episode series if it wanted to.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said curiously, “It looks like it’s full to the point of bursting. What was the white ball that it swallowed just now?”","“I didn’t see it clearly and didn’t even notice when it appeared. It materialized in Song Shuhang’s original dantian out of thin air...” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s “face” was full of bewilderment.","“No matter what it was, the fat whale ate too much of it and can’t digest it,” said the black-skinned Soft Feather while looking at the virtuous lamia.","The virtuous lamia said confidently, “It’s time to show everyone what real skills are!”","The wings on her back were firmly protecting Song Shuhang’s lower body while her soft and boneless waist began to twist.","She glided until she was in front of Song Shuhang and stretched out her hands, pressing them on his abdomen.","Fairy Creation looked at her with envy because she could not learn this unique skill of the virtuous lamia.","Under the disbelieving gaze of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Fairy Virtue’s hand passed through Song Shuhang’s abdomen, straight into his original dantian.","“Is this even possible?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt that its worldview had been greatly impacted.","Little friend Song Shuhang’s body has too many weird things about it!","However, what took place this time made some sense in theory.","The light of virtue was a part of Song Shuhang, so there was nothing wrong with its manifestation being able to reach into his original dantian.","However, what happened next made Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet feel anxious again.","The virtuous lamia’s hand grabbed the fat whale mercilessly.","The eyes of the fat whale revealed a look of despair. This time, it was so full from what it had just eaten that it was unable to dodge at all.","In the past, it would manage to slip away a few times before getting caught by the virtuous lamia. Even though it was always defeated in the end, it would put up an honorable fight.","But this time, it got caught right away.","Food was indeed the biggest enemy of the strong.","The virtuous lamia held the tail of the fat whale with one hand and gently squeezed the lower part of its belly with the other hand.","She looked very familiar with this set of actions, and this level of proficiency was not something that could be achieved from having performed the action only once or twice.","The fat whale opened its mouth wide in pain, and a huge white ball was forcefully squeezed out of its mouth.","Apparently, there was only one dumpling, and it was much larger than what the fat whale originally swallowed.","The black-skinned Soft Feather guessed, “Could it be that all the white balls swallowed by the fat whale fused into one while in its stomach?”","Fairy Creation nodded in agreement.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “By the way, what is this white dumpling?”","After the white dumpling was squeezed out, the fat whale felt like a stingy merchant who was suddenly deprived of all its gold coins. It lost all hope.","The virtuous lamia tried to reach out and touch the white dumpling.","She was the manifestation of Shuhang’s light of virtue, so even if she was destroyed, she could recover in a short while. As such, she took it upon herself to check this unknown, and potentially dangerous, object.","When the virtuous lamia’s fingers touched the white dumpling, she felt as if she had been electrocuted.","Her body began shaking violently, and her wings almost unfurled and stopped protecting Song Shuhang’s lower body.","Fortunately, she quickly regained control of her body and protected Song Shuhang’s last bit of honor.","The virtuous lamia let out a long breath.","The moment she touched the white ball, her consciousness was almost pulled into the vortex of time.","“The power of time...” the virtuous lamia said slowly in her own voice.","The main reason was that she could not find a suitable sentence in her database, so she was forced to use her own voice.","...","But even then, she did not want to use too many words and tried to say as little as possible.","“The power of time?” The black-skinned Soft Feather thought for a while and said, “Could this be related to the time technique that Senior Song is experiencing?”","The small dumpling that embodied the power of time floated above Song Shuhang’s spirit lake, but the fat whale did not try to eat it this time.","This was a principle of the fat whale. As long as it had swallowed something once, it would not swallow it a second time.","Especially things that were forcibly squeezed out of its body, it would no longer pay attention to them. This seemed to be related to its dignity.","“These white dumplings won’t cause harm to Senior Song’s body, right?” the black-skinned Soft Feather asked with some concern.","The stone tablet replied, “Probably not. On the contrary, I feel that it’s strengthening Song Shuhang’s new body.”","While they were talking, another dumpling emerged inside Song Shuhang’s original dantian.","The newborn dumpling was about ten times smaller than the one that was squeezed out of the fat whale’s belly earlier.","The fat whale leaped up gracefully and swallowed the small dumpling into its stomach.","The virtuous lamia’s hand was still in Song Shuhang’s dantian.","...","She unceremoniously grabbed the fat whale and squeezed hard, squeezing out the small dumpling it had just swallowed. This object could not be digested, so if the fat whale swallowed it, she had to squeeze it out.","And so...","After the big dumpling, the fat whale swallowed seven smaller dumplings, which were squeezed out one by one by the virtuous lamia.","With that, there were now eight white dumplings floating over the spirit lake, one big and seven small.","Coincidentally, Song Shuhang also had a big dantian and seven smaller dantians.","Afterward, the fat whale finally calmed down.","At the same time, the black-skinned Soft Feather sensed fluctuations of the power of time come from Sixteen’s body next to her."]},{"number":2141,"title":"Chapter 2141 Eyes opened!","paragraphs":["2141 Eyes opened!","The black-skinned Soft Feather concluded, “It seems like it’s really related to what Senior Song and the others are experiencing during the time reversal.”","This small dumpling that appeared in the bodies of Song Shuhang and Sixteen was of great benefit to the two of them according to the stone tablet.","The black-skinned Soft Feather continued, “I envy them so much.”","It was a pity that her main body was not here. Otherwise, her consciousness could have also joined Senior Song in experiencing the time technique and unveiling the mysteries of the past.","!!","The number of small dumplings that appeared in Sixteen’s body was not that high. There were only three.","At the same time, another change took place in the dantian of Song Shuhang’s main body.","As the eight dumplings, one big and seven small, floated above the spirit lake, the fat whale became angry for some reason.","It rushed out of the lake again and slapped the white dumplings with its tail.","“Petals pelt the earth, do what we may. Swallows greet me like a memory~” The virtuous lamia recited a line from a poem.","The black-skinned Soft Feather subconsciously continued the poem. “Lonely, still, I walk along the flowers~”","No wait, that was probably not what the virtuous lamia meant.","She thought about it carefully and guessed, “Could Fairy Virtue be trying to say that this scene looks familiar?”","The black-skinned Soft Feather was an inner demon, and she was good at reading people’s minds.","Following the violent actions of the fat whale, the seven small dumplings were sent flying away. They disappeared into the channel that connected Shuhang’s original spirit lake and his seven small dantians.","Because of its large size, the big dumpling stayed in the original dantian even after the attack of the fat whale and wasn’t ejected.","The seven small dumplings entered Song Shuhang’s seven small dantians, with one small dumpling coming to a stop in each of the small dantians.","The final arrangement was neat and pleasing to the eye.","After the little dumplings found their place in Shuhang’s body, they began influencing the nascent souls that were about to be born.","At the same time, Song Shuhang’s feet finished regrowing.","As a result, the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?, the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, the ?Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha?, the ?Variant Steel Hands Technique?, and everything else contributing to his regrowth exited overclock mode and entered normal mode.","A new Song Shuhang was born; even the Heavenly Punishment had failed to destroy him completely.","As his body was restored, the hidden dangers that came to be after Demon Emperor Hezhi’s energy transfer were eliminated.","The General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? was extremely mysterious. While recreating Shuhang’s physical body, it fixed everything that was wrong with it.","The aftereffects of the fat ball’s blood sacrifice were likewise eliminated.","Only a final bit of the curse’s power was still struggling to bring him harm.","It condensed into a dot of energy and emerged from Song Shuhang’s head. Then, it turned into a shrimp-like creature and attacked Song Shuhang’s new body.","Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit stretched out her hand and grabbed the curse, rubbing it into a ball.","Then, under the shocked gaze of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, she swallowed it in one go and licked her lips in satisfaction.","If it were the curse at the height of its power, she would’ve only been able to nibble at it little by little. But now that it had lost most of its power, she could swallow it in one go without problems.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet wondered, “Why does his ghost spirit have the ability to swallow curses?”","“Maybe it underwent some kind of mutation.” The black-skinned Soft Feather recalled, “I remember that Senior Song’s last ghost spirit... No, it should be his last-last ghost spirit. I can’t even remember anymore. Anyway, at that time, Senior Song’s ghost spirit also had the ability to swallow curses.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","It sounds like Song Shuhang has had more than one ghost spirit.","Ghost spirits, especially high-rank ones, were pretty rare; they weren’t something common like cabbages.","While low- and mid-rank ghost spirits were nothing to big shots, high-rank ones could be tempting. Even if they couldn’t have them for themselves, they could keep them for their disciples or juniors.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt that it had discovered something common between Song Shuhang and its master. Was it possible that both had a great talent for treasure hunting, the kind that would allow them to find a spirit stone mine whenever they went out for a stroll?","If so, little friend Song should be very rich, and he might even have several spirit stone mines at home.","It felt that this was a good thing as many of its VIP functions could only be activated after consuming a lot of spirit stones. After all, its master, Wielder of the Will White, was someone who had never lacked money, and having money was also a kind of superpower.","If Shuhang doesn’t have any spirit stone mines at home, he won’t be able to use my VIP functions.","But if he does... With my VIP functions activated, there would be no problem even if we fought Immortals head-on!","When it thought of this, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet began to feel happy.","At this moment, the voice of Pavilion Master Chu sounded, “Eh? Has Shuhang’s body finally regrown?”","Her strand of hair protruded from the top of Song Shuhang’s head.","Pavilion Master Chu’s main body was in the Inner World, and what remained in this strand of hair was only a figment of her consciousness. As such, her consciousness was not involved in the time technique.","Nonetheless, the magical technique disturbed the connection with her main body, and only after Song Shuhang’s physical body fully recovered did her main consciousness reconnect with her strand of hair.","The black-skinned Soft Feather explained, “Yes, Senior Chu. Senior Song’s efforts were not in vain. He succeeded in using the General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? to restore his physical body.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stretched and sized Song Shuhang up. “Oh, his whole body has become transparent. A body like lustrous glass... This kid has actually achieved this state. This state is something that even real Eighth Stage Profound Sages have trouble achieving.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “Has Senior Song’s physique reached the Eighth Stage?”","Pavilion Master Chu replied, “It’s hard to say. This lustrous body is a kind of body tempering state. However, now that he has learned the General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, it is not surprising that his physical prowess has touched the Eighth Stage.”","Now, Song Shuhang could easily transcend a non-mutated Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation with his physical strength alone and bully it while he was at it.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “Moreover, this lustrous body has another benefit.”","Everyone pricked up their ears and listened to Pavilion Master Chu’s explanation.","Pavilion Master Chu laughed and said, “With this lustrous body, he won’t need to take CT, X-ray, and so on when he goes to the hospital. As long as he properly controls the level of transparency of his body, he won’t even need to go to the orthopedics department.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","...","“According to Senior Chu’s train of thought, if Senior Song were a girl, it would be possible to see what her child would look like when she is pregnant, right?” The black-skinned Soft Feather covered her mouth and chuckled.","After she finished speaking, she looked at the nascent souls in Song Shuhang’s body.","She saw that inside Song Shuhang’s first small dantian, the nascent soul slowly opened its eyes."]},{"number":2142,"title":"Chapter 2142 Are they about to be born?","paragraphs":["2142 Are they about to be born?","The black-skinned Soft Feather turned her head around. As an inner demon, she instinctively avoided the gaze of the nascent soul.","A nascent soul would be born when a practitioner ascended from the Sixth to the Seventh Stage.","Under normal circumstances, a practitioner’s nascent soul would open its eyes twice during its existence. The first time was when the practitioner reached the peak of the Sixth Stage Realm and triggered the heavenly tribulation.","Once the nascent soul opened its eyes, the heavenly tribulation would strike down.","!!","Then, if the practitioner successfully transcended their tribulation, the nascent soul would close its eyes again and enter a state of energy accumulation.","It would not open its eyes again until the practitioner reached the peak of the Seventh Stage Realm and entered the Heavenly Tribulation Realm. The nascent soul would then burst out with all its accumulated energy, advancing to a higher realm and starting the next round of evolution.","The gaze of the nascent soul when it opened its eyes had the power to destroy all kinds of evils. That was why Soft Feather’s inner demon felt uncomfortable.","Golden Core – Spirit Lake – Nascent Soul, these three realms were part of a cycle.","It was similar to Song Shuhang’s evolutionary cycle that consisted of [little bug that is difficult to pinch to death – big sleeping bug that everyone loves – mammal that is difficult to crush to death].","Anyway, once a practitioner entered the Eighth Stage, they would enter a new evolutionary cycle. That was why they were so special compared to Seventh Stage Venerables and could show their divinity and hold a Profound Sage Speech.","The black-skinned Soft Feather moved to the side and said, “Something bad happened. The nascent soul in Senior Song’s belly has opened its eyes.”","If a nascent soul opened its eyes, it meant that the heavenly tribulation was coming.","Even if this nascent soul was one of the many in Song Shuhang’s small dantians, it was still a genuine nascent soul.","“How could they open their eyes at this time?!” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair hastily turned around.","Song Shuhang was under the effect of the time technique, and his consciousness was not in his body. How was he to transcend his heavenly tribulation?","Moreover, if the heavenly tribulation came at this time, it might interfere with the time technique, causing the magical technique to backfire. The backlash from a magical technique that had been arranged by a Wielder of the Will could definitely kill Song Shuhang.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said in a deep voice, “There is no need to worry. We are in a secret realm left behind by my master. Even if his heavenly tribulation is drawn over, it’ll take some time before it reaches us.”","Moreover, from what it could remember, if the heavenly tribulation was too powerful, it could scatter it, giving Song Shuhang more time to prepare.","In the past, when practitioners transcended the heavenly tribulation, they would be guarded by their elders or seniors. In addition to protecting the practitioner from external interferences, these guardians could also take action to scatter the heavenly tribulation at critical times.","Therefore, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was very calm as it continued, “I will keep an eye on the heavenly tribulation in the outside world. You guys pay attention to little friend Song’s status.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “By the way, why did Senior Song suddenly advance?”","“I suspect it’s related to the white balls that the fat whale swallowed earlier.” The stone tablet thought for a while and then said, “Fairy Soft Feather, please pay attention to the state of the little girl from the Su family next to me. I’ve got a bad feeling about this whole thing.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Senior Chu, come here.”","Her body was that of an inner demon. If Sixteen were to advance, it would be inconvenient for her to make contact with her as that may draw out the inner demons in Sixteen’s heart and create trouble for her as she transcended her tribulation.","The black-skinned Soft Feather was not only very understanding but also kind.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair extended and got under Sixteen’s clothes, touching her belly.","Perhaps because Pavilion Master Chu’s hair was a little cold, Sixteen’s body twitched slightly when it touched her.","“Her nine immortal bones have been perfectly integrated into the illusory core. At the same time, there are a series of energies, such as the light of virtue, the power from the blessing of her clan, and dragon power that are buffing her illusory core and assisting her in condensing a golden core. They will also help her in condensing more dragon patterns.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair assessed Sixteen’s situation.","As the stone tablet had guessed, Sixteen was also about to transcend her tribulation.","In her dantian, there were three small white balls floating up and down, releasing the power of time and an aura of “luck.”","Things like luck were not noticeable under normal circumstances, but the aura of some things was often associated with luck.","One such example was dragon veins.","And at this moment, an aura similar to those of a dragon vein was being released from the small dumplings in Sixteen’s dantian.","With these three small dumplings, when Sixteen condensed her golden core, the number of her dragon patterns would likely approach the upper limit.","For example, with Sixteen’s strength, the number of dragon patterns that she could condense was probably either 8 or 9. But now, with the blessing of the white dumplings, the number of dragon patterns would be maximized, allowing her to condense nine dragon patterns.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “These white dumplings are incredible.”","I wonder what their origins are and how they were formed.","If I can retrieve some, I would definitely be able to sell them for a lot of money in the world of cultivation.","However, it’s not like I’m short of money. Pavilion Master Chu chuckled and stopped thinking about it.","“In other words, Sixteen is going to transcend the tribulation too...” The black-skinned Soft Feather rubbed her temples and looked at Song Shuhang.","Can Senior Song really never go through a normal heavenly tribulation?","“Your tears~ Sadness among your gentleness~” Fairy Creation hummed a little tune and reached out to stroke Song Shuhang’s left eye socket.","Then, another jewel-like eye was plucked out.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet shouted hastily, “Wait! Little friend Song is no longer regrowing his body parts. If you pluck out his eyes now, they won’t grow back in time.”","Fairy Creation had become extremely proficient in taking out eyes, and she was kind of addicted to it.","Fairy Creation grinned and stretched out her hand to put the Scholarly Sage’s eye back inside Shuhang’s eye socket. It was common sense to equip the best items when you were going to transcend the heavenly tribulation.","This was their daily routine now, and only a newcomer like Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet did not know about it.","After installing the Sage’s eye in Song Shuhang’s eye socket, Fairy Creation pointed at his abdomen.","The second nascent soul slowly opened its eyes.","This gave rise to a chain reaction, and the other little nascent souls opened their eyes as well.","The nascent souls were wrapped in a large “cocoon” formed by the water of the spirit lake, and they looked at the world curiously after opening their eyes.","They then stretched out their arms and started swimming around in their cocoons.","The seven little nascent souls looked like real babies.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had never seen such lively nascent souls during the course of its life.","...","After swimming around for a while, they stopped moving and leaned against the walls of the cocoons.","They did not intend to come out yet.","“So cute.” The black-skinned Soft Feather carefully avoided the eyes of the nascent souls, observing them from the side. “Are they about to be born?”","“It would become a thriller if that were the case,” Pavilion Master Chu said.","As soon as Pavilion Master Chu finished speaking, a scene straight from a thriller ensued.","The umbilical cords of the seven nascent souls pierced through their respective cocoons and stretched out..."]},{"number":2143,"title":"Chapter 2143 It finally looks like a proper golden core","paragraphs":["2143 It finally looks like a proper golden core","This was another difference between Song Shuhang’s nascent souls and the nascent souls of ordinary cultivators—Shuhang’s nascent souls had umbilical cords, the kind that was used to absorb nutrients from the mother’s body.","While it was normal for a baby to have an umbilical cord, whatever was happening in Song Shuhang’s belly seemed to be a scene straight out of a thriller movie.","The tentacle-like umbilical cords moved along the pathways that led from the small dantians to the original dantian.","Pavilion Master Chu froze.","Song Shuhang, this boy, really just wants to slap me in the face, doesn’t he?","She would remember this grudge.","When Song Shuhang woke up, she would exact her vengeance and make him pay for giving her the nicknames “Hair Sword” and “Beautiful Forehead.”","She would let Song Shuhang experience death by suffocation and teach him how to respect his seniors!","??????","“Senior Chu, do women go through similar steps when giving birth?” the black-skinned Soft Feather asked while glancing sideways at the nascent souls.","Pavilion Master Chu replied, “I don’t know. I’ve never given birth.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather nodded silently. As she thought, Senior Chu hadn’t ever had a daoist partner. She noted this down, feeling that it might come in handy in the future for heart-rending purposes.","“The umbilical cords are heading to his original dantian,” said Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, feeling that this scene was really odd.","Little friend Song is too special. He is not taking the standard path at all.","Inside Song Shuhang’s original dantian, the fat whale, which had been pretty irascible until a moment ago, seemed to have calmed down considerably.","It floated on the surface of the spirit lake while the big dumpling hovered above its head aimlessly.","Then, like a wig, it landed on the whale’s head, blocking its blowhole.","The fat whale was angered again.","It leaped high up and shook its head, sending the dumpling flying away. Then, it used its tail and hit it eighteen times in a row.","After slapping the dumpling around, the fat whale fell back into the lake.","The big dumpling floated about and landed on its head again. During the process, it adjusted its position, deliberately blocking the blowhole of the fat whale.","This same scene took place several times.","Finally, the fat whale could no longer be bothered to continue. It floated on the lake’s surface and let the big dumpling build a nest on top of its head. It didn’t need to use its blowhole, so it wasn’t that much of a problem.","Just as the fat whale admitted defeat, the seven umbilical cords arrived in the original dantian.","Unlike Song Shuhang’s lotus roots, these seven umbilical cords really reminded one of tentacles.","When the umbilical cords spotted the fat whale, they all rushed over with joy, just like children seeing their mother.","The fat whale was taken aback after seeing the umbilical cords. Then, it lost its temper again.","It leaped fiercely and slapped them with its tail.","But when it did so, its tail became and the umbilical cords fused together.","The scene looked quite amusing, with the fat whale now having seven umbilical cords extending from its tail.","The virtuous lamia recited a poem with a tone of despair, “When the sun goes down, the heartbroken man is at the horizon~”","This tone of despair perfectly encapsulated the mood of the fat whale.","“What is going on?” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair turned back, staring at the scene in Song Shuhang’s transparent belly.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet speculated, “Could it be that the seven little nascent souls don’t have enough energy and need to absorb more nutrients from the original dantian?”","“No, their energy should be enough.” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair swayed from side to side.","Song Shuhang’s nascent souls had enough energy thanks to Demon Emperor Hezhi’s gift. Pavilion Master Chu could sense that these seven nascent souls could break out of their shells at any time, allowing Song Shuhang to step into the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm.","However, they did not do so.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet guessed, “If it’s not to extract energy from the original dantian, could they be trying to feed energy back to the main golden core?”","“Fairy @#%×, what do you think?” Pavilion Master Chu looked at the virtuous lamia.","The virtuous lamia reached into Song Shuhang’s dantian, gently touching the seven small umbilical cords and nodding.","Pure energy was being transferred to the fat whale golden core from the seven nascent souls","Song Shuhang’s golden core started to expand as if someone was blowing air into it.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “If Shuhang’s golden core is the same as a patternless golden core, it should melt and sink to the bottom of the lake. Afterwards, it should turn into a seed, produce a lotus flower, and birth a nascent soul.”","At present, it seemed that Song Shuhang’s fat whale golden core had many similarities with a patternless golden core, so was it also going to plunge into the lake and produce a lotus flower?","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “If this continues, Senior Song will have to transcend his tribulation soon. Not only are his little dantians triggering the heavenly tribulation, but his original golden core is doing so as well.”","“Correct.” Pavilion Master Chu’s hair nodded.","The black-skinned Soft Feather rested her chin on her palm and looked at Song Shuhang.","It hasn’t even been that long, yet it’s time for him to transcend his tribulation again...","The gap in strength between her main body and Shuhang was going to increase once again.","“It feels like Senior Song transcended his tribulation just yesterday,” said the black-skinned Soft Feather emotionally. After mentioning the heavenly tribulation, she remembered the Braised Heavenly Tribulation. “The Braised Heavenly Tribulation tasted so good. I miss its texture and taste.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was puzzled.","Braised Heavenly Tribulation?","During the time I was carrying out my mission in Garre Holy Mountain, just what exactly happened in the outside world?","Pavilion Master Chu said suddenly, “Here it comes.”","...","In Song Shuhang’s original dantian, the fat whale was looking more and more like a golden core.","It inflated until it started looking like a round ball.","This was what a golden core should look like. If wasn’t round, then was it even a golden core?","The fat whale soon reached its limit. If it was inflated any further, it would explode.","After reaching its limit, the fat whale underwent a mutation.","A huge black lotus bloomed under its belly","“It didn’t turn into a seed,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said.","It seems that this golden core is different from a patternless golden core.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Why does it remind me of Senior Song’s ‘lotus blooming steps’ ability?”","The black lotus propped up the fat whale.","At the same time, the Star Road on the fat whale’s body lit up.","...","The silhouettes of the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group appeared in quick succession. Soon after followed the figures of the seniors that had a close relationship with Song Shuhang.","The road felt like it was coming alive.","“What is this? A golden core composition?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was taken aback.","It did not know if it was an illusion, but it could sense the aura of a “path” coming from the Star Road."]},{"number":2144,"title":"Chapter 2144 So it’s not a path, just the aura of the big shots","paragraphs":["2144 So it’s not a path, just the aura of the big shots","The aura of this path was very faint, so the stone tablet could not reach a definite conclusion.","“If this Star Road really does have the aura of a path, doesn’t that mean that it has infinite potential?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet murmured.","And a person’s potential represented their future.","Still, what aspect of the Way does this Star Road touch upon?","!!","The stone tablet observed it carefully but could not find a clue. There was too little information to draw any conclusions.","The light of virtue behind Song Shuhang seemed to carry a complete path to immortality.","However, Fairy @#%× seemed to have no intention of stepping on this path. She did not intend to use this “Virtuous Immortal Path.”","Additionally, her current state was quite weird. She was the materialization of Song Shuhang’s power of virtue, yet maintained an existence separate from Song Shuhang. That begged the question, if she were to step out onto the path of virtue, would she become a different entity, or would she still be part of Song Shuhang?","After looking at the virtuous lamia, the stone tablet looked at the scholarly fairy that communicated through songs. She was also hiding a path to immortality, and there was more than one.","Afterward, it looked at the strand of hair on top of Song Shuhang’s head, whose existence it had almost forgotten. This was the hair of an Immortal, and one of the strongest weapons on Song Shuhang’s body.","In the end, it looked at the black-skinned Soft Feather and breathed a sigh of relief. This inner demon fairy maiden was a lot more normal compared to the others. Although she had a patternless golden core, she was currently the most normal one among the people around Song Shuhang.","The black-skinned Soft Feather seemed to sense Senior Stone Tablet’s gaze. She smiled slightly at it.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet nodded to itself.","The most normal one was an inner demon clone. This made it feel a pang of sadness.","??????","Inside Song Shuhang’s original dantian.","The round fat whale was supported by a black lotus, and seven umbilical cords were connected to its tail.","The power of the seven little nascent souls combined with the power of the fat whale, activating the QR code group.","In the network.","The ports of the main world and the Netherworld Realm were connected.","The virtuous core and cosmic demon core worked as the managers of the friend list and the blacklist.","The technological core carried out the necessary calculations.","As for the whale core, it worked as the main server.","A framework was taking shape.","The stone tablet asked expectantly, “Is a nascent soul going to be born?”","Even though this isn’t the way by which the patternless golden core births a nascent soul, this is not the way normal golden cores birth nascent souls either. I wonder how Song Shuhang’s nascent soul will look.","The final change began to take place.","Everyone stared at Song Shuhang’s original dantian without blinking.","At this time, the fat whale was no longer fooling around. It had entered “serious mode.”","Its mouth opened and closed, as if it was saying something.","The black-skinned Soft Feather guessed, “The next step should be for it to suck the water of the spirit lake, right?”","She could not bear to look at the round fat whale anymore. If it were to absorb water from the spirit lake, it would explode, wouldn’t it?","Pavilion Master Chu suddenly said, “It seems to be... talking?”","“Impossible, how could a golden core possibly...” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said subconsciously, but its words got stuck in its throat as it was speaking.","This golden core can eat, vomit things, and it can even have children, so why would it not be able to talk?","In order to prevent itself from being slapped in the face by Song Shuhang’s golden core again, it quickly shut its mouth.","As long as I don’t speak and keep silent, my face won’t get slapped!","At this time, the ghost spirit who had been silent all this time suddenly said, “Cultivation.”","Her eyes were dull, like a translator without a soul.","“Cultivation?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked in puzzlement, “Is this what the fat whale is saying?”","“Cultivation,” said the ghost spirit again as if replying to the stone tablet.","“What do you mean?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet sighed, wishing to use the mind-reading technique on the ghost spirit.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “It should be the name of the QR Code Golden Core Composition.”","When it was time for Song Shuhang to select a name for his QR code group chat, the name he ended up settling on was the very simple but meaningful “Cultivation.”","“Cultivation? Is that the name of the chat group you can access through the QR code?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt very tired when it thought of this. It could not add Song Shuhang as a friend and could only receive messages through Netherworld Black White.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “It seems that the fat whale also acknowledged this name.”","This should be a step in the evolution of Senior Song’s golden core.","The fat whale gently burped.","Then, a cracking sound could be heard from its body.","It seemed that Song Shuhang’s nascent soul was going to jump out of the fat whale directly and would not be “birthed.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Huh? Isn’t it going to give birth?”","If the fat whale were to crack open, wouldn’t it die?","The virtuous lamia stretched out her hand to squeeze the fat whale but stopped halfway.","The way Song Shuhang’s nascent soul was coming into the world was different from that of ordinary cultivators, and there was no precedent.","...","What if she ended up ruining the evolution process if she tried to squeeze the whale at this time?","So, unless there was something wrong with Song Shuhang’s ascension process, she would stand back and let nature take its course.","The virtuous lamia was very calm and reliable at critical moments.","Cracks continued to appear on the fat whale’s body.","Even the Star Road began to break down.","“Buzz~”","Just as the Star Road began to shatter, several of the figures on it flickered violently.","Then, a little bit of energy was transmitted to Shuhang remotely.","Energy from the Heavenly Emperor.","Energy from Fairy Cheng Lin.","Energy from Little Stripey.","...","Then came the energy of the Almighty Merchant, Lady Kunna, and Pavilion Master Chu Two.","These big shots sensed something and sent a drop of energy over to see what was happening to Song Shuhang.","Even Senior White Two was alarmed.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","So, this is what it was.","This is the aura of the “path” I previously sensed on the Star Road.","It turns out that these auras aren’t from the Star Road itself but belong to the big shots represented on it.","In just a moment, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet sensed the auras of more than five Immortals.","No wonder I couldn’t make out the path of little friend Song’s Star Road. It turns out that it is not his path at all; it’s just the aura of the Immortals depicted on the road, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet thought to itself.","No wonder the aura of the paths was so faint.","Actually, wait a moment...","There are more than five Immortal-level auras, and the number is still increasing.","Moreover, every Immortal seems to be quite close with little friend Song, close enough to transmit him their energy directly.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt a chill run through its body.","After much pondering, it concluded that it would keep a low profile after returning to the main world!"]},{"number":2145,"title":"Chapter 2145 I hope Fellow Daoist’s auspicious words can come true","paragraphs":["2145 I hope Fellow Daoist’s auspicious words can come true","Pavilion Master Chu said, “So many auras flashed by just now. It seems that the shattering of the Star Road has alerted numerous people.”","Even “Chu Two,” who was in a gap between the Netherworld Realm and the main world, had been alerted.","The black-skinned Soft Feather furrowed her brows and said, “Now that the Star Road has shattered, can it be restored? I feel that it’s something very important.”","This was her intuition at work. When the Star Road shattered, every figure on it also began to crack.","The black-skinned Soft Feather felt very disturbed when she saw the scene, especially since her main body was right in the front section.","Pavilion Master Chu explained, “Don’t worry. The nascent soul breaking out of the fat whale is a sort of metamorphosis. Later, the Star Road will definitely be transferred to Shuhang’s nascent soul, so there’s nothing to worry about.”","Inside Shuhang’s original dantian, the fat whale’s body suddenly began to recover.","It might be because the big shots had been alerted and remotely transmitted some of their energy. Anyway, under the action of these energies, the originally shattered fat whale healed up.","The fat whale slowly raised its head, looking at the white dumpling in the sky.","Although it was not making any sound, its actions clearly expressed a feeling of despair.","This kind of despair could be felt with the naked eye.","Pavilion Master Chu explained, “It’s as if halfway through giving birth, the baby’s head came out but a group of enthusiastic doctors insisted on stuffing the baby back because they were worried that the mother was bleeding too much.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “I think it’s more like the fat whale was going through a cesarean section... An incision had already been made, and the baby was already being taken out, but then it was suddenly stuffed back in, and the incision was sewn up. Along with that, a healing technique was even used to completely remove any scarring.”","The fat whale was truly pitiful.","The virtuous lamia fell into thought. She was considering whether or not to draw the word “miserable” on the body of the fat whale.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt that it could not get into this topic, and complained, “Unfortunately, I’m just a stone tablet, and I can’t understand the feeling of having a baby.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather glanced at Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet upon hearing this.","She did not speak, but her eyes seemed to carry a deep meaning.","The stone tablet got goosebumps when it sensed the black-skinned Soft Feather staring at it in such a way.","It asked, “What’s wrong? Is there something on my face?”","“It’s nothing, Senior. I was just thinking about something.” The black-skinned Soft Feather smiled warmly. Despite being an inner demon, her smile was very heart-warming.","After she returned to the main world, she would trick Senior Stone Tablet to accept Senior Song’s Demon Sage Speech.","I wonder what effect the Impregnating Gaze would have on the consciousness of a magical treasure.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","Inside Song Shuhang’s original dantian, the fat whale jumped up again.","Its spherical body was bouncing vigorously on the black lotus, seemingly making preparations for what would follow.","This time, it would complete its transformation in one go, from a fat whale to a fat baby!","Its body shattered again, but this time, the fat whale’s control was impeccable.","It tried to keep the Star Road intact and made a cut on its back. With the blowhole as the dividing line, it split itself into two halves.","In this way, it would not be disturbed by the big shots remotely transferring their energy during its transformation.","“Crack~”","The whale core’s back split open, and a human-shaped figure made of light slowly emerged from the cut.","The black-skinned Soft Feather giggled and said, “Here it is, the nascent soul!”","Moreover, this wondrous and radiant nascent soul did not make her feel repulsed.","This small radiant figure tried hard to get out of the fat whale’s body.","When it drilled out, the Star Road and the nine dragon patterns on the fat whale’s body were transferred to the nascent soul.","The nascent soul had taken shape.","“Now, Senior Song can be renamed to Venerable Song in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.” The black-skinned Soft Feather covered her mouth and chuckled.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said seriously, “Don’t get ahead of yourself. He still has a heavenly tribulation to transcend.”","It was pretty worried at the moment.","Seven small nascent souls and one big, strange nascent soul!","Not to even mention their quality, their quantity alone is already shocking... Is little friend Song alone equivalent to eight separate practitioners ascending to the Venerable Realm?","If so, how powerful will his heavenly tribulation be?","Eight heavenly tribulations of the Seventh Stage... Perhaps this isn’t too far from the might of an Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “Has little friend Song prepared a tribulation-transcending formation? I estimate that the strength of his heavenly tribulation may reach the Eighth Stage. If he does not have a tribulation-transcending formation, he might have some trouble facing this heavenly tribulation.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather smiled and said, “Senior Song seemed to have prepared a tribulation-transcending formation in the past, but he didn’t get to use it in the end.”","Pavilion Master Chu let out a long sigh and said, “If its might is merely close to the Eighth Stage, then there should not be any problem.”","If, as estimated by Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, the might of the heavenly tribulation was only at the peak of the Seventh Stage or close to the Eighth Stage, then with Song Shuhang’s current strength, there was basically no need to worry.","Pavilion Master Chu said slowly, “I hope that Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s auspicious words will come true.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “???”","Auspicious words?","I just said that the strength of his heavenly tribulation might be close to the Eighth Stage! How is that auspicious at all?!","“Has Senior Song’s nascent soul still not opened its eyes?” The voice of the black-skinned Soft Feather diverted the stone tablet’s attention.","In the original dantian.","...","Song Shuhang’s nascent soul was sitting cross-legged.","Its appearance was also very special.","The nascent soul of a normal practitioner was mostly a shrunken version of themself.","However, Song Shuhang’s nascent soul looked like a real toddler, with sparse hair on the top of its head.","Baby Song was sitting atop the black lotus in a serious manner, its eyes closed.","Below, the old body of the fat whale slowly sank into the lake.","The stone tablet guessed, “Could it be that it has yet to open its eyes due to the influence of my master’s secret realm, which makes it so that the heavenly tribulation can’t be triggered?”","The moment the nascent soul opened its eyes, the heavenly tribulation would strike.","Perhaps it was precisely because the heavenly tribulation could not strike down in this area that the nascent soul did not open its eyes.","“That can’t be right. Haven’t the little nascent souls already opened their eyes?” the black-skinned Soft Feather said.","Pavilion Master Chu thought for a while and said, “Could it be that he’s not done yet and there are other steps?”","...","While they were speaking, another change occurred in the original dantian.","The big dumpling spread, and it turned into a lot of fluff, scattering on the spirit lake of Song Shuhang’s original dantian.","At the same time, the old body of the fat whale reached the bottom of the spirit lake.","As if a certain condition was met, a bright light appeared between Song Shuhang’s brows.","Fairy Creation covered her small mouth and stared closely at Song Shuhang’s brows. Was a third eye emerging?","However, Fairy Creation was bound to be disappointed.","It was not the emergence of a third eye that caused the radiant light between Song Shuhang’s brows but a rune.","[Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune] revised version.","The reincarnation rune originated from the Black Dragon World, and it was a precious means of resurrection that could allow even Ninth Stage big shots to come back to life.","At this time, even though Song Shuhang was still alive, the resurrection rune had been activated.","The power of the rune shrouded the old body of the fat whale."]},{"number":2146,"title":"Chapter 2146 Seize every minute","paragraphs":["2146 Seize every minute","The body of the fat whale, which had already sunk to the bottom of the lake, unexpectedly floated up after being shrouded by the light of the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune.","Its shattered body was healed once again.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was stunned. “What’s going on?”","“I don’t know, but this rune is one of Shuhang’s means of resurrection,” said Pavilion Master Chu.","This was a rather important point.","The black-skinned Soft Feather pointed to the fat whale and said, “The cracks on the golden core are healing.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said slowly, “Even if the cracks on the golden core are completely healed, nothing will change. The golden core has already transformed into a nascent soul.”","In other words, the fat whale was nothing but a soulless shell at the moment.","Pavilion Master Chu sighed and said, “As I said, it’s a resurrection rune. Song Shuhang did not die just now, so why was it activated?”","“Could it be that it wants to resurrect the fat whale?” The black-skinned Soft Feather’s eyes lit up.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet retorted, “No, the golden core did not ‘die.’ It just transformed into a nascent soul. This is just like when a caterpillar turns into a butterfly and leaves its cocoon behind. There should have been no reason for the resurrection rune to activate.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather pinched her chin and asked, “Could it be that Senior Song, who was under the effect of the time technique, died again?”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet stopped talking and paid extra attention to the word “again.”","Died again?","Death is such a serious matter; why add the word “again”?","Unless... Death is no longer something rare when it comes to little friend Song.","“Ayaya~” Fairy Creation stretched out her little hand, scratching the area between Song Shuhang’s eyebrows.","She thought that Song Shuhang was going to grow a third eye, so she was very happy earlier.","The appearance of the resurrection rune was a great disappointment as Fairy Creation could not pluck it out. However, she did not give up and tried to collect it regardless.","After tens of attempts...","The resurrection rune in between Song Shuhang’s brows suddenly disappeared.","Fairy Creation: “!!!”","She quickly looked down at her hands, but there was nothing there.","She then looked at Song Shuhang’s original dantian.","Sure enough, the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune had moved to Song Shuhang’s dantian and entered the body of the whale core.","The Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune originated from the Black Dragon World, and it was a blessing given by the Dragon Network to every level 9 mage that left the Black Dragon World. With the help of this rune, those level 9 mages who died outside the Black Dragon World would be resurrected back inside the Black Dragon World at the cost of some of their strength.","As for Song Shuhang’s reincarnation rune, it had evolved a few times after coming in contact with the bone of eternity.","Even Song Shuhang did not know what it could do at the moment!","??????","Under the audience’s watchful gaze, the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune integrated into the fat whale’s body.","The resurrection rune was fully activated, and the fat whale really began to resurrect.","Its body became more substantial, and even the Star Road that had been transferred to the nascent soul began to recover. The deflated fat whale was inflated once more, returning to its ball-like shape.","The Star Road on the fat whale’s body resonated and synchronized with the Star Road on the nascent soul’s body.","“WTF, the golden core really revived!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt that its stone face was all swollen due to the senseless slapping it had just received.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Could it be a backup server?”","After all, in order to ensure the safety of the data, besides the main server, there had to be a backup server so as to avoid data loss if the main server was damaged.","While they were speaking, the revived fat whale floated back to the surface of the lake.","It then jumped up and landed on the black lotus.","The nascent soul, who was sitting cross-legged, spread out its arms to grab the fat whale.","“It looks like that Lunar New Year’s painting where a baby is holding a carp.” The black-skinned Soft Feather’s eyes lit up.","Pavilion Master Chu could not help but laugh out loud. “How auspicious.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “Look at the fat whale’s head.”","The Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune was now branded on the top of the fat whale’s head.","The energy in the rune had been exhausted, and that faint mark was the only proof that it once existed in this world.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said curiously, “Can this Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune be used again?”","The rune was transferred from Shuhang to the fat whale, and it did not just disappear!","“Let me take a look.” Pavilion Master Chu carefully inspected the fat whale.","After a while, Pavilion Master Chu speculated, “You’re right. From the looks of it, this rune can be used many times. However, it accumulates energy very slowly. It may take eight to ten years for it to accumulate enough energy again. ”","“Eight to ten years?” The black-skinned Soft Feather blinked and said, “Then, it seems that Senior Song won’t be able to use it next time.”","Senior Song lived a fast-paced life and seized every minute. Eight to ten years was too long for him; he couldn’t wait that much.","A means of resurrection that would take eight to ten years to recharge was destined to be of no use to Senior Song.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet became silent again.","‘Senior Song died again...’","‘Eight to ten years? Then, it seems that Senior Song won’t be able to use it next time...’","...","The voice of the black-skinned Soft Feather echoed in its mind.","It seems that little friend Song dies more than once every ten years...","I must remember this...","As a tombstone, I must pay attention to every death of little friend Song.","This was the mission entrusted to it by its master Black White.","From the looks of it, it could do many other things besides fighting big shots, so it did not have to worry too much about losing its job.","“I did not expect that the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune would be used on the fat whale.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair twirled around.","This was something that went against the principles of cultivation.","If a golden core breaking was judged as “death,” wouldn’t the resurrection means of every practitioner in the universe activate when they ascended to the Sixth Stage?","It did not make sense!","The black-skinned Soft Feather speculated, “Could it be that something happened to Senior Song’s consciousness when he was in the time technique? The crisis faced by his consciousness and the shattering of the golden core may have been enough to cause the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune to activate...”","...","Pavilion Master Chu said, “That’s very likely to be the case.”","Her hair slid under Sixteen’s shirt again and touched her lower abdomen.","The illusory core in Sixteen’s body was almost solid, ready to trigger a heavenly tribulation at any time and allow her to become a Fifth Stage Spirit Emperor."]},{"number":2147,"title":"Chapter 2147 Deceive time, deceive the world, deceive yourself","paragraphs":["2147 Deceive time, deceive the world, deceive yourself","At this time, inside the time technique.","As guessed by the black-skinned Soft Feather, Song Shuhang and the others had just gone through a series of twists and turns.","The group of four had lost their memories, but they instinctively stayed together.","Song Shuhang held the Scarlet Heaven Sword in his left hand and Sixteen with his other, while Sister White Dragon was wrapped around Sixteen’s body.","!!","The time reversal seemed to be finally coming to an end.","All of them felt that they were about to break free from this time technique. Therefore, they remained close together.","Just when the effect of the magical technique was about to end, a black stele rushed over.","The stele was also without memories, but when it saw Song Shuhang, it instinctively rushed over, intending to crush him and his party.","“Watch out!” Song Shuhang shouted. He stepped in front of Sixteen and protected her.","At the same time, with Scarlet Heaven Sword in his left hand, he fiercely slashed at the black stele.","The black stele looked very tyrannical, as if it could suppress all the living things in the world. But when it made contact with the sword, Song Shuhang discovered that it was actually very fragile.","When he slashed down with Scarlet Heaven Sword, the black stele was cut open like tofu. It was cut in half without any resistance!","The two halves of the black stele continued to move forward with the same momentum until they hit something.","“So weak...” Song Shuhang himself was taken aback.","But after a while, he flicked the sword in his hand and said, “No, it’s not that the opponent was too weak. It should be that the sword in my hand was its natural enemy.”","Previously, that long, strip-like sister said that they were spiritual bodies at the moment, and the black sword in his hand seemed to be very powerful against such entities!","The sword in his hand reminded him, “Remember, I am a saber.”","Song Shuhang nodded in agreement and said, “Yes, yes. You are a saber.”","Although he had lost his memory, he still had some basic knowledge left that allowed him to understand languages and the difference between a sword and a saber.","What a strange sword. It is clearly a sword, yet it insists that it’s a saber.","Before losing its memory, what did this sword go through to instinctively think that it is a saber?","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and stroked the “saber” out of habit.","A magical technique with unknown effects was cast on the sword.","“Uwah~ So refreshing~ What magical technique is this?” Scarlet Heaven Sword was so excited that its whole blade body trembled.","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “I don’t know. I just used it instinctively.”","Scarlet Heaven Sword shouted, “Do it again. That magical technique made me feel as if I had applied protective saber oil all over my body and polished myself with the best whetstone.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Watch out! The shockwave of the explosion is coming!” Song Shuhang heard the shout of the long, strip-like sister.","Bursts of electric sparks came from the two halves of the black stele.","“Boom~” The black stele exploded.","Stuck in the time technique, Song Shuhang and the others had nowhere to hide.","All kinds of protective magical techniques shrouded Song Shuhang as he stretched out his hand to pull the petite girl into his embrace. He cooperated with the long, strip-like sister to protect her.","At the same time, the time reversal finally came to an end.","The world stopped for an instant.","The shockwave of the explosion, Song Shuhang’s hand as he was pulling the young girl, White Dragon, and Scarlet Heaven Sword, who was in his hand, all froze.","Their minds could still think, but their bodies could no longer move.","And then...","Death befell them.","This “death” was part of the time technique, and it deceived the entire universe.","Song Shuhang, Scarlet Heaven Sword, Sixteen, and Sister White Dragon “died” for a moment.","Yes, this is the taste of death... Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He would never forget this familiar feeling. Even if he had no memories, this feeling had been engraved into his bones and soul. He would never forget it.","While in this death-like state, they were extracted from the time technique.","At the same time, in the main world, the bodies of Song Shuhang and Sixteen also entered a death-like state for a split second.","If one wanted to deceive time and the world, they first had to deceive themselves.","This state of death only lasted for a moment, and even Pavilion Master Chu and the stone tablet did not notice it.","However, the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune sensed this change and was activated.","??????","“Fwooo~”","Song Shuhang and others were frozen in time and in a death-like state as they left the time technique.","The group of four and the two halves of the black stele appeared in a desert that looked familiar and unfamiliar.","It was unknown how much time had passed, but eventually, the death-like state and the time stop came to an end.","“Boom~” The two halves of the black stele exploded with a loud bang.","But this time, it was far away from Song Shuhang and the others, so it didn’t manage to injure them.","...","“What is this place?” Sixteen got up and looked around.","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “It seems very familiar, but I can’t remember much about it.”","Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Do we have a mission to accomplish here?”","Sister White Dragon said softly, “Even if we do have a mission to complete, with the memory loss we’re experiencing, we won’t be able to do anything.”","“Who was the one that drew us into the magical technique?” Song Shuhang asked. “Maybe they made arrangements to tell us what to do next.”","While they were speaking, the melodious sound of horse bells could be heard and a white horse slowly made its way toward them from a distance.","Song Shuhang suddenly trembled all over.","Sixteen, who was holding his hand, mused, “What’s wrong?”","Song Shuhang said, “I don’t know. When I heard the sound of the horse bell, I felt as if something horrible was coming. I must have been tortured by that horrible thing before I lost my memory.”","“Don’t be afraid, we’re here with you this time.” Sixteen stood on the tip of her toes and patted Song Shuhang’s head lightly.","The white horse approached slowly and stopped beside Song Shuhang and the others.","...","“Huh? It’s only a horse? Why is there nobody with it?” Song Shuhang wondered.","He felt that there was something missing.","The white horse glanced slightly at Song Shuhang and lowered its head. It then went to the place where the black stele exploded.","Afterward, its front left hoof stepped on the wreckage of the black stele. A string of information emerged from the black stele, which it promptly read.","Its actions seemed very well-practiced.","It was almost as if this black stele was designed and made by it...","“What is this place?” Song Shuhang held Scarlet Heaven Sword in his hand and asked vigilantly.","After the white horse read the information, it revealed a human-like smile.","The white horse stood upright on one leg like a rooster and spread out its forelegs like a crane spreading its wings."]},{"number":2148,"title":"Chapter 2148 I can pay you back with my body","paragraphs":["2148 I can pay you back with my body","Song Shuhang: “...”","He remained vigilant, holding Scarlet Heaven Sword in one hand as he retreated step by step.","Sixteen and Sister White Dragon also retreated.","Sixteen asked, “Is there a problem with this horse?”","!!","Song Shuhang said seriously, “Yes, and a big problem at that. Although I can’t remember what it is exactly, when I saw its hooves, my head started hurting.”","If that white horse standing on one leg attacked with its hoof, the blow would be fatal. Shuhang kept on getting the feeling that he had been plotted against by this horse at some point of time in the past. As such, when it saw its hooves, he retreated out of instinct.","While the white horse showed off its posture, it saw that Song Shuhang had begun retreating like a coward. Seeing this, an expression of disdain flashed through its eyes. The horse’s face was surprisingly capable of displaying an emotion such as disdain. This had to be really difficult for its facial muscles and nerves.","The white horse landed on its four hooves, turned around, and returned to the wreckage of the black stele.","The wreckage of the black stele began to change after the information contained in it was read. It went from being a black stele to an ordinary structure made of stone.","“Um, Senior Horse, can I ask a question? Was that black stele a treasure of yours?” Song Shuhang asked carefully.","The black stele had been cut into two halves by him.","If it was a treasure of this white horse, did that not mean that he was in trouble?","The white horse turned its head around and looked at Song Shuhang with a half-smile.","“If it belonged to me, are you going to pay me back?” An illusory voice spread from the white horse.","It did not come from its mouth but directly from the body of the white horse.","This voice was very pleasing to the ear, and it increased one’s favorability toward the horse by 99 points.","Song Shuhang touched his pocket subconsciously. Although the concept of “money” was somewhat vague in his mind, he remembered one thing very clearly—he had no money.","“Senior, if I don’t have any money... Can I pay you back with my body?” Song Shuhang said cautiously. “I can work part-time to pay off the debt. I have some strength, and I can help with physical work.”","Sixteen hurriedly pulled Song Shuhang and said, “The way you said it, it sounded really wrong.”","Song Shuhang said curiously, “Then, how should I have said it?”","Sixteen frowned slightly, but she could not think of a better wording for the statement. Her memory was a blur. The more she wanted to remember something, the more she failed to do so.","Her current state made her feel very uncomfortable.","“Okay,” the voice coming from the white horse suddenly said, “then pay me back with your body. I happen to have an experiment to complete, and I might need your cooperation, Mr. Tyrannical Song.”","“Tyrannical Song? Are you referring to me?” Song Shuhang pointed to himself.","“That’s right. Tyrannical Song is your name,” replied the white horse casually. It turned and began walking. At the same time, it stomped on the wreckage of the black stele with its right hind hoof.","With that single stomp, the wreckage completely disappeared, just as if it had been erased from the world.","Song Shuhang said softly, “Why do I keep on getting a familiar feeling from that stone structure?”","He felt as if he was friends with someone made of stone...","Sixteen asked softly, “Are we going to follow it?”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “We have collective amnesia right now. If we want to find clues, we have to follow that horse. By the way, this white horse is really beautiful. It must be cool to have it as a mount.”","If he were to ride the horse while wearing a green robe and having a long sword tied to his waist, he would look especially elegant.","Sister White Dragon reminded him, “The white horse ahead of us can hear your words.”","Words could be one’s downfall.","It was better to have them filtered before allowing them to come out of one’s mouth.","The white horse in front of them turned its head and looked at Song Shuhang contemptuously.","Song Shuhang: “...”","And so, a horse, a dragon, a sword, and two human beings traversed the vast desert.","It was unknown how long they walked, but the white horse eventually stopped.","Song Shuhang asked, “Have we arrived?”","The voice from the white horse said, “We have. Follow my instructions in a while, and close your eyes when I count to three.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword could not help but say, “I don’t have eyes.”","The white horse said, “In that case, you’ll stay outside with me.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “???”","Wait, am I supposed to stay here alone?","In this strange world, only the strip-like lady, the petite girl, and the boy with a kind face could give it a sense of familiarity. It did not want to leave them.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said hurriedly, “No, the four of us are in this together, and we’ll go through life and death together. We will never be separated.”","The white horse said, “Don’t make a mess. If you go any further, it will be hell for you. Tyrannical Song, leave this sword behind. I’ll keep it safe for you.”","Song Shuhang hesitated for a moment and finally handed the black Scarlet Heaven Sword to the white horse.","Although he had no memory, his intuition told him that this was the correct choice.","While handing over the sword, Song Shuhang asked, “Senior, are you going to strap the sword to your bo— Uh.”","Before he could even finish speaking, the white horse opened its mouth and swallowed the black Scarlet Heaven Sword. Then, with a flick of its head, Scarlet Heaven Sword ended up in its stomach.","Song Shuhang: “...”","This scene had a strong visual impact and gave off a very familiar feeling.","The white horse replied, “Don’t worry. This is just a sword-swallowing performance. I did not eat the sword and will return it to you when you come back.”","...","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","“Okay, listen to me. 3, 2, 1, close your eyes! Now, count to ten before opening your eyes again,” said the white horse.","Song Shuhang, Sixteen, and Sister White Dragon all closed their eyes and started counting in their minds.","After counting to ten, Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","He discovered that white dumplings had appeared in front of him.","There were large and small dumplings suspended in the air. It was a spectacular sight.","Song Shuhang asked curiously, “What is this?”","Sixteen could not help but touch her stomach. When she saw these little dumplings, she felt as if her stomach was full.","The voice from the white horse said, “This is my research area. I am currently carrying out an interesting experiment on the path of time. Since you want to pay me back with your body, you can just cooperate with me in completing this experiment.”","Song Shuhang asked aloud, “Will our lives be at risk?”","The voice coming from inside the white horse said, “Yes, but you’re at risk for other reasons. My experiment can actually reduce the risk of death.”","...","“Then, can you let her and the long, strip-like sister leave?” Song Shuhang gently pushed Sixteen away. “I am the only one who has to repay you. There’s no need to involve them in this.”","The voice from the white horse said, “You’re misunderstanding things. It’s not that I want to involve her. It’s just that in the future, she and you both have already been involved in this.”","Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement, “What do you mean?”","The white horse continued, “Just know that there’s nothing to fear. Anyway... I carefully thought things through and noticed that I might have made a mistake just now. That black stele wasn’t my work, but rather something created after someone plagiarized my design.”"]},{"number":2149,"title":"Chapter 2149 Because I’m awesome!","paragraphs":["2149 Because I’m awesome!","Does this mean that the black stele did not belong to Senior White Horse?","Also, doesn’t that mean that I should not be paying anything back at all?","I’m suffering a loss for no reason!","Song Shuhang yelled, “Senior White Horse, you tricked me!”","!!","The voice from the white horse’s body said, “No, not at all. You should know that even if others ask me if they can be my test subjects, I would not necessarily allow them to do so.”","“Give me back my body compensation!” Song Shuhang felt that he had been cheated.","The white horse tilted its head as if thinking about something.","After a while, it nodded solemnly and said, “Okay, then I owe you a ‘flesh payment.’ After you come back alive, I will also give you a ‘flesh payment.’”","Song Shuhang: “...”","It really does sound wrong for some reason.","In the next moment, he and Sixteen felt as if they were trapped in a dense fog. They could no longer see the figure of the white horse.","The white dumplings had spread out and turned into a white mist, covering the entire space.","??????","White Horse stood still at the edge of the fog, staring ahead intently.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword could not help but ask, “What kind of experiment are you going to do? I’m warning you, if you harm that boy with a kind face, don’t blame me for being rude!”","Believe it or not, I can pierce your stomach if I want to!","Sword-swallowing is not something that just anyone can do!","White Horse laughed and said, “You are an embarrassment to all inner demons. I’ve never seen an inner demon as upright as you.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said subconsciously, “There’s no need to worry about that, because there is another inner demon who’s even worse than me at being an inner demon. Huh, wait... Who is this other inner demon?”","Amnesia was something that could really bring a huge headache at times.","The voice from the white horse said slowly, “Don’t worry. I’m actually helping him.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “???”","White Horse continued, “This experiment of mine was prepared for White Rabbit, and its purpose was to bring him out of the Netherworld Realm and allow him to gain true freedom. But when I gazed into the future, I saw that White Rabbit was still the ruler of the Netherworld. From that moment, I knew that this experiment would end in failure.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword went silent for a while, then said, “Can you explain in a simpler manner? I have amnesia right now, and what you said is too difficult to understand. It would be better if you used simpler words.”","White Horse said, “Things involving ‘time’ are inherently difficult to explain. If you can’t understand, just know that I am conducting an experiment that is doomed to fail, and this experiment just happens to be helpful to Tyrannical Song.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “What are you helping him with?”","The voice from the white horse sounded again. “I’m helping him move his heavenly tribulation from the future to the past.”","In the future, Tyrannical Song was involved in a Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation.","If he were to transcend his Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation, the two heavenly tribulations would combine into one, and his main body would be forced to face the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation. Additionally, this Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation would rise in strength to a terrifying level.","As such, his experiment was very helpful in that it could move Tyrannical Song’s Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation to the past, making the world think that he had already overcome his Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation in the present.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said in a deep voice, “Is such a thing even possible? Who are you?”","“Others can’t do it, not even Wielders of the Will. Usually, the path of time only allows you to peek into the past and won’t allow you to change it. However, I can do it.” White Horse looked at the fog. Its voice was almost illusory and seemed to come from all directions.","“Why?” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword wondered.","“Because I’m awesome!” White Horse laughed.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","I really want to pierce his belly.","Anyway, the path of time can’t change the past and can only peek into it. Were our memories wiped during the time reversal so that we wouldn’t influence the past?","White Horse said regretfully, “What a pity. I prepared for so long for this experiment that was meant for White Rabbit.”","??????","Back in the Beast Realm, in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","The black-skinned Soft Feather shouted, “The eyes have opened. Senior Song’s nascent soul has opened its eyes!”","Song Shuhang, whose nascent soul had a fat whale in its arms, slowly opened its eyes.","This meant that the Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation was coming.","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet!” Pavilion Master Chu yelled. Her hair jumped down from the top of Song Shuhang’s head as if it had grown legs and transplanted itself to the top of the black-skinned Soft Feather’s head.","“Don’t worry. I’ve long been ready,” replied the stone tablet.","In the next moment, the sand in the tomb began moving. Song Shuhang’s body was covered in sand and hurled away like a cannonball.","The virtuous lamia protected Song Shuhang, and Fairy Creation returned inside his body.","If the tribulation transcension was about to begin, then no other practitioners should be allowed within the range of the tribulation. Only the virtuous lamia could help Song Shuhang.","Fairy Creation was merely insurance, and she could not make a move directly. Only if Song Shuhang’s life was at stake would she act to delay the heavenly tribulation.","At this time, Pavilion Master Chu shouted again, “Over here, Sixteen is about to transcend her tribulation as well!”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet called out, “Leave it to me.”","In the next moment, Sixteen was shot out like a cannonball in the opposite direction.","In this way, the tribulation transcending zones of the two would not overlap and there would be a buffer zone.","The stone tablet added, “Fairy Soft Feather, hide in the hole. You have the body of an inner demon, and you could easily die if the heavenly tribulation were to strike you. I will go to protect little friend Song and the little girl from the Su Clan.”","...","With its presence, little friend Song and Sixteen should not face any problems.","It just had to wait for the heavenly tribulation to descend. If the virtuous lamia could not protect Song Shuhang, it would act and scatter the heavenly tribulation.","The same went for Miss Su’s side.","??????","Meanwhile, in the desert after the time reversal.","Song Shuhang’s consciousness looked up at the sky.","The mist formed by the white dumplings enveloped his consciousness, which began to become solid.","The white dumplings carried the power of time, and they were like passages that connected the past, present, and future.","The consciousness of Song Shuhang in the “past” and his physical body in the “future” were connected together under the influence of the white dumplings.","The same went for Sixteen.","Song Shuhang looked down at his body and asked in confusion, “Huh? How did my body become transparent?”","...","Sister White Dragon asked curiously, “Your body has become like lustrous glass. How did you do that?”","Song Shuhang shook his head, and he looked at his stomach. “There are eight children in my belly... Am I pregnant? I feel that they’re going to be born soon. Do I need a cesarean section?”","For some reason, Song Shuhang was very calm when faced with the possibility of being pregnant.","Sister White Dragon corrected Song Shuhang, “Those aren’t children. Those are nascent souls.”","Next to them, Sixteen covered her eyes shyly.","“Boom~” In the sky, a tribulation cloud appeared.","It was the Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation.","At present, it was still normal and had yet to mutate."]},{"number":2150,"title":"Chapter 2150 Weak and simple heavenly tribulation","paragraphs":["2150 Weak and simple heavenly tribulation","The heavenly tribulation this time was very normal, and when it descended, it followed the standard procedure.","It began with the warning tribulation cloud.","The purpose of this cloud was to warn the cultivator that the heavenly tribulation would soon begin, so they should quickly get ready. Back in the day, tribulation clouds generally took a very long time to gather, which gave cultivators enough time to rush to the place where their formation was set up—this step was equivalent to a “verbal warning.”","Then came the first wave, the warning bolt of lightning.","!!","It was a very ordinary attack that was not very powerful and would basically not cause too much damage to the cultivator. The purpose of this lightning was to inform the cultivator that the heavenly tribulation had officially begun—this step was equivalent to “firing a warning shot into the air.”","What was bombarding Song Shuhang right now was the warning lightning.","“Boom~”","A bolt of tribulation lightning with strength around the Sixth Stage struck Song Shuhang’s body.","Song Shuhang was thinking about how to deal with the tribulation lightning when a strong light of virtue emerged from his body.","The light of virtue condensed into the appearance of a lamia, but due to environmental factors, her body was blurred and somewhat rough around the edges. From time to time, she would also “flicker,” just like when a movie file was damaged and the screen would flicker during playback.","After the virtuous lamia appeared, she grabbed the warning bolt of lightning with her bare hands.","The bolt of tribulation lightning was captured alive.","The lightning was like a big snake, twisting and struggling constantly.","But no matter how hard it struggled, it could not escape the virtuous lamia’s hands.","At the same time, a virtuous fat whale appeared behind the virtuous lamia and opened its mouth.","The virtuous lamia stretched out her hand and stuffed the tribulation lightning into the whale’s mouth.","Song Shuhang murmured, “This silly whale. Why is it swallowing things again... Huh?”","The amnesia and blurry details gave him a headache.","The warning tribulation lightning was sealed in the belly of the virtuous fat whale, where it rampaged but failed to break free.","Song Shuhang scratched his head and said, “Why do I feel as if the tribulation lightning is a bit pitiful...”","The petite girl beside him nodded in agreement. She felt the same way.","Sister White Dragon reminded them, “Don’t be careless. That was just the warning bolt of tribulation lightning, so it’s normal for it not to be too powerful. From what I remember, the next wave of the heavenly tribulation will be very strong. It’ll be completely different from this warning bolt. Don’t underestimate the heavenly tribulation.”","Song Shuhang nodded seriously and said, “I got it. I won’t be careless.”","When he heard the word heavenly tribulation, complex emotions emerged in his heart.","Liver pain, a sense of familiarity, pain, deliciousness...","It was an extremely complicated feeling.","Song Shuhang did not even know how he felt about the heavenly tribulation before he lost his memory, but the complicated feelings also told him that he attached great importance to the heavenly tribulation before the memory loss.","Therefore, facing the heavenly tribulation now, he raised his focus to 200%.","The tribulation clouds above his head became bigger, and the power of the five elements started condensing.","“Aaahhh!” Song Shuhang clenched his hands into fists while the muscles all over his body bulged.","“What are you doing?” the petite girl asked in puzzlement.","“I was trying to unleash my power, but I forgot how to do it.” Song Shuhang looked up at the sky and exclaimed, “Heavens.”","Sixteen was speechless.","“But my intuition tells me that at this time, I can draw out the power in my body by relying on my will. Yaaah!” Song Shuhang clenched both of his fists and roared again.","This time, it worked!","Following his will, the power in his body was drawn out.","His skin was covered by a layer of jet-black color, and his lustrous body looked similar to a black diamond inscribed with scholarly runes.","Immediately afterward, 123 holy apes in scholarly robes materialized above his head, each with a dragon-shaped scarf around their neck.","The larger holy ape raised its right hand toward the sky.","The 122 little holy apes quickly followed suit and raised their hands while maintaining a certain distance between them.","In the blink of an eye, they formed the sentence “offering to the dead” in the sky","The larger holy ape was right in the center, making it clear who was the leader among the holy apes!","Song Shuhang: “...”","Sixteen: “...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","The wind blew, and the scholarly robes donned by the holy apes fluttered.","The true dragon scarves around their necks stretched out their heads, making it so that their horns could be used as bookshelves.","This was the new formation that the holy apes and true dragons had come up with.","Triangular, round, square, or pentagonal-shaped formations could no longer satisfy the holy apes. They sought innovation and breakthroughs.","The “offering” formation was undoubtedly an innovation, which opened a new world of possibilities. After all, there were so many words that they could choose from.","With this new, word-based formation, the large holy ape no longer had to worry about being out of ideas if they needed to shake things up.","Outside the fog, White Horse laughed so much that it lost its balance. The voice that echoed from its body sounded very pleasant when it was laughing.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword felt like it had fallen in love as it listened to that pleasant laughter.","The voice from the white horse said slowly, “I feel so much better all of a sudden.”","...","It had been in a bad mood today as it was almost time for it to leave.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said in a serious tone with its adorable voice, “Is there anything I can do for you?”","The voice from the white horse laughed and said, “Just stop thinking about piercing my stomach. That would be enough.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","White Horse said cheerfully, “The incoming heavenly tribulation will pose no threat to Tyrannical Song. However, the little fairy maiden with him should be about to begin transcending her tribulation as well.”","Inside the fog.","Sixteen looked at the holy apes in the sky and then at the true-dragon scarfs around their necks.","Then, she turned her head to look at Sister White Dragon, who was wrapped around her.","They were the same species! Other than their color, they were basically the same.","Sixteen looked at Sister White Dragon, and Sister White Dragon looked back at her.","Sixteen stretched out her small hand, trying to lift Sister White Dragon up a bit, but perhaps because she lacked the strength, she couldn’t do it.","...","After a while, Sister White Dragon sighed and said dotingly, “Okay, just once.”","Then, her figure began to shrink, all the way until she was the size of a scarf.","Sixteen imitated the holy apes in the sky and wrapped Sister White Dragon around her neck.","Seeing this, Song Shuhang was overwhelmed with envy.","Song Shuhang suggested, “Sister White Strip, why don’t you make yourself a little longer? That way, you can wrap half of your body around the fairy maiden’s neck and the other half around my neck!”","“Screw off!” Sister White Dragon scolded.","What do you think I am?!"]},{"number":2151,"title":"Chapter 2151 Self-confidence skyrockets","paragraphs":["2151 Self-confidence skyrockets","Sister White Dragon’s voice seemed to carry the power to make others do her bidding.","When she told him to screw off, Song Shuhang immediately rolled away, and he did so very quickly.","Actually, the reason was that the first real strike of the Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation was descending. This strike was no longer a warning shot; the five-element heavenly tribulation lightning possessed might at the peak of the Sixth Stage.","The power of the five elements covered most of the sky. Ferocious flames burned and thunder roared, while hail mixed with sandstorms and ravaged the sky. The scene reminded one of the end of the world.","Song Shuhang knew that the heavenly tribulation was coming for him. In order to avoid involving the petite fairy maiden, he quickly put some distance between them.","After rolling away, Song Shuhang stood still and began to prepare for the five-element heavenly tribulation.","The heavenly tribulation firmly locked onto him, sending attacks his way both from the ground and the sky.","The virtuous lamia did not try to capture the heavenly tribulation this time around as she was only interested in lightning-type tribulation.","She dissipated and turned into light of virtue before settling inside Song Shuhang’s body, strengthening his defense.","The five-element heavenly tribulation was a very good whetstone for cultivators who practiced body tempering techniques.","For such people, it was of great benefit to resist the five-element heavenly tribulation without the aid of defensive magical treasures or auxiliary formations.","If they were lucky, they might even be able to make use of that opportunity to raise the level of their body tempering techniques.","However, Song Shuhang, who had lost his memory, did not know this. Actually, even when he had his memory, he didn’t know of this fact.","“Come!” Song Shuhang shouted at the five-element heavenly tribulation.","Afterward, he hugged his head, squatted down, and assumed an impeccable defensive posture.","Having lost his memory, he didn’t remember how to use offensive or defensive techniques, so he could only resist the attack and see if he had any skills that would activate on its own.","The five-element heavenly tribulation pounced on him viciously, covering him from head to toe.","“Yaaaa!” Song Shuhang clenched his teeth and endured the damage of the heavenly tribulation.","But after a few yells, he stopped.","Still crouched, he raised his head in puzzlement and glanced at the horrifying scene in the sky.","While scratching his head, he mused, “Is that it?”","This five-element heavenly tribulation looks so scary, so why are its attacks so weak?","??????","“Tyrannical Song, are you alright?” asked Sixteen, worried. She heard the white horse call Song Shuhang “Tyrannical Song” earlier, so she followed suit.","Seeing Song Shuhang surrounded by the five-element heavenly tribulation, a worried look emerged on her face.","The metal, wood, water, fire, and earth element enveloped Song Shuhang’s body, with the five forces forming a cycle. No matter what kind of affinity a practitioner had with the various elements, the five-element heavenly tribulation would find their weaknesses.","If the power of the five-element heavenly tribulation managed to invade one’s body, it could destroy the practitioner from the inside, which was something very difficult to defend against.","“I’m fine, and I don’t feel much pain. Anyway, isn’t the might of this five-element heavenly tribulation a bit too low?” Song Shuhang stood up while receiving the attacks of the five-element heavenly tribulation and waved at Sixteen.","So weak... Is this the real might of the heavenly tribulation?","These attacks feel no different from a baby slapping me.","Rather than hurting, it feels like a massage.","Seeing how weak the heavenly tribulation was, Song Shuhang’s self-confidence skyrocketed.","If this was the true power of the Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation, then he, Tyrannical Song, would survive without any problems!","Song Shuhang challenged the heavenly tribulation, “Come on! Try harder! Did you forget to have your breakfast this morning?”","Such a provocation did not conform to his usual cautious and careful nature, but when he was bombarded by the heavenly tribulation, Song Shuhang kept getting a sense of familiarity. So, he could not stop himself from provoking the heavenly tribulation.","The five-element heavenly tribulation increased its power.","The five elements formed a cycle and enhanced each other’s damage.","Various powers derived from the five elements, such as lightning, fire, wind, and ice, enveloped Song Shuhang’s body and attacked him from all directions.","Song Shuhang continued to provoke the heavenly tribulation. “Is this all you can do? Your damage only increased by a small bit. Try harder! Let me feel a little pain!”","He felt that this was the only way to force the heavenly tribulation to go all out.","This time, it was no longer a simple provocation but part of Song Shuhang’s strategy.","He did this because he suddenly recalled a piece of knowledge about the heavenly tribulation.","As long as it did not mutate halfway, the heavenly tribulation’s attack power was fixed.","If the total attack power was 100, then it was best to waste the energy of the heavenly tribulation in the early stages.","After all, the later the stage, the more diverse and trickier the attacks of the heavenly tribulation.","Even with the same amount of energy, the damage caused by the earlier attacks and the damage caused by the later attacks was very different.","Therefore, Song Shuhang provoked the heavenly tribulation, hoping that he could fully consume its energy in the first few stages.","The heavenly tribulation continued to strike down fiercely, and its power kept increasing.","Song Shuhang was still fine and continued to spout nonsense.","In the distance, Sixteen watched attentively. Although she had lost her memory, her instincts told her that there was definitely something wrong with the way Song Shuhang was transcending his tribulation.","Song Shuhang said loudly, “That’s it! You added some strength this time. I felt a little bit of pain, the kind you’d feel when someone gently pricks you with their fingernails. I knew that as long as you wanted to, you could do it! Come on! Continue to increase your strength. Don’t pity me!”","The five-element heavenly tribulation added more power to keep its face.","Everything was going according to Song Shuhang’s plans.","While Song Shuhang was in thought, an awe-inspiring saber intent emerged from his body, exploding toward the sky.","...","This explosive saber intent that came out of nowhere was extremely powerful.","Everything that stood in its way was obliterated.","Whether it was the fire or the lightning, the sand or the ice, the wood or the wind, all of them were cut apart with that single slash.","Even the tribulation clouds in the sky were slashed in two halves.","After cutting through the tribulation clouds, the saber intent did not dissipate and continued toward the starry sky as if wanting to tear it apart.","The five-element heavenly tribulation was snuffed out.","The tribulation clouds in the air began to condense again, brewing the next wave of the heavenly tribulation.","Song Shuhang: “...”","What the hell was that?!","Why did such a powerful saber intent suddenly emerge from my body?","When the word “saber intent” appeared in his mind, another type of saber intent burst out of his body.","...","The saber intent wrapped around his body and turned into a set of gorgeous armor.","This shining armor conveniently covered Song Shuhang’s forbidden zone.","“Is this armor intent?” Song Shuhang touched the armor on his body.","No wonder I couldn’t think of any offensive techniques. It seems I’m a tank specialized in defense..."]},{"number":2152,"title":"Chapter 2152 Tribulation clouds, sun fire, flaming shower, black lotuses, and Shuhang","paragraphs":["2152 Tribulation clouds, sun fire, flaming shower, black lotuses, and Shuhang","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “Wonderful! I didn’t expect to be someone who specialized in defense.”","When practitioners were in a state of amnesia and could not remember anything, those who specialized in defense had an advantage.","If they had a high defense, they would last longer and have a higher chance to survive the heavenly tribulation.","On the other hand, if a practitioner who specialized in offense were to suddenly forget how to use their strongest attacks and could only use basic ones when faced with the heavenly tribulation, that would be truly tragic.","After the saber intent armor covered his body, Song Shuhang’s self-confidence rose even more.","Outside the fog.","Since the tribulation clouds were still gathering, the white horse seized the opportunity to say, its tone cheerful, “Little friend Tyrannical Song, is it really okay for you to provoke the heavenly tribulation like this?”","Song Shuhang replied loudly, “Senior, it’s all part of my strategy. I intend to force the heavenly tribulation to consume all its energy in the first few waves, reducing the danger of the later waves.”","“Hmm, that’s actually quite creative. However, if you provoke the heavenly tribulation like this, you should be careful as you might get flagged and recorded in its database.” Senior White Horse’s tone was full of joy and anticipation.","Song Shuhang blurted out, “...What database?”","“Usually, the heavenly tribulation follows a predetermined set of rules. But to ensure that it keeps working properly, every instance is recorded and stored inside a huge database. It is only in this way that the heavenly tribulation can be adjusted to better fit each practitioner,” Senior White Horse explained. “If you continue provoking the heavenly tribulation and calling it weak, there’s a high possibility of it marking you.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","To think that the heavenly tribulation had this kind of function...","Song Shuhang said, “I see. Thank you for reminding me, Senior. I will be more careful next time.”","A true man should know when to bow.","When it was time to cower, Song Shuhang would not hesitate to give up his pride and do so.","Senior White Horse said with a smile, “People who care too much about their face usually die quickly.”","Song Shuhang nodded in agreement. “I agree.”","??????","After a few breaths of time, inside the fog.","The third wave of the heavenly tribulation began. The tribulation clouds were torn apart, and a big red sun descended from the sky!","It was the great sun fire tribulation.","Judging by the clouds that had gathered, the might of the tribulation had jumped straight to the Seventh Stage. This was the strongest the heavenly tribulation could be in the main world. Any stronger and the transcension would have to be carried out in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","The sun fire tribulation blasted toward Song Shuhang with an unrivaled momentum.","“That’s huge.” Song Shuhang’s scalp went numb.","At a glance, the size of the sun fire appeared to be around that of a soccer field, or perhaps even larger.","With this being the case, he could no longer stay on the ground. Otherwise, Sixteen would also be involved.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and jumped up.","He had forgotten that he could simply walk on air and thought that he could only jump if he wanted to “fly.”","Still, the height of the jump far exceeded Song Shuhang’s imagination.","Looking at the ever-shrinking ground and desert, Song Shuhang felt a little weak in his legs.","He had jumped so high that he was scared now.","Do I have a fear of heights? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","As a practitioner, I might even have the ability to ride on a flying sword, yet I’m afraid of heights!","The man I was before losing my memories must’ve been an embarrassment to all practitioners.","Song Shuhang started to despise his pre-amnesia self.","He took a deep breath, controlled the rhythm of his breathing, and shook his legs according to the rhythm.","One two three four, two two three four, three two three four, shake again!","Nice. If I shake my legs according to this rhythm, I can partially overcome my fear of heights.","Song Shuhang clenched his fists, continuing to fly toward the sun fire tribulation.","When he punched, his muscle memory was naturally awakened.","He instinctively unleashed the second form of the ?Basic Buddhist Fist Technique?.","Song Shuhang’s fists bombarded the tribulation like a meteor shower. The energies of his eight nascent souls and the fat whale were all mobilized.","In addition, Song Shuhang was buffed by three top-tier body-tempering techniques at the moment, so every time he punched, he created a small explosion.","“Three, two, three, four, shake!” Song Shuhang yelled passionately while shaking his legs and gathering all his strength in his fists.","The 123 holy apes above his head cooperated with him as he attacked. They let out deep chants, adding some background music to the scene.","The 123 true dragons cooperated with Song Shuhang as well. Every time he punched, a true dragon shot forward along with his fist.","In the blink of an eye, Song Shuhang had thrown 123 punches, and 123 true dragons blasted into the sun fire tribulation together with his fists.","This style was very much in line with Song Shuhang’s aesthetics.","The fists and the sun fire tribulation continued to clash against one another. The sky and the earth shook, and the world seemed like it was going to be destroyed.","Affected by the strength of the fists, the sun fire tribulation swelled in size and became unstable.","The punches halted, and Song Shuhang started free-falling.","In the meantime, the glorious sun fire tribulation exploded with a deafening blast.","The sun fire scattered in all directions, turning into a shower of flames that poured down on the ground.","...","Two black lotuses appeared under Shuhang’s feet, supporting his body and allowing him to firmly stand in the air.","??????","The pitch-black tribulation clouds, the exploding sun fire, the shower of flames, the shining black lotuses, and the imposing figure in armor standing proudly in the sky were reflected in Sixteen’s eyes.","She could not help but grab Sister White Dragon, who was around her neck, and pull her body up to cover half of her face.","Her heartbeat accelerated, and her little face became slightly red.","This feeling was... It was the feeling that the heavenly tribulation was coming.","Sixteen looked at her original dantian. Her illusory core had solidified.","A golden core determined one’s path, and her golden core was about to take shape.","In the air, tribulation clouds appeared.","This time, the tribulation clouds weren’t there for Tyrannical Song but for her.","“Tyrannical Song’s heavenly tribulation has not ended yet, but my heavenly tribulation is already here. Sister, can you help me suppress my heavenly tribulation?” Sixteen gently pulled at Sister White Dragon.","...","Sister White Dragon was about to reply when someone interjected.","“There is no need to suppress your heavenly tribulation, so don’t worry about it.” The voice of the white horse sounded from outside the fog. “The experi— I mean, the fortuitous encounter I arranged for you and Tyrannical Song is something you have to face together.”","“My time is running out. Before I disappear, I’ll make sure that you and Tyrannical Song can return safely.","“Don’t resist.","“I will always be with you.”","The voice of the white horse became increasingly gentle but also more and more distant."]},{"number":2153,"title":"Chapter 2153 Surfing in the sea of lightning","paragraphs":["2153 Surfing in the sea of lightning","The long, scarf-like sister shouted, “Don’t believe his nonsense!”","Transcending the heavenly tribulation together sounded cool but would most likely end with everyone perishing.","The heavenly tribulation was no joke.","Only someone with a black heart would entice people to transcend the tribulation as a group. This kind of guy should be recorded in the ?Cultivation’s Record of the Treacherous?!","Moreover, the way the white horse spoke made Sister White Dragon feel that it was very unreliable and that nothing good would come from listening to it.","Sixteen chose to believe the scarf-like sister because she gave her a sense of familiarity.","Moreover, she did not want her heavenly tribulation to affect Tyrannical Song and harm him.","Sixteen turned around and headed in the direction opposite Shuhang.","Outside the fog, the white horse sighed faintly.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword comforted it, “Don’t be sad. After all, this is the first time you’ve met with everyone. It takes time to build trust between people.”","“Unfortunately, I don’t have much time,” White Horse said sadly. “My body has already begun to disappear.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked suddenly, “By the way, if you disappear, will I fall out of your stomach?”","As an inner demon, even though it was in love, it was still very selfish, and its existence was the most important thing to it.","“Since you are in my body, if I disappear, of course you will disappear with me,” said White Horse as a matter of fact.","“Wait! Then spit me out before you disappear!” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword said urgently.","However, White Horse ignored it.","Even if the black Scarlet Heaven Sword kept shouting, no one would help it.","??????","Inside the fog, Sixteen put some distance between herself and Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang stood on the black lotuses, his legs shaking rhythmically and his fists clenched.","He wanted to keep a low profile, but the range of the sun fire tribulation far exceeded his imagination. In order to avoid getting that petite fairy maiden involved, he chose to meet the heavenly tribulation in mid-air.","However, he did not expect the sun fire tribulation to be all show and no substance. Although it looked very scary, it couldn’t even take a single one of his attacks. It was blasted apart with a mere 123 punches.","I really want to keep a low profile, but your being so weak isn’t helping!","If you get destroyed so easily, how am I supposed to look weak?!","Song Shuhang felt very anxious.","“I will definitely keep a low profile during the next wave. I’ll decrease the power of my punches by a third!” He swore to himself.","“Don’t hold back anymore.” The ethereal voice of the white horse echoed in Song Shuhang’s ear.","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","White Horse’s voice sounded again. “I have prepared the stage for you. Go up boldly.”","“Wait, what stage?” Song Shuhang panicked. “Do you have a script as well?”","I remember that my acting skills should be pretty good as long as I’m given a script.","Wait... What is a script? I can’t seem to remember well.","The white horse’s voice sounded again. “You can just improvise.”","Then, it added, “Transcending the heavenly tribulation as a group is something very special, and it might be the key to breaking the game. If you don’t transcend the tribulation together, are you even worthy of calling each other ‘fellow daoist’? In the future, remember to cherish the people you transcend the tribulation with.”","Song Shuhang blurted out, “A group tribulation equals a mass grave!”","Even if he had lost his memory and could not recall his previous experiences, he still somehow managed to yell out this sentence.","White Horse said, “Begin.”","In the sky, Song Shuhang’s large tribulation cloud approached Sixteen’s small tribulation cloud.","Although Sixteen was trying to distance herself from Song Shuhang, her speed could not compare to that of the large tribulation cloud.","At the same time, all the nascent souls in Song Shuhang’s body closed their eyes and opened them again.","The power of the eight nascent souls was fully activated.","Song Shuhang’s tribulation cloud increased in size and swallowed Sixteen’s tribulation cloud.","The entire desert was overshadowed by pitch-black tribulation clouds.","Arcs and serpents made of lightning roamed about in the dark clouds.","It was as if the world was ending.","But then, all the dark clouds and lightning disappeared.","In mid-air, Song Shuhang frowned. It was a familiar yet unfamiliar feeling, a dangerous one.","Heavenly Tribulation Realm... the space where Profound Sages transcend their tribulation.","These words flashed through Song Shuhang’s mind like shooting stars.","In the next moment, he disappeared with the petite fairy.","“I bless you in the name of White,” murmured the white horse.","Although its blessing might have some side effects, it would still increase the odds of Tyrannical Song’s survival.","??????","Song Shuhang, Sixteen, and Sister White Dragon appeared in a dark, chaotic world.","...","Sixteen asked, “What is this place?”","Song Shuhang said, “The world where Profound Sages transcend their tribulation. Only those who are at the Seventh Stage or above will be pulled into this space.”","Sister White Dragon said with a stifled heart, “This is the worst outcome.”","Song Shuhang tried to comfort her, “Sister Scarf, don’t be afraid. Although I have lost my memory, I feel that I am familiar with this space. We can survive.”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","While they were speaking, the dark space changed.","Flashes of lightning came from all directions. Soon, there was a sea of lightning all around Song Shuhang and Sixteen.","The vast sea of lightning was full of destructive power, and each arc of lightning had the power to tear apart Sixth Stage practitioners.","The two of them seemed to be trapped on an island in the middle of the sea, surrounded by sharks of lightning.","Song Shuhang gasped.","This was no fun at all!","...","The sea of lightning churned, and something very scary seemed to be brewing in its depths.","“What do we do?” Sixteen subconsciously stretched out her hand and held onto Song Shuhang’s arm. She was afraid that this kind-looking boy would lose his calm and charge into the lightning sea.","Therefore, she pulled onto his arm to prevent him from doing something reckless.","Song Shuhang looked at the petite fairy and smiled slightly, “Don’t worry. I’m here.”","After smiling, he looked at the shining armor intent on his arm.","Armor was great as it could defend its owner from all directions without any lapses.","But sometimes, it could stand coldly between people and hinder mutual connections between them. During interpersonal communication, wrapping yourself in thick armor made it impossible to have a true confidant or a friend!","Because of that, Song Shuhang really wanted to remove his armor.","But after glancing at the sea of lightning that surrounded them on all sides, he gave up on this thought.","Song Shuhang said softly, “Stay here. I’ll test the power of this sea.”","He cracked his neck and got ready to go surfing in the sea of lightning."]},{"number":2154,"title":"Chapter 2154 His back","paragraphs":["2154 His back","Sister Scarf reminded him, “Don’t be impulsive. Inside this Heavenly Tribulation Realm, a random bolt of lightning can kill a Sixth Stage cultivator.”","This honest-faced little friend was transcending a Seventh Stage heavenly tribulation, so he should be at the peak of the Sixth Stage.","Sixteen hugged Song Shuhang’s arm tightly.","According to Murphy’s Law, whatever could go wrong will go wrong. She was worried that the young man would do something reckless, and the young man really did start acting reckless.","“Don’t worry. I’ve got this under control.” Song Shuhang stretched out his palm and gently touched the petite fairy’s head. “I will come back safely and get you out of this Heavenly Tribulation Realm. Sorry for getting you involved in this mess.”","Then, he held the petite girl up by her armpits and moved her aside.","Sixteen: “...”","Song Shuhang stood up and strode toward the lightning sea.","He walked very boldly, showing his broad and strong back to the petite fairy maiden.","A back just like that of a father.","It was not that Song Shuhang wanted to be a fatherly figure for the petite fairy, but he felt that his back would definitely give her a sense of security.","Behind him, Sixteen looked helplessly at the heroic visage of the young man and the 123 holy apes floating above his head.","Honestly speaking, the young man looked somewhat like a balloon salesman with ape-shaped balloons hovering above his head. Even a dangerous place like the Heavenly Tribulation Realm could not be taken seriously with this kind of scene.","Sister White Dragon silently wrapped herself around Sixteen. Although she was attached to this petite girl, she could not interfere too much during the heavenly tribulation; otherwise, she might end up increasing the strength of the tribulation.","Sister White Dragon was still different from the virtuous lamia.","The power of virtue that made up the virtuous lamia’s body was accumulated by Song Shuhang little by little, and it belonged to him alone. Therefore, in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, the virtuous lamia could fully display her power. By the judgment of the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, she and Song Shuhang were a single entity.","As for Sister White Dragon, she was classified as the “Ancestral Golden Dragon.” Therefore, the Heavenly Tribulation Realm would not regard her as the same as Sixteen, and she had to pay attention to her actions.","??????","After a few steps, Song Shuhang arrived at the sea of lightning.","He bent down and stretched out his hand to feel out the crackling tribulation lightning as if to get used to the temperature of the wa... Er, to get used to the intensity of the lightning.","Just as he imagined, the tribulation lightning that Sister Scarf said could destroy a Sixth Stage cultivator in a single blow was harmless to him. With his treasured armor protecting him, his hand didn’t even become numb.","How disappointing.","After some pondering, Shuhang got up and stepped into the sea of lightning, his eyes staring deep into the sea.","There, he saw something that made him feel threatened.","He headed toward the source of that threatening feeling to stop the heavenly tribulation that was brewing in the depths of the sea from reaching the petite fairy.","After taking one step into the sea of lightning, Song Shuhang paused for a moment to make sure there was no problem before continuing onward.","He was bold, but he did not lose his caution.","He slowly waded his way through the sea of lightning.","I can’t go on like this. Is there any better way to move through this sea of lightning? What if I surf on the waves? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","As that thought flashed through his mind, a surfboard-shaped object appeared beside him.","It was a shield made of a turtle shell.","Moreover, he could feel that there was a blood connection between him and the shield.","Similar to the virtuous lamia, this surfboard... Er, shield would flicker from time to time. It was as if its existence was somewhat unstable.","“Hahaha, of course! Since I’m a tank that specializes in defense, how can I not have a shield? This should be my life-bound magical treasure.” Song Shuhang grabbed the large shield.","With a shield in hand, he felt greatly reassured.","With this shield... There is nothing in this sea of tribulation lightning that can hurt me!","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and placed the shield on the surface of the sea. Afterward, he jumped up on it.","“Go!” Song Shuhang snapped his fingers.","Above his head, 123 holy apes stretched out their hands and snapped their fingers as well.","Everything was neat, which gave it a more serious vibe.","The large turtle shell shield carried Song Shuhang over the vast lightning sea.","Claps of thunder boomed all around him, and bolts of lightning continuously crackled beneath the turtle shell, but none of this hurt Song Shuhang, who was standing on the large shield.","The lightning sea seemed to be enraged by this.","Pillars and nets of lightning emerged from the sea and sharp spears of lightning rained down from the sky.","The world became rife with traps and attacks coming from all directions.","Song Shuhang, who was on the turtle shell shield, nimbly avoided the traps and swiftly made his way through the endless sea of lightning.","He was really surfing on lightning!","“What a pity... I thought that I could fly on a sword, but I did not expect to be a shield cultivator. It seems like I can only fly on a shield.” Song Shuhang controlled the pace of the giant shield with his mind.","But shield cultivators are also good.","Although they are not as handsome as sword cultivators when flying through the sky, when it comes to surfing, sword cultivators come nowhere close in style to shield cultivators!","At this time, the only thing missing is background music! Song Shuhang thought to himself.","As his thoughts flashed through his mind, the virtuous lamia and another fairy maiden quietly appeared.","One of the fairies was holding a lute—a treasure from the Throne of Wealth Distribution.","The other fairy maiden had her tail wrapped around a zither—one of the magical treasures of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure.","...","In the next moment, a beautiful melody sounded.","The 123 holy apes sang with deep voices along with the sound of the zither. The true dragons wrapped around their necks chimed in with their dragon roars.","The Ape Dragon Lamia Choir responded to their master’s call.","Amidst the passionate melody of the zither and the chorus, Song Shuhang steered the turtle shell shield and headed to the depths of the lightning sea.","??????","In the island-shaped safe area of the lightning sea, Sixteen silently watched the hardheaded boy surf over the lightning sea.","Sixteen asked curiously, “Sister, what does he want to do?”","She could see that this young man did not simply want to surf on the lightning sea.","“His target might be the heavenly tribulation brewing at the center of the lightning sea. It seems like he wants to test its strength.” Sister White Dragon guessed Song Shuhang’s goal.","Sixteen frowned and said, “Isn’t that too dangerous?”","Sister White Dragon said, “Don’t worry. I will pull him back if it gets too dangerous. I can’t take the initiative to resist the heavenly tribulation, but I can still provide some assistance.”","...","Sixteen asked, “Can we survive this heavenly tribulation?”","Sister White Dragon fell silent.","Question: Could a soon-to-be Venerable and a soon-to-be Spiritual Emperor survive an Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation?","The normal answer to that would be: In your dreams!","Under normal circumstances, unless it was a dream, it was impossible for such a combination of cultivators to survive an Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation.","However, that was under normal circumstances.","Sister White Dragon looked at the boy surfing the lightning Sea.","This boy was anything but normal."]},{"number":2155,"title":"Chapter 2155 Live or die together","paragraphs":["2155 Live or die together","Song Shuhang rode the wind and the waves, carrying with him his Holy Ape Choir, the virtuous lamia, and Fairy Creation as he headed to the depths of the lightning sea.","Eventually, he caught sight of the heavenly tribulation that had made him feel threatened.","There was a huge ball of lightning in the depths of the sea, and beneath this lightning ball was a palm made of tribulation clouds.","The scene gave him a familiar feeling, and he could not help but glance at the palm.","Above his head, the virtuous lamia sang while playing the zither, “Lightning~ Palm~”","“Nonsense.” Song Shuhang pointed at the huge lightning ball ahead of him and said, “How could a Lightning Palm be so big?”","The tribulation lightning unceasingly gathered around the huge palm. If this continued, the power of this Lightning Palm would become high enough to instantly wipe out a city.","Just as if it had sensed Song Shuhang’s aura, the hand made of tribulation clouds rose up and aimed at him. In the palm of this hand, a terrifying lightning ball crackled.","Then, as if a chain reaction had been set off, hands made of tribulation clouds emerged from the sea of lightning one after the other. Each of these hands was as large as a pillar, and they all locked onto Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang: “...”","If so many giant palms were to slap me at the same time, even if I was made of steel, I would be scorched black.","The atmosphere became heavy.","The music of the two fairies came to a halt, and the 123 holy apes also stopped singing.","The giant hands that had risen out of the sea did not attack Song Shuhang immediately. They simply locked onto him and started gathering strength.","After about three breaths of time, above Song Shuhang’s head, the two fairy maidens began playing again.","It was an ensemble consisting of a zither and a lute.","However, the style of the music had changed; it was no longer a passionate melody but rather a sad and familiar tune.","Even Song Shuhang, who had lost his memory, felt as if he had heard this tune somewhere.","What the two fairy maidens were playing was funeral music.","When a person was being laid to rest and lowered into their grave, it was customary in numerous places to arrange a band to play and sing on the side. The band would play mournful music as the dead were sent into the grave where they would have their final rest.","What the two fairies were playing at this moment was exactly the kind of music that would be played during those times.","Their only regret was that they only had string instruments. They lacked the sad tones that were brought about by wind instruments, and this resulted in the sad atmosphere brought about by their playing to be rather lacking.","Under the leadership of the large holy ape, the holy apes lowered their voices and sang dirges with sad tones.","In the future, if Song Shuhang were to truly die, he would not only have brought his own gravestone with him, but even his personal band of scholarly apes to play and sing for his funeral.","He would not need to trouble anyone else to take care of his death.","??????","As if stimulated by the sorrowful music, the tribulation hands slapped fiercely at Song Shuhang despite not being at the height of their power.","Song Shuhang hastily stretched out his hand to lift up the turtle shell shield. After all, his purpose of entering the depths of the lightning sea alone was to test the power of the heavenly tribulation that was brewing there.","“There are too many Lightning Palms. Is there any way to get rid of a few of them?” Song Shuhang mused. With him having come here to investigate the strength of the tribulation, he only needed to withstand one Lightning Palm.","As this thought flashed through his mind, the eight nascent souls in his dantian moved as if they had received a command.","The seven little nascent souls raised their hands, and seven life wheels appeared in their hands.","The serrated blades wheel, broadswords wheel, metal pages wheel, spiraling swords ball wheel, interlocked gears wheel, thread wheel, and the seemingly ordinary octagonal wheel were all summoned.","The seven life wheels shot out toward the giant Lightning Palms.","At the same time, the life wheel of his original dantian materialized on the top of Song Shuhang’s head. It was a bristly cannon wheel that looked like a crown of sorts, and it was a long-range life wheel.","Life wheels were different from magical techniques, and they were considered an innate attack. Even if Song Shuhang lost his memory, as long as the thought of attacking appeared in his mind, his life wheel would automatically appear. It followed the same principles as the Lotus Blossoming Steps, which was an innate skill.","The life wheels, a means of attack unique to cultivators at the Sixth Stage Realm, were enhanced by Shuhang’s nascent souls.","Moreover, the phantom of thirty-three magical treasures appeared behind every life wheel. It was the projection of Song Shuhang’s life-bound magical treasure, which further enhanced the life wheels.","After these two buffs, the life wheels unleashed power far exceeding that of the Sixth Stage.","The giant palms, which acted prematurely, each possessed a might equivalent to a full-strength strike of a Seventh Stage Venerable.","The life wheels swiftly cut through the air and slashed apart the giant Lightning Palms. At the same time, the bristly cannon wheel above Song Shuhang’s head opened fire, destroying these giant palms that had been sliced in half.","After the life wheels concluded their onslaught, a single Lightning Palms was left, exactly what Song Shuhang wanted.","“Boom~”","The giant Lightning Palm, which was deliberately left intact, slapped Song Shuhang and hit the turtle shell shield.","Song Shuhang remained motionless.","The power of the Lightning Palm was completely blocked by the turtle shell, and the numbing effect of the lightning was also useless.","Song Shuhang shook his hands. He had obtained a general understanding of the power of the Heavenly Tribulation Lightning Palm.","If it’s just that, I should be able to survive it as long as I’m careful, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","As long as the heavenly tribulation does not mutate, I should not have much to—","When he was halfway through his thought...","“F*ck!” Song Shuhang cussed and hugged his turtle shell shield tightly.","There was a sudden change in the lightning sea.","This heavenly tribulation had deviated from its normal route.","All the energy in the lightning sea condensed in the blink of an eye.","It was as if a black hole had suddenly appeared in the lightning sea.","...","It was possible that the heavenly tribulation had come to believe that it was a waste of time to go through the standard procedure. As such, it directly went from the opening scenes to the finale.","All of the power of the Heavenly Tribulation Realm gathered for one final tribulation.","The final tribulation—the invisible death tribulation.","In the early period of the ancient era, if the cultivator transcending the Profound Sage Tribulation was too lively, there was a small chance that they would trigger this tribulation.","This tribulation was not a physical or magical attack, neither was it an inner demon.","It was an attack that made use of the power of laws.","In addition, there was another prerequisite for this tribulation to appear.","The cultivators that it targeted were those who were favored by the heavens and had already come into contact with a “path” while they were still in the Seventh Stage.","For example, when Scarlet Heaven was in the Venerable Realm, he had already comprehended the path that he would tread in the future and had begun to lay the foundation for it.","Only those who transcended the tribulation and carried the aura of a path would be able to trigger this tribulation.","The invisible death tribulation turned into a black light, shining on Song Shuhang. The light passed through Song Shuhang’s body and shone on Sixteen, who was in the distance.","...","An ominous light connected the two.","They would either live or die together.","??????","In the meantime.","The white horse, who was outside the fog, let out a sigh of relief.","Its body began to dissipate into countless particles.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword, who had been in its stomach all along, fell to the ground."]},{"number":2156,"title":"Chapter 2156 Sitting on the throne of torment","paragraphs":["2156 Sitting on the throne of torment","“I did not disappear with it...” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword was taken aback.","The tip of its blade was stuck in the sand, and the hot wind and sand crashed against its body.","After a long while, it breathed out a sigh of relief. “That liar scared me to death.”","It thought that it would truly disappear together with the white horse. As a “selfish” inner demon, it did not like the feeling.","!!","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword slowly floated into the air.","“I didn’t disappear,” it murmured.","It obviously did not disappear with White Horse, so why did it feel like there were knots in its heart?","Am I sad about the horse’s death?","“No, wait a minute.” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword’s consciousness swept over the fog. The kind-faced man and the petite fairy maiden had not come out yet. In other words, the heavenly tribulation had yet to conclude.","However, the white horse had already disappeared.","We’ve been had by that white horse!","??????","Inside the tribulation-transcending space.","Song Shuhang continued to hold the turtle shell shield high, unable to move.","The black light of death shot through his chest, freezing his movements.","Spots of gray-colored death aura emerged on his body, radiating a rotten aura as they spread.","The final tribulation—invisible death.","This kind of direct application of the concept of “death” was truly insidious.","If a cultivator failed to free themselves of this tribulation, they would be shrouded in death aura and die.","This kind of death was eternal, and even resurrection magical treasures would not help as cultivators who died under the invisible death tribulation were classified as people that died of old age, causing them to fail to meet the conditions for resurrection.","Behind him, Sixteen was also frozen in place.","The black light of death that came out of Song Shuhang’s back passed through her heart.","The aura of death enveloped Sixteen, causing her skin to lose color.","Sister White Dragon was extremely anxious. This final tribulation had come too suddenly, and she was powerless to stop it.","Now, Song Shuhang and Sixteen could only rely on themselves.","Sister White Dragon could only wait and see if their luck, will, and vitality got them past this tribulation.","??????","“Aaahhh!” Song Shuhang suddenly shouted.","While shrouded by an aura of death, his mind and body were dealt a heavy blow.","The severe pain evoked a part of Song Shuhang’s memory; it was a small piece of memory where he was dying nonstop.","However, a brutal death could never frighten a true warrior.","The virtuous lamia, who was still playing the zither, performed a beautiful somersault and returned to Song Shuhang’s body, and Fairy Creation followed suit.","The incomparably vast power of virtue was fully activated.","When transcending the tribulation, the power of virtue was a panacea. No matter what kind of tribulation it was, the light of virtue could always help.","After the light of virtue erupted, it began to fight against the death aura, slowing down the speed at which it was engulfing Song Shuhang’s body.","On the mental side, the “fear of death” brought about by the invisible death tribulation didn’t affect Song Shuhang in the slightest.","At the same time, under the stimulation of the death aura, a powerful vitality was activated deep within Song Shuhang’s body.","This was a vitality that did not belong to ordinary cultivators but only to those who had survived the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation.","When the Tribulation Transcender Vitality was stimulated, the gray death aura shrouding Song Shuhang’s body was quickly suppressed and expelled.","Song Shuhang slowly opened his eyes. His kind face looked especially heroic at this moment.","“Today must be my lucky day,” Song Shuhang murmured. He was really lucky to have been able to survive the invisible tribulation.","His luck today was great for some reason.","??????","Sixteen, who had also been hit by the black light of death, was influenced by Song Shuhang’s actions.","Their life and death were interconnected, so Song Shuhang having gained the upper hand against the invisible death tribulation relieved a lot of her pressure.","Not only that, it seemed that the “luck” that Song Shuhang had was passed on to her as well.","A hazy white light emerged from Sixteen’s body. This was a combination of the power of virtue, dragon energy, the luck of the Su Clan, and this special luck coming from Shuhang.","Sister White Dragon assisted her in guiding this white light, leading it to fight the death aura.","Inside Sixteen’s body, a special kind of vitality also began to emerge.","That was the vitality from being extremely close to death and then being reborn.","It was like when spring came for a withered tree.","Song Shuhang’s Tribulation Transcender Vitality resonated with Sixteen’s vitality, and they joined forces in resisting the invisible death tribulation.","The invisible death tribulation, which could scare even the most talented of cultivators, was steadily pushed back and lost all face.","No matter whether it was Song Shuhang or Sixteen, deep down in their hearts, they did not let themselves be bound by the fear of death, and this greatly reduced the effectiveness of the invisible death tribulation.","...","The tribulation gradually began to weaken.","This law-level attack that made use of the power of the entire Eight Stage tribulation could not last for too long.","After four breaths of time, the pitch-black light began to dissolve.","The invisible death tribulation had ended.","I can no longer sense the aura of the heavenly tribulation.","The heavenly tribulation is over!","Song Shuhang finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Today, he, Tyrannical Song, survived again.","It was thanks to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation ultimately turning into the invisible death tribulation that he was able to smoothly transcend this tribulation.","“The heavenly tribulation has ended. Sister Scarf, we can now leave this Heavenly Tribulation Realm, right?” Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at the petite fairy behind him.","When he saw her figure, he was startled.","...","Sixteen stood in place stiffly, a hole in her chest.","When that pitch-black light pierced through his and the petite fairy’s body, it wounded them.","Song Shuhang had a bad feeling. He looked down at his chest, and there he saw another hole.","However, the wound didn’t cause him any pain.","Song Shuhang did not panic and calmly voiced out his guess. “Is this an aftereffect of that black light just now?”","The petite fairy stretched out her finger and touched the hole in her chest. She nodded and replied, “It should be. It looks like my heart was pierced through.”","While speaking, her body suddenly fell backward.","Song Shuhang immediately went over and supported her.","At the same time, he stretched out his hand into the air, and a strange throne emerged before him.","The throne was built from the bones of an unknown creature, and stuck into it were twelve eerie-looking black blades.","A ghastly fire circled the throne.","On the whole, it looked like a throne that a large undead boss in a fantasy game would have.","On the seat of the throne, there were bone spurs growing all over, the longest bone spur was even as long as a finger.","Song Shuhang sat on the throne without hesitation while holding the petite fairy in his arms."]},{"number":2157,"title":"Chapter 2157 Sorry to have disturbed you, goodbye","paragraphs":["2157 Sorry to have disturbed you, goodbye","Due to his memory loss, Song Shuhang could not remember at all why he had such a weird and scary magical treasure.","This throne was not cruel to the enemy but to oneself.","However, Song Shuhang did not think too much about it, and he instinctively summoned this throne at this critical moment.","His intuition told him that this throne could come in handy. In the world of cultivation, strange magical treasures often had very special purposes.","!!","As long as this throne could help him and the petite fairy maiden, then he had nothing to hesitate about!","Faced with the throne covered in bone spurs, Song Shuhang was not afraid. After all, he was wearing armor!","With the armor on, he wasn’t scared of those bone spurs.","But as he sat on the throne, Tyrannical Song hissed.","Severe pain assaulted his nerves. The pain he was experiencing was something that mere words could not describe.","While enduring the pain, he supported the petite fairy maiden in his arms and observed her condition.","The effect of the throne turned out to be amazing.","The heartless fairy maiden’s conditions improved right away, and the same was true for Song Shuhang.","The feeling of air passing through his chest disappeared, and he no longer felt cold.","The two sat motionless on the scary throne.","Sister Scarf asked, “What kind of magical treasure is this throne?”","Song Shuhang said, “I don’t know, but what I know is that it’s useful right now. When I sat on this throne, my wounds stopped worsening.”","This throne had the effect of preserving one’s life.","No matter how grave one’s injury was, as long as they sat on it, they could keep living.","“It’s working on me as well,” said Sixteen. Although she was sitting on Tyrannical Song’s lap, the throne was working on her. Perhaps due to her occupying a relatively small area, when she sat with Tyrannical Song, they counted as one.","“The only problem is that I can’t stand up now,” Song Shuhang said in a deep voice. As soon as he left this brutal throne, its effect would be lost.","While he was fine and the hole in his chest was slowly recovering, probably due to the self-recovery effects of the several body-tempering cultivation techniques that he practiced, the heart of the fairy maiden in his arms was showing no signs of recovery.","After the hole in his chest healed, the petite fairy would have to sit on the throne by herself.","Song Shuhang said, “Anyway, let’s leave this damned place first.”","As long as he could preserve his life and get out of this tribulation-transcending space, he could find a way to heal the petite fairy’s heart.","Sister White Dragon replied, “If you want to leave, you might have to do another thing.”","She vaguely remembered that there should be a very important step after the Eighth Stage tribulation.","“There’s another step? Is the tribulation not over yet?” Song Shuhang frowned and fell into thought. After Sister Scarf mentioned it, he recalled that there indeed seemed to be a follow-up step.","From what I can remember, it should be a very exciting step.","“From my fragmented memory, I remember that the next step should be the part where you harvest your rewards, and there won’t be much danger.” Sister White Dragon scratched her chin with her little claws.","As long as you don’t seek death, that is.","Song Shuhang asked, “Then when will the next step take place?”","Sister White Dragon replied, “Just wait. Don’t rush things.”","Song Shuhang gritted his teeth. “I’m not in a hurry. It’s just that staying like this hurts.”","The throne under him constantly inflicted pain on him.","This was the price of preserving his life.","??????","The waiting time was rather long.","When playing games or indulging in entertainment, an hour flew in the blink of an eye. But when one was purely waiting, a minute would feel like an hour.","Song Shuhang leaned against the throne of torment, enduring the pain.","The guy who invented this throne was a sadist!","To preserve your life, you have to sit on this throne while waves of pain constantly assault your senses. How many people can even bear this kind of pain?!","While he was in thought...","Song Shuhang found out that his body was adapting to this pain.","Accept the pain, adapt to the pain, then ignore the pain!","I already knew that I have a very strong pain tolerance. However, isn’t my ability to accept pain and adapt to it a bit too strong? Song Shuhang felt a sense of unease in his heart.","What kind of person was I before losing my memory?","Why am I so adept at adapting to pain?","This is no longer something that can be explained by being a simple “tank”...","As time passed, Song Shuhang discovered even more terrifying things.","He... began to enjoy the pain.","The tingling sensation gradually started feeling like a massage.","The muscles of his body began to signal to the brain that they were enjoying this feeling.","The cruel throne seemed to have become a massage chair.","This is definitely not a normal ability! Song Shuhang became a little flustered.","...","It was likely that this ability would let people misunderstand him.","Therefore, he absolutely could not let the petite fairy maiden and Sister Scarf find out that he was now enjoying the pain.","Thinking this, Song Shuhang began to take deep breaths from time to time and let out gasps of pain.","Every time he hissed, the fairy maiden felt a twinge of pain in her nonexistent heart.","She stretched out her hand and tightly held onto Song Shuhang’s hand.","Song Shuhang hissed in a timely manner.","Behind him, the lamia’s dictionary was quietly updated.","??????","After an unknown length of time, Song Shuhang’s consciousness became somewhat hazy due to the “massage chair” he was sitting on.","As it continued to poke him, he started feeling drowsy, even forgetting to keep hissing from time to time.","He subconsciously leaned his head against the blades of two sharp knives.","...","At this time, the efficacy of his body-tempering techniques was displayed.","His head was as hard as iron, and the sharp blades failed to hurt Song Shuhang’s scalp in the slightest.","And then, he fell asleep.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","And you were hissing until a moment ago!","??????","While drifting in the world of dreams, Song Shuhang found himself at the center of a huge vortex.","There was an upside-down staircase in the vortex, like a world in a mirror.","He found the place awfully familiar.","After some thought, Shuhang jumped into the vortex.","As he did so, the upside-down staircase turned into a huge pyramid.","Song Shuhang walked up the large steps of the pyramid.","After some time, a wooden door appeared in front of his eyes.","It was a very ordinary wooden door without any decoration. There were not even any runes or carvings on it.","Song Shuhang reached out and pushed the door open.","“You’re here.” Behind the door, a young man with three eyes smiled at him. “I’ve been waiting for you to come again. Come, let’s hold another betting match and gamble everything!”","Gambling?","Gambling is not a good thing!","“Sorry to have disturbed you, goodbye.” Song Shuhang cupped his fists, turned around, and closed the wooden door behind him."]},{"number":2158,"title":"Chapter 2158 Warehouse cleaner","paragraphs":["2158 Warehouse cleaner","Although his memory was a mess, the concept that gambling was something bad still existed in Song Shuhang’s mind.","So, when he heard the three-eyed young man say that he wanted to make a bet with him, Song Shuhang chose to leave without hesitation.","Drugs and gambling were vices that people should not stick to in their lives.","Seeing that Song Shuhang was about to leave, the three-eyed young man said anxiously, “Wait a minute! Stop!”","However, Song Shuhang had already closed the wooden door behind him.","The three-eyed young man was left speechless.","He was now sure that there was something wrong with Tyrannical Song’s head.","That being the case, he had no choice but to use his trump card.","The three-eyed young man said enticingly, “Tyrannical Song, come back here and let’s have a good talk. Didn’t you say you wanted to become a cleaner of my warehouse? Let’s sit down and talk about it. I might give you a chance.”","At present, there was barely any garbage in his warehouse, so even if Tyrannical Song did become a cleaner, he was doomed to get nothing.","On the other side of the wooden door, Song Shuhang wore a puzzled look.","I wanted to apply for a warehouse cleaner job here?","What was going on with me before I lost my memory?","He suffered from a fear of heights and “enjoyed” pain, and when he applied for a job as a cleaner, he was rejected.","Song Shuhang felt that his self before the memory loss was very unreliable, and that he would probably be better off without remembering his past.","After thinking about it for a while, he turned around and pushed open the wooden door.","It was not because he wanted to apply for the position of warehouse cleaner, but rather because the three-eyed young man seemed to know his previous self.","The three-eyed young man was sitting on a chair, a cup in his hand. He had a weary expression on his face that made him look like an old man.","Song Shuhang looked at him carefully.","On the young man’s ears, there were two eye-shaped gemstones. And on his finger, there was a ring with a gemstone, also eye-shaped.","It didn’t stop there. In the world behind the wooden door, decorations based on “eyes” could be seen everywhere.","Even the servant serving tea was a strange-looking eyeball!","In short, there were eyes everywhere.","Song Shuhang shivered. He discovered that he felt some apprehension toward eyeballs.","“Senior, may I know your name?” Song Shuhang cupped his fists at the three-eyed young man.","Even though he looks like a young man, he’s definitely some old senior.","“I can’t tell you my name or my origin. However, know that I’m not targeting you but rather the whole world.” The three-eyed young man blew on his tea and wore a light smile as he spoke.","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Judging from your silly look, there seems to be something wrong with your memory.” The third eye on the young man’s forehead glanced at Song Shuhang, while the corners of his mouth curled up.","“Yeah.” Song Shuhang nodded slightly.","I should not speak much since I’ve lost my memory. The more I speak, the more mistakes I’ll make.","The three-eyed young man said cheerfully, “Sit down, no need to be so reserved. This new you with amnesia is much more interesting than your previous self.”","The servant beside the young man offered Song Shuhang a cup of immortal tea.","Song Shuhang took the teacup and said, “Thank you.”","Shuhang also felt that this new version of him was a lot more promising than the previous one.","The three-eyed young man explained briefly, “Since you’ve lost your memory, I’ll go straight to the point and explain what’s happening. This is my world, and the flight of steps outside is known as the Throne of Wealth Distribution. You and I had an agreement. After stepping into the Sixth, Seventh, Eighth, and Ninth Stages, you would get a chance to have a betting match with me. Now, you are already in the process of ascending to the Seventh Stage, and if you go through with it, you’ll lose the chance you got when you reached the Sixth Stage to have a bet with me. So, do you want to make a bet with me now?”","Song Shuhang subconsciously said, “I have no money.”","The three-eyed young man said, “I don’t want vulgar things like money.”","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up, and he blurted out, “Senior, if you have any money you don’t want, you can just throw it to me.”","The three-eyed young man: “...”","“I’m sorry. My memory is a blur right now, and I can’t control myself well. Please forgive me,” Song Shuhang coughed and apologized.","He was facing a strange big shot. What if he were to overstep his bounds and ended up getting himself killed?","A real man should know when to bow down!","The three-eyed young man took a sip of his tea and said slowly, “In my world, as long as something is valuable, it can be used as a stake for the gambling.”","“But I don’t seem to have any treasures on me. I do have a lot of apes, though.” Song Shuhang snapped his fingers and 123 holy apes with scholarly clothing and true dragons wrapped around their necks appeared above his head.","The three-eyed young man nodded and said, “Are these the holy ape projections of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?? Sure, you can use them for the bet. And your 123 holy apes are obviously mutated versions, so I can give you a high value for them.”","Although he never left the world behind the wooden door, the young man had many means to collect information from the outside world. As a result, he knew about the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? of the Beast Realm.","“For real?” Song Shuhang was bewildered. Although he had lost his memory, he could tell that these holy apes were just projections. They were merely the manifestation of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? he practiced.","In a way, they were just his knowledge in regard to the cultivation technique. How was he supposed to bet something so abstract?","The three-eyed young man said slowly, “As long as you are willing, we can bet everything in these matches. I can even strip away things like chef hearts and sword intent, let alone your holy ape projections.”","After thinking for a while, Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “Although these apes are pretty nasty, I’m not really willing to stake them in a betting match.”","The three-eyed young man smiled and said, “Even after losing your memory, you haven’t changed.”","Song Shuhang said embarrassedly, “Senior, I don’t think I have anything worth betting. I’m afraid I’ll have to miss the opportunity to bet with you during the Sixth Stage.”","The three-eyed young man said suddenly, “I really like that eyeball in your left eye socket.”","...","Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback.","The eyeball in my left eye socket?","Can eyeballs also be used as a stake?","Just as Song Shuhang was in thought, a hand stretched out of his eye.","The hand spread open, and in its palm were two beautiful eyeballs that looked as if they were made of lustrous glass.","Those were Song Shuhang’s eyeballs.","While he was regrowing his physical body with the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, Fairy Creation had plucked out his eyeballs to use them as spares.","Fairy Creation would definitely not let Shuhang use the Sage’s eye, which resided in his left eye socket, for the bet.","Therefore, she brought out Song Shuhang’s spare eyes.","The three-eyed young man looked at the pair of eyes in the fairy’s hand, thought for a while, and said, “These eyes are quite interesting. The mysteries of the General Principles Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? are hidden within them. They are barely qualified to be a part of my collection.”","..."]},{"number":2159,"title":"Chapter 2159 Are you misunderstanding what luck is?","paragraphs":["2159 Are you misunderstanding what luck is?","Aren’t those my eyeballs? Song Shuhang’s divine sense swept over the pair of eyeballs.","I didn’t think that they could become gambling chips.","Doesn’t that mean that they are very valuable?","In the future, could I make a living by selling my eyes?","In an instant, numerous thoughts flashed through Song Shuhang’s mind.","After the three-eyed young man gave his approval, Fairy Creation brought her other hand out of Song Shuhang’s right eye socket and made an OK gesture.","They had reached an agreement.","Afterward, both of her palms retracted into Song Shuhang’s head.","The three-eyed young man nodded and said, “I will prepare some treasures that have the same value as that pair of eyes. You can choose two of them.”","He waved his hand, and a pile of treasures materialized in mid-air before Song Shuhang.","There were magical treasures, medicinal pills, natural treasures, magical techniques, cultivation techniques, secret techniques, and even abstract treasures such as sword intent, rod intent, and fist intent.","Song Shuhang scanned through the pile of treasures, and a familiar-looking pill piqued his interest.","He stretched out his hand to grab the pill. “What is this?”","“It’s a Rebirth Pill, and it’s great for treating injuries. It’s also known as Muscle-Rejuvenating Pill, Recovery Pill, or Regeneration Pill, and it can be used by cultivators at the Sixth Stage or below. Even if a person were to be cut in half, as long as there is still a breath in them, they will heal after taking this pill. This pill is capable of regrowing limbs, but it can’t heal the injuries caused by the heavenly tribulation or similar skills,” the three-eyed young man explained. “If it’s used well, it can save your life as a resurrection magical treasure would.”","Song Shuhang pinched his chin. He felt that he might have eaten something similar in the past.","He asked, “If someone’s heart is gone, can it be regrown by taking this pill?”","The three-eyed young man asked back, “Are you heartbroken after a rejection?”","Song Shuhang: “???”","The young man nodded and said, “Judging from your expression, you aren’t heartbroken. In that case, are you referring to a case where the heart is literally gone? As long as it is not an injury caused by the heavenly tribulation, a heart can be regrown after taking this pill.”","“What a pity,” said Song Shuhang regretfully. The hole in the petite fairy maiden’s chest was caused by the heavenly tribulation, so this pill couldn’t heal it.","He continued to search through the pile of treasures and eventually saw a strange item in the pile.","It was a metal cube projecting a 3D picture.","The 3D picture was that of a simple robot, the kind that might appear when dealing with ATMs and other automated devices.","It was very different from the pills, magical treasures, and secret manuals around it.","And in the world of cultivation, strange things were often very useful.","“What is this?” Song Shuhang curiously grabbed the small metal cube.","The moment his finger touched the cube, the picture projected by the metal cube turned into Song Shuhang’s face.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The young man said, “It’s a magical treasure I recently developed, and it’s still an experimental product. It’s called ‘Real Time Question Answering AI.’ As long as it is provided with a good enough database, it can answer any questions in real time. And, just to remind you, the one you are holding right now is only an ‘extension.’ The value of the real thing is very high, and your eyes won’t be enough to exchange for it.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Experimental product, eh? Does it work?”","His intuition told him that this thing suited him quite well.","This magical treasure might become an integral part of his life going forward.","“It can barely be considered a success,” the three-eyed young man replied. “The problem is that the database is too big, and it is very troublesome to set up. As such, I attached the main server to one of my clones and turned the clone into a sort of database, letting it fill the main server with information.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Why not just let your clone answer the questions? That would be smarter and allow for questions to be answered more accurately!","“That’s why it’s only half a success.” The three-eyed young man sighed.","Song Shuhang decided, “I want it!”","Just the fact that the main server was attached to a clone of the three-eyed young man made it worth it. Through this extension, he could directly contact the clone and thus the young man.","As long as it was properly made use of, it could be very helpful.","The three-eyed young man reminded him, “Good, one of the treasures has now been set to be the Real Time Question Answering AI. Anyway, since you only have an extension, it will be disconnected from the main server after each use. You’ll need to come here to have the connection reestablished.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Do magical treasures really work this way?","The young man asked, “What other treasure do you want?”","After some thought, Song Shuhang chose the Rebirth Pill. This pill was precious, and if used well, it could have the same effect as a resurrection magical treasure.","Although he could not use it himself, it would be very cost-effective whether he sold it for money or used it for his juniors.","The young man said gently, “Then, we have an agreement. It’s time for the unlimited gambling phase. To maximize the excitement, every gamble would absolutely be fair.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“How do you want to challenge me this time? I decided the game last time, so it’s your turn to choose,” the three-eyed young man said. “To keep it fair, I’ll set my realm, strength and mental energy to be equal to yours.”","This would make the game way more exciting!","Song Shuhang thought for a while and remembered his ability to “enjoy pain.”","“How about we bet on who can endure more pain?” Song Shuhang suggested with a look of expectation.","The three-eyed young man’s face froze, and he waved his hand violently. “Tyrannical Song, life requires creativity! Last time we played a game involving pain tolerance, so this time we must play something else. We should not bet on who can endure more pain every time.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","After thinking about it, he remembered his weird ‘luck’ today.","...","“Then, how about a simple bet on who is luckier?” Song Shuhang suggested.","The things he was using as gambling chips were his spare eyes.","It would be best if he could win, but it wouldn’t really hurt him if he lost.","“You want to see who is luckier? Are you sure?” The three-eyed young man looked at Song Shuhang with a half-smile.","Song Shuhang nodded. “I’m sure.”","“How are we going to compare our luck?” The three-eyed young man was full of confidence. Whether it was a game of Morra, or the throw of a dice or coin, he believed that he was sure to win.","After thinking for a while, Song Shuhang suggested, “Why don’t we completely seal the spiritual energy in our bodies and apply magical techniques to weaken our physical strength? Hmm... Right, we should also add a formation that applies a random acceleration to our bodies before jumping from a height of 10,000 meters. Whoever comes out with fewer injuries after falling to the ground is the winner.”","The three-eyed young man: “...”","What kind of shitty way of testing luck is this?!","Are you misunderstanding what luck is?","..."]},{"number":2160,"title":"Chapter 2160 A game without a true winner","paragraphs":["2160 A game without a true winner","A few minutes later...","Two figures stood above the clouds at an altitude of 10,000 meters, overlooking the scenery below.","The three-eyed young man asked, “Are you ready?”","Song Shuhang nodded.","!!","He seemed to be mumbling something, and the beats “one two three four, two two three four” could be heard vaguely.","The three-eyed young man coughed lightly and said, “In twenty seconds, all of our means to fly will stop working, your Lotus Blossoming Steps included.”","“The ten seals on our bodies will completely seal our spiritual energy, and even power of virtue will become unusable.","“And the curse of weakness I personally crafted will weaken our physique to a very interesting level.","“There is also the random acceleration formation, whose acceleration will change every fifteen seconds ranging from 2x acceleration to 11x acceleration. Who will fall to the ground first and who will receive fewer injuries will be left up to luck!”","The three-eyed young man had ultimately agreed to Song Shuhang’s proposal.","Although he felt that Song Shuhang had a strange idea of luck, he found the game very exciting, so he did not mind playing it.","As for the result of the bet, he wasn’t worried about it in the slightest, especially since little friend Tyrannical Song was a relatively unlucky person.","The young man planned to enjoy the game and have fun.","Song Shuhang nodded. “No problem.”","“Three... two... one!” The three-eyed young man snapped his fingers.","A layer of golden runes wrapped their bodies, a sign that the bet had started.","At the same time, the seals on their bodies were activated, which negated all of their means to fly.","Song Shuhang and the three-eyed young man fell down from the clouds.","“Aaahhh!” Song Shuhang yelled.","The experience was so exciting that even his mumbling turned into a series of shouts.","Only the heavens knew how, with him being a cultivator, he still had a fear of heights.","“Hahahaha!” The three-eyed young man laughed wildly.","The energy in their bodies was completely sealed, and their strength had been limited to that of a normal human being. When falling from a height of 10,000 meters, even breathing was hard.","This kind of game was really too stimulating.","Why did I not think of such a great game in the past?","This amnesiac version of Tyrannical Song is way more fun than this previous self.","After the two of them had fallen for a few hundred meters, the random acceleration formations on their bodies were activated.","It was time to see who was luckier.","Young Tyrannical Song’s luck seems terrible today. His acceleration will definitely be above 8x. As for me, I feel pretty lucky today, so I should be able to stay below 5x, the three-eyed young man thought to himself.","“Fwoosh!”","The random acceleration formation on his body was activated first, and the 9x acceleration made the three-eyed young man’s face go pale.","Is my luck so bad today?","Still, it doesn’t matter. No matter how unlucky I am, I will definitely be luckier than little friend Tyrannical Song... His luck is usually terrible.","With this thought in mind, the three-eyed young man looked over at Song Shuhang.","The acceleration formation on Song Shuhang’s body had also activated, going straight for that 10x burst.","Haha, just as I expected. The three-eyed young man smiled.","But in the next moment, the light of the acceleration formation on Song Shuhang’s body suddenly dimmed, with the acceleration dropping to 2x.","The three-eyed young man was baffled","What just happened? Why did the acceleration formation go from 10x to 2x?","Since when is little friend Tyrannical Song so lucky?","Perhaps it’s not his luck but some kind of blessing...","His third eye firmly locked onto Song Shuhang.","For a second, he felt as if Song Shuhang’s hair had become soft and silky and grown until his waist. His figure also became slender, while exuding infinite charm.","The three-eyed young man said angrily, “Is he using a luck cheat?”","From the looks of it, little friend Tyrannical Song is affected by a powerful blessing.","With the help of this blessing, his shitty luck has turned around.","The young man wanted to spit at Tyrannical Song for being a vile cheater, but with the difference in acceleration, the distance between them kept widening.","The farthest distance in this world is when you are using 8x acceleration and I chase behind you at 2x acceleration. You move further and further away, and despite trying my best, I will never catch up with you!","This was the tragic difference between 8x and 2x acceleration.","I refuse to believe that the effect of this blessing will last until the end of the betting match! the three-eyed young man thought to himself.","Blessings or prayers that enhanced one’s luck were always temporary as it was impossible to permanently increase someone’s luck.","When the effect of this blessing dissipates, Tyrannical Song’s horrible luck will resurface.","Fifteen seconds later...","The random acceleration formation was reset.","...","The 8x acceleration affecting the three-eyed young man became 9x acceleration.","The 2x acceleration affecting Song Shuhang remained unchanged.","The three-eyed young man: “...”","He felt that he was really unlucky today.","Could it be that Tyrannical Song’s blessing can curse the people around him while blessing him? Or does it allow him to absorb the luck of the people around him?","The three-eyed young man felt that he was onto something.","Another fifteen seconds later...","The three-eyed young man moved up to 10x acceleration, while Song Shuhang moved up to 3x acceleration.","The distance between the two grew larger and larger.","In Song Shuhang’s eyes, the three-eyed young man had turned into a small black dot.","The faster you fall, the worse your death will be, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","...","The winner of the game seemed to have become clear.","“As expected, I am very lucky today,” said Song Shuhang with a nod.","This feeling of being surrounded by luck was wonderful.","“It would be great if I had half of today’s luck every day in the future.”","“Boom~” A loud bang brought an end to the betting match.","The three-eyed young man hit the ground first, leaving a crater in the ground with his 5x acceleration at the time of the impact.","His body, which had been weakened, was seriously damaged.","The three-eyed young man lay in the crater, hissing in pain.","He said softly, “It seems that this body... will have to be sent for maintenance.”","After a while...","“Boom~” Song Shuhang created another crater right beside him.","“I won,” said Song Shuhang tremblingly while lying in the pit.","“Yeah, you won.” The three-eyed young man glanced at Song Shuhang, who looked miserable.","Although Song Shuhang won the bet, there was no true winner in this game as they were both seriously injured.","One suffered a level 50 serious injury, while the other a level 100 serious injury.","“Take them, the pills and the magical treasure. They are yours.” Seeing the seriously injured Song Shuhang, the three-eyed young man’s mood improved a little."]},{"number":2161,"title":"Chapter 2161 @Tyrannical Saber Song One","paragraphs":["2161 @Tyrannical Saber Song One","The bet came to an end, and the three-eyed young man had lost again.","He was so sure to win but ended up losing to the same opponent twice.","The Rebirth Pill and the Real Time Question Answering AI were given to Song Shuhang.","Afterward, Song Shuhang’s consciousness left the Throne of Wealth Distribution.","!!","??????","In the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Song Shuhang, who was still sitting on the cruel throne, suddenly opened his eyes.","Did I just... fall asleep?","Seriously, this massage throne is so comfortable that I got sleepy.","Wait, how long have I been asleep? All this time, I’ve forgotten to scream and pretend to be in pain! Did the petite fairy maiden and the scarf-like sister see through my act?","Song Shuhang quietly wiped the drool at the corner of his mouth and took a look at his chest.","Under the influence of the General Principle Inheritance Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? and another cultivation technique that enhanced his regeneration, the big hole in his chest had almost fully healed. The injury was no longer a problem for him and would not affect him.","Sister Scarf asked with a half-smile, “Are you finally awake?”","Song Shuhang said, “Uh, yeah... I seem to have fainted due to the pain.”","What a great excuse!","Song Shuhang could not help but praise his quick wit.","“Hehehe.” Sister Scarf smiled and said nothing.","Song Shuhang faked a laugh and looked at the petite fairy maiden in his arms.","The hole in her heart had yet to heal.","It seemed that the only way to heal her wound was to wait until she got out of the Heavenly Tribulation Realm. Before that, she would have to keep sitting on the throne to preserve her life.","As if sensing Song Shuhang’s change of mood, the girl stretched out her hand and stroked his palm. “I’m fine. Don’t worry about me.”","Song Shuhang asked, “When can we get out of this place?”","He had even fallen asleep and woken up, but that “next step” had yet to arrive.","Were they going to be forever trapped in this isolated space?","Sister White Dragon said all of a sudden, “It’s coming!”","The next step that they had been waiting for was finally here.","What is the next step of the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation? wondered Shuhang.","??????","Back to the future, it was the evening of November 29, 2019.","All the practitioners across the universe had a strange feeling.","Whether they were cultivators, witches, local deities, sorcerers, or wizards, they all had the same feeling.","“This feeling... Has another person become a Profound Sage?” A handsome scholar looked up to the sky with eyes full of longing.","It might be due to the incoming golden age of cultivation, but after a thousand-year drought, practitioners had been ascending to the Profound Sage Realm in batches during the past six months.","For this reason, even young practitioners knew what this sudden feeling was about.","“Excluding Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s three Divinity Shows and that one Divinity Show from the Netherworld Realm, this should be the twelfth one, right?” a practitioner mused.","In half a year, they had seen 12 Eighth Stage Profound Sages. This number was unheard of even in the ancient era when there was way more spiritual energy.","It seemed that there were many practitioners who had accumulated energy for a long time.","“This time, which system’s practitioner will show their divinity?” Practitioners all over the universe were full of anticipation.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “@Tyrannical Saber Song One, Is little friend Shuhang online or not?”","Fairy Dongfang Six asked curiously, “Old Northern River, why are you summoning Shuhang?”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “[Sighing Emoji] I’m summoning little friend Song to avoid accidents. If he is online, then it is not him who is showing his divinity. But if he isn’t online... Everyone, you have to prepare yourselves mentally.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “...”","Old Northern River’s words were so reasonable that he could say nothing to refute them.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “I’ll try to summon a few other people as well. @White, @Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark, @Frice Reckless Mad Saber.”","After a while...","Fairy Lychee: “Shuhang didn’t respond.”","“He can’t be showing his divinity again, right?” Fairy Dongfang Six rubbed her temples.","Unparalleled Butterfly Fairy (Soft Feather): “Does Senior Song not have any signal? I remember that Senior Song and Senior White went to the Beast Realm together. Senior Skylark and Senior Thrice Reckless seem to have gone to the Beast Realm as well. Maybe it’s just that there’s no signal in the Beast Realm.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain nodded and said, “Soft Feather’s words make sense.”","Soft Feather said seriously, “Senior Yellow Mountain, please call me Unparalleled Butterfly Fairy.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “...”","My friend Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly, you’ve got it hard.","Fellow Daoist When the Bright Moon Appears said, “Eh? Wait a minute... Did you guys notice it as well? There seems to be something wrong with the Divinity Show this time.”","...","It felt as if the Divinity Show was more of a [rebroadcast] rather than a [live broadcast].","It was like receiving the Profound Sage Speech after coming out of seclusion.","Scholar Xian Gong said suddenly, “I just remembered that Senior White has a modified phone that allows him to surf the Internet anytime and anywhere. As such, even in the Beast Realm, Song Shuhang should have a signal.”","Unparalleled Butterfly Fairy (Soft Feather): “Senior Xian Gong, Senior Song’s trip to the Beast Realm involved a secret realm located inside Garre Holy Mountain, and the signal might be blocked there. Also, Seniors, can you send Senior Song a message through his QR code Golden Core? Perhaps he’ll reply that way.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain said, “I’ll try.”","When the Bright Moon Appears: “Did any of you notice what I said? Do I need to spam the same message until I cover the whole screen?”","Somewhere in China.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was drinking tea when his eyes shone brightly—he had caught a glimpse of Fellow Daoist When the Bright Moon Appears’ message.","He scrolled through the chat history and saw his previous message.","“The Profound Sage Divinity Show doesn’t feel right... Yeah, he has a point. It does feel different from a normal Divinity Show.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator raised his head and quietly looked at the sky.","This time, there seemed to be a delay with the Divinity Show.","...","It also gave off the feeling of being a rebroadcast.","It was as if this Divinity Show had been sealed for a long time and was not released until today.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator posted his guess in the group. He also quoted the message of Fellow Daoist When the Bright Moon Appears, lest him be ignored again.","At this time, Soft Feather said, “Time... This Profound Sage Speech comes from the distant past. It is very ancient, even older than the age of the Scholarly Sage!”","This information of hers was obtained from the Heavenly Emperor.","“A Profound Sage Speech from the ancient era... Why was it unsealed today?” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue frowned.","Su Clan’s Seven said, “Here it is!”","The Divinity Show finally started.","Immediately, a scary chair and two pairs of feet appeared in everyone’s field of vision...","Su Clan’s Seven’s eyes widened."]},{"number":2162,"title":"Chapter 2162 Heavenly tribulation, cruel and merciless","paragraphs":["2162 Heavenly tribulation, cruel and merciless","Su Clan’s Seven didn’t have any special ability that allowed him to recognize people from their feet, but he could recognize their shoes just fine.","In this strange Divinity Show that seemed to have traveled through countless millennia, one of the two people was wearing a cute pair of shoes.","Those shoes were a special product of the Spirit River Su Clan, exclusive to the numbered geniuses of their clan. Each pair of shoes was a unique magical treasure.","On that cute pair of shoes, there was a special mark that belonged only to Su Clan’s Sixteen. Coupled with the familiar style, there was basically no chance Su Clan’s Seven had made a mistake.","Su Clan’s Seven sent a voice message. “[Voice Message] It’s Sixteen! My God, it’s Sixteen!”","His heart was filled with complicated emotions and his thoughts were in disarray.","How did Sixteen end up appearing in this Divinity Show?","Was she involved in a group tribulation?","Even then, how did she end up in the past and got involved in a Divinity Show from the ancient era?","What in the world is happening?","When Northern River’s Loose Cultivator heard the voice message, he felt his heart twitch. “Seven, are you sure this is Sixteen? If one of them is Sixteen, then the other person sitting on the throne...” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator had a bad premonition.","Fairy Dongfang Six: “Heavens.”","She was practicing her driving skills when she tried to press the voice recording button, nearly hitting a pillar as a result. Sure enough, it was a bad idea to use a phone while driving or watch live broadcasts.","Immortal Master Copper Trigram suddenly interjected, “Tsk, you can recognize Sixteen just by looking at her feet. I didn’t expect you to be such a siscon.”","“Fellow Daoist Copper Trigram, let’s have a fight on the next night of the full moon.” Even though Su Clan’s Seven’s thoughts were in disarray, he still managed to instinctively send Immortal Master Copper Trigram a battle invitation.","Immediately afterward, he wrote in the group: “Can you see that pair of shoes in the picture? There is a small pattern on the front of the shoe. It’s a special mark of our Spirit River Su Clan, and that particular mark belongs only to Sixteen.”","When the Bright Moon Appears: “Heavens, this is bad.”","On the screen of the Divinity Show.","Because of strange delays and stuttering, the Divinity Show’s loading time was really long.","The fellow daoists in the Nine Provinces Number One Group had chatted for a long time, but the scene of the Divinity Show was still showing the thighs of the two people on the throne.","When the scene was shot from this angle, everyone could see that the owner of the big pair of feet was sitting on the cruel chair, using his body to keep the smaller figure safe.","[This scene makes me feel uncomfortable! Bad review, bad review!]","[Why did two people appear in the Divinity Show? Is it another group tribulation?]","[Do any of you feel that the Divinity Show is lagging? And the lag seems to be pretty big.]","[Recently, there have been several Divinity Shows where a group of people transcended the tribulation together. Perhaps this is the new way to transcend the Profound Sage Tribulation...]","[We should increase the funds allocated for the research of group tribulations. There must be a secret to it. Maybe when forming a group to cross the tribulation, the odds of success are greater!]","[If there are two people this time, then apart from Senior Tyrannical Song who has shown his divinity three times, the ones appearing this time should be the 12th and 13th Sage in the past thousand years. If we add Senior Tyrannical Song’s appearances as Tyrannical Scholar and Tyrannical Dragon and that demonic hamster’s Divinity Show in the Netherworld Realm, then they would count as the 15th and 16th.]","People discussed animatedly as they looked at this obviously peculiar Divinity Show.","??????","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “[Sighing Emoji] If the owner of the small pair of feet is Su Clan’s Sixteen, then the other person... Well, everyone should know.”","“It might be Senior Song,” replied Unparalleled Butterfly Fairy (Soft Feather). The seniors in the group were as witty as her, so they had reached the same conclusion.","Sometimes, being too witty would leave one unable to feel any surprise, which was somewhat regretful.","Fairy Lychee replied, “There’s a 90% chance that it’s Song Shuhang.”","“He has a similar physique as well,” added Northern River’s Loose Cultivator.","“And that armor, it’s obviously Song Shuhang’s armor.”","Su Clan’s Seven: “It’s not armor but saber intent.”","When it came to sabers, Seven was always meticulous.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “Then here comes the question, if those are indeed Su Clan’s Sixteen and Song Shuhang, how did they go to the ancient era to show their divinity?”","As Soft Feather mentioned earlier, this Divinity Show took place in a distant past, in a time even before that of the Scholarly Sage.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue said, “This time, the Divinity Show is full of strangeness and somewhat contradictory.”","It was not only time but space as well that was distorted.","When Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue looked at the scene of the Divinity Show, for some reason, he was reminded of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","He felt that there was something in common between this scene of the Divinity Show and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","But as for what that common point was, he could not tell.","The shot on the screen eventually moved further up, arriving at the chest position.","In the next moment, all of the people around the universe were shocked.","Because there was a huge hole where the heart of the petite fairy was supposed to be.","There was no blood, almost as if the hole had always been there.","Through this hole, one could even see the pattern on the breastplate of the cultivator holding her.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, the lively atmosphere cooled down.","After a short while, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator hurried to type: “Seven, don’t worry. Even if we cultivators lose our heart, it does not necessarily mean that we’ll die. Perhaps Sixteen got injured while transcending the tribulation.”","Looking at the hole in the girl’s heart on the screen of the Divinity Show, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator felt a chill.","Why is it always Little Sixteen that gets injured?","...","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator put down his teacup and sighed softly.","During her Fourth Stage heavenly tribulation, Sixteen was fatally wounded. According to what Seven told him when he went to drink with him, if not for little friend Song Shuhang’s sudden appearance, which aroused Sixteen’s desire to survive, Sixteen might have died back then.","This time, during her Fifth Stage heavenly tribulation, she was injured once more.","The heavenly tribulation really seemed to be cruel toward her.","??????","Meanwhile, the discussions among practitioners in the universe exploded again.","[Organizing a group tribulation transcension is a momentary pleasure, but will ultimately end with a group funeral.]","[This would explain why two Profound Sages appeared in the Divinity Show. It is very likely that one of them died and the other is just holding the corpse of their companion.]"]},{"number":2163,"title":"Chapter 2163 Inspirational Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2163 Inspirational Emperor","[It looks like they’re dao companions that decided to transcend the tribulation together. Unfortunately, the cruel heavenly tribulation killed the woman, and the twelfth Sage in a thousand years was left with her corpse in his arms. Because of that, when the Divinity Show started, he couldn’t even bring himself to stand up and continued to sit on the throne, filled with sorrow.]","[This twelfth Sage in a thousand years might have already lost his will to live.]","[If that’s the case, will he be able to deliver a speech during the Profound Sage Speech phase in a while?]","As the lower half of the new Sage’s body was displayed on the screen, practitioners all over the universe were coming up with all kinds of scenarios, wondering what had taken place. A story of love and tragedy. Regardless of which part of the universe they were from, their imagination was running wild.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group. Unparalleled Butterfly Fairy (Soft Feather): “Senior Seven, you don’t have to worry. Look carefully at Sixteen’s chest.”","“Huh, her chest? Hmm... It’s flat, just as before.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber appeared out of nowhere and typed.","It was unknown if he was still in the Beast Realm or if he had already returned to the main world.","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “...”","[System message prompt: Frice Reckless Mad Saber has been muted by the group owner, Venerable Yellow Mountain, for 5 minutes.]","As the Divinity Show and Profound Sage Speech were taking place, all bans were lifted for the day, and Thrice Reckless had been given a chance to communicate.","Soft Feather said, “What I meant is that if you look carefully, you can see Sixteen’s chest rising and falling. In other words, she is still breathing. [Smiling Emoji]”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator looked carefully, and sure enough, as Soft Feather said, Sixteen was still breathing. Previously, everyone was shocked to see a hole in Sixteen’s chest. Coupled with the severe lag, they failed to realize that she was still breathing.","Su Clan’s Seven: “Thank you, Soft Feather. [Thumbs Up Emoji]”","After Soft Featherthat pointed out that Sixteen was still breathing, he felt considerably more at ease.","Although that hole in her chest was concerning, as long as she was still alive, there was hope for her.","“Here it comes. His face is about to be shown. I’m looking forward to seeing the expressions of the practitioners all over the universe when they see little friend Shuhang again. Needless to say, everyone’s liver is going to hurt, and their hearts are going to twitch. Senior Yellow Mountain, next time you get those fast-acting heart-soothing pills, do leave some for me,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator said.","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “[Pill Emote]”","He had already swallowed some pills. Ever since he established the Nine Province Number One Group, he had to spend on fast-acting heart-soothing pills every month, and each of those pills was worth a Fifth Stage spirit stone.","When the Bright Moon Appears: “I’m so envious.”","“[Voice Message] Let me tell all of you something even more heart-wrenching.” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue suddenly sent a voice message, but it was Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue who spoke. “If I remember correctly, the last time Song Shuhang showed his divinity was after reaching the Sixth Stage True Monarch Realm. In other words, after successfully transcending the tribulation this time, his realm...”","[I’m Mr. Yellow Mountain’s loyal dog] said, “Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue, shut up! You’re going to lose me if you keep talking!” While they were conversing, the picture shown on the Divinity Show screen gradually moved upward.","The first thing that appeared was the head of Sixteen’s body. She was relatively smaller in size, and regardless of whether or not she was in Song Shuhang’s arms, her face would be exposed earlier than his. On the screen, her chin was already slightly visible.","“Buzz, buzz~”","When Sixteen’s head was about to be revealed, the screen flickered and became distorted.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s eyes narrowed.","In the entire universe, who had the ability to affect the Divinity Show?","No matter what level a practitioner was at, it was impossible for them to do such a thing. Even if the Scholarly Sage were alive, he would not be able to accomplish this!","Unless...","On the screen, Sixteen’s chin disappeared, replaced by a majestic and gorgeous... white dragon chin!","A white dragon head whose size perfectly fit her body had appeared on Sixteen’s neck. The proportions had clearly been adjusted as the dragon head and Sixteen’s body were seamlessly connected together. Practitioners all over the universe fell silent.","Although the dragon head and the body were seamlessly connected, the picture looked very strange.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","‘... A dragon head?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked in puzzlement.","Su Clan’s Seven: “It might be due to Sixteen having activated the true dragon bloodline in her body. A small pair of dragon horns grew on her head not too long ago. When she goes out nowadays, she hides them with her hair. Since the Divinity Show reflects the Profound Sage’s true body, it makes sense for her to have a dragon head.”","When the Bright Moon Appears said, “That does make sense.”","Immortal Visitor Amidst Clouds: “I’m just wondering... Can I pre-book a ticket for the next group tribulation transcension?”","After he left his seclusion, he felt as if the whole world had changed.","Most of the fellow daoists in the group carried the title of Ancient Sage. Although they did not receive the opportunity to deliver a speech to the universe, it was still very prestigious and enviable to have a Sage Name. Unparalleled Butterfly Fairy (Soft Feather) said seriously, “Transcending the tribulation as a group is only a momentary pleasure, but will inevitably lead to a group funeral. [Tyrannical Song’s Left Eye Staring Emoji]”","She was very serious as she reminded everyone that if they were to carelessly transcend the tribulation as a group, they would only end up with lifelong regrets and inner demons. This is something she did not want to see. She did not want any accidents to happen to the seniors in the group. Venerable Yellow Mountain said with a stifled heart, “Soft Feather, don’t post this picture! That damned Thrice Reckless...” This picture of Song Shuhang’s left eye had been sent to the Nine Provinces Number One Group by Thrice Reckless Mad Saber in the past. He had no idea how or where Thrice Reckless got this picture.","While they were speaking, behind the Sixteen’s dragon head, the man’s face also began to emerge.","As before, when the man’s face was about to appear when the screen started flickering. “Could it be that Song Shuhang’s appearance has also changed?” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator noticed the pattern. Young Master Phoenix Slayer was lying on the glass door of his house, scratching its surface while watching the Divinity Show. While playing around, he took out his phone and replied, “By the way, since Sixteen’s head turned into a dragon head, Shuhang’s head couldn’t have turned into a phoenix head, right?”","In the next moment, the face of the man was finally revealed.","It was the face of a man with an imperial and majestic bearing. [E-Emperor Hezhi!] All over the universe, ancient demonic cultivators stared at the screen wide-eyed.","This face was often depicted in their textbooks.","Legends had it that even with only eight dragon patterns, that man ultimately defied his fate and surpassed his peers, embarking on his own path to immortality and becoming an inspirational Demon Emperor. That man was Demon Emperor Hezhi!","[Is this Divinity Show the one Demon Emperor Hezhi held when he ascended back in the day?]","[However, why did his Divinity Show appear now?]","In the main world, inside a forbidden area in the Infernal Realm.","Demon Emperor Hezhi raised his head, staring at the screen of the Divinity Show, baffled."]},{"number":2164,"title":"Chapter 2164 Hello, everyone. My name is Demon Emperor Hezhi","paragraphs":["2164 Hello, everyone. My name is Demon Emperor Hezhi","Why am I on the screen? If the one delivering the speech is me, how could I be lying here at the same?","Is there something wrong with me? Have I been affected by an inner demon, which is making me hallucinate?","Demon Emperor Hezhi stared at the screen.","Everyone knew that during the Divinity Show and Profound Sage Speech, a practitioner’s true face would be shown. Regardless of whether it was a disguise or a transformation, it would not work at that time. Nothing could prevent the true face of the practitioner from being shown.","!!","Even monster cultivators could only choose between their monster form or their human form; they could not take anyone else’s appearance.","In short, no practitioner could interfere with the Divinity Show.","So, what was the deal with the Demon Emperor Hezhi that was on the screen?","“This is not a scene from when I showed my divinity. I was not carrying my daughter in my arms as I transcended my tribulation. In fact, I don’t even have a daughter. So, who is this?” Demon Emperor Hezhi kept looking at the screen of the Divinity Show.","After thinking about it for a moment, he thought of a possibility.","In the universe, no practitioner could interfere with the Divinity Show.","But what if it was an existence that surpassed practitioners?","Demon Emperor Hezhi fell into thought.","“However, that does not make any sense. If it’s a Wielder of the Heaven’s Will, why are they involving me in this? Why are they trying to make this Profound Sage that just transcended their tribulation look like me?” Demon Emperor Hezhi frowned.","After a while, the Demon Emperor muttered to himself, “It looks like I must change locations again.”","He kept on getting the feeling that there was someone who wanted him dead.","The fellow daoists of the Nine Provinces Number One Group had dumbfounded expressions on their faces.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator frowned. “It actually isn’t Shuhang? Did we guess wrong?”","“That’s Demon Emperor Hezhi!” shouted Fairy Dongfang Six. At the same time, she quickly copied and pasted the parts of the demonic sect’s textbook that showed pictures of Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue: “Is this the same Demon Emperor Hezhi that was mentioned last time? If it’s him, then this Divinity Show should’ve taken place a long time ago, in an era that came even before that of the Scholarly Sage. What’s happening almost makes sense.”","Soft Feather said seriously, “No, that’s Senior Song!”","Even if his face was different, her intuition told her that the person on the screen was Song Shuhang.","The complete picture of the Divinity Show was shown. Then, the camera began to rotate slowly, from the front to the back of the Profound Sage to show his appearance to the practitioner of the universe","This moment that was shown across the entire universe could be said to be the most glorious moment of a cultivator’s life.","While seated on the massage throne, Song Shuhang reached out and touched his face.","He felt time overlapping on his body as the Divinity Show was taking place.","The past and the future were merged together.","And, for some reason, he was wearing a mask.","When showing one’s divinity, a Profound Sage’s true face would be shown. Disguises didn’t work during this time.","However, he somehow managed to make use of a disguise and have it work during the Divinity Show.","“Interesting, I wonder who I look like right now” Song Shuhang muttered to himself.","Sister White Dragon glanced at him.","She could feel that just now, the past and the future were overlapping on his body. The experiment that the white horse had talked about was showing its results.","With the interference of the experiment, Song Shuhang was able to make use of the mask even during the Divinity Show.","What exactly is this experiment about? Sister White Dragon became curious.","Song Shuhang’s fingers touched the mask, and the secret appraisal technique was activated due to his curiosity.","His fingertips felt slightly tingly, and the price of the appraisal was paid.","[Heavenly Silver Trigram’s Disguise Mask (Used): A one-time-use prop. Disguise personage: Demon Emperor Hezhi, a top-tier Immortal who managed to become an Immortal despite having only eight dragon patterns.]","So, I’ve disguised myself as Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Although I don’t know who this Demon Emperor Hezhi is, he seems pretty cool.","Song Shuhang suddenly had the urge to tear off his mask, face everyone, and say hello to Demon Emperor Hezhi.","However, he resisted this impulse.","Impulses were evil.","He was a cautious, careful, and patient person, so he managed to hold himself back from saying hello to Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Haste would ruin everything, so he had to control his emotions.","When the most suitable time came, he would take off the mask and surprise Demon Emperor Hezhi.","In the Limitless Demon Sect.","Young Master Hai’s main body raised his head and looked up at Demon Emperor Hezhi, falling into contemplation.","Although the face of the person on the screen was that of Demon Emperor Hezhi, he did not have the same temperament.","He had received Demon Emperor Hezhi’s inheritance and had some understanding of his character.","Therefore, he could tell that there was something wrong with the Demon Emperor Hezhi shown on the screen.","But if that’s not Demon Emperor Hezhi, then who is it?","Young Master Hai slowly closed his eyes and stretched out his hand, placing it on his chest.","His heart was beating wildly.","In the Profound Sage Space.","...","After Song Shuhang regained his composure, he moved his fingers away from the mask.","Sister White Dragon said, “Are you ready? After the Divinity Show, a Sage Seal will be condensed, and then the Profound Sage Speech will begin.”","Information on the Divinity Show, Sage Seal, and Profound Sage Speech would automatically appear in the minds of Song Shuhang and Sixteen.","This was how things worked since the beginning of time.","These pieces of information could also act as a guide.","If there was a newbie Profound Sage who had transcended the tribulation without knowing any of this information, the automated system would guide them on how to act.","“A speech?” Song Shuhang frowned.","This was bad. He had amnesia and didn’t know what to say.","He was afraid that he might end up not saying anything during his speech.","“Fairy, are you ready?” Song Shuhang looked at Sixteen.","Sixteen shook her head.","...","Sister White Scarf said to Sixteen, “I can provide some assistance for her speech. Even if my memory is blurred, my realm still remains. As long as I grasp an important point, I can infer a lot of things. It should be enough for this speech.”","“Sorry, but I am unable to do that. The Profound Sage Speech is a personal matter.” Sister White Sister spread her small arms.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Damn, then what am I supposed to do?","This is the Divinity Show, and the eyes of every practitioner in the universe are focused on me.","If I can’t say anything during the speech, wouldn’t I be embarrassing myself in front of everyone?","At that time, I will definitely become the laughingstock of the entire world.","What do I do now?","Hmm... Wait.","Embarrassing myself and becoming the laughingstock of the whole world?","My face is currently that of Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Even if I embarrass myself, it’s not me who will become the laughingstock!","Song Shuhang was elated.","He said confidently, “It’s a mere Profound Sage Speech. Even if I’ve lost my memory, it shouldn’t be too difficult for me!”"]},{"number":2165,"title":"Chapter 2165 Su... Su...","paragraphs":["2165 Su... Su...","The practitioners all over the universe kept their heads raised as they looked at the screen.","The next phase was the one where the Sage Seal would be condensed.","It was a moment worth remembering.","On the screen, “Demon Emperor Hezhi” got up and carefully placed the dragon-headed fairy maiden on the cruel throne.","!!","He then placed his hands together and began to condense his Sage Seal.","There was a vast light of virtue that gathered around his body.","Demonic cultivators around the universe were stunned. This vast light of virtue frightened them.","The quantity and quality of this light of virtue were incredibly high. Even senior monks and virtuous scholars would have a hard time gathering so much light of virtue.","Afterward, the embryonic form of a Sage Seal condensed in the air, landing in front of “Demon Emperor Hezhi.”","If this is the scene from when Demon Emperor Hezhi became a Sage, then his Sage Name should be Hezhi, right? people from demonic sects thought to themselves.","In the meantime, “Demon Emperor Hezhi” reached out and touched the Sage Seal.","The word “Hezhi” emerged on it.","However, the script used was not that of the ancient language. The name was written with simplified Chinese characters, which were used on modern Earth.","During the Divinity Show and the condensing of the Sage Seal, there were principles that would act as a translator, allowing everyone to understand the meaning of the words.","But in the main world, the facial muscles of the practitioners who had been exposed to Chinese characters twitched.","After writing the word Hezhi, “Demon Emperor Hezhi” fell into thought.","He stretched out his hand again and drew an X on the name.","This action caused practitioners from all over the universe to almost choke.","A Sage Name should not be chosen so casually. Hezhi is already someone else’s Sage Name. Choosing this name is clearly not very auspicious, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","After crossing out the daoist name, he began to think deeply.","In the end, he followed his instinct and used his hand as a pen to write the word “Tyrannical” on the Sage Seal.","And, sure enough, he found that he liked this word more.","For some reason, practitioners all over the universe gasped when they saw this word.","Recently, since the beginning of the second half of the current year, whenever someone read the word “Tyrannical,” they would stutter in fright.","If it was not for the fact that the face of the person on the screen was different, many practitioners would have chosen to turn off the broadcast.","After the word Tyrannical, what should I add? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He remembered what the white horse called him before, Tyrannical Song.","Should I use Tyrannical Song?","No, no, I already have Tyrannical Song as one of my Sage Names. I can’t use it again.","Then, should I combine the word Tyrannical with Demon Emperor Hezhi?","Tyrannical Emperor?","This name sounds pretty cool, but it doesn’t fit my low-key style.","Subconsciously, he wanted to keep a low profile, at least for a while.","So, he chose to compromise.","How about Tyrannical Demon?","When Song Shuhang’s mind settled on this name, the Sage Seal sensed it.","The Sage Name “Tyrannical Demon” had been confirmed.","Today was a big day.","In the eyes of practitioners who did not know Demon Emperor Hezhi, the twelfth Sage in a thousand years had emerged and they were called Tyrannical Demon.","As for the practitioners who did know of Demon Emperor Hezhi, their hearts thumped.","If this was really the Divinity Show of Demon Emperor Hezhi from the past. Then did it mean that the Demon Emperor’s true Sage Name was Tyrannical Demon?","Tyrannical Demon Hezhi.","How domineering!","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Sage Monarch Yellow Mountain: “Tyrannical Demon...”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “The style of this name...”","Su Clan’s Seven: “Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon...”","Unparalleled Butterfly Fairy (Soft Feather): “I told you. That’s Senior Song.”","Fairy Lychee: “Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire, [Pill Emoji].”","Sage Monarch Yellow Mountain: “I’ve already taken them.”","Fairy Lychee: “Make sure to drink plenty of water so that you don’t choke.”","Sage Monarch Yellow Mountain: “Yeah, I’m going to boil a pot of water. I’m getting the feeling that it will come in handy in a while.”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer rolled on the ground as he typed. “Is it really little friend Song Shuhang? After the speech is over, let’s ask him.”","Fairy Dongfang Six slowly climbed out of her overturned car and wrote: “That’s not the real issue here. What we really need to discuss is... Are we going to watch Tyrannical Demon’s speech in a while? I want someone to watch it with me. As long as there’s a chance that it’s really Demon Emperor Hezhi’s speech, I want to watch it.”","...","Dongfang Snow: “I’ll accompany you, Six.”","Immortal Visitor Amidst Clouds suggested, “No need to be so extreme. I suggest that when Tyrannical Demon starts with his speech, everyone enters a state of meditation. After coming out of seclusion, we can just ask the fellow daoists who watched the speech about its content. Then, we can decide whether to watch the broadcast or not.”","Frice Reckless Mad Saber: “I can finally type again... Hahaha, everyone is supposed to be born equal, so why is Fellow Daoist Immortal Visitor so much wiser than everyone else? I think that the group founder should watch the speech and tell us the content later. As the founder, he should take the lead.”","Immortal Master Copper Trigram: “Wonderful idea!”","Fairy Lychee: “@Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire, [Pill Emoji].”","Sage Monarch Yellow Mountain: “...”","This stupid group. I’m going to delete it!","The Sage Name Tyrannical Demon was confirmed.","Because after the Divinity Show and the choosing of the Sage Name was the most important part!","[Next is the Profound Sage Speech, right?]","[However, Profound Sage Tyrannical Demon has just lost his dao companion. Will he be able to deliver a good speech?]","...","[Tyrannical Demon Emperor Hezhi is not the kind of man who can be easily defeated. We can look forward to what he will be saying.]","[The Great Emperor is not the kind of person who can be overwhelmed by emotion. According to the records of the Demon Sect, he is a man who has been single all his life. How can mere emotions defeat him?]","Just as everyone was filled with excitement, the screen of the Divinity Show shifted to the body of the dragon-headed fairy.","There was a Sage Seal that had formed right beside her.","[Holy shiet! Is that fairy maiden still alive?]","[Look, she is condensing a Sage Seal! That means that she succeeded in transcending the tribulation.]","[Maybe we misunderstood before. Maybe the fairy was born with a hole in her chest, and it’s not an injury from the heavenly tribulation!]","The stock of the group tribulation was rising again.","The Sage Seal floated beside Sixteen. Song Shuhang also looked at her curiously, wanting to see what name she would choose for herself.","Sixteen stretched out her hand and touched the Sage Seal.","The word “Su” appeared.","The Su family was an integral part of her being. When she chose a Sage Name, she would naturally not abandon this word.","After deciding on the word Su, she began to hesitate.","What daoist name should I choose?","Her memory was too blurry, and she could not remember what her daoist name was.","Su Clan’s Seven, who was watching the broadcast, was very puzzled. What is Sixteen hesitating about?","Shouldn’t she simply choose “Su Clan’s Sixteen” as her Sage Name?","The number Sixteen is of great significance.","Little Sixteen has no reason to abandon it.","On the screen, Sixteen raised her head and looked at Song Shuhang. She wanted to ask for his opinion.","“Su Su?” Song Shuhang pinched his chin, deep in thought.","He repeated the word “Su” over and over again.","Suddenly, there was a word that he instinctively called out, “Su Hang!”","Although he did not know who or what Su Hang was, the word sounded familiar and of great importance."]},{"number":2166,"title":"Chapter 2166 Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island","paragraphs":["2166 Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island","“Su Hang? That doesn’t sound like a daoist name,” said Sister Scarf. Yet, she also found the name very familiar, as if she had heard it before.","Song Shuhang replied, “Yeah, it doesn’t sound like a daoist name, but I feel like it should be pretty important. Even after losing my memory, I know that this name is important to me.”","“I also feel that this name is very important.” Sixteen nodded. When she heard the words, they left a deep impression on her.","“Then, can you remember what special significance it has?” Sister Scarf scratched her chin and said, “The Sage Name is a title that will accompany a cultivator for the rest of their life. There is no way to change it later.”","!!","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and murmured, “Su Hang Su Hang”","While in thought, he blurted, “They say that there’s a heaven above and below are Suzhou and Hangzhou. Could that be it?”","Sister Scarf: “...”","“I don’t think that’s what it means,” Sixteen said. “Anyway, while this name feels very important, I also feel that I must not use it as my daoist name.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Then, what are you going to do?”","“Su Clan... Su...” Sixteen muttered and then thought of another word. “Su Shan (Su Mountain)?”","Sister Scarf said, “Do you mean a mountain of books (Shu Shan)? Still, the word for book (Shu) and Su have different pronunciations.”","“I like Su Shan.” Sixteen had decided.","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up. “Stressed by a Mountain of Su?”","Because of the influence of the local accent, he was very insensitive to the difference in pronunciation between the two words. As such, when he heard the words Su Shan, he subconsciously connected them to “stressed by.”","He felt that “stressed by” and “mountain of books” were very suitable for one another.","“Your talent for naming things is really bad,” Sister Scarf said scornfully.","If a person’s Sage Name were to be Stressed by a Mountain of Su, they would definitely be laughed at by everyone in the universe!","“Then How about Fairy Su Shan, Immortal Visitor Su Shan, Loose Cultivator Su Shan, Palace Master Su Shan, or Scholar Su Shan?” Song Shuhang suggested a few names.","“Those are prefixes and aren’t part of the daoist name. They’re similar to Mister and Miss.” Sister Scarf rolled her eyes so hard that they ended up in the back of her head.","Song Shuhang continued, “Then, Su Shan it is. It does sound very imposing.”","That concluded their discussion.","Sixteen willed it, and the name “Su Shan” appeared on her Sage Seal.","Then, she moved her finger and involuntarily added the word “Sixteen” after Su Shan.","But after some thought, she removed it.","The number 16 was an important part of her, but she wanted to save it for when she officially showed her divinity. If no accidents happened, when she ascended from the Seventh Stage to the Eighth Stage, she would be able to show her divinity once more.","Anyway, her Sage Name was also confirmed.","The twelfth Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Su Shan.","Or according to the other sorting system, the sixteenth Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Su Shan.","This name sounded quite similar to Venerable Yellow Mountain’s; it was a region-based daoist name.","Due to the condensing of the Sage Seal, the screen of the Divinity Show was locked onto Sixteen.","As such, the universe could not see Song Shuhang or Sister White Dragon and had no idea of the conversation that took place between them.","The people watching the Divinity Show had only seen Sixteen write the word “Su” on the Sage Seal and then add “Shan” and “Sixteen” before erasing the latter. Finally, the Sage Name she decided on was Su Shan.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Su Clan’s Seven: “...”","Seeing Sixteen erase the word “Sixteen,” Seven felt a throbbing pain in his liver.","He kept on getting the feeling that Sixteen was planning on ditching the Spirit River Su Clan.","Sixteen, you silly girl. You should have erased the word Shan and left the word Sixteen!","“Also, what the hell is with this Su Shan? What kind of daoist name is it?!” Su Clan’s Seven complained in the group.","If the elders of the Su Clan recognized her and saw her erase the word “Sixteen,” how much pain did they feel?","At this pace, the fast-acting heart-soothing pill was going to be a huge hit. After Sixteen delivered her speech, she would acquire the [Nobody Under the Heavens Does Not Know of Me] effect.","At that time, whenever the elders of Spirit River Su Clan saw her, they would suffer from stomach pain, heart pain, kidney pain, and several other types of pain.","If Sixteen walked around the clan grounds every day, the elders of the Spirit River Su Clan would probably have their lives shortened from liver pain.","Soft Feather replied, “Su Shan Su Shan... When you say it quickly, it sounds quite similar to Shu Shan (Mountain of Books). [Senior White Ponytail Emoji]”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer was now throwing punches at a dog-shaped punching bag. While boxing, he typed with his toes, “Stressed by... A Mountain of Books?”","Su Clan’s Seven: “...”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “That was Song Shuhang’s nickname when he first joined the group. At that time, he did not know that we were cultivators. Now that I think about it, he’s really come far from the little newbie he was.”","Fairy Lychee said, “@Su Clan’s Seven, Seven, you should consider inviting Shuhang to the Spirit River Su Clan’s annual meeting.”","Su Clan’s Seven: “...”","Soft Feather said suddenly, “I’ve decided. The next time I show my divinity, I will call myself Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island! After all, I still have another chance to show my divinity.”","Then, she changed her group nickname to [Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island (Soft Feather)].","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “[Tearful Face-Palming Emoji]”","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “@Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, [Pill Emoji].”","After a short while, an account whose nickname was Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island (Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly) went online and typed: “...”","The father and daughter had the same nickname.","...","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “...”","Yellow Mountain took out a bottle of fast-acting heart-soothing pills with trembling hands and immediately swallowed one with boiling water.","On Spirit Butterfly Island.","Soft Feather sat in front of the computer, resting her chin in one hand while tapping lightly on the computer.","At the same time, she looked up at Sixteen, who was on the screen of the Divinity Show.","“I really feel like there’s something wrong,” she said softly.","Today, she didn’t have her usual energy, to the point that she did not even think of silently running from home.","Is it because of the lack of stimulation?","[Do you want to experience something exciting?] A tempting voice sounded in Soft Feather’s mind.","It was not an inner demon since her inner demon had been separated from her body and handed over to Senior Song.","This voice was the voice of the person who occupied her ghost spiritthe voice of the Heavenly Emperor.","...","Soft Feather laughed.","The temptation of the Heavenly Emperor did not appeal to her.","The excitement that she wanted was not something that the Heavenly Emperor could give her.","The condensing of the Sage Seal stage had come to an end.","The Divinity Show had now entered its most stimulating phase, the Profound Sage Speech!","After all, a nice Profound Sage Speech could benefit all the practitioners in the universe significantly.","This time, practitioners from demonic sects were especially excited.","They felt that it was highly likely that they would get to listen to the speech that Tyrannical Demon Hezhi delivered when he became a Sage in the past!"]},{"number":2167,"title":"Chapter 2167 Fellow Daoist Hezhi, are you surprised?","paragraphs":["2167 Fellow Daoist Hezhi, are you surprised?","To be honest, the current generation of practitioners both loved and dreaded the Profound Sage Speech.","The reason for loving it was self-explanatory. After all, Profound Sage Speeches were free, and those who listened to them could receive countless benefits. This was especially so when the topic of the Profound Sage Speech matched one’s field. When this was the case, it was very likely that the practitioner would even experience a breakthrough just from listening to the speech.","As for the reason why they felt dread toward the Profound Sage Speech, it was because of a specific Profound Sage, who the public did not even dare to mention. This man had deeply traumatized the whole universe, both physically and mentally.","In the past few months, whenever a practitioner heard the words “Profound Sage Speech” mentioned around them, they would feel a throbbing pain in their abdomen.","Fortunately, before the Profound Sage Speech, there was an important phase where the new Profound Sage’s appearance would be shown.","During this stage, the new Sage was forced to show their true face.","One could only admire and praise the existence that came up with the idea of the Profound Sage Speech in the first place. Whoever it was, they had great foresight!","This feature was very useful as of late.","With practitioners all over the universe having become familiar with the Divinity Show, as long as the cultivator holding the Profound Sage Speech was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, whether it was his child version, teen version, young version, middle-aged version, or elderly version, they planned to immediately turn off the broadcast and go into seclusion.","Once the Profound Sage Speech was over, practitioners had the option to watch the rebroadcast when they wished.","As for the content, they could rely on the group of strong-willed and brave warriors who dared to watch Tyrannical Song’s Profound Sage Speech live. Once they heard from them about the speech, they could decide whether to watch it or not.","This time, it was Demon Emperor Hezhi who was showing his divinity and not Tyrannical Song.","Practitioners all over the universe felt they could enjoy the Profound Sage Speech in peace.","With all eyes on him, Song Shuhang expressionlessly moved toward the stage where he would hold the Profound Sage Speech.","As soon as he got into position, he felt as if countless pairs of eyes were staring at him.","From now on, everybody under the heavens would know of him.","If it was one’s first time delivering a Profound Sage Speech, being stared at by countless eyes would likely cause the speaker to feel uncomfortable for a moment.","However, Song Shuhang had already adapted to this feeling.","Now then, what should I say? Song Shuhang touched his face, confirming that the mask was still there.","First... I should make an opening statement!","“Fellow Daoists, Fairies, and Seniors from all over the universe, I am Hezhi, and my Sage Name is Tyrannical... Demon. After thousands of deaths, I have finally stepped into the Profound Sage Realm. I am here today to deliver a speech to you all, and I hope that you’ll enjoy it.” Song Shuhang cupped his fists and simply introduced himself to the fellow daoists that were watching him from all over the universe.","This simple introduction made the blood of all the demonic cultivators in the universe boil!","[It’s Emperor Hezhi! It’s really him!]","[Is this really a Profound Sage Speech sealed from the ancient era? I did not think that I would get to listen to the Profound Sage Speech of Emperor Hezhi in my lifetime!]","[Long Live Demon Emperor Hezhi!]","[What was the content of Emperor Hezhi’s speech back then? Has it been handed down?]","[The Great Emperor’s speech traversed time and space and manifested today! Our demonic sect will be prosperous!]","The disciples of ancient demonic sects who had Demon Emperor Hezhi recorded in their textbooks were now brimming with excitement as they stared at the screen above them.","As for the practitioners from other cultivation systems who did not recognize Emperor Hezhi, they were also waiting patiently, looking forward to his speech.","There was only a small group of people who had sensed that something was off and kept silent.","For example, in a certain forbidden area in the Infernal Realm","The face of the real Demon Emperor Hezhi was getting darker and darker. “Tyrannical Demon Hezhi? Hehehe...”","You bastard, you better not let me catch you.","Who exactly is this guy that pretended to be me in the ancient era?","On the platform of the Profound Sage Speech.","After Song Shuhang briefly introduced himself, he patted the armor on his body lightly.","His eyes lowered slightly, and he wondered what he should say.","At first, he was thinking that since he was wearing Demon Emperor Hezhi’s face, he could just talk about whatever came to his mind.","Anyway, it was not he who would bear the embarrassment.","But when he stepped onto the platform, his mind began operating on its own.","The memories of his physical body told him that after the Profound Sage Speech ended, as long as the speech was good, the benefits would be endless.","For a normal cultivator, the Profound Sage Speech was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, and anybody could tell how valuable it was.","Therefore, one should never waste the opportunity that was the Profound Sage Speech.","Song Shuhang’s cautious yet bold character came in handy at this critical moment, and a certain plan formed in his mind.","Having no other choice, he decided to go with it!","Although I have no idea what I said in my previous speeches, allow me, Tyrannical Son Demon, to deliver a different kind of speech today.","Shuhang sat cross-legged and got ready to deliver the speech. He looked truly awe-inspiring with Emperor Hezhi’s face.","Practitioners from all over the universe perked up their ears, preparing to listen to the speech.","Song Shuhang said seriously, “Today, I shall tell you all about the ‘Five-Year Simulation of Three-Year College Entrance Examination.’”","What he wanted to do was going to take some extra time, so he borrowed Demon Emperor Hezhi’s face and tried to stall for time.","“Pff~ ” Sixteen, who was behind him, could not stop herself from bursting out in laughter.","Sister Scarf’s jaw nearly dropped to the ground as she heard what Song Shuhang said.","Has this guy gone mad?","He dares to joke around at a time like this? Isn’t he afraid that he won’t be able to gather enough power of virtue from the practitioners of the universe and suffer the backlash of the inner demon tribulation?","...","Right after, Sister Scarf recalled something. Tyrannical Song had that lifelike virtuous lamia with him. With such an impressive materialization of the power of virtue, there was no Profound Sage that could hold a candle to him!","With such a strong power of virtue, it seems that this guy does have the capital to mess around during the Profound Sage Speech","If you had enough virtue, you could do whatever you want.","Meanwhile, practitioners from all over the universe wore looks of confusion on their faces..","Everyone wondered if they were suffering from some kind of auditory hallucination.","[Five-Year Simulation of the Three-Year College Entrance Examination?]","[What’s that?]","In the Infernal Realm.","Demon Emperor Hezhi’s face was so black that it could almost absorb all the surrounding light.","He could sense strong malice coming from this fake Hezhi.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","...","Frice Reckless Mad Saber said, “If this guy isn’t little friend Shuhang, I’m going to screw my head off and kick it away like a ball!”","Medicine Master said with a stifled heart, “[Voice Message] This is all Thrice Reckless’ fault.”","Medicine Master could still remember how pure little friend Shuhang was when they first met.","How could such a pure child have become so deranged? This must all be Thrice Reckless’ fault!"]},{"number":2168,"title":"Chapter 2168 Tyrannical Song answering questions in real time","paragraphs":["2168 Tyrannical Song answering questions in real time","“What? How does this have anything to do with me?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said in confusion.","After Young Master Phoenix Slayer finished clawing the door, rolling on the ground, and beating the Doudou-shaped sandbag, he began chatting on his computer seriously. “The fellow daoist above is full of shiet.”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “[Song Shuhang Spiral Ascension Emote] Now I’m in a complicated mood.”","Dongfang Snow: “Six, why are you in a complicated mood?”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber quickly replied, “That’s because Goddess Six is the saintess of a demonic sect.”","Emperor Hezhi was an inspirational figure among demonic sects all over the universe. Now that she was seeing little friend Song hold a speech with Demon Emperor Hezhi’s face, Fairy Dongfang Six naturally felt a bundle of complex emotions.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “Goddess Six?”","Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island (Soft Feather): “I’m guessing that Senior Thrice Reckless is referring to Drive Goddess Dongfang Six.”","Frice Reckless Mad Saber: “Correct, [Soft Feather Salute Emote].”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “...”","She silently took out her phone, clicked on the world map within the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and input the keywords “Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s cave abode” in the search bar.","Soon, about ten kilometers away from her location, she found the villa-shaped immortal cave of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","Fairy Dongfang Six set this small immortal cave as her destination and started heading over.","After that, she took a screenshot and sent the photo to the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Fairy Dongfang Six replied, “Getting ready to go. My destination is Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s Immortal Cave No. 33. The distance is about 11.3 kilometers, and it’ll take me about five minutes to get there. I’ll watch the Profound Sage Speech while heading to Thrice Reckless’s place. Please wish me a safe journey. [Song Shuhang Falling From the Sky and Screaming Emote].”","Frice Reckless Mad Saber: “()”","“Six, be merciful. The people living in the proximity of the road leading to Thrice Reckless’ immortal cave are innocent. Make sure to not hit any passers-by. Don’t let those people suffer because of Thrice Reckless.” Fairy Dongfang Snow comforted.","Fairy Dongfang Six: “...”","Silly Snow, we even have the same surname. Why must you rend my heart like this?","Su Clan’s Seven replied, “There’s no need to be in such a rush, Six. Just wait for me to get there. I’ll beat Thrice Reckless up and tie him up for you.”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “Deal!”","Immortal Master Copper Trigram: “I have a suggestion. Let’s make a small script that will automatically mute Thrice Reckless every time he types more than ten words in a row in the group.”","Frice Reckless Mad Saber: “...”","“Good idea.” Venerable Yellow Mountain said, “Once this script is finished, I will add Thrice Reckless and Copper Trigram to its target list.”","Immortal Master Copper Trigram: “(_)”","“You just shot yourself in the foot.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator took a sip of his tea. Seeing the shady fortune teller suffer, he felt refreshed both physically and mentally.","On the platform of the Profound Sage Speech.","“It was just a joke. Let’s begin with the real speech,” Song Shuhang said seriously.","He then began to create an atmosphere appropriate for the speech.","White lotus flowers bloomed in the air thanks to his Lotus Blossoming Tongue.","And right under where he was seated appeared a gigantic black lotus, courtesy of his Lotus Blossoming Steps.","A magnificent and radiant light of virtue burst out from his body. Under the gaze of the people across the universe, the light of virtue transformed into a beautiful lamia.","The virtuous lamia embraced the world with her arms. The dazzling light radiating from her body nearly blinded the eyes of those who were watching her.","[Why does Demon Emperor Hezhi possess such a magnificent power of virtue?]","[Wait... Why does that lamia look so familiar?]","[Eh? The appearance of that virtuous woman... Isn’t that the Virtuous Empress of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?]","[Wait.Tyrannical Demon?]","[Ack! I feel the need to meditate! I’m going into seclusion!!!]","[Maybe it’s just a coincidence. This light of virtue seems to be slightly different from the Virtuous Empress. The empress was majestic, while this lamia looks very charming. It might be of another species.]","[Don’t fear, this is definitely Demon Emperor Hezhi and not Tyrannical Song. The Profound Sage Speech forces a practitioner to show their true face. Even if it was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, he could not possibly fake his appearance during the Divinity Show. This is an iron rule that no one can change.]","It was already too late for them to go into seclusion. As the Profound Sage Speech had officially started, they had missed the window where they could do so and still listen to the speech later.","Song Shuhang said slowly, “I don’t know how people approached this task in the past, but I plan to use a brand-new method today.”","While he was speaking, his left eye began to light up.","Practitioners across the universe immediately recognized this light.","[The Scholarly Sage’s eye!!!]","A demonic voice seemed to echo in the minds of all the practitioners.","“What is filial piety?”","“What is love?”","“Do you know the greatness of maternal love?”","This was an auditory hallucination, but it felt very real","How could Demon Emperor Hezhi have the Scholarly Sage’s eye?","Why did he possess such an enormous power of virtue?","As soon as the Sage Name “Tyrannical Demon” appeared on the screen, they should have packed it up!","Practitioners across the universe regretted not turning off the broadcast when they had the chance.","...","However, the light of the Impregnating Gaze and the pain of childbirth they expected did not come.","The light radiating from the left eye of Demon Emperor Hezhi had nothing to do with the Impregnating Gaze.","The light created a “link”, and through the Profound Sage Speech, every practitioner who was watching felt connected with “Demon Emperor Hezhi.”","During the Profound Sage Speech, some of the Profound Sage’s abilities would be amplified by the Heaven’s Will.","Something similar happened when Song Shuhang delivered his infamous speech as “Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar.” He had used the Scholarly Sage’s eye to cast the Impregnating Gaze, and even most Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders fell victim to its power This was due to the amplification provided by the Profound Sage Speech.","Shuhang said softly, “Great. I was able to establish a connection through the Profound Sage Speech. I’m done with the preparations.”","His voice was very gentle, which caused the uneasy practitioners to calm down.","“Next, on to the next stage.” Song Shuhang reached out and summoned a small metal cube.","This was a treasure he got after winning his bet with the three-eyed young man in his dream, the Real-Time Question Answering AI. At first, he thought that it was nothing but a dream, but the two treasures had actually appeared in his hands!","This AI was connected to a clone of the three-eyed young man, which also acted as its database.","This was the bold solution Shuhang came up with to deal with the speech. In short, “Tyrannical Song” would be answering questions in real time.","...","However, before the speech, there was one more thing he wanted to do.","He wanted to say hello to the real Demon Emperor Hezhi and thank him for the Tribulation Transcender energy that he sent his way. Song Shuhang’s memories were being restored in the same order as he lost them."]},{"number":2169,"title":"Chapter 2169 You are my best pal","paragraphs":["2169 You are my best pal","It was perhaps due to the white horse’s experiment coming to an end, but Song Shuhang found that his memory was recovering. He first recalled the things that had taken place most recently.","He recalled that he, Sister Scarf, the petite fairy maiden, and the sword that called itself saber were involved in a time-type magical technique. Then, the memory of Demon Emperor Hezhi transferring him strength remotely was also restored.","It turned out that having your memories recover in this manner was quite interesting.","He was recalling his life experiences from the most recent one to the least recent one.","It was like discovering that you had a close relationship with a stranger, gradually getting to know how you met them.","!!","??????","The corners of Song Shuhang’s mouth curled upward as he said, “My speech this time is going to deviate from the usual pattern. I will be taking advantage of the Profound Sage Speech and present you with an interactive lecture. You can ask me questions, and I will answer.”","Practitioners across the universe were stunned when they heard his words.","[An interactive speech?]","[How are we supposed to interact with him during the Profound Sage Speech?]","[I heard that during the Profound Sage Speech, a Profound Sage can feel the thoughts of the practitioners watching their speech and even filter the content. Could it be that Senior Tyrannical Demon wants to take advantage of this function?]","Unlike fake Profound Sages like Song Shuhang, genuine Profound Sages could hear the voices of the practitioners around the universe when they were delivering a speech. It was similar to what one would see when looking at a chat with billions of people typing at the same time.","[However, there should be billions of practitioners watching the speech. How can Senior Tyrannical Demon interact with everyone? Is he going to pick some lucky practitioners who will have their questions answered?]","Although doubtful, practitioners all over the universe were excited.","Senior Tyrannical Demon’s way of delivery was different from the past and very innovative.","If their questions could be answered, then they might be able to improve their realm in one go.","Although the chance of being picked out from billions upon billions of practitioners was very small, it was similar, in a way, to winning the lottery. The smaller the chance of winning, the more interesting it was.","??????","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Fairy Lychee swallowed an orange-flavored medicinal pill, and wrote in the group, puzzled. “Wait a minute, is Shuhang planning to answer the questions of all the practitioners in the universe? Did I mishear?”","“Could it be that this isn’t actually little friend Shuhang? [Shocked expression]” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was holding a wax-coated medicinal pill in his hand, ready to take it at any moment.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer said bluntly, “With all due respect, with the amount of knowledge that Shuhang has, how can he possibly answer the questions of practitioners all over the universe? He probably won’t even be able to help Second Stage cultivators. No way this is going to work! [Soft Feather Hand Gun Emote]”","Medicine Master asked, “What do you think, Senior Yellow Mountain?”","Medicine Master: “...”","Eternal Fire is very tired and wants to retire: “What a coincidence, I’m also lying on my side. If I become pregnant in this position, the pain and pressure that my stomach experiences will be reduced a bit. Additionally, I prepared an orange-flavored medicinal pill, just in case.”","Tyrant Flood Dragon wants to father a football team: “So I’m not the only one who changed flavor. I got one that tastes like dog meat.”","Cave Lord Snow Wolf: “What a coincidence, mine also has that taste.”","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman: “Cave Master, you and dogs have a common ancestor. Why are you so cruel to your own kind? @I am Mr. Yellow Mountain’s loyal dog.”","I am Mr. Yellow Mountain’s loyal dog: “[Soft Feather Throwing Money Emote]”","Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island (Soft Feather) said, “Senior Song’s knowledge is indeed insufficient, but he might have found a way. For example, he might make use of the QR code chat to ask big shots for help, or he may have gotten some special magical treasure. After all, people can even sell manuscripts for the Profound Sage Speech.”ραпdα `n?ν?| сom","Island Master Tian Tiankong: “That makes sense. Even if he does not have the necessary knowledge, he can cheat.”","The seniors in the group began to wonder what new tricks Song Shuhang would show everyone this time.","??????","Song Shuhang continued with a smile on his face, “A gentle reminder to all the fellow daoists across the universe. Each person has only one opportunity to ask a question. Additionally, the question must be cultivation-related. So, if you want to ask a question, please consider carefully before doing so. After answering one question, I will not answer a second one. Fellow Daoists, please cherish this opportunity. I will give you some time to prepare.”","As soon as Song Shuhang finished speaking, people all over the universe burst into discussion once more.","[Everyone will have an opportunity to ask a question?]","[So, is it not going to be decided by lucky draw?]","[How will this work? How is Senior Tyrannical Demon going to answer everyone’s questions? He will have to answer countless questions if this is true. When will he finish? Even if Senior Tyrannical Demon’s processing power is off the charts, it might take decades or hundreds of years for him to answer all the questions...]","Although they were suspicious, practitioners across the universe began to think of what they were going to ask.","They only had one chance, so they had to pick out the most pressing question they had about their cultivation.","Most practitioners cherished this opportunity to ask a question, but the universe was vast and there was no lack of people who liked to seek death, did not care, or thought themselves too clever.","In the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, Song Shuhang felt that it was about time.","While practitioners across the universe were preparing questions, he could greet Demon Emperor Hezhi and thank him for the gift.","“It’s almost time. Senior Hezhi... Yes, I’m talking to you, Demon Emperor Hezhi. You must be watching this speech as well, right? You must be very confused at this moment, and you’re probably wondering why I have appeared here.” Song Shuhang’s eyes narrowed as a result of the wide smile on his face.","When smiling this way, he looked like a villain.","Most of the practitioners across the universe wore puzzled looks.","Some of them fell into thought, and those who knew the truth covered their foreheads, their expressions complicated.","In the Infernal Realm.","Demon Emperor Hezhi’s eyes were cold. If the chill in his eyes were to be moved to the North Pole, polar bears would no longer have to worry about losing their home.","Is he finally going to expose himself?","Come on, let me see who dared to pretend to be me in the ancient era!","Song Shuhang said, “First of all, I want to thank you, Senior Hezhi.”","He stretched out his hand and slowly lifted the mask off his face.","Under the majestic emperor’s face was a pudgy chin. His chin had probably become pudgy during the time he only had his head left, which resulted in all of the nutrition he received being absorbed by his head.","“Thank you for sending me that batch of Tribulation Transcender energy a few days ago. It was that energy that allowed me to be here. Senior Hezhi, from today onwards, you are my best pal!” Song Shuhang abruptly lifted off the mask on his face, revealing the kind-looking face below.","[T-Tyrannical Song!]","...","[T-Tyrannical Scholar!]","[T-Tyrannical Dragon!]","[T-Tyrannical Demon!]","At times, stuttering was a disease, and it was extremely contagious."]},{"number":2170,"title":"Chapter 2170 As long as you’re sincere, we’ll watch","paragraphs":["2170 As long as you’re sincere, we’ll watch","Tyrannical Song’s despicable methods were beyond the imagination of the people in the universe.","No one expected that he would be able to use a disguise to cover up his face during the Profound Sage Speech.","For thousands of years, during the Profound Sage Speech, the practitioner that was hosting it was forced to show their real face, until Profound Sage Tyrannical Song somehow bypassed this rule.","Previously, when Tyrannical Song appeared in his child form, he managed to fool everyone. Practitioners all over the universe had learned their lesson, and this time everyone was wary of Tyrannical Songs of any age group.","Unexpectedly, Tyrannical Song directly used a disguise. And for some unknown reason, this disguise was able to bypass the iron rule of the Profound Sage Speech.","How could anyone see this coming?","At this point, should they just directly avoid the Profound Sage Speech?","We’re willing to watch everything from beginning to end, but before giving the lecture, could he at least allow us to prepare ourselves for what is to come?","Many practitioners had this thought, and they hoped it could reach Senior Tyrannical Song through the Profound Sage Speech.","They hoped that the next time that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song delivered a speech, he would do so in a straightforward manner, without so many detours.","[By the way, Senior Brother, did you hear that just now? Did Tyrannical Song just thank Demon Emperor Hezhi for his Tribulation Transcender energy? It sounded like that was why he was able to hold another Profound Sage Speech.] Someone with keen ears took notice of Tyrannical Song’s words.","[Could Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s fourth speech have been due to Demon Emperor Hezhi?]","[Is that why when Profound Sage Tyrannical Song showed his divinity this time, his face was that of Demon Emperor Hezhi? Maybe the Demon Emperor helped him in secret!]","Bold speculations emerged in the minds of many practitioners across the universe.","??????","In the Infernal Realm.","When Song Shuhang’s harmless face emerged on the screen, Demon Emperor Hezhi’s chest exploded due to the pent-up anger.","If he did not have a firm heart, he would have been so angry that he would have vomited blood by now.","Even after tons of calculations, he never considered that the person showing his divinity right now could be Tyrannical Song.","This was true injustice.","Seeing Tyrannical Song alive and kicking, Demon Emperor Hezhi knew that the Tribulation Transcender energy he had forcibly sent over was lost forever, with no way of getting it back. However, that was not the main issue here. Not only had he failed to hurt Song Shuhang after doing so, but he had even allowed him to hold another Profound Sage Speech.","As the saying goes, good people do not live long, but enemies live for thousands of years.","Anyway, how was the vile Tyrannical Song able to go to the ancient era to show his divinity?","Demon Emperor Hezhi held back what he wanted to say next.","Tyrannical Song was currently holding a Profound Sage Speech.","If his thoughts were to reach Tyrannical Song, would it not simply become the bark of a defeated dog? It would only make people laugh.","He, the respected Demon Emperor Hezhi, had not yet fallen into a situation where he would tear down all appearances.","He would patiently hide in the dark, waiting for the right moment, and kill his enemy with one blow.","??????","In the Limitless Demon Sect.","Seeing that harmless-looking face, Young Master Hai felt a headache.","At the same time, his inner demon imitated the voice of the Tyrannical Song, and spoke in his mind. [Demon Emperor Hezhi is very powerful. That day, it was only through lucky circumstances that I was able to blow him up.]","To blow him up...","The Demon Emperor has been blown up!","The voice of the inner demon continued to echo in his mind. [Young Master Hai, you have suddenly become so weak. I’m really not used to this.]","Young Master Hai chanted slowly, “Tolerate it, endure it, avoid it, run from it, ignore it.”","Under the immense pressure, his mental strength had risen to a new level.","Young Master Hai did have many similarities with Demon Emperor Hezhi.","For example, both of them only possessed eight dragon patterns. Both of them never wanted to admit defeat. Both of them had great ambitions. Both of them were excellent schemers. The only difference may be that Young Master Hai did not have any talent for cooking.","Young Master Hai murmured, “Pressure cannot defeat me. It only makes me stronger.”","Next, he would just avoid Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","The last time they met, it was evident that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had lost interest in him. As long as he did not make trouble, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would probably have no interest in dealing with him.","Tolerate it, avoid it.","Do not be impulsive.","In the future, one day...","??????","In the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","The mask in Song Shuhang’s hand was reduced to ashes.","It was a pity that such a precious mask was gone just like that. If it could be used repeatedly, it would surely come in handy in the future.","“Now then, have you prepared your questions?” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, and a technological metal cube emerged before him.","At the same time, the picture of a robot with Song Shuhang’s face was projected from this cube.","[Real Time Question Answering AI]","At this time, this magical treasure was connected with the countless practitioners across the universe through the Sage’s eye and the powerful amplification effect of the Profound Sage Speech.","As soon as Song Shuhang activated this magical treasure, practitioners all over the universe could ask him any question about cultivation. The cube’s database was connected to a clone of the three-eyed young man, and Song Shuhang believed in his ability to answer the questions.","Song Shuhang said seriously, “The countdown begins. When the 20-second timer reaches zero, please send me the question you want to ask. Remember, each person only has one chance to ask a question, and only questions related to cultivation will be answered. Please do not play tricks when asking a question, as I will not answer any question that doesn’t follow the rules.”","After saying that, he activated the Real Time Question Answering AI’s program.","The 20-second countdown began.","Song Shuhang added, “Finally, a friendly reminder. Due to the interactive nature of this speech, only the fellow daoists who are currently watching the live broadcast will be able to ask a question and receive an answer. After the speech, please pass this on to the other fellow daoists.”","When answering questions in real time, one could naturally only answer when they were online.","This was similar to watching the rebroadcast of a stream. When the streamer was no longer online, one could no longer communicate with them.","[Pass this on to the others? Tyrannical Song really is treacherous and shameless!] In the minds of practitioners across the universe, such a thought immediately appeared.","[He’s practically forcing everyone to watch the live broadcast!]","[And from the tone of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, is he planning to hold another speech?]","[Are four Divinity Shows still unable to satisfy him?]","[Screw it... I’ve already grown numb to it.]","This was already the fourth time Tyrannical Song was holding a Divinity Show.","The first Divinity Show was normal, the second one was a surprise, and the third one gave everyone a shock. But by the fourth Divinity Show, they had already grown numb to it.","It’s fine.","As long as you hold the Divinity Show without playing tricks, we will readily watch it..."]},{"number":2171,"title":"Chapter 2171 Senior will definitely be overjoyed with this wealth distribution","paragraphs":["2171 Senior will definitely be overjoyed with this wealth distribution","Having everyone pass on the message was indeed to lay the foundations for his next Profound Sage Speech.","While Song Shuhang looked calm on the surface, he was, in fact, feeling quite embarrassed.","If it were not for the fact that he practiced three top-tier body tempering techniques, which gave him a particular thick face, he might have failed today.","However, there was nothing he could do.","He was ascending to the Seventh Stage right now, which meant that he would reach the Eighth Stage one day and hold his rightful Profound Sage Speech. If he did not thicken his face and ask everyone to watch it live, there was a chance that people would directly turn the broadcast off in the future.","The 20-second countdown quickly ended.","“Hello, everyone. I am a Real Time Question Answering Artificial Intelligence. If you have any questions about cultivation, you can ask me.” The 3D projection of Song Shuhang spoke to all the people watching the Profound Sage Speech.","All the practitioners quickly sent their questions to “Profound Sage Tyrannical Demon” through their minds.","This time, the number of people watching the live broadcast was more than any of the previous three times when Song Shuhang held a speech!","During the previous times, there were always practitioners who failed to watch the live broadcast for one reason or another.","But this time, since Tyrannical Song was going to answer any questions about cultivation in real time, many practitioners who were in seclusion were awakened by their brothers, disciples, relatives, or friends, and immediately ran to watch the live broadcast of the Profound Sage Speech.","After all, it was only during the live broadcast that they could ask questions. If they watched the rebroadcast, they would not be able to ask anything!","After all, asking personally and watching other people ask questions was absolutely not the same thing.","If the start of Song Shuhang’s speech could be delayed some more, the number of practitioners watching the live broadcast would have increased even further.","“What I’m doing aligns with the principles of the Throne of Wealth Distribution. Of the two treasures that I won from the bet, I am using one of the sake of practitioners all over the universe. I’m practically hitting two birds with one stone.” Song Shuhang, who had recovered some of his memories, praised his wit.","??????","Each practitioner had one chance to ask a question. While many of the questions were bound to be similar, the total number was still hard to count.","If it was not for the blessing of the Profound Sage Speech, the Real Time Question Answering AI that Song Shuhang was using would have been blown up from all the questions it was receiving.","At this moment, the Scholarly Sage’s eye, the Profound Sage Speech’s blessing, the Principles of the Throne of Wealth Distribution, and the database of the three-eyed young man’s clone all worked together, becoming a server that could receive the questions of practitioners from all over the universe.","Song Shuhang said passionately, “Senior Three Eyes, my wealth distribution ceremony is about to begin. Please accept the gift!”","Distributing wealth is one of Senior Three Eyes’ hobbies.","This time, with me distributing wealth to so many practitioners across the universe, Senior Three Eyes must be overjoyed.","??????","Meanwhile, in a world behind a wooden door, the rain had just ended and a rainbow had come out.","This world’s weather would change according to the mood of the three-eyed young man.","When there was a rainbow, it meant that the three-eyed young man was in a good mood. His mood today was brilliant, just like a rainbow.","The eyeball-looking butler delivered him some fragrant tea with its tentacles.","The three-eyed young man picked up the cup, swayed his rocking chair lightly, and took a sip of his tea like an old man.","“It seems that my master is in a good mood today. What made you so happy?” asked the eyeball-looking butler.","The three-eyed young man said with a nod, “Although I lost, the game I just played was very exciting. That made me quite happy. I’ve noted down the game, and when my contract with Tyrannical Song is over, I will play it with the next contractor. I’m in a good mood because I’m looking forward to when I can play that game again.”","That game where he had all the strength in his body sealed while falling from the sky with a randomized acceleration formation was a very new and interesting concept to the three-eyed young man.","Compared to Loose Immortal Xiaoyao, who didn’t show me anything new over thousands of years, little friend Tyrannical Song’s ways seem much more innovative, with him surprising me time and time again.","The eyeball-looking butler was speechless.","“Aaahhh!!!” Suddenly, the three-eyed young man screamed and the cup of immortal tea in his hand fell to the ground.","“What’s the matter, Master?” The eyeball-looking butler hurried over, caught the teacup with his tentacles, and stabilized the rocking chair.","“W-What is this? My clone is about to explode! The amount of information flowing through is simply crazy!” The three-eyed young man’s main body leaned on the armrest of the rocking chair, trembling as he spoke.","Is little friend Tyrannical Song playing some tricks?","It was as if all the practitioners in the universe had sent questions to his clone at the same time.","All kinds of languages, all kinds of questions... all in one go.","It was as if billions of flies, mosquitoes, and cicadas were buzzing in his ears at the same time.","The clone couldn’t bear the load, so it forcibly diverted a portion of the vast information to the main body to preserve its life.","The three-eyed young man’s main body was trembling, and his fingers left a few fingerprints on the armrest of the rocking chair.","What does little friend Tyrannical Song think of me? Does he think that I’m the Wielder of the Will?","Moreover, how on earth did that guy manage to send through so many questions?","After five breaths...","The three-eyed young man’s main body and clone dealt with the most simple and repetitive problems first.","Then, they made use of more processing power and quickly dealt with the complex, cultivation-related problems.","With the help of the unused processing power, the three-eyed young man began to go back and check on Song Shuhang to see what this guy was doing.","“This feeling... Is that the Profound Sage Speech? F*ck, this is insane!” The three-eyed young man pounded the armrest of his rocking chair.","Right, only with the blessing of the Profound Sage Speech could he exploit this bug.","I can’t believe I was so foolish to hand little friend Tyrannical Song the Real Time Question Answering AI!","The three-eyed young man sighed. “I must admit that I underestimated Tyrannical Song’s ability to cause trouble.”","Right at that moment, through the Throne of Wealth Distribution, several “thoughts” from Song Shuhang were sent over.","[Senior Three Eyes, my wealth distribution ceremony is about to begin. Please accept the gift.]","[This time, with me distributing wealth to so many practitioners across the universe, Senior Three Eyes must be overjoyed.]","The three-eyed young man: “...”","After dealing with all the problems, he lay weakly on the chair, his fingers tightly grasping the armrest of the rocking chair.","“I—AM—NOT—HAPPY,” said the three-eyed young man while putting emphasis on every word.","He was in no way thrilled by this new method to distribute wealth.","In the world where a rainbow had been shining, everything became dark, with rain coming down.","The eyeball-looking butler silently took out an umbrella.","At the same time, it began to admire Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","After all, he had managed to make use of its master’s favorite hobby to reduce him to such a weak state.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was the first person in the universe to achieve this feat."]},{"number":2172,"title":"Chapter 2172 The entire universe is convinced!","paragraphs":["2172 The entire universe is convinced!","A torrential rain came pouring down in the world behind the wooden door.","The weather was just an extension of the mood of the three-eyed young man. What had been a joyous mood a few moments before had turned into a downpour of sadness.","This means that my master is very sad, the eyeball-looking steward thought to itself.","Its tentacles held the umbrella up as it stood beside the three-eyed young man.","The three-eyed young man, who was drenched by the rain, turned his head to look at his butler. The butler held up an umbrella but only cared about itself and did not cover him at all.","The three-eyed young man’s heart felt extremely stifled, and this led to the rainstorm becoming heavier and heavier.","Because the torrential rain got heavier, the three-eyed young man’s heart felt even more stifled, and that led to the rain getting even stronger.","It was an infinite loop that could not be stopped!","The downpour, the beautiful garden, the three-eyed young man laying on his rocking chair amidst the rain, and the eyeball-looking butler standing on the side with an umbrella. The scene reminded one of a beautiful oil painting with a hint of sorrow.","Meanwhile, practitioners all over the universe received the answers to the questions they had sent to Profound Sage Tyrannical Demon.","Moreover, the answers came back very quickly.","For those who asked simple questions, they received their answer within a breath.","For those who asked difficult questions, they received their answer within three breaths.","After the practitioners received their answers, they began to discuss with one another. Some people even crossed worlds to meet each other and exchange their gains.","Later, the practitioners discovered that as long as they had asked a serious question related to cultivation, then regardless of their “cultivation system”, regardless of the language they used, regardless of whether it was a question regarding the state of mind, a question regarding cultivation techniques, or a question about magical techniques they received a satisfactory answer!","They were all deeply satisfied with the answers they had received!","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song seemed to have immense knowledge of every cultivation system, with each answer accurately resolving the doubts the practitioners had about certain aspects of their cultivation.","[Just how vast is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s knowledge?]","[There are as many cultivation systems in the myriad worlds, as numerous as the stars, and each cultivation system can be subdivided into many different subsystems. It is already extremely difficult for an Eighth Stage Profound Sage to know everything about their own cultivation system, so how in the world did Profound Sage Tyrannical Song manage to gain so much knowledge of the various cultivation systems and subsystems in the universe?]","Take Earth’s cultivation system as an example, this system was divided into Buddhism, Scholarism, Daoism, and so on. And within the daoist faction alone, there were as many schools as there were stars. Each school and sect had different cultivation techniques and practices.","This was the same for the holy light system, magic system, ancient witch system, warrior system, and so on. And there were still other practitioners from different parts of the universe, such as those from the Celestial Realm, Beast Realm, Ancient Realm, and Infernal Realm.","Different cultivation systems worked in completely different ways.","As a result, practitioners from all over the universe were absolutely stunned!","Their impression of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had changed yet again.","They no longer regarded him as someone scary due to their experience with the Impregnating Gaze, but rather as someone with an endless amount of knowledge.","[Could it be that everything has a common origin, so when one’s realm reaches the peak, regardless of the cultivation system, as long as it is a question about cultivation, they can answer it perfectly?]","[Just what level has Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s knowledge reached?]","All the practitioners in the universe were truly convinced this time.","All the practitioners who asked normal questions received satisfactory answers.","However, people that sought death, people that tried to cheat the system, and people that asked questions that had nothing to do with “cultivation” all received the strange image of an eyeball.","It was not Tyrannical Song’s Impregnating Gaze, but it was equally strange. Those who saw this eyeball felt a sense of unease in their heart.","The content of these unlawful questions was very varied.","Someone asked Profound Sage Tyrannical Song about some rather embarrassing private matters, someone asked about the contact information of the petite Fairy Su next to him, someone asked whether or not Ancient Sage Spirit Butterfly who showed her divinity together with him last time was married, someone asked for the contact information of Sage Monarch White who had shown his divinity together with him last time, someone asked if Sage Monarch Seven Lives Talisman had a dao companion... Yet no one asked if Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was married.","Some shameless people even asked if the virtuous lamia could get married.","All these shameless questions were answered with the image of an eyeball.","Across the vast universe, a group of powerful people who was currently in hiding wore stunned expressions.","All these people were Tribulation Transcenders who had accidentally been struck by Tyrannical Song’s Impregnating Gaze last time.","They were all avoiding showing their presence because of the imminent change of the Wielder of the Will. However, when they learned that Tyrannical Song was going to deliver a Profound Sage Speech again, they used the means at their disposal and accepted the broadcast of his Divinity Show.","It was not that they had become addicted to pregnancy, but that they had some dissatisfaction left in their heart!","So when the real time question answering session began, this small group of Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders laughed and asked about the difficult problems they encountered during their practice.","In the past, Tribulation Transcenders would have never done something as shameful as using the difficulties they encountered during their practice to embarrass an Eighth Stage Profound Sage who was delivering a Profound Sage Speech.","But if the other party was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, the Tribulation Transcenders felt no shame nor guilt in doing so.","In fact, embarrassing Tyrannical Song was their goal!","However, they were dumbfounded when they received correct answers to their questions within a mere five to six breaths of time!","The answer they received was concise and clear, without embellishment or useless words.","From this concise answer, the Tribulation Transcenders could feel Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s immense knowledge.","Their impression of Tyrannical Song changed, and in their minds, he became someone who could hold up the skies if they were ever to fall.","In terms of raw knowledge, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was truly on another level. Just like a seasoned teacher, he easily answered all the doubts that these Tribulation Transcenders had.","Whoever knew more than the others was worthy of becoming the teacher!","The problems that had plagued these Tribulation Transcenders for decades or even hundreds of years had been answered in just a few words by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","To be honest, if he had given them this kind of guidance face-to-face, they might even begin to worship him as their teacher! This was the grace of enlightenment!","[Is he really a Profound Sage?]","[No, Tyrannical Song is definitely not a Profound Sage.]","[He has shown his divinity again and again. That should be enough to tell us that he is not a Profound Sage.]","[It is very likely that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is a Tribulation Transcender who is preparing to step on his path to immortality. His path may be related to showing his divinity and providing teachings. That is to say, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song could host another Divinity Show in the future!]","At that moment, the hearts of the Tribulation Transcenders thumped.","Some of them even began to issue secret orders to their juniors and disciples...","At the same time, in the Spirit River Su Clan.","The patriarch of the Su Clan suddenly received an order from a “deceased” ancestor. It was an order from Su Clan’s Knot.","The ancestor wished to invite Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to the Spirit River Su Clan’s annual meeting."]},{"number":2173,"title":"Chapter 2173 Lightning Tree","paragraphs":["2173 Lightning Tree","On the stage of the Profound Sage Speech.","An inscrutable smile appeared on Song Shuhang’s face. After thinking for a while, he closed his eyes, which brought immense pressure to any practitioner that saw them.","He wanted to maximize the power of virtue that he was going to receive from this speech, so he closed his eyes once the AMA was finished to reassure the practitioners.","Little did he know that when he closed his eyes, the livers of all the practitioners in the universe trembled.","This was because they recalled that a similar scene had taken place when Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar had delivered his speech. Tyrannical Song had first closed his eyes and then opened them all of a sudden. Afterward, he brought all the practitioners across the universe to tears by making use of the Scholarly Sage’s eye.","!!","This was a lesson that they had learned the hard way.","Therefore, when they saw Profound Sage Tyrannical Song close his eyes, everyone became nervous.","The experienced practitioners began to take medicines, lie flat or sideways on the ground or directly in the air.","There were also some practitioners who tried to send a second question to Tyrannical Song, but due to the Real Time Question Answering AI being disconnected after its use, these questions went nowhere.","Song Shuhang said calmly with his eyes closed, “The speech has come to an end.”","[I-It’s over?]","[There’s no Impregnating Gaze?]","[This can’t be Tyrannical Song! It doesn’t make any sense!]","[Why do I feel like there’s something missing from Tyrannical Song’s speech when there isn’t an Impregnating Gaze?]","[Then, did I just take this medicine for nothing?]","Although there was some confusion, the “will” of the practitioners all over the universe continued to gather toward Song Shuhang.","This energy, which was similar to the power of faith, was collected and transformed, turning into light of virtue as it reached Song Shuhang.","The amount of light of virtue produced during this speech was much higher than the previous times.","The first reason was that there were simply more people that watched this speech; secondly, he was answering questions in real time, which directly benefited most of the practitioners.","Even the Ninth Stage Tribulation Trascnenders who were watching the speech were fully convinced.","Therefore, the amount of virtue that Song Shuhang obtained this time was extraordinarily high, simply as vast as the sea.","Behind Song Shuhang, the virtuous lamia placed her wrists together and opened her palms as she slowly raised her arms high up.","The virtuous fat whale propped her up, and one could vaguely see lightning flashing inside the whale’s body... That was tribulation lightning!","Practitioners all over the universe were left in disbelief and rubbed their eyes. However, no matter how many times they rubbed their eyes, the lightning of the heavenly tribulation was still there.","The oblivious practitioners wore puzzled looks. They had no idea what Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was going to do with the sealed tribulation lightning, but they still admired his means.","But a small group of practitioners who knew exactly what the tribulation lightning was for licked the corners of their mouths, drooling as they recalled its deliciousness.","??????","In order to not ruin his pose, Song Shuhang did not turn his head to look at the virtuous lamia.","However, based on her past evolutions, Fairy Virtue’s snake form should recede until her thighs.","As her private area was already covered by her wings, there would not be any problems.","Song Shuhang was looking forward to seeing how Fairy Virtue would look after recovering her legs.","The power of virtue in the sky started merging with the body of the virtuous lamia.","The virtuous lamia blinked and wanted to “die” again.","But the last few times she appeared in front of the people in the universe, she had “died” every time, so she felt it to be rather unoriginal to do it again this time.","Unfortunately, Scarlet Heaven Sword’s main body was not present.","Otherwise, she could perform the sword-swallowing performance for all practitioners across the universe.","The virtuous lamia’s strength constantly rose as she received the virtue. If not for her being limited by Song Shuhang’s realm, the strength of her body could have risen all the way to the level of Fairy @#%× when she was alive.","Even though the virtuous lamia’s strength was rising, her legs did not change to those of a human as she deliberately kept her snake tail.","The excess power of virtue was passed on to the virtuous fat whale in order to strengthen it.","The problem was that the power of the virtue they were receiving this time was simply too big.","Even if the virtuous fat whale was filled to the brim, it could not hold such a vast amount of virtuous power.","Above their head, the power of virtue was still descending.","After filling up the bodies of the virtuous lamia and the fat whale to the brim, the power of virtue was spewed out through the fat whale’s breathing hole together with the tribulation lightning inside its body.","This portion of energy solidified behind Song Shuhang, forming the third materialization of his light of virtue.","A huge “lightning tree” slowly grew.","Its tree trunk was made up of virtue, while its branches and leaves were made from the power of tribulation lightning.","The lightning tree grew bigger and bigger, reaching a height of 20 meters in an instant.","Claps of thunder could constantly be heard coming from the tree.","Song Shuhang looked up at the lightning tree, speechless.","He then looked at the virtuous lamia.","What is she doing?","Wouldn’t it be better to use this power of virtue to further strengthen her body and evolve? Why did she form a separate entity?","The stronger the virtuous lamia was, the safer Song Shuhang would feel.","Moreover, what is the use of this lightning tree?","From what he remembered, the tree born from Senior White’s virtuous power could at least bear fruit.","Can this lightning tree also bear fruit?","The virtuous lamia giggled. She then stretched out her hand and grabbed the 20-meter-tall tree with one arm.","Afterward, she flicked her snake’s tail and jumped onto the virtuous fat whale.","This was the virtuous lamia’s knight mode.","The huge lightning tree turned into the knight’s spear, and the fat whale turned into its mount.","The virtuous lamia was no longer satisfied with being a mere defensive tool. She wanted to start attacking.","After the knight-like virtuous lamia shook the lightning tree in her hand, she seemed to remember another thing.","She brought out the flat imperial hat and put it on.","The remaining power of virtue hovering in the sky poured into the flat imperial hat and recharged it.","Then, a gorgeous imperial robe materialized and shrouded her body.","This was the virtuous lamia’s imperial knight mode!","Song Shuhang felt as if he was blinded by the dazzling light.","In the end, all the power of virtue above his head was absorbed by the lightning tree.","The virtuous lamia, the virtuous fat whale, and the virtuous lightning tree all began to return to Song Shuhang’s body.","When returning to Song Shuhang’s body, the virtuous lamia suddenly leaned over to Song Shuhang’s ear and said softly, “It’s a treasure.”","She was talking about the lightning tree.","The lightning tree would not only serve as her spear but had another important use as well.","It would be an integral part of Song Shuhang’s arsenal.","“What?” Song Shuhang asked in confusion.","The virtuous lamia did not say anything else. She took the lightning tree and returned to Shuhang’s body.","All the phenomena in the sky dissipated, and the nascent souls in Song Shuhang’s body slowly closed their eyes.","His heavenly tribulation had officially concluded.","Song Shuhang turned around and got off the stage of the Profound Sage Speech.","He took a light step, and the nascent soul in his first small dantian shook slightly, just as if something was triggered.","Afterward, an illusion spread from this nascent soul."]},{"number":2174,"title":"Chapter 2174 I’ll help you build momentum!","paragraphs":["2174 I’ll help you build momentum!","At this moment, in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Song Shuhang turned around and left the platform for the Profound Sage Speech.","Meanwhile, Sister White Dragon pushed the Throne of Endurance with Sixteen still on it toward the platform.","The two humans and the dragon glanced at each other.","!!","In Song Shuhang’s body, the nascent soul in his first small dantian seemed to have received some sort of signal. One had to remember that this nascent soul was conceived with the help of Sixteen’s dragon pearl.","As Song Shuhang came in close contact with Sixteen, the small nascent soul began to resonate with her dragon pearl.","It was an illusory reality, the signature move of Seventh Stage Venerables.","This was an ability that had brought Song Shuhang a lot of pain in the past, but also benefits.","Generally speaking, after a Sixth Stage cultivator ascended to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, it would take them some time to transform the most tangible memories in their mind into an illusory world.","An example of this was Senior White’s “Desert World” and “Song Shuhang’s Room,” with the latter still being a work in progress.","Another example was Venerable Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s “Ancient Tomb World.”","However, Song Shuhang’s small nascent souls were born through unusual meansit could be likened to the difference between a test-tube baby and an ordinary baby.","This first small nascent soul, after resonating with Sixteen’s dragon pearl, directly generated an illusory reality.","A majestic and well-defended holy city emerged out of thin air.","The gates of the holy city were closed, and there was a mighty chariot and a set of golden armor in front of them.","This was a depiction of Song Shuhang’s first Golden Core Composition, the Forever Impregnable Holy City.","This nascent soul was obviously quite lazy.","It took the Golden Core Composition and turned it into a scene for the illusory reality.","The illusory reality materialized, and the gigantic holy city went to protect Sixteen.","Sixteen, who was on the Throne of Endurance, was propped up by the holy city and pushed to its top, just as if she were the master of the city.","Song Shuhang, who was fully armed, was pushed toward the Divine Lobster’s Chariot and then outside the gates of the holy city.","“Is this an illusory reality?” Sister White Dragon looked up at the sky.","In the sky, tribulation clouds were taking shape.","Those were all the tribulations that Song Shuhang had experienced. They were drawn on the Golden Core Composition, and now they were coming to life through the illusory reality.","The 11-wave heavenly tribulation of the Third Stage, which was difficult to come by even over a thousand years.","The 5+1 heavenly tribulation when he was ascending to the Fourth Stage.","The first-ever heavenly demonic tribulation, a combination of the Netherworld’s demonic tribulation and the main world’s heavenly tribulation when he was ascending to the Fifth Stage.","Seas of tribulation lightning, demonic tribulation lightning, ball-shaped tribulation lightning, dragon-shaped tribulation lightning, thunderstorms, five-element heavenly tribulation, divine lightning, lightning palms, modern artillery, missiles, nuclear bombs...","A rich variety of heavenly tribulations could be found in the illusory reality, and this scene caused anyone who saw it to feel fear as a sorrowful feeling welled up inside them.","Additionally, perhaps due to Song Shuhang having acquired that lightning tree, the Forever Impregnable Holy City and the heavenly tribulations in the sky carried the aura of the actual heavenly tribulation. They did not seem to be mere illusions.","This made it look even more terrifying.","If an enemy were to be pulled into this illusory world, the sky filled with heavenly tribulations would probably be enough to make them shout surrender.","Song Shuhang reached out and pointed his hand at the sky.","It was as if a pause button was pressed as all the heavenly tribulations in the sky became motionless. Ultimately, this was Song Shuhang’s illusory reality, and everything in the illusory world was under his control.","After all, he was a man who had created a bootleg version of Senior White’s Desert World when he was just at the Sixth Stage Realm. Song Shuhang already had some experience when it came to controlling an illusory reality.","On the top of the wall, Sixteen’s eyes met Song Shuhang’s.","Song Shuhang asked with a smile, “Have you thought about the content of your speech?”","“Yes.” Sixteen nodded. While Song Shuhang was delivering his speech, Sister Scarf had already prepared a manuscript for her.","It was just that after Song Shuhang’s performance, she did not know if her speech would be able to draw the interest of the practitioners across the universe. She was feeling a little nervous.","In addition, during the Real Time Question Answering Session, Sixteen had also taken the opportunity to ask him a question. However, she received the image of an eyeball as a reply. Not even Sister Scarf knew about this matter.","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “Be confident. Delivering a speech is actually very easy. Just remember that we are distributing wealth, not applying for a job. Keep calm and just say what you want to say.”","After saying that, he finally stepped off of the Profound Sage Speech platform.","The illusory world shifted, and Sixteen was moved to the Profound Sage Speech platform.","The illusory reality had not been dissolved yet, because Song Shuhang, being a rookie, didn’t know how to cancel his illusory reality of the Forever Impregnable Holy City.","The method to cancel the bootleg illusory reality was, after all, different from the real thing.","Interestingly enough, when Sixteen’s figure appeared on the speech platform, the illusory reality was also brought onto the speech platform, visible to all the universe.","There was a possibility that it was because the content of the illusory reality was produced by a combination of Song Shuhang’s golden core and Sixteen’s dragon pearl.","Therefore, the Profound Sage Speech considered this illusory reality to also be a part of Sixteen.","Seeing this, Song Shuhang immediately stopped thinking about canceling the illusory reality.","He decided that he would use the illusory reality to help set the stage for the petite fairy maiden and boost her momentum.","This would give her a head start, increasing the impact she could have on all the practitioners across the universe.","Regardless of the content of the lecture, the grandeur of her entrance could help her overwhelm others. At the very least, it would be effective when dealing with newbie practitioners in the First or Second Stage.","Across the universe, most practitioners were still thinking about the answers that they received from the previous Profound Sage Speech.","However, their immersion was cut short by the start of Profound Sage Su Shan’s speech.","[Speaking of which, the name Su Shan sounds quite similar to Su Three (San), doesn’t it?]","[Since Profound Sage Su Shan and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song have appeared together, is there going to be another special speech?]","[Whether it is a new mode or the usual style, a Profound Sage Speech will benefit us greatly. Don’t overthink it. Just listen well and appreciate what you get.]","While the practitioners from all over the universe were communicating, the second Profound Sage Speech began.","“Rumble~”","A huge holy city appeared in the eyes of the practitioners from all over the universe.","The holy city was vast and majestic, casting a feeling of oppression.","At this moment, Profound Sage Su Shan was sitting at the top of this holy city.","Although she was petite, her aura made her seem as if she was at least 5 meters tall!","At the same time, above Profound Sage Su Shan, countless heavenly tribulations appeared.","Lightning tribulation, five-element tribulation, a combination of heavenly tribulations, and even demonic tribulation. At the highest point in the sky, the sky was divided by a sea of demonic lightning and heavenly lightning, creating a doomsday-like scene.","The rumbling sound from earlier was caused by the heavenly and demonic tribulations.","Practitioners all over the universe could not help but gulp involuntarily.","Profound Sage Su Shan had not even begun delivering her speech, yet her momentum was already overwhelming!"]},{"number":2175,"title":"Chapter 2175 Open your ears and listen well","paragraphs":["2175 Open your ears and listen well","Beneath the holy city, there was another figure.","It was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, completely covered in armor.","His speech had already ended, but this man had a strong sense of presence, and even when doing nothing, he was rather conspicuous.","Before Su Shan’s speech began, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s figure kept on flashing beneath the Holy City.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, whose eyes were still tightly shut, seemed to be taking pity on the practitioners across the universe.","!!","??????","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator sent a message. “Shuhang must have used a magical treasure for this question answering session. I asked about a very profound cultivation problem, yet I received a proper answer in just three seconds. Little friend Shuhang could not possibly have given such a good answer.”","“Yeah, I asked a question that only someone at the Eighth Stage could understand and got a solid reply within 5 seconds.” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue wrote, a smiley attached at the end of the message.","Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire: “That real time, question-answering session should’ve been possible with that little metal cube that little friend Shuhang brought out when he began his speech. Every time he delivers a speech, he changes his style. Little friend Shuhang... What he’s doing is honestly not easy.”","Frice Reckless Mad Saber: “Huh? You all got reliable answers? I only got the picture of an eyeball!”","Fairy Dongfang Six replied, “Thrice Reckless, you yourself best know why you got that image as a reply. [Thrice Reckless Spiraling into the Sky Emote]”","Frice Reckless Mad Saber: “I don’t believe I’m the only one who got an eyeball. @Immortal Master Copper Trigram, @Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island (Soft Feather), @I’m that little white crane at the edge of the Earth’s End, @I’m Mr. Yellow Mountain’s loyal dog, @Dongfang Snow. @White.”","Looking at the long list of people that Thrice Reckless Mad Saber had pinged, Venerable Yellow Mountain silently used a Lightning Palm to soothe his heart.","Birds of a feather flock together.","He was considering adding most of the members listed above to the blacklist of that small program that would auto-mute people once they said more than ten words in a row.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “...”","Immortal Master Copper Trigram: “...”","Dongfang Snow: “...”","I’m Mr. Yellow Mountain’s loyal dog: “...”","I’m that little white crane at the edge of the Earth’s End: “...”","At this moment, the silence was louder than any words.","As expected by Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, these guys also received the image of an eyeball.","Soft Feather said seriously, “Senior Thrice Reckless, I asked a serious question about the ‘path of time’ and got a satisfactory answer. We are cultivators, and this was a nice opportunity to solve our doubts in regard to cultivation. How could I waste it? [Song Shuhang Spiraling into the Sky Emote]”","When he saw this message, Venerable Yellow Mountain felt relieved.","This message also greatly comforted Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly.","“By the way, what do you think Sixteen will talk about? Will she also use Song Shuhang’s magical treasure for her Profound Sage Speech?” Young Master Phoenix Slayer took the initiative to change the subject.","On the Profound Sage Speech stage, Sixteen had a magnificent debut.","The holy city, the tribulation lightning, the white dragon around her neck, and the picture of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song flashing from time to time below the holy city...","The opening scene alone had engraved the image of Sixteen in countless people’s minds.","Su Clan’s Seven panicked and said, “Sixteen has just ascended to the Fifth Stage. How can she deliver a proper speech?”","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman: “It’s fine. Shuhang definitely has a decent speech that he can give her. Previously, when I had to deliver a Profound Sage Speech, the puppet fairy maiden with him sold me one.”","When the Bright Moon Appears: “Sigh, the Divinity Show...”","Dharma King Creation: “Seven, your phone is ringing.”","Su Clan’s Seven: “Who’s calling?”","Dharma King Creation replied, “Su Clan’s Four?”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “[Confused expression] Creation, are you with Seven?”","Dharma King Creation said, “Yeah. I’m going to hold a concert at the Spirit River Su Clan, so I came to Seven’s immortal cave first. Tomorrow, I will head to the Spirit River Su Clan with him. Seven’s phone was charging right next to me.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “The Spirit River Su Clan agreed to let you hold a concert for them?”","Dharma King Creation said proudly, “I am now very popular in the world of cultivation, and my schedule for concerts has been filled until next year. If not for the fact that I still care about my daily practice, I could hold three concerts every day. [Soft Feather Headbanging While Playing the Guitar Emote]”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator felt that the world of cultivation was heading to its doom.","Meanwhile, Su Clan’s Seven ran over from the next room and picked up the phone.","“Seven, is it Sixteen who is showing her divinity right now?” Su Clan’s Four’s voice came from the phone.","Su Clan’s Seven asked, “Yes, it’s her. Is there a problem?”","After a long silence, Su Clan’s Four asked, “So, is she really trying to usurp the throne?”","“What?” Su Clan’s Seven looked confused.","“The Sage Name Su Three,” said Su Clan’s Four. This name was Su Clan’s Four’s previous daoist name.","Su Clan’s Seven: “...”","It’s mountain (Shan), not three (San)! Open your ears and listen well, M-O-U-N-T-A-I-N!","Su Clan’s Four continued, “Anyway, the ancestor passed a message to the patriarch, and the patriarch passed it to me. I will now pass it onto you.”","Su Clan’s Seven: “Which ancestor?”","“Ancestor Knot.” Su Clan’s Four lowered his voice and said, “I’m only going to tell you and no one else. The patriarch is quietly getting rid of the memorial tablets right now. We originally believed that our ancestor, Su Clan’s Knot, had died, but little did we expect that he was still alive. Fortunately, when I prayed to him before, I shed a lot of tears. I even promised him a lot of things when I was young, all in vain.”","“...” Su Clan’s Seven asked, “So, what did the ancestor say?”","Su Clan’s Four asked in surprise, “Aren’t you surprised that the ancestor is still alive?”","Su Clan’s Seven replied, “No, I found out some time ago.”","“Seven, you’ve grown up. You even have your own little secrets.” Su Clan’s Four sighed.","Su Clan’s Seven: “...”","When he tied up Thrice Reckless and brought him to Fairy Dongfang Six, he was going to give him an extra beating.","Su Clan’s Four continued, “We shouldn’t waste too much time; the phone bill will get very expensive. I will simply convey the words of the ancestor to you... The ancestor hopes to invite Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to the upcoming Su Clan’s annual meeting. We will be handing this task over to you, and if you want to invite other people, you can do it. In other words, you can invite as many people as you want, and you can invite whoever you want. Even if you want to invite cats and dogs, there is no problem!”","“I understand.” Su Clan’s Seven looked up at the sky.","The ancestor had spoken.","In the past, he was worried that little friend Song would end up being pressured by the Spirit River Su Clan, but just after a few months, little friend Song had grown to a level where he was respected and even sought after by the clan.","Su Clan’s Four asked again, “By the way, does Sixteen actually want to usurp the throne?”","Su Clan’s Seven said softly, “Senior, I will recommend you a book. Do read a Chinese grammar book for kids when you can.”","After saying that, he hung up.","At the same time, on the stage of the Profound Sage Speech.","Sixteen said, “Fellow Daoists across the universe, I will be talking about ?Lightning Techniques? today.”","“Rumble~”","When she said that, the heavenly and demonic lightning above her head boomed loudly. It was Tyrannical Song working behind the scenes to increase Sixteen’s momentum.","Sixteen turned her head and whispered, “Tyrannical Song, tone it down a bit.”"]},{"number":2176,"title":"Chapter 2176 A heart lacking substance","paragraphs":["2176 A heart lacking substance","If the background music was too loud, the people watching the speech would not be able to hear the content.","Song Shuhang nodded in understanding. He stretched out his hand, and the booming of thunder was greatly reduced.","As the sound of thunder weakened, the energy that Song Shuhang needed to maintain the illusory reality decreased as well.","Of course, this extra energy could not be wasted.","After some thought, he decided to use it on the light brought about by the lightning.","Thus, the heavenly and demonic lightning in the sky began to flash according to Song Shuhang’s will.","At the same time, different kinds of heavenly tribulations released different colors.","The light from the tribulation lightning, like colorful stage lights, shone on Sixteen.","Sister Scarf: “...”","Do you have too much energy to spare?","She turned her head to look at Song Shuhang’s position and nodded.","This guy really seems too full of energy.","Having just transcended his tribulation, along with the vast amount of power of virtue he received, Song Shuhang’s overall state had improved significantly. Whether it was his primordial soul, physical body, or skills, they had gotten better.","As a result, Song Shuhang was overflowing with energy.","Sister Scarf sighed and said to Sixteen, “Let’s start with the speech.”","The lighting and sound effects were left to Song Shuhang to handle.","Sixteen smiled slightly. She leaned against the Throne of Endurance and spoke about ?Lightning Techniques?.","During this time, the pain from the Throne of Endurance constantly assaulted her senses. She did not have Song Shuhang’s ability to adapt to the pain and eventually learn to enjoy it, so she could only endure.","She discussed ?Lightning Techniques? from their simplest concepts to the most advanced ones. Sister White Dragon assisted her throughout the speech. With that, Sixteen’s delivery went well.","At first, when practitioners across the universe listened to her explanation of ?Lightning Techniques?, they felt that her explanation was a bit too simple. The key points she mentioned were simple things that even those at the First and Second Stage had already grasped.","Practitioners who had high cultivation realms had already mastered such basic knowledge long ago.","[Don’t you think that the content of Profound Sage Su Shan’s speech is a bit too simple?]","[I’ve already grasped such concepts. She’s merely talking about the foundation of the foundation.]","[If the lecture is going to be like this until the end, I might just head out.]","[Could this be the reason why Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is desperately trying to build momentum and create an impressive atmosphere for Profound Sage Su Shan?]","Could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song knew that Profound Sage Su Shan was rather lacking in this aspect, so he tried to improve her standing before she began her lecture?","While practitioners all over the universe were busy making guesses, Sixteen’s speech became increasingly profound.","On the stage of the Profound Sage Speech, various phenomena began to appear.","It began with the most basic sound of the Great Way, the ringing of a bell.","Then came flowers, the image of a fish leaping over the dragon’s gate, and all kinds of visions.","Practitioners all over the universe focused on the speech, their ears pricked up.","[Amazing! This is exactly what we wanted!]","[That’s more like it! Profound Sage Su Shan’s speech has finally become interesting.]","[This speech is truly a gospel for practitioners specialized in lightning techniques.]","Most of the practitioners in the universe, especially those who were familiar with lightning techniques, were fascinated by what they heard.","But as they listened, the content of Sixteen’s speech became more and more complex.","Most of the practitioners were beginning to fail to understand what she was saying.","The content of the speech was too profound for them to understand in a short period of time, and most of them needed to ponder for a considerable period of time about every word before they could make sense of it.","[Wait... wait a minute, Profound Sage Su Shan, we were wrong. It’s too profound! Please stop!]","[Please speak a bit slower. Give us some time to comprehend your words!]","[It would be best if you could slow down the pace a little!]","Most practitioners frantically conveyed their thoughts, hoping that Profound Sage Su Shan could hear their pleas.","Unfortunately, Profound Sage Su Shan was a fake Profound Sage, and she did not have the ability and authority to “see the comments” when she was delivering her speech.","She followed the script given to her by Sister White Dragon and explained everything methodically.","In the end, the content of the lecture had become so profound that even Tribulation Transcenders could no longer understand it.","The small group of Tribulation Transcenders that watched Profound Sage Su Shan’s speech after watching Tyrannical Song’s speech were now in a daze.","[Is this even a Profound Sage’s speech?]","[A-Are you kidding me? This is definitely at the level of a Tribulation Transcender, and it might even be...]","It was approaching the level of an Immortal’s speech!","[I can’t understand what she’s saying anymore. The content of this speech has already touched upon the laws of lightning.]","[As expected of the fairy maiden who was so intimate with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.]","[I’ll write down what she’s saying and think about it carefully after the speech is over.]","[Of the two speeches today, one was novel and the other was very profound. Having the opportunity to watch them is worthy of a celebration.]","??????","Seeing the phenomena around Sixteen as she delivered her speech, Song Shuhang knew that the speech had gone well!","The content of Sixteen’s lecture was too profound, and Song Shuhang could not understand it at all.","However, the earlier explanations were still extremely useful to him.","At least now, his understanding of the Lightning Palm, Lightning Drawing Technique, and Charging Technique had risen to a higher level.","His understanding of the Lightning Palm was the one that benefitted the most due to him having come in contact with the power of the heavenly tribulation’s Lightning Palm recently.","Shuhang held out his hands.","This time, he did not even need to draw runes. With just a thought, a dazzling lightning ball materialized in his palm.","He flipped his palm lightly, and the Lightning Palm increased in size.","From a palm-sized Lightning Palm, it became the size of a basketball, then expanded until it reached a diameter of 5 meters.","Moreover, this was only its initial form.","As long as he continued to pour energy, its size would continue to expand. Song Shuhang estimated that he could make it reach 500 meters in diameter, around the size of a small village.","After he acquired a deeper understanding of the Lightning Palm, he should be able to expand it to the size of a big village.","As long as his proficiency kept increasing, the City-Wide Lightning Palm was right around the corner!","??????","Sixteen’s speech eventually came to an end.","After her speech ended, the thoughts of practitioners all over the universe gathered and turned into a huge amount of power of virtue that landed on her body.","For those who were listening to Sixteen’s lecture, they had no idea as to what she was talking about by the end","Few people in the entire universe could understand the last few sections of the speech, but what she had said sounded cool nonetheless.","The power of virtue that she had managed to gather was more than Sister White Dragon had expected.","“What form will Sixteen’s light of virtue take?” Song Shuhang was a little curious.","Would her power of virtue integrate with Sister Scarf’s body and enhance her existence, or would it materialize into a whole different existence?","After a while, the light of virtue in the air integrated with Sixteen’s body, pouring into the hole in her chest.","The hole was quickly filled.","Eventually, the power of virtue turned into an illusory heart of virtue!","“Is the light of virtue healing her chest injury?” Song Shuhang said in surprise.","The power of virtue unexpectedly had such a function.","Regardless... If the light of virtue could heal Sixteen’s heart, that would be great.","While he was thinking this, the illusory heart finished taking shape and began to beat like a real heart.","With a new heart, Sixteen’s face regained some blood.","“Thump~ Thump~”","The virtuous heart beat rhythmically until it suddenly shattered.","“Huh? What happened?” Song Shuhang looked dazed.","Sister White Dragon said slowly, “A heart made of virtue lacks substance. It has no support, just like a tree without roots.”","Song Shuhang asked, “It lacks substance? What does it need to be filled with, love?”","When talking about filling it with love, his right hand began moving involuntarily."]},{"number":2177,"title":"Chapter 2177 Heart pierced by Senior White!","paragraphs":["2177 Heart pierced by Senior White!","Sister Scarf glanced at Song Shuhang and asked, “Do you have some misunderstanding of what love is?”","Does this guy think that “love” is some kind of omnipotent thing and can be used to fill up anything?","Song Shuhang replied seriously, “Generally speaking, as long as someone says that their heart is empty, normal people would immediately think of filling that empty heart with love.”","Sister Scarf: “...”","Stop associating an actual physical “missing heart” with an emotional “empty heart”!","“Well, if the light of virtue needs something to rely on to create a functional heart, I might have a treasure that can come in handy.” Shuhang flicked his fingers, and a medicinal pill appeared in his hand.","Although the Rebirth Pill didn’t work on injuries caused by the heavenly tribulation, it should not be a problem for it to act as a support for the light of virtue.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and threw the pill into the hole in the petite fairy maiden’s chest.","He did so because the Profound Sage Speech was still ongoing and countless people were watching. Otherwise, he would have gone for a much more secure procedure and carefully placed the pill into the cavity.","After all, if he accidentally used too much force when throwing the pill, there was a good chance that he might injure her further. It was nowhere near as safe as personally putting it in by hand.","Just as Song Shuhang had guessed, this medicinal pill that he had gotten from Senior Three Eyes was enough to support the light of virtue.","With it as the core, the light of virtue created a new heart, which then began beating slowly.","This time, no matter how fast it beat, it did not collapse like it did previously.","The remaining power of virtue, after filling the hole in the petite fairy’s chest, went to Sister Scarf.","Sister Scarf did not reject it. She guided the light of virtue to strengthen the connection between her and Sixteen.","The buff of the Profound Sage Speech began to disappear.","At the same time, Song Shuhang’s illusory reality also dissipated.","??????","“It’s over,” Sixteen said softly.","Song Shuhang said, “Can we leave this place now?”","Under normal circumstances, after the speech concluded, the Heavenly Tribulation Realm would kick the Profound Sage that held the speech out.","Sixteen lowered her head, looking at the hole in her chest that had been filled with light of virtue. After some thought, she tried to stand up from the Throne of Endurance.","Song Shuhang hurried forward and reached out to grab the soft arm of the petite fairy.","A steel-colored hand grasped a small, soft hand.","The moment their hands touched, Song Shuhang’s soul was stimulated so much that it almost jumped out of his body. It was as if his body and consciousness were about to separate.","We’re just holding hands. Why was the special effect so exaggerated?","No... It isn’t just a special effect!","Song Shuhang soon discovered that the separation of the body and the mind he experienced was not an illusion.","His consciousness had really separated from his physical body.","It didn’t only happen to him, but to Fairy Su as well. Her body and soul were also being forcefully separated.","It was the merciless power of time!","Time was the most ruthless thing in the universe. It allowed the human body and soul to be born together and form an intimate connection. But in the end, time would mercilessly tear them apart, separating the body and soul forever.","At this time, Song Shuhang and Sixteen were experiencing this very event.","During the passing tens of thousands of years, their soul and body were ruthlessly separated.","Their bodies and souls were blocked by the river of time and forbidden from being together.","Song Shuhang felt that he could make an 800-word composition to describe the miserable feeling of separation that he was currently feeling.","??????","When their bodies and souls separated, the Heavenly Tribulation Realm began to collapse.","The sound of paper tearing echoed.","However, it was not paper but space that was being torn apart.","Then, a colored figure appeared in the monochromic Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","As soon as he appeared, this man drew everyone’s attention, his jet-black long hair fluttering behind his back.","“Senior White!”","“Senior White!”","Song Shuhang and Sixteen called out at the same time.","“Found you.” Senior White smiled. There was a long sword on his back, and this sword was none other than the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“Senior White, save us!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and shouted. He felt that in another ten or eight seconds, his soul and flesh would be completely separated.","When that happened, he would be completely dead.","“Don’t worry, that’s why I’m here,” Senior White said.","He walked slowly toward Song Shuhang and used his finger as a blade, suddenly stabbing Shuhang’s chest.","“It will hurt a little, so grit your teeth and bear with it,” Senior White reminded.","Senior White, you should have said that before stabbing me!","“It hurts! It hurts, Senior White!” Song Shuhang felt his steel-like chest muscles getting torn apart. Senior White’s palm pierced into his chest and grabbed his heart.","Is this what it feels like to have your heart gripped and your breath taken away?","However, what was strange was that no blood flowed from the wound.","Senior White took out his arm, a heart was now in his hand.","Unlike the bloody heart of a normal person, this heart looked as if it was sculpted from a gem. It shone with a luster like that of glass and looked like a work of art.","Song Shuhang said tremblingly, “Did... Did my heart get clogged up and hardened?”","At the same time, his body automatically circulated his three top-tier body-tempering cultivation techniques along with the secret, self-recovery technique.","In his original dantian, on the top of the fat whale’s head, there was a shining rune that helped him in secret.","Not long after, Song Shuhang felt an itchy feeling in his chest.","Given enough time, will another lustrous heart be born?","Senior White held up Song Shuhang’s lustrous heart with one hand and patted him lightly with the other.","“Rip~”","Song Shuhang’s and Sixteen’s bodies were completely separated from their consciousness and disappeared.","This was the will of Wielder of the Will White.","When Song Shuhang and Sixteen transcended the tribulation and held their speeches, their physical bodies and souls had traversed millions of years and briefly reunited.","Once they were done with their speeches, their body and soul would separate again. Next, their consciousness, which was left in the “past,” would join their body in the present.","“I’m going to die, I’m going to die...” Song Shuhang murmured.","Senior White smiled and said, “Little friend Shuhang, don’t cause trouble. I’m going to seal your consciousness and take you back now.”","Sixteen looked curiously at the lustrous heart in Senior White’s hand.","What does going back have to do with Senior White taking out Tyrannical Song’s heart?","Seemingly sensing the doubts in Sixteen’s heart, Senior White lightly tossed up the lustrous heart in his hand and said, “This is a medium that I will be using to seal your consciousness.”","Senior White, don’t play with my heart. It’s going to beat faster!"]},{"number":2178,"title":"Chapter 2178 Song No. 001","paragraphs":["2178 Song No. 001","Sister White Dragon said, “Seal our consciousness? Won’t our consciousness get pulled back to the future on its own after the time reversal ends?”","Out of the three of them, her memory was recovering the fastest. At this time, she had already recovered the majority of her memory.","When seals were mentioned, she became apprehensive. Usually, an Immortal like her would never give others a chance to seal her.","“The time reversal has already ended.” Senior White patted the black Scarlet Heaven Sword on his back and said, “That is why I have to use other means to bring your consciousness back.”","The time reversal was an experiment of Wielder of the Will White. While sending all of their consciousnesses to the past, he would also conduct some experiments.","!!","In order to keep the experiment going, he made it so that it could not be interrupted midway. So even if the magical technique ended, the time travel would not be reversed.","If they wanted to go back, they had to think of another way.","“Senior White, do you intend to seal everyone’s consciousness inside my heart? Is there anything special about my heart? Can it protect everyone’s consciousness and travel through time?” Song Shuhang looked at the lustrous heart curiously.","Speaking of which, he was now more or less a Seventh Stage Venerable.","If he sold this lustrous heart of his for money, how many spirit stones could he get?","After thinking for a while, Senior White replied, “It’s because your heart is quite secure.”","He did not pluck Song Shuhang’s heart out casually, and he only did so after careful consideration.","Senior White added, “Using your heart as a sealed container is mainly to add a layer of insurance.”","After saying that, he took out a plate-sized disc. There was a hazy mist surrounding the disc.","The disc was a treasure left by Wielder of the Will White, and it would help return everyone’s consciousness to the future.","The normal process was to let everyone’s consciousness enter this disc, and then return.","But given Wielder of the Will White’s unreliable character, Senior White felt compelled to add another layer of insurance.","Sister White Dragon’s divine sense extended over, lightly touching the mist surrounding the disc.","After a brief contact, her consciousness quickly retreated, and she said, panicked, “Is that the aura of eternity?”","“To be precise, it should be the aura of pseudo-eternity,” commented Song Shuhang. The mist surrounding the disc was similar to his smoke mode.","After the Profound Sage Speech ended, his memory had recovered significantly, about the same percentage as Sister White Dragon. However, this was mainly because he had only cultivated for a short time, so he recovered the relevant memories very quickly.","Sixteen asked, “Senior White, is this disc a magical treasure that is supposed to bring our consciousnesses back?”","Senior White nodded slightly.","“That’s right,” Senior White replied. “I will guide everyone’s consciousness into Shuhang’s heart and then place the heart into the disc. This way, should there be any accident in the middle, Shuhang’s heart will act as a protective shield.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","My poor heart!","“What about you, Senior White?” Sixteen asked. Was Senior White’s consciousness not going to use the disc to go back?","“Of course, I will also return through the disc, and I only need half of my body to go back with you. The activation of the disc can be left to my half that is a clone. After the clone activates the disc, it can cancel the clone technique and simply disappear.” Senior White smiled slightly.","After he finished speaking, Senior White stretched out his hand and lifted the upper half of his body.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Sixteen: “...”","“Haha, since that’s the case, let’s go back.” Song Shuhang laughed. Seeing Senior White’s body separate like that, he was finally sure that the Senior White in front of him was the real Senior White.","??????","Senior White first drew a string of complex runes on Song Shuhang’s heart.","Every time he made a stroke, Song Shuhang felt an itch in his heart.","This was merely a phantom sensation, but no matter who it was, if they saw their heart being grabbed and touched, they would probably feel the same.","Sister White Dragon watched the whole process carefully, analyzing how the sealing formation worked.","“Okay, it’s done.” Senior White held up Song Shuhang’s heart in satisfaction and said, “Disposable heart-shaped sealing magical treasure... Song No. 001.”","Song Shuhang applauded vigorously. This naming style was very Senior White-like.","When he got back, he planned to consult Senior Medicine Master and ask him if there was any medicine for regrowing one’s heart. Since “Song No. 001” was a disposable magical treasure, he had to consider getting a new one.","“Are you guys ready?” Senior White looked at the two humans, the dragon, and the sword.","Sister White Dragon replied, “No problem here.”","Song Shuhang said, “Ready.”","Sixteen nodded slightly.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword sighed faintly. It had not even been able to say a word from beginning to end!","Senior White shouted, “Well then, Shuhang!”","Song Shuhang replied, “Here!”","In the next moment, his consciousness was stretched like a noodle and sucked into the lustrous heart.","Heavens, is this disposable sealing magical treasure, Song No. 001, so powerful?","Song Shuhang was impressed. Once he got back, he could try and see if he could pluck out another heart. If he could make another Song No. 001, he would always keep it with him and bolster his defenses.","“Sixteen,” Senior White called out.","“Here.” Sixteen smiled and followed in Song Shuhang’s footsteps.","“Fellow Daoist White Dragon.” Senior White looked at White Dragon.","“Here.” Sister White Dragon nodded in response. Her body did not need to be stretched like a noodle because she was a long white strip anyway, so she could easily take that shape without deforming.","“Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword.” Senior White called out one last time.","The hilt of the black Scarlet Heaven Sword pointed at Senior White. “I... Ahhh!”","Like the others, its consciousness was pulled into the heart.","Senior White nodded in satisfaction. He held Song Shuhang’s heart in one hand and opened the disc with the other.","Inside the disc was a strange dimension.","There were countless strange rays of light inside, each of which contained the power of time.","At this moment, all the rays of light were still.","From the looks of it, everything inside the disc was frozen in time.","Senior White held Song Shuhang’s heart and carefully placed it inside the disc.","The lustrous heart, which was beating slightly from time to time, entered the disc and froze completely.","Senior White nodded slightly.","Afterward, his half-body turned into light and entered the disc as well.","Meanwhile, his half-bodied clone deftly closed the disc with its foot, sealed it, and activated it.","After the disc was activated, it turned into a ray of light and disappeared from the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Senior White’s half-bodied clone wandered around in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, found a nice place, and sat down in a cross-legged position.","“Bang~”","The clone technique was canceled, and the half-bodied clone disappeared."]},{"number":2179,"title":"Chapter 2179 Song “Flirty” Shuhang","paragraphs":["2179 Song “Flirty” Shuhang","After Song Shuhang’s heart was moved into the disc, everyone’s consciousness was frozen in time.","In the world inside the disc, everything was completely still.","Even Senior White’s half-body, which was lying beside the lustrous heart, was frozen.","Under the concealment of the mist, as long as the disc did not reveal itself, nobody in the universe would be able to sense its existence.","Song Shuhang’s thoughts were also frozen. In the disc world, the concept of time seemed to have been lost.","??????","After an unknown amount of time, Song Shuhang had a dream.","He dreamed of a scalding desert... not the one that belonged to Senior White, but rather a strange, fiery desert that was somewhat similar to what one might believe purgatory would look like.","In his dream, he was walking barefoot in the desert like an ascetic monk. The soles of his feet burned from the heat of the desert.","Because the soles of his feet were too hot, Song Shuhang woke up with a start.","His consciousness “opened” its eyes.","After his eyes opened, he saw Sister White Dragon right beside him.","Truth be told, Sister White Dragon was an absolute beauty among dragons.","She had beautiful dragon horns, magnificent and glistening, and her figure was also immaculate. Yu Jiaojiao once said that dragons mainly determined their beauty by their dragon horns.","As for her figure, Sister White Dragon had a slender body with perfect proportions... that perfectly matched that of a scarf.","I wonder what Sister White Dragon’s human form looks like...","Song Shuhang’s consciousness turned and looked elsewhere.","On his other side was Sixteen.","While sleeping, she curled up like a cute little shrimp.","Song Shuhang sat beside her and looked at her frozen self. “Will Sixteen really grow to look like her adult version we saw some time ago?”","It was hard to tell.","Song Shuhang recalled her posture. He rested his face on his crossed arms and looked sideways, a small portion of his face hidden behind his arms as he looked at Sixteen.","Mm-hm, this should be the pose.","Next time, he would face Sixteen with this posture and see how she would react. In the meantime, he would practice while she was in a frozen state.","This is much better than practicing in front of a mirror.","Song “Flirty” Shuhang.","After practicing a few times, Song Shuhang’s consciousness decided to see if he could look outside his heart.","When he thought of that, his consciousness “seeped” through the lustrous heart.","In the next moment, he saw Senior White lying on the lustrous heart.","Senior White was also frozen in time.","His arms were crossed and his face was resting on his arms. His eyes were closed, and his long eyelashes were slightly curled upward. Sparse strands of black hair were scattered over his face, giving him a lazy look.","Senior “Super Attractive” White.","“I can’t learn that. It’s simply impossible,” Song Shuhang said, dejected.","This was too difficult to learn.","His consciousness quietly bypassed Senior White and headed outward as he wanted to explore further.","But before he could move further, a suction force came from the lustrous heart, pulling him back.","Song Shuhang’s consciousness was, once again, frozen in time.","??????","Then, after an unknown amount of time passed.","The newly-ascended Venerable Song had another dream.","This time, he dreamed that he was being washed away by a flood. He struggled in the torrent, but in the end he could not fight against the immense power of nature. He was overpowered and forced deep into the water, where he could not breathe.","This kind of dream was very familiar. Song Shuhang remembered that when he was a child, he would have similar dreams when he wet the bed or was about to wet the bed.","Whenever he dreamed of this irresistible flood, as soon as he relaxed and gave up resistance, a flood would surge out in the real world and draw a map on his bed.","Thinking that he might wet the bed, Venerable Song suddenly opened his eyes.","Then, Sister White Dragon’s dragon horns came into view.","A familiar scene with familiar characters.","Song Shuhang’s consciousness secretly heaved a sigh of relief. He first looked at Sister White Dragon and then turned his head to look at Sixteen.","After some thought, he practiced that flirty pose two more times right next to Sixteen.","Then, his consciousness seeped through the heart again.","Outside the lustrous heart, Senior White’s pose was still the same.","Song Shuhang could not help but give him a quick glance. Afterward, his consciousness quickly moved outward, toward the outside world.","Previously, he had dawdled for too long and his consciousness was dragged back into the lustrous heart. This time, he wanted to see if he could see the outside world if he hurried.","Although just for an instant, Song Shuhang’s consciousness seemed to get a glimpse of what lay ahead!","This short glimpse was enough to make his head ache.","In the next moment, his consciousness was pulled back to the lustrous heart.","When his consciousness returned, he thought carefully about the external information he got a glimpse of.","First, he saw water.","The outside world seemed to be underwater, which was consistent with his dream of being submerged in water.","Then, he vaguely saw a young girl playing in the water.","The girl’s feet were submerged in the water, shaking slightly.","Her appearance was very similar to a certain pavilion master... To be precise, she looked just like Pavilion Master Chu Two.","Thinking of Pavilion Master Chu Two, Song Shuhang could not help but touch his neck.","Fortunately, his head was still there.","After that, he fell into a frozen state again.","??????","While the time in the disc was frozen, the time outside was constantly moving.","The newly-ascended Profound Sage Tyrannical Demon had another dream.","This time, he dreamed that he was walking on the clouds. And as he stood atop the clouds, his fear of heights flared up!","He did not dare to look down for fear that if he took the wrong step, he would fall through the clouds.","A man named Edward Murphy once proposed a law—anything that can go wrong, will go wrong.","Since Song Shuhang was afraid of taking the wrong step, he misstepped and fell through the clouds.","“Aahhh!” Profound Sage Tyrannical Demon woke up with a start.","After waking up this time, he calmed down significantly.","He glanced at Sister White Dragon first, and then went to practice his flirty pose next to Sixteen as usual.","Afterward, he seeped through the lustrous heart, took another look at the particularly attractive Senior White, and tried learning a bit from him.","Soon after, his consciousness quickly moved outward.","When his consciousness seeped into the outside world, he saw wind coming from the east, auspicious clouds covering the sky, and flying dragons and phoenixes.","This scene is familiar...","It’s him, the super amazing Scholarly Sage, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He could not be mistaken. These were the phenomena that appeared when the Scholarly Sage was born.","This was a man who was destined to be extraordinary since the day he was born, and he would go on to live an incredible life. From the ancient era to the present day, there were few people that could match his strength.","Even after death, with only an eye left, his prestige continued to shock the entire universe through the name of Tyrannical Song."]},{"number":2180,"title":"Chapter 2180 The King of Teasing","paragraphs":["2180 The King of Teasing","Whether it’s the desert, the pavilion master of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, or the Scholarly Sage, they are all related to me. Were these marked time nodes? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","More importantly...","After Senior White activated the disc, did he not directly send our consciousnesses to the future?","From the Desert World to Pavilion Master Chu to the Scholarly Sage, this was clearly history moving forward.","Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","If that’s the case, when I return to the real world, whenever I fight someone, wouldn’t I be able to say that line?","[I was imprisoned for ten thousand years...]","No... That’s not quite it.","[I have wandered for millions of years, living through different eras, and yet you dare to be my enemy? You are asking for death!]","When he thought of that, a certain emotion welled up inside him.","That emotion was shame.","Under normal circumstances, the enemy would probably attack him before he could even finish saying the line, as the line was simply too long.","While Song Shuhang was thinking, his consciousness was pulled back, falling into a time-stopped state again.","??????","From time to time, Song Shuhang would be freed from his frozen state, and every time, his consciousness would briefly seep out of the disc to gather some information.","Sometimes, he managed to gather useful information. Other times, he got nothing.","After the Scholarly Sage, Song Shuhang caught a glimpse of the stories of Sister White Dragon and the Heavenly Emperor when he came into contact with the outside world.","When caught a glimpse of Sister White Dragon’s story, he saw a small white dragon being born from the remains of a deceased ancient golden dragon. This was Sister White Dragon’s origin story.","As for the Heavenly Emperor, he caught a glimpse of a roar spreading across the universe. It was the moment when the Heavenly City was established.","Afterward, Song Shuhang’s consciousness reached the outside world several times, but the information he obtained was of no value and he couldn’t determine what was going on in the outside world.","??????","Even though he could not get any details, Song Shuhang took great pleasure in making his way out and exploring the outside world.","By doing that, he could roughly ascertain when they would “arrive” at their destination.","Song Shuhang was unfrozen. He wasn’t awoken by a nightmare this time but woke up on his own.","“It doesn’t feel right to wake up naturally like this,” Song Shuhang murmured.","After getting used to waking up from nightmares, waking up naturally felt a lot less interesting.","During the previous times he had woken up, he was greeted by Sister White Dragon’s horns.","Because he had seen them so many times, Song Shuhang glanced at her out of habit and then turned to look at Sixteen.","“I wonder when we’ll arrive...”","As he said, he tried several flirty poses in front of Sixteen.","This was the whole set he had learned during the time his consciousness was unfrozen. There were a total of nine poses, which displayed all his charm.","His face was so thick that it could not be destroyed even by the Heavenly Punishment. When Sixteen woke up and he showed her his set of flirty poses, what would her reaction be? Would she be seduced?","After completing his routine, Song Shuhang’s consciousness flew upward, escaping the lustrous heart.","??????","After Song Shuhang’s consciousness left, Sister White Dragon and Sixteen opened their eyes.","The human and the dragon stared at each other.","Sister White Dragon said, “That was Shuhang just now, right?”","“Mm-hm, that should be him.” Sixteen wiped the tears at the corners of her eyes, a smile appearing on her face. Only the heavens knew how hard it was for her to hold back her laughter just now.","Shuhang, when he was posing like that, was especially interesting.","After going silent for a while, Sister White Dragon asked, “Did he take the wrong medicine?”","She felt so much second-hand embarrassment that her dragon scales were about to stand on end!","“Sister White Dragon, we are spiritual bodies right now,” said Sixteen. What she was trying to say was that as consciousnesses, how could they possibly take any medicine?","Sister White Dragon said, “That means that he must have stopped taking his medicine and suffered a relapse.”","Sixteen said, “Still, it was pretty cute.”","“At least, this guy seems to have gotten the hang of things. He’s even started to learn how to tease girls. Although his way of teasing is completely wrong, he has some awareness.” Sister White Dragon looked up at the sky. She thought that it was better than a certain blockhead. “Next time, I will teach him a really flirtatious pose.”","Sixteen: “...”","Sister White Dragon continued, “The effect of the time technique seems to have ended, we should have returned. We just need to wait for Fellow Daoist White to undo the seal and bring us out.”","Although they had returned in the time it takes to blink once, for some reason, it felt like a really, really long time had passed.","??????","Outside the lustrous heart, Song Shuhang’s consciousness glanced at Senior White as usual.","Eh? Why do I feel that Senior White has become more eye-catching this time? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Senior White felt like a lifeless work of art earlier.","But now, it felt as if he had come to life.","After scratching his head, Song Shuhang’s consciousness seeped outward again. After all, the time that he could stay awake was very short. He had to make the most of every moment, lest his consciousness be pulled back into the lustrous heart before he could make it out and take a look.","When Song Shuhang’s consciousness seeped into the outside world, he found that this time the disc was back in a desert. It seemed to be particularly fond of deserts.","Several times during the trip, what he saw was a desert.","Which era does this desert belong to? Which person does it symbolize? Is it related to one of my acquaintances? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He tried his best to spread his divine sense outward.","This time, the range he managed to cover was particularly large, much larger than the previous few times.","Soon, Song Shuhang’s consciousness sensed a familiar object.","It was a large stone tablet that was standing in the middle of the desert.","Eh? Isn’t that Brother Tablet? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","From the looks of it, this node belonged to Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. However, he had no idea what era this was.","“Shuhang, are you awake?” Suddenly, a voice rang in Song Shuhang’s ear.","He was taken aback, and his divine sense immediately retracted.","After regaining consciousness, he saw the half-body of Senior White, yawning.","Senior White has woken up?","Wait, does this mean that we have returned?","Song Shuhang activated his divine sense, looking for Brother Tablet again.","After scanning the surroundings with his mind, he saw the other side of Brother Tablet too.","On this side were engraved the words “Song Shuhang’s Gravestone.”","Haha, we’re back to the present.","Their consciousnesses had returned safely.","Senior White asked, “What are you looking at?”","“I’m looking at my gravestone,” Song Shuhang said jokingly.","Senior White glanced into the distance. “Oh, it’s the stone tablet. Who is it fighting?”","“Fighting?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","He spread out his divine sense even further.","Then, a weird, evil demon appeared within his senses.","When his consciousness “saw” this strange evil demon, Song Shuhang’s consciousness could not help but touch its waist..."]},{"number":2181,"title":"Chapter 2181 Kidney vs Stone Tablet","paragraphs":["2181 Kidney vs Stone Tablet","For some reason, Song Shuhang felt his waist itch when he saw this strange demon.","There are always people who are after my kidneys!","Senior White asked, “Shuhang, do you have lower back pain?”","Song Shuhang said sadly, “No, Senior White, I don’t have back pain. It’s just that, for some reason, when I saw this evil demon, I ended up recalling that time I lost my kidney.”","“Mm, that makes sense.” Senior White nodded and said, “This evil demon is indeed related to that necrotic kidney of yours.”","Song Shuhang was stunned.","“Anyway, do you see that fog-like evil energy around its body?” Senior White’s half-body approached Song Shuhang and asked while pointing at the evil demon.","Song Shuhang observed carefully, and sure enough, he could see the fog-like evil energy of the Netherworld around the evil demon’s body. “Wait, that mist... Why does it feel so similar to my smoke mode?”","“Because it’s similar to your pseudo-eternity mode,” Senior White nodded and said. “It seems that Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball has achieved some success after researching the bone of eternity and your necrotic kidney.”","After all, it was the ruler of the Netherworld, the existence closest to the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will.","“In other words, is that the work of Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball?” Song Shuhang frowned.","This was not good news.","The more thoroughly the fat ball studied the principles of eternity, the greater the likelihood of it being able to directly enter the main world, even without the bone of eternity.","More importantly, from what Senior White had just said, after his kidney had been cut out, it had been picked up by Fat Ball and used for research.","As soon as he thought of the fat ball studying his kidney day and night, Song Shuhang felt a coldness at his waist. If it got any colder, he would probably never be lacking in any yin in his life.","??????","In the desert, the battle between Song Shuhang’s kidney demon and Song Shuhang’s gravestone reached its climax.","If I were to say that my kidney fought with my gravestone, would people even believe me? Song Shuhang’s heart felt extremely stifled.","“Boom~”","The kidney demon raised its arms high, and a huge ball of black lightning condensed between its palms.","The size of the lightning ball expanded wildly, instantly reaching five meters in diameter.","The demon roared and threw the lightning ball at the stone tablet.","The runes on the stone tablet’s body lit up, creating a shield-like defensive barrier to block the lightning headed its way.","The black lightning collided with the shield, with the light of the evil lightning filling their entire field of view. After the collision, thunder boomed repeatedly throughout the desert.","Song Shuhang said with dissatisfaction, “F*ck, the evil demon that was made with my kidney can even imitate the giant Lightning Palm!”","“That was not the Lightning Palm but a double-handed lightning technique,” Senior White calmly said. “It was a high-level lightning technique, the Wild Lightning Annihilation. The evil demon used the evil energy to activate it, which increased its destructive power even further.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior White said with bright eyes, “Let’s go. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet is fighting against the evil demon while protecting all of our physical bodies, which forced it into a passive position. Its main means of attack is suppression, but it cannot use it since it is busy protecting our bodies. We should go and help it subdue the evil demon.”","Seeing Senior White’s bright eyes, Song Shuhang’s heart thumped. “Are you going to take that demon as a pet?”","Whether it was Netherly White or Senior White, they both seemed to have the hobby of keeping pets.","However, Netherly White’s ability to keep pets was truly otherworldly. On the other hand, Senior White seemed to have raised a few that later died.","Senior White said, “No, it’s too ugly. I want to grab it and dissect it.”","Song Shuhang said, “But that’s my kidney.”","“Go back to the lustrous heart. I’m going to cast a technique to bring everyone out. Let’s talk later, I’ll catch this demon first.” After Senior White said that, he stretched out his hand and slapped Song Shuhang’s consciousness back into the lustrous heart.","In the desert, the evil demon began to cast one lightning technique after the other, attacking the stone tablet.","Taking advantage of the sky that was filled with thunderous booms, Senior White cast a technique, activated the disc, and approached the location where the physical bodies of Song Shuhang and Sixteen were stored.","??????","Inside the lustrous heart.","Seeing that Song Shuhang’s consciousness was about to return, Sixteen quickly returned to her “frozen state.” She closed her eyes, entered a fetal position, and stopped moving.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","What is she doing?","[Sister White Dragon, why don’t you do the same? If Shuhang finds out that we saw all of his previous shameful actions, he will definitely feel very embarrassed. What are we going to do if he doesn’t dare to do it again in the future?] Sixteen used her spiritual connection to say to Sister White Dragon.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Sixteen, are you saying that you want to see Shuhang do those embarrassing things again? My dragon scales are going to stand on end, okay?","However, since it was what Sixteen wanted, she had no choice but to cooperate and return to where she had been when she was in the time-stopped state and stay completely still.","After Sister White Dragon returned to her original position, Song Shuhang’s consciousness body was slapped back.","“Eh? Sister White Dragon and Sixteen haven’t woken up yet?” Song Shuhang scratched his head in puzzlement.","The time stop should have ended by now.","Additionally, the stiffening effect that the time stop brought with it seemed to have already disappeared.","“Could it be that they won’t recover until Senior White casts that technique?” Song Shuhang stepped forward and lightly poked Sixteen’s cheek.","This sensation... I’m now sure that the time stop has already ended.","It must be noted that when they were in a time-stopped state, whenever he touched Sixteen or Sister White Dragon, they were as hard as stone.","After gently moving the hair on Sixteen’s forehead behind her ears, Song Shuhang turned his head to look at Sister White Dragon. Then, a bold idea came to his mind.","This was something he wanted to try when he had woken up during the time stop. But during those times, the bodies of Sixteen and Sister White Dragon were as hard as stone and could not be moved.","But now, taking advantage of the fact Sister White Dragon and Sixteen were unfrozen and still unconscious, he could give it a try.","Song Shuhang smiled happily.","He stepped forward and carefully grabbed Sister White Dragon. At this time, Sister White Dragon’s size was reduced, and Song Shuhang could grab her with one hand.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","What is Shuhang planning on doing?","Although she really wanted to slap him away, considering Sixteen’s wishes, she had no choice but to hold herself back.","Seeing that Sister White Dragon did not respond, Song Shuhang felt relieved.","After grabbing Sister White Dragon, he wrapped her around his neck.","“Wonderful.” Song Shuhang was satisfied.","When he lost his memory before, he saw Sixteen wearing Sister White Dragon like a scarf, and he was quite envious.","Now, taking advantage of this opportunity, he wanted to try how Sister White Dragon felt when worn as a scarf.","He could not miss this rare opportunity when Sister White Dragon was still unconscious. This was an opportunity that might never come by again!","While thinking of that, Song Shuhang wrapped Sister White Dragon around his neck a few more times.","How can you call something a scarf if you don’t wrap it several times around your neck?"]},{"number":2182,"title":"Chapter 2182 Empress Charge","paragraphs":["2182 Empress Charge","Coincidentally, when Song Shuhang finished wrapping Sister White Dragon around his neck, her face just so happened to face his own.","The majestic eyes of Sister White Dragon slowly opened, and a terrifying draconic pressure descended upon him.","The human and the dragon stared at each other.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Heavens, this is embarrassing.","Sister White Dragon gritted her teeth and said, “Can you tell me... What exactly is it that you are doing, little friend Shuhang?”","Have all guys who have the surname Song been cursed?","Some people were kissed by angels before they reincarnated, but as for those with the surname Song, did all of them have their brains licked by a husky before they were born?","Song Shuhang said quick-wittedly, “Haha... Don’t get me wrong, Sister White Dragon. It’s just that... When I saw you sleeping soundly, I thought of bringing you to Sixteen’s side. Then, I concluded that it would be most convenient to bring you over by hanging you around my neck... Ugh, sorry, I can’t think of any more excuses.”","“Continue to make up excuses. If it so happens to be satisfactory, I may consider letting you go.” Sister White Dragon bared her sharp teeth as she spoke.","At the same time, she tightened herself around his neck.","As expected of the White Dragon Scarf, it even has an automatic tightening function.","Song shuhang screamed, “Sister White Dragon! Ah, I’m going to die! I’m going to die...”","Sister White Dragon roared in anger, “Then die, you idiot!”","Unfortunately, Pavilion Master Chu was not online right now.","Otherwise, she and Sister White Dragon would have found a common hobby. The two might even be able to abandon past grievances and work together.","“Whoosh~”","At this time, Senior White just so happened to finish casting the technique.","That disc jumped into the grave protected by Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","With its mission completed, it split in half.","Senior White’s half-body held Song Shuhang’s lustrous heart and escaped into the grave.","“We’re back.” Senior White nodded slightly at the stone tablet. While saying that, he squeezed the lustrous heart.","The consciousnesses of Song Shuhang, Sixteen, White Dragon, and Scarlet Heaven Sword were all transferred out and returned to their physical bodies.","In the air, when the evil demon saw Senior White appear, it suddenly got a bad feeling.","It raised both of its arms, and nearly a hundred lightning rings emerged behind it. In each lightning ring, there was a laser condensed into shape.","“Die!” the evil demon roared. Perhaps due to it being born from Shuhang’s necrotic waist, when it spoke human words, it used Wenzhou’s dialect.","Hundreds of powerful laser beams shot through the air.","“Aaah! Sister White Dragon, please spare me! I’m going to die for real at this rate!” Song Shuhang’s scream could be heard coming from the grave.","When they returned to their physical bodies, Sister White Dragon was still wrapped around his neck.","This time, he was being dealt real physical damage!","As he was strangled, the feeling of suffocation came in waves. He felt as if his neck was about to be twisted out of shape.","With its master under attack, the light of virtue immediately appeared to protect its master.","The virtuous lamia emerged to protect its master. However, instead of resisting Sister White Dragon, she left the grave and went to face the hundreds of lasers.","When facing the attack, the virtuous lamia grabbed her hair, brought out the flat imperial hat and wore it after tying her hair into a bun by inserting a jade pin.","The tassels hanging in front of the flat imperial hat swayed gently with the movements of the virtuous lamia. As she faced the lasers, her eyes exuded an aura of majesty.","In the next moment, a mighty power of virtue emerged from the flat imperial hat, merging with the virtuous lamia’s body.","A gorgeous imperial dragon robe shrouded her body, with the long hem of the robe hiding her snake tail. On this dragon robe, there were nine lifelike dragons swimming around.","It was the virtuous lamia in her virtuous empress mode.","At the same time, the cry of a whale could be heard. The fat whale of virtue materialized right beneath the tail of the virtuous empress.","Afterward, there was a crackling sound, and an incomparably huge tree of virtue materialized in the hand of the virtuous empress.","The virtuous lamia was now in her imperial knight mode.","The virtuous lamia said coolly, “Veni, vidi, vici.”","I came, I saw, I conquered!","The only flaw was that the voice that came from the virtuous lamia was that of a male. It was unknown which movie she was referencing.","In the next moment, the virtuous lamia swung the virtuous tree in her hand.","The terrifying laser beams looked incredibly tiny when compared to the gigantic tree of virtue. Even if they were all tied together, they would not be as girthy as a single branch of the virtuous lightning tree.","Moreover, every leaf on the virtuous tree contained the power of tribulation lightning.","This type of lightning carried an immense suppressing effect toward the Netherworld Evil Lightning Technique unleashed by the evil demon.","The tree swept away the lasers with ease.","The virtuous lamia didn’t even slow down. While holding the lightning tree, she charged toward the evil demon. “I have wandered for millions of years, living through era after era.”","At some point, Fairy Creation had appeared beside her. At this moment, she followed up, “Yet, you dare to be my enemy? You are asking for death!!”","This time, they did not bring the black-skinned Soft Feather with them.","This was because the light of virtue and the power of the lightning tree would be incredibly harmful to her.","While Fairy Creation shouted “You are asking for death,” the virtuous tree slammed into the evil demon’s body like a battering ram.","The evil demon wanted to dodge, but the lightning tree’s canopy was simply too big. Its attack range was massive, and the virtuous lamia’s charging speed was so high that the evil demon was left with nothing but despair in its heart.","As if that wasn’t enough, Fairy Creation had cast several binding magical techniques on it.","It simply had no way out.","In the end, the evil demon simply chose to close its eyes and got ready for the attack of the virtuous lamia.","“Aahhh!” The evil demon’s body was blown to pieces, transforming into smoke. But even after that, the power of the heavenly tribulation did not let it off, chasing after every wisp of black smoke.","The virtuous lamia did not stop after crashing into the demon. She charged all the way into the sky, turning into a shining, miniature star of virtue.","This was the fault of her mount, the virtuous fat whale. It had no way of braking after beginning its charge.","On the back of the whale, the virtuous lamia turned her head and stared at the evil demon that she had run over with a hint of approval in her beautiful eyes.","This approval was not merely due to her acknowledging the strength of the evil demon but also due to the four-toned scream that it let out just now.","In the grave, Song Shuhang, who had been screaming repeatedly, suddenly stopped.","The lines that the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation recited aloud just now were still echoing in his ears.","How had that line entered the line database of the virtuous lamia?","When he actually heard the line being said aloud, a strong sense of shame crashed into him like a tsunami.","He felt that even his face, which had been buffed by his three top-tier body-tempering techniques, was not strong enough to bear such shame.","At this moment, Song Shuhang gave up resistance. He simply wanted to die.","“Is that even light of virtue?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was stunned.","The destructive power of the virtuous lamia’s imperial knight mode was way beyond the imagination of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet."]},{"number":2183,"title":"Chapter 2183 The part with the strongest desire to live","paragraphs":["2183 The part with the strongest desire to live","Song Shuhang is at the Sixth Stage Realm... Well, he was. He’s now at the Seventh Stage.","Yet, the destructive power of his Seventh Stage light of virtue seems to be comparable to a Ninth Stage magical treasure...","This simply does not make any sense!","Moreover, isn’t the main purpose of the light of virtue to defend its master? If so, what is with the destructive power of this light of virtue? Isn’t it just stealing other people’s jobs?","The more Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet thought about it, the more it felt puzzled.","As such, it chose to put this thought aside for the moment, deciding to focus on suppressing the evil demon in the air.","Although the demon had been blasted into smoke by the virtuous lamia, it was not dead yet.","Now that Song Shuhang and the others had woken up, it could finally unleash its true power.","Just as Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was about to act, Senior White’s figure abruptly emerged from the grave.","He smiled and said while holding a wooden body, “I’m back. Make sure to focus on your mission.”","“My mission?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was taken aback, but after a short while, it understood.","Its current mission was, of course, to be Tyrannical Song’s gravestone!","Does that mean that Tyrannical Song, who is in the grave, is about to die?","If that was the case, then it should not move.","After all, this was the new mission that its master, Netherworld Black White, had given it.","Having thought of that, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remained motionless atop the grave.","Senior White stretched out his hand and patted the wooden body. “Wooden body, can you shrink down a bit?”","“That wooden body does not have a mind of its own. Only some instincts remain,” said Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. If it had a consciousness, it would have also been involved in the time-reversal technique.","But as soon as Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet finished speaking, the wooden body began shrinking.","To be more specific, the upper half of the wooden body began to cave in.","In the blink of an eye, only the lower half of the wooden body was left. It had “shrunk” down with the two special fruits around the waist as the dividing point.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","How obedient... Is this wooden body really Tyrannical Song’s?","After Senior White’s upper half was connected to the wooden body, the two sides became one.","Senior White tried carrying out a series of difficult moves such as kicking, high leg raising, and splits, and then nodded in satisfaction after performing everything perfectly.","Afterward, he called out to Song Shuhang in the grave, “Shuhang, give me back my clothes.”","Only then did Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet realize that Sage White was only wearing a white undershirt at this time.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand tremblingly from the grave. In the next moment, a daoist robe flew out of his magical bracelet and landed in Senior White’s hand.","“Die!” Sister White Dragon shouted angrily as she tightened herself around Song Shuhang’s neck.","“Crack~” A sharp sound echoed from Song Shuhang’s neck.","Venerable Song’s head tilted to the side and his eyes rolled upward.","“Sister White Dragon!” Sixteen looked at Song Shuhang worriedly.","Sister White Dragon snorted, her slender dragon body unwrapping itself from Song Shuhang’s neck.","At this moment, Song Shuhang’s neck was twisted at a weird angle. It was similar to when the father of that female giant turtle of disaster had used that secret head-twisting technique on him.","Seeing this, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet quickly straightened its body, the words “Song Shuhang’s gravestone” on its body shining brightly.","It was a pity that Song Shuhang did not activate the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?. Without the holy ape choir, the atmosphere felt lacking.","Sixteen sighed, kneeled down beside Song Shuhang, and grabbed his head. “Seriously, you only joined the Nine Provinces Number One Group this year. How could you have already been infected by Senior Thrice Reckless to such a degree?”","Sixteen held Song Shuhang’s head with both hands, twisting it slightly.","“Klak~” Song Shuhang’s head was snapped back into place.","The General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? was truly extraordinary.","After mastering it, Song Shuhang’s body could be twisted and turned to extreme degrees. His newfound tenacity made him really hard to kill.","Song Shuhang’s eyes rolled downward, and he blinked at Sixteen.","Sixteen did not know whether to laugh or cry when she saw him like this.","Sister White Dragon seemed to sense something and suddenly turned her head.","Song Shuhang’s eyes instantly rolled up, and then he stuck out his tongue in full force.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Why are you sticking your tongue out like that? You’re provoking me, aren’t you?","“Sixteen, get out of the way!” Sister White Dragon gritted her teeth and wrapped herself around Song Shuhang’s neck again.","Outside the tomb, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet raised its head high, and the words “Song Shuhang’s grave” on its body began to shine even more brightly, foretelling the death of Song Shuhang.","??????","Senior White took the robe and put it on.","The robe automatically shaped itself, turning into a beautiful white windbreaker and also a pair of trousers to cover the wooden body.","“Unsheath,” said Senior White.","Meteor Sword came flying through the air, falling into his hands.","The black mist in the air finally re-condensed into a human form. However, its volume had decreased considerably.","After re-condensing, the smoky figure directly activated an escape technique, hoping to run away.","Senior White swung his sword and slashed at it.","The sword qi broke through space, directly cutting the human-shaped black mist.","The figure of black mist lost its legs, which fell from the sky.","Senior White was aiming at the creature’s waist, but the figure of black mist seemed to have sensed it and abruptly moved up, making it so that the slash did not hit its waist but its legs.","Senior White said cheerfully, “Well, I guess that this much is expected from Shuhang’s kidney.”","Shuhang’s kidney could be said to be the part of his body with the strongest desire to live, and it was also the part with the strongest defense. This evil demon formed from his necrotic kidney seemed to have inherited this characteristic from Song Shuhang.","The upper body of the evil demon frantically fled into the distance.","While escaping, it also picked up half of the disc.","Its main mission when entering this secret realm of the previous Wielder of the Will was to take away the “treasure.”","And this round disc was tainted with the aura of the previous Wielder of the Will, so the evil demon recognized it as the treasure that had been left behind.","When the evil demon was fleeing, it did not forget to carry out its mission and take away this half of the disc.","The evil demon’s secret escape technique was very powerful. After all, it was the work of Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball. It disappeared in the blink of an eye.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “Sage White, why didn’t you catch it?”","It felt that Sage White was perfectly capable of catching the evil demon. As such, it wondered why he let it go.","“For anatomical research, these legs will be enough.” Senior White took out a jade box and placed the severed pair of smoky legs inside it.","After putting away the jade box, Senior White smiled mysteriously. “In addition, only with a nice bait can we catch a big fish. Don’t settle on the immediate benefits, we have to focus on the long term.”","The runes on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body flashed. It seemed to not quite understand what Senior White was planning.","Senior White stepped forward and picked up the remaining half of the disc.","The disc had fulfilled its mission, and now, it had a brand new function."]},{"number":2184,"title":"Chapter 2184 A wise man does not stand under a dangerous ceiling!","paragraphs":["2184 A wise man does not stand under a dangerous ceiling!","Having lost its original purpose, the disc was nothing but scrap, and it could see some use only if Senior White provided it with some treasures from his treasury.","However, although the disc was currently split into two, it was originally a single item.","The disc in Senior White’s hand and the disc that had been taken away by the evil demon created from Song Shuhang’s kidney were connected to each other and could track the other side.","It would take a good bait to catch a big fish, and Senior White had always been a good fisherman.","After putting the disc away, he turned around and shouted toward the grave, “Everything out here has been dealt with. Shuhang, Sixteen, you can come out.”","The runes on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body shone, and it replied, “Fellow Daoist White, Shuhang seems to have been strangled.”","Senior White: “...”","A respected Venerable who practiced three top-tier body-tempering cultivation techniques was actually strangled to death. Still, it fitted little friend Shuhang’s style rather well.","At this time, a meteor came falling down from the sky. It was the virtuous lamia in her imperial knight mode who had failed to step on the brakes earlier.","She had finally made her way back.","“Ahhh~ Song~ Stupid~” Along with the quickly descending virtuous lamia was a screaming Fairy Creation.","The two fairies were falling toward the ground like cannonballs.","When they finally reached the ground, a huge explosion ensued, and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was even flipped upside down due to the impact.","Senior White managed to take a small step backward just in time to avoid the impact of the explosion, but the grave where Song Shuhang and the others were buried was directly blown apart.","“Did you just blow up this grave? Our enmity is irresolvable. We cannot live under the same sky!” from the blasted grave, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword shouted angrily.","Its consciousness had just recovered. There were some differences between weapon spirits and ordinary creatures, so Scarlet Heaven Sword’s consciousness took longer to recover compared to theirs.","As soon as it regained consciousness, the tomb in which it had been temporarily staying was blown up.","This was simply intolerable for it.","Who is so bold to blow up the grave of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?","Are they looking for trouble?","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword had just finished reprimanding the other party in its mind when someone grabbed its hilt and lifted it up.","Scarlet Heaven Sword shouted, “Eh? Hot, hot, hot!”","It raised its hilt to take a “look” at the source of the searing pain and saw the little hand of the virtuous lamia.","“Hehehe,” The virtuous lamia giggled.","Afterward, she raised up the black Scarlet Heaven Sword, raised her head, and swallowed it.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword screamed in horror, “Fairy @#%×, don’t! I’m still young! I don’t want to die yet!”","It was an inner demon clone and was different from the main body.","If it was swallowed by the virtuous lamia, it was equivalent to being wrapped in an extremely pure power of virtue, which could lead to its death!","The virtuous lamia swallowed down.","Ever since Scarlet Heaven Sword left, her sword-swallowing skill had been left on the shelves collecting dust... Today, she finally got to bring it out again!","In order to revive her performance, she even added a new feature.","When Song Shuhang delivered his speech and employed the Real Time Question Answering AI, he ended up gathering an incomparably vast amount of power of virtue","The power of virtue that he had received this time was far greater than in any of his previous speeches.","With this wave of virtue that had come pouring into her body, it would have been enough for the virtuous lamia to shed her snake tail and form two feet. However, she had forcibly stopped her evolution.","So, where did the excess power of virtue go?","The power of virtue she transferred to the virtuous fat whale and the virtuous lightning tree was only a portion of the total amount.","Anyway, the answer lay in the belly of the virtuous lamia.","She made use of the remaining power of virtue to create a “dimensional pocket” in her stomach.","This dimensional pocket was attribute-free, making it perfect for the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","This newly-created dimensional pocket could also become her trump card at critical times.","The virtuous lamia was very satisfied with herself.","“Ding~” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword fell into the attribute-free dimensional pocket and was left dumbfounded.","In this dimensional pocket, there were several small windows.","One small window was connected to the virtuous lamia’s sight, a small window was connected to the virtuous lamia’s hearing, and the remaining windows had various functions, such as smelling and telepathy.","“This space... It can’t be that Fairy @#%× made it just for me, right?” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword felt really scared.","Fairy, I’m not worth the price you paid!","It thought that it could escape the sword-swallowing performance since, unlike its main body, it was an inner demon, but it did not expect the virtuous lamia to go to such lengths to continue with her show.","On the side, Fairy Creation applauded silently.","??????","While the grave was blown apart, Sister White Dragon protected Sixteen.","Sixteen, who was carrying Song Shuhang on her shoulders, managed to stabilize herself after being blasted into the sky.","After she landed, Senior White stepped forward and put his hand on Song Shuhang’s forehead.","Senior White said, “He has really fainted.”","Sister White Dragon turned her head away in embarrassment.","Sixteen held Song Shuhang tightly and asked, “Senior White, are you going to wake him up?”","“There’s no rush.” Senior White shook his head.","He felt that Song Shuhang was in a trance rather than being in a coma.","It was very likely that when Fellow Daoist White Dragon tightened herself around his neck, he was enlightened on some subject and pretended to faint.","Senior White said, “We should leave this secret realm first.”","They could now return to Garre Holy Mountain’s trial area.","After leaving Garre Holy Mountain, Senior White wanted to spend a few days in the Beast Realm, basking in the sun and fishing.","It would be best if he managed to catch a big fish.","??????","Anyway, Song Shuhang had not actually entered a trance-like state. Through the Throne of Wealth Distribution, he entered the world behind the wooden door again to meet Senior Three Eyes.","This time, he did not take the initiative to activate the Throne of Wealth Distribution. It was just that after his consciousness returned to his body, the Throne of Wealth Distribution sensed that he had ascended to the Seventh Stage and pulled him over. Every time he rose a realm, he would get one chance to bet against the three-eyed young man.","Pushing open the familiar wooden door, Song Shuhang peeked inside.","After recovering his memory, he realized that he had messed things up during the real time question answering session and troubled Senior Three Eyes.","As such, he was a little nervous at the moment.","He decided to first check out the weather to see how Senior Three Eyes was feeling.","And so, he quietly glanced at the scene on the other side of the door.","In the world behind the door, rain was pouring heavily.","Not good, Senior Three Eyes is in a very bad mood, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","A wise man does not stand under a dangerous ceiling!","So, Song Shuhang made up his mind and retracted his head, ready to leave."]},{"number":2185,"title":"Chapter 2185 You can listen to what I say firs—","paragraphs":["2185 You can listen to what I say firs—","Perhaps it was because his heart had been taken out by Senior White, or perhaps because he had just been reborn, but Song Shuhang felt particularly cowardly today.","However, it did not hurt being a coward at times.","When he was about to close the door that led to the world of the three-eyed young man, the voice of the eyeball-looking butler echoed. “Master, why don’t you listen to some music? Listening to music might make you feel happy.”","Next, the eyeball-looking butler took out a musical instrument and began to play it.","The rapid sound of drums echoed.","!!","This prelude had a catchy rhythm, and people could not help but sway with the beat of the drums.","When Song Shuhang heard the beat, he panicked. This was because most of the songs of a certain senior in the Nine Provinces Number One Group started with this exact beat.","The music that’s going to be played couldn’t possibly be a song from that terrifying senior, could it?","I need to hurry and leave! If it’s really a song from that senior... If I don’t leave now, I might really not be able to leave at all!","Song Shuhang decisively turned around.","At this time, the rapid drumbeat and the prelude ended.","What followed was a woman’s loud singing.","It was not the singing of Dharma King Creation.","Moreover, the language that was being used was very special. It seemed to be the language of another world.","Song Shuhang secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","As long as it was not the singing of Dharma King Creation, he would be fine.","If it was the voice of Senior Creation, he was afraid that he would have been KO’d before he even got to escape.","After heaving a sigh of relief, Song Shuhang continued to back away quietly, retreating from the wooden door.","Today, he was going to be a coward.","Behind the wooden door, the woman’s singing became louder and louder, to the point that it reached Shuhang’s ears again.","Song Shuhang, who was retreating, discovered that his body had begun to shake according to the rhythm of the singing.","The beat of the drums, the notes of the piano, and the fast-paced singing of the woman. Every note she sang seemed to have the ability to make people dance involuntarily.","Even with Song Shuhang being at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, he could not resist the song.","His body kept shaking, just as if he were doing a robotic dance.","His head was like a clock, moving up, down, left, and right.","The voice of the woman carried a power similar to that of Dharma King Creation’s voice. It was a very terrifying power that made those who listened to their singing obey them.","What was even more troublesome was that after being dominated by the singing, Song Shuhang’s body began to involuntarily approach the place where the singing was coming from.","In other words, he, who was planning to leave quietly, was now dancing while approaching the wooden door.","F*ck, don’t tell me that this is the singing of an Immortal!","Unable to help himself, Song Shuhang opened the wooden door with his head bobbing up and down.","“Creak~”","??????","Behind the door, rain was still pouring down heavily.","The three-eyed young man listlessly lay on the rocking chair, letting the raindrops hit his body.","The weather in this world was completely dictated by the mood of the three-eyed young man.","His letting the raindrops hit his body clearly showed how bad of a mood he was in.","The eyeball-looking butler was holding an umbrella. However, it only covered its own body, letting the three-eyed young man be drenched in the rain.","When Song Shuhang saw this scene, his kidneys throbbed with pain.","This scene reminded him of his Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, the Impregnable Holy City.","In addition, the butler held a speaker-shaped magical treasure in his hand, and the singing was coming from that magical treasure.","Song Shuhang moonwalked toward the three-eyed young man, approaching the speaker-shaped magical treasure.","At the same time, his head kept swaying along with the music, shaking off the drops of rain.","At this moment, it was as if he were possessed by the king of pop.","It was not until Song Shuhang moonwalked in front of the three-eyed young man that the song slowly came to a halt.","The singing stopped and Song Shuhang was free again.","The third eye on the young man’s forehead looked at him.","This was the worst kind of forced encounter.","“Hi, Senior.” Song Shuhang finished the moonwalk with a nice pose, looked sideways at the three-eyed young man, and greeted him bravely.","“Hehehe, little friend Tyrannical Song.” The three-eyed young man raised his head and a bright smile appeared on his face.","The torrential rain disappeared as if it had never even been there.","A heart-warming sun once again smiled at the world.","Even the water that had soaked the young man’s clothes disappeared.","The eyeball-looking butler next to him silently put away the umbrella.","As soon as Profound Sage Tyrannical Song arrived, my master’s mood instantly improved. As expected of the first Sage in a thousand years, he’s indeed unfathomable, even if he’s a fake.","The three-eyed young man sat up from his rocking chair and said with a half-smile, “Congratulations on your ascension to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, my friend.”","“It is all thanks to the assistance of the magical treasure that Senior gave me. Without the Real Time Question Answering AI, I would definitely not have managed to deliver such a magnificent speech, and I would not have advanced to the Seventh Stage as smoothly as I did.” Song Shuhang showed a sincere smile and then continued, “In addition, I happened to fulfill my duty during the Profound Sage Speech, distributing the wealth of knowledge to the entire universe by answering their questions.”","Looking at the expression of the three-eyed young man, it was obvious that the real time question answering session affected him quite a bit. From his reaction and the changes in the weather, it was obvious that he wanted to settle accounts with him.","This was the worst-case scenario for Shuhang.","As such, he went ahead and brought up the agreement they made when he took over the Throne of Wealth Distribution to keep Senior Three Eyes in check.","“Little friend Tyrannical Song, you did a great job.” Senior Three Eyes chuckled and gestured with his hand. “Have you come to make another bet with me now that you’ve ascended to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm?”","“No, no, I’ve just ascended, so there’s no rush to make a bet.” Song Shuhang waved his hands repeatedly and said, “Besides, I have not prepared any treasure for the bet and only my consciousness came here this time, not my physical body.”","The three-eyed young man looked at Song Shuhang, the corners of his mouth curling upward. “That’s really a pity, because I can’t wait to gamble with Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song again.”","“Let’s leave that for the future. It won’t be too late to gamble when I have consolidated my realm,” said Song Shuhang sincerely. Anyway, even if Senior Three Eyes tried enticing him today, he would not let himself be fooled. No matter what Senior Three Eyes said, he would treat it as temptation and ignore it!","“You have a point,” the three-eyed young man said. “Anyway, I happen to hold some secrets related to the Seventh Stage Realm. Since little friend Shuhang has ascended to the Seventh Stage, would you like to hear about them?”","“Senior, do tell.” Song Shuhang immediately sat down and began to listen carefully.","Senior Three Eyes sat up straight and said, “After ascending to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, you only need to spend a few years honing your mind to condense an illusory reality. What I will talk about now are the hidden aspects of this technique. It does not matter if you have not condensed an illusory reality yet, you can listen to what I say firs—”","Opposite him, the newly-ascended Venerable Song silently activated his illusory reality, the Impregnable Holy City.","The three-eyed young man: “...”"]},{"number":2186,"title":"Chapter 2186 Scored a lucky hit","paragraphs":["2186 Scored a lucky hit","The three-eyed young man stared daggers at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang sat obediently opposite him, the Impregnable Holy City shining brilliantly behind him.","“Master, you have been slapped in the face,” the eyeball-looking butler said softly. Then, it brought out its umbrella again.","The torrential rain that had just stopped poured down once more.","Dark clouds covered the sky of the world behind the wooden door.","The eyeball-looking butler skillfully opened the umbrella, not letting a single droplet hit its body.","The three-eyed young man looked at Song Shuhang and said, “Can’t you ever follow normal procedures?”","When it came to newly-ascended Venerables, the first thing that they would do was to enter a state of meditation to consolidate their realm. After that, they would sharpen their mind and recall their deepest memories. It would then take a year to several years for them to construct their personal illusory reality.","Song Shuhang had just ascended, so why did he already have an illusory reality?","Opposite him, Song Shuhang waved his hands and said, “Senior, I really don’t mean anything by it. I just wanted to show you this illusory reality. This illusory reality is quite special as it’s not the product of my main nascent soul but rather of the Golden Core Composition of my first small nascent soul. It appears to be different from normal illusory realities, and my other six small nascent souls are also likely to condense their own illusory realities eventually.”","The three-eyed young man: “...”","In other words, you’re telling me that you’re going to have six other illusory realities like this one?","Tyrannical Song, how dare you say that you do not mean anything by it?! You’re slapping me in the face repeatedly!","The torrential rain in the sky got heavier, and some hail came down mixed with the rain.","Several large holes appeared in the fabric of the butler’s umbrella.","A few of the hailstones even hit its body.","The eyeball-looking butler sighed silently. This kind of mercurial master was truly difficult to serve.","It silently put away what was left of the umbrella and took out a larger, shield-shaped umbrella made of steel, and opened it up.","“Clink, clink, clink~” The hailstones fell on the steel umbrella, making a crisp impact sound that was actually very pleasant.","In the meantime, Song Shuhang had also taken out a turtle shell shield to protect himself from the hail falling from the sky.","He hurried to explain, “Senior, I really don’t mean anything by it. Actually, the illusory reality is an ability I grasped when I was still in the Sixth Stage Realm. If you don’t believe me, take a look at this!”","The reason he was showing another illusory reality right now was not that Song Shuhang’s desire to survive had disappeared, but rather because his desire to survive was unprecedentedly strong now!","In the copy of Senior White’s desert world, there was a younger version of Senior White.","In desperation, Song Shuhang hoped that Little White would bring him luck!","His strong desire to survive urged him to take this step.","The three-eyed young man was puzzled.","The eyeball-looking butler said, “Master, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song said that he grasped the illusory reality when he was still in the Sixth Stage.”","“Shut up.” The three-eyed young man felt his liver aching.","Song Shuhang snapped his fingers, and the Impregnable Holy City dissipated, turning into a desert.","Torrential rain and hail fell on the hot sand of the desert.","Senior White, help me! Song Shuhang prayed silently in his mind.","Little White did not show up, but a rumbling sound came from the depths of the desert world.","In the next moment, a thick pillar rose from the sand.","Song Shuhang shouted, “Oh no!”","When he saw this demonic god pillar appear, he felt a chill in his heart.","Whenever this pillar appeared in the past, he would be hung up on it and burned to death.","Although he wasn’t really going to die, it was not a good experience.","Moreover, it was quite embarrassing to be hung up and burned like that.","Amidst the rumbling sound, the demonic god pillar rose from the ground.","In the next moment...","The three-eyed young man was lifted up by the pillar to a height of over 20 meters. Right after that, a terrifying demonic fire erupted from the pillar and turned the three-eyed young man into a burning man.","Song Shuhang raised his head and stared stiffly at the burning man hanging from the pillar.","It’s over. Today, someone surnamed Song is absolutely done for. There is no saving him.","The eyeball-looking butler raised its head silently, looking at its master who was hoisted up by the demonic god pillar.","“Eh, isn’t this Demon Emperor Hezhi’s demonic god pillar?” said the eyeball-looking butler.","No wonder my master did not dodge; it was because he was hoisted up by the demonic god pillar.","It seems that seeing Demon Emperor Hezhi’s pillar brought back some memories from the past.","Afterward, the eyeball-looking butler stretched out two tentacles, placed them together, and muttered something.","At the same time, it said to Song Shuhang, “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, hurry up and make a wish. This is a living, crucified, and burning God, so take this opportunity to make a wish. You must not miss it as it might never come again.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","How did this butler survive till now? It’s simply a miracle.","Or could it be that this eyeball-looking butler is similar to the virtuous lamia and cannot be killed as long as its master is alive?","Anyway, this butler seems to know Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Taking into account that Demon Emperor Hezhi had the qualifications to take part in the battle to become the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will... Could it be that he competed with the three-eyed young man for the position of Wielder of the Will?","Or does Demon Emperor Hezhi have some kind of relationship with the three-eyed young man?","On the demonic god pillar, the three-eyed young man came back to his senses after about ten breaths.","With a quick movement, he broke free from the pillar and landed on the ground.","In the sky, the torrential rain and hail disappeared.","However, dense, dark clouds were still everywhere...","The butler put away the steel umbrella and took out a rocking chair.","The three-eyed young man sat down on it.","His eyes suddenly turned to six o’clock, and after a long time, he finally looked away.","He said slowly, “Cancel this illusory reality.”","Song Shuhang snapped his fingers to cancel the illusion and returned to sit opposite the three-eyed young man. That demonic god pillar seemed to have scored a lucky hit, allowing him to escape a catastrophe!","The three-eyed young man said seriously, “Let’s get back to business. Since you can create an illusory reality, you should be able to feel it. This innate ability that Seventh Stage Venerables possess is very mysterious. Theoretically speaking, it should not be an ability that can be grasped by a Venerable as it involves the principles of illusion, reality, as well as creation.”","Song Shuhang nodded.","He remembered that another senior had once said something similar to him.","“So, after you have ascended to the Seventh Stage, you do not need to hurry to ascend to the Eighth Stage. My suggestion is to study the illusory reality in depth. In addition, I have some knowledge about illusory realities in my hand. Come here, I will pass it on to you.” The three-eyed young man waved to Song Shuhang.","As he spoke, he stretched out his hand and brought it to his forehead, plucking out his third eye."]},{"number":2187,"title":"Chapter 2187 Are you in pain? My pain was far greater than yours!","paragraphs":["2187 Are you in pain? My pain was far greater than yours!","Sure enough, having the ability to gouge out one’s eyes was standard for big shots.","While pondering on illusory realities, Song Shuhang stepped forward and arrived before the three-eyed young man.","When Senior Three Eyes talked about the importance of illusory realities, Song Shuhang immediately thought of Pavilion Master Chu’s Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion.","The Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion was so realistic that even cultivators had a hard time telling if it was real or not.","Every plant, tree, and person that was inside seemed so real.","For tens of thousands of years, Pavilion Master Chu kept up the illusion of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, which seemed to have eventually broken through the limitations of ordinary illusory realities.","Afterward, Song Shuhang thought of the Ancient Heavenly City, which was also related to illusory realities to an extent.","Back then, some survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City tried to rob Pavilion Master Chu of her Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, intending to use it as a foundation to recreate the Heavenly City.","“Very good. Relax yourself,” Senior Three Eyes said seriously. He then pressed his third eye against Song Shuhang’s forehead. “Don’t resist, accept the information that I’m transferring to you!”","Are the hidden mysteries of the illusory reality contained in this third eye?","While Shuhang was in thought, the eye of the three-eyed young man touched his forehead.","When the eye touched his skin, Shuhang felt something similar to an electric shock course through his brain.","This pain instantly reached the limit that Song Shuhang could endure.","“Ouch!” Song Shuhang gasped.","His body began trembling from the pain.","What was present was not his physical body and only his consciousness, yet the pain felt so real.","Senior Three Eyes said slowly, “It will hurt a little. Bear with it.”","“Senior, you should have warned me earlier!” Song Shuhang gasped.","“If I had reminded you earlier, you would have instinctively guarded against the pain. How would you have relaxed then?” Senior Three Eyes replied while observing Song Shuhang’s expression.","Then, information about illusory realities poured into Song Shuhang’s brain from the third eye, and this information seemed to be authentic.","Song Shuhang began to cooperate with the young man, and tried to relax to better receive the information.","It would be wonderful if my QR code group ‘Cultivation’ could develop an information transmission function, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He felt that there were still numerous functions that he had to uncover.","Since “Cultivation” could allow for pure energy to be transmitted, something like transmitting information should be possible as well.","He was in the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm now, and as he continued to advance, he would definitely be able to unlock more functions and authority.","Just as he was thinking this, he caught a glimpse of the eyeball-looking butler, who was repeatedly blinking at him. It was a rather desperate kind of blinking as well.","Song Shuhang: “???”","What is it trying to tell me?","Oh, no... Senior Three Eyes might be trying to trick me! Song Shuhang realized.","However, it was too late.","In the next moment...","“Ahhh! I’m about to explode!!!” Song Shuhang screamed.","A huge amount of information was suddenly stuffed into his brain from the eye of Senior Three Eyes.","The information was like a powerful torrent as it rushed into his brain.","His brain was left shocked by the amount of information pouring into it.","If the information on illusory realities had a size of 1KB, then the data stream that was forced into his brain this time had a size of 1TB. The gap in size between the two was over a billion times.","The information that was being poured into his brain was no longer information related to illusory realities, but rather countless questions about cultivation in all kinds of different languages.","All these questions were seeking clarity on cultivation.","Practitioners of various strengths, fields, and worlds raised all kinds of questions.","There were male and female, old and young, deep and high-pitched voices...","With such a large amount of information being stuffed into his brain all at once, Song Shuhang felt as if his brain was going to explode.","...Are these the questions that the practitioners around the universe asked during my question-answering session? Song Shuhang immediately realized what was going on.","These were seeds he planted himself.","When you plant a seed, you must be prepared to reap its fruit—Nine Provinces Number One Group’s Fairy Soft Feather.","Song Shuhang had always felt that Soft Feather’s words were extremely accurate.","‘We are all adults, so we should not avoid the fruit borne from our actions.’","However, this “fruit” is just too big.","These days, there is an option to pay one’s debt in installments.","When bearing this fruit, couldn’t they have given me the choice to take it in installments?","Song Shuhang said with trembling hands, “Senior... Please slow down... My brain is going to explode...”","“Are you in pain?” the three-eyed young man asked in a gentle, almost brotherly tone.","Song Shuhang nodded while shaking. This scenario where a huge amount of information poured into his brain in one breath was a brand new kind of pain.","In addition, the pain breached his limit without warning, leaving Song Shuhang with no time to adapt.","If the transmission speed slowed down a little bit, Song Shuhang had the confidence to gradually adapt to it.","“Yes, you’re in pain,” the three-eyed young man said softly. “Don’t be afraid, though. Although you are in pain... My pain was far greater than yours!”","The butler covered its eye with its tentacle, unable to bear to look at the scene.","At the same time, its other tentacle moved the chair forward and stuffed it behind Song Shuhang, allowing him to sit down.","“The pain you are experiencing right now is only a trillionth of the pain I endured when you were delivering your speech. Can you feel it? I was shaking in pain and could not even get up. After so many years, you are the first to make me experience so much pain,” the three-eyed young man said happily. “So, you have to be proud, little friend Tyrannical Song. Hold your head up high. You are the best! You deserve this honor.”","This honor is something I don’t want. Can I reject it? Song Shuhang clasped the armrest of the chair so tightly that his fingers left deep gashes in it.","The three-eyed young man laughed and said, “Don’t worry, little friend Tyrannical Song, this is just the first wave of questions from the real-time question-answering session. I have prepared a total of ten waves for you... I planned to use it during the Seventh Stage betting game, but I did not expect that this trump card would come in handy so soon.”","Song Shuhang’s eyes rolled upward.","There are actually nine more waves of this?","I’m going to die!","The three-eyed young man said softly, “Try to resist, little friend Tyrannical Song. As long as you can make it to the tenth wave, I’ll give you this eye.”","Each of the next nine waves was going to be more brutal than the last.","He bet that Tyrannical Song would last until the fourth wave at most!"]},{"number":2188,"title":"Chapter 2188 So damn gentle","paragraphs":["2188 So damn gentle","Song Shuhang’s mind was in immense pain.","It felt as if a scorching-hot iron rod had been inserted straight into his brain.","This was the essence of cramming. As long as your brain is functioning, better continue feeding it with information!","The three-eyed young man was ruthless, and he didn’t even give him the opportunity to adjust to the pain.","Song Shuhang firmly clutched the armrest, his lips blue and his toes curled up from the severe pain he was experiencing.","Senior Three Eyes would ask him with a gentle voice from time to time, “Is it painful? Have you passed out yet? Are you still conscious? Can you continue enduring it?”","His voice was surprisingly warm. Just listening to it made one feel quite rejuvenated.","So damn gentle!","Next to them, the butler was thinking about whether or not it should massage Tyrannical Song’s temples to ease his pain.","Little friend Tyrannical Song looked so miserable right now, to the point that the butler felt like it was going to end up shedding some tears for him.","“Come on, little friend Tyrannical Song. The first wave is going to end soon. Victory is in sight. You can do it, you must persevere.” Senior Three Eyes encouraged Song Shuhang enthusiastically.","If Song Shuhang could not even withstand the first wave, wouldn’t his carefully assembled ten waves of information go to waste? Therefore, Tyrannical Song had to last, at the very least, until the fourth wave for it to be worth it.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, do you want a chewing stick?” the butler asked thoughtfully.","Song Shuhang was gritting his teeth and letting out painful whimpers from time to time. If he continued like this, he might end up biting his tongue off. As such, the butler felt that a chewing stick might come in handy.","The three-eyed young man turned around and glared at the eyeball-looking butler. If not for his butler having no mouth, he would have stuck a chewing stick right in to shut it up!","After about five breaths of time, Song Shuhang slumped in the chair.","He was gasping for breath, deathly pale, and covered in sweat. In this world behind the wooden door, there was no difference between a physical body and consciousness.","The first wave of information had finally ended.","In Song Shuhang’s mind, there were all kinds of questions about cultivation, all of which were raised by practitioners across the universe.","Theoretically speaking, these questions could benefit him.","However, the problem was that in the information that Senior Three Eyes transmitted to his brain, there were only questions and no answers!","It was not because he had a low level of theoretical knowledge but rather because of the language barrier.","Language was indispensable for communication. If people were unable to communicate with each problem, problems would arise.","As a result, a large number of the questions that were raised made no sense to him.","They had no other use aside from making his brain hurt.","Song Shuhang slumped in the chair—the pain that he had just gone through was comparable to death.","This kind of forced infusion of data was way worse than the 88,888 voices that kept ringing in his mind when he was studying the secret appraisal technique.","However, after this first wave of pain, Song Shuhang felt that he had finally adapted to this new kind of pain a little bit.","His body had begun to develop antibodies to fight against the pain.","Moreover, he did not know if it was just his misconception, but he felt that the strength of his divine sense had increased significantly. His mental energy also seemed to have grown to a certain extent when he was enduring the infusion of data.","The three-eyed young man said passionately, “Little friend Tyrannical Song, congratulations on getting through the first wave! However, now is not the time to rest. There are still nine waves waiting for you. We have no time to waste on meaningless things like rest. Rest is a waste of time and life. We must continue.”","Song Shuhang said tremblingly, “Wait, wait a minute, Senior! At least let me catch my breath!”","The three-eyed young man nodded and said, “No problem. After all, you are a junior, and I can’t give others the impression of being someone who bullies his juniors. I’ll give you some time to catch your breath.”","The eyeball-looking butler looked at Song Shuhang with pity in its eye.","A moment later, the three-eyed young man pressed his third eye against Song Shuhang’s forehead again. “You’ve already rested for three seconds. Come, let’s begin with the second wave. We should strike the iron while it’s hot!”","“Aahhh!” The classic Song Shuhang’s four-toned scream sounded.","The despicable Senior Three Eyes did keep his promise in a way; he let him catch his breath for three seconds!","[It would be great if this pain could be diverted to somewhere else. As long as I can divert the pain, I can adapt to it faster and gain more resistance to it.] While his brain was in shock, this thought flashed through Song Shuhang’s mind.","When he thought of that, Song Shuhang felt that the pain in his brain seemed to have reduced significantly.","It was as if the pain had really been diverted somewhere else.","The intensity of the stream of information that was being forced into his brain had not decreased. Yet, when compared to the first wave, the second wave felt weaker.","Then, was it just psychological?","The amount of information that Song Shuhang’s brain was receiving was increasing, and this was not something that could be faked.","Yet, the level of pain that he was experiencing seemed to be dropping.","[Could it be that I’m getting used to this pain?]","[No, my ability to bear this kind of pain is still very weak.]","[So, a part of the pain has really been diverted somewhere else!]","[Could it be that the QR chat group, Cultivation, has unlocked a new function that allows me to share my pain with others?]","[That can’t be right, though. If the pain has really been diverted elsewhere, then there should have been a prompt of some sort...]","Song Shuhang went to check the QR code, but it had clearly not been activated.","Then, where did my pain go?","“Your whole body is trembling. Are you in pain, little friend Tyrannical Song?” said Senior Three Eyes softly.","Song Shuhang gritted his teeth and closed his eyes. He did that because the eyes were a window to the soul, and he feared that the three-eyed young man would notice that his pain was decreasing from his gaze.","Because part of it was diverted elsewhere, the pain he was feeling returned within a range he could endure.","Song Shuhang’s pain endurance skill was now fully activated.","His adaptability to this new type of pain was improving rapidly.","After twenty breaths, the second wave of data entered its final stage.","Then, there was another surprise.","Song Shuhang could understand a part of the second wave of information.","The practitioners who were asking questions in this part of the data stream appeared to be practitioners from Earth.","Even if there were no answers to these questions, the questions could help Song Shuhang increase his knowledge.","The seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group should have also watched his Profound Sage Speech, so it was possible that their questions would be entering his mind soon.","I wonder what questions the seniors in the group asked...","Song Shuhang became a little curious. He was the type of person that was very lively as long as his brain wasn’t being stirred with a hot iron rod."]},{"number":2189,"title":"Chapter 2189 I shall give my all while putting on this show","paragraphs":["2189 I shall give my all while putting on this show","One question after another entered Song Shuhang’s mind.","All kinds of doubts that practitioners on Earth had about cultivation popped up in his mind.","Questions were asked in the languages of various countries, as well as some local dialects.","Questions in known languages, less known languages, and hardly spoken languages poured into his brain.","Song Shuhang struggled bitterly, waiting for questions in Mandarin to come. He was very curious about what questions the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group would ask.","After waiting for a long time, the voice of a young boy speaking in Chinese echoed in his mind. [Senior Tyrannical Demon, I am currently in the Third Stage Realm. I’m practicing the Lightning Drawing Technique from the ?Heavenly Master’s Lightning Techniques?, and I’m stuck at four bolts of lightning. How do I break through and learn how to use the fifth bolt? Is there any trick I can make use of?]","Heavens, this guy is a genius!","In the Third Stage Realm, he has already practiced the Lightning Drawing Technique until he can use four lightning bolts.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang, who was in the Seventh Stage Realm, could barely summon two lightning bolts.","Fortunately, the Real Time Question Answering AI was there to help him. Otherwise, Song Shuhang would not have even been able to answer questions of this level!","Soon after the young boy asked that question, hundreds of other questions in Mandarin, together with questions in English, Spanish, Russian and so on, poured into Song Shuhang’s mind.","“Ahhh!” Song Shuhang closed his eyes as he let out a painful roar. He even managed to squeeze tears out of his eyes, further enhancing his acting.","Inwardly, he was still looking forward to receiving the questions from those of the Nine Provinces Number One group.","Come on, give me all the questions in Mandarin at once. I want to hear the questions of the seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Group...","But then, the wave of information suddenly ended.","The data stream that was pouring into his brain was forcibly cut off.","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","It... stopped? Come on! Just a little more! Let me receive the questions of the seniors from the group!","It’s not like this data stream is a TV series. Why does it have the “to be continued” feature?","However, he could not simply start complaining to Senior Three Eyes and tell him to not stop the data stream.","Moreover, in order to prevent Senior Three Eyes from noticing any abnormalities, he had to keep acting.","During the second wave, he had only gained a minor resistance to the pain, and sharp pain continuously assaulted his brain and nerves.","He merely needed to match his body’s reaction to the pain and exaggerate it a little bit.","??????","After the second wave ended, Song Shuhang slumped in his chair again, gasping for air while sweat poured down his face. It was hard to tell whether the droplets on his face were sweat or tears. He was so weak that he could not even make a sound. His appearance this time was much worse than before.","Senior Three Eyes cheered him up, “This is only the second wave. Can you not bear it anymore? Is this your limit? How did you beat me during the first round of betting? Show me your endurance! Show me how well you can handle pain! Even if this is already the second wave, it’s way less intense compared to what I felt back then!”","He then gestured with his hand, and the eyeball-looking butler took out a towel and wiped away the tears and sweat on Song Shuhang’s face.","It seems that this guy won’t get past the third wave, Senior Three Eyes looked at the dehydrated Song Shuhang and thought to himself.","He felt a little regretful because of it, but he was very satisfied nonetheless.","It appeared that his carefully designed waves of information did what they were supposed to do. As such, as the creator, he was very satisfied.","The butler stepped aside after wiping off Song Shuhang’s sweat.","The three-eyed young man could not wait to press his hand onto Song Shuhang’s forehead and send the third wave.","“Senior... Senior... Let me rest for a whil— Ahhh!” Song Shuhang screamed again.","It’s time for me to perform with you~ I shall give my all while putting on this show!","The intensity of this third wave was much greater than the previous two.","At this time, the expression of pain on Song Shuhang’s face was 80% real and 20% fake. His acting was exceptionally good.","He was born with an easy-to-read face, but his expression at this time was simply perfect, so much so that even Senior Three Eyes could not see anything strange.","??????","Before he could “divert” the pain from this third wave, he was hit so hard that his brain nearly went into shock.","Fortunately, the intense pain only lasted for a moment and was quickly diverted elsewhere.","At the same time, the questions from the Nine Provinces Number One Group that Song Shuhang was looking forward to entered his mind along with the rest of the information that came with the stream.","It’s finally here! Song Shuhang thought to himself, happy.","At the same time, he discovered that his brain was a little magical.","Reasonably speaking, if such a huge amount of data was poured into someone’s brain, all of the data should be jumbled up.","However, even though his brain was swollen to the point that it felt like it was going to burst, he could still classify and organize the information he was receiving.","At this time, if Song Shuhang were to use on himself the ?Memory-Erasing Technique? taught to him by Senior White, he would notice that there were several different partitions in his mind.","C Drive, D Drive, E Drive, F Drive, and a DVD G Drive, as well as the icons for My Network and IE.","The F Drive was the memory drive of the virtuous lamia.","The E Drive was very mysterious and somehow related to Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit.","The D Drive was where Song Shuhang normally stored his memories, and seven small, external drives were connected to this D Drive, which caused its storage capacity to be massive. All the information poured into his brain by the three-eyed young man was sent into the D Drive, where it was automatically classified, sorted, and compressed.","??????","While in pain, people would think of other things to distract themselves and forget the pain.","Song Shuhang was now enjoying himself while suffering.","He extracted and arranged all the questions from the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","The first one to ask a question was Northern River’s Loose Cultivator. The always-online warrior of the Nine Provinces Number One Group was also the first one to ask a question.","The question raised by Senior Northern River was very normal, and it was about cultivation.","Song Shuhang was confused by the question. He could understand every word Senior Northern River said, but after combining them, he had a hard time making sense of them.","After Senior Northern River, it was Soft Feather’s turn.","Soft Feather’s way of thinking was very jumpy, and she was kind of a genius.","What question would she ask?","Song Shuhang was very curious.","[Senior Song, if my future self masters the power of time, is there a way for me to influence her so that I can get cultivation information?]","This was Soft Feather’s question.","Song Shuhang smiled and mused, Is Soft Feather trying to cheat?","After Soft Feather, it was Sixteen’s question that was brought up.","Sixteen was without memories at that time, and she was there with me. So, she also asked a question? Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Then, he clicked on Sixteen’s question.","[Tyrannical Song, are we dao companions?]","This was what the amnesiac Sixteen was wondering about."]},{"number":2190,"title":"Chapter 2190 Let me destroy your happiness!","paragraphs":["2190 Let me destroy your happiness!","Back then, Sixteen’s and Song Shuhang’s memories were in a mess.","In that situation, they instinctively ended up relying on each other.","That was the reason Sixteen asked such a question at that time.","Dao companions? Song Shuhang murmured the words in his mind.","These were words that were familiar yet unfamiliar.","Unfamiliar not because he didn’t understand what the words meant, but rather because he never got to experience anything related to them. It was similar to the awkwardness that a single person would feel when faced with words such as girlfriend or boyfriend. Of course, single big shots did not fall in the category of normal people.","As for the feeling of familiarity that he was experiencing, it appeared to stem from his disease that caused him to feel everything he saw or heard to be familiar.","I wonder how Sixteen’s question was answered during the real-time question-answering session. Song Shuhang felt like a cat was scratching his heart when he thought of this.","In principle, only questions related to cultivation should’ve been answered, and any question that was not related to cultivation would be ignored.","However, Sixteen’s question was related to cultivation in a way, as dual cultivation was also a way of cultivation.","What if several ?Dual Cultivation Techniques? had been sent to Sixteen during the real-time question-answering session? Wouldn’t that be extremely embarrassing?","Moreover, if Sixteen mistakenly thought that those ?Dual Cultivation Techniques? were sent to her by him, he had no idea how she would take it.","Song Shuhang frowned, calculating in his mind how to deal with this possibility.","Wait a minute...","After thinking about it carefully, even if he accidentally sent Sixteen several ?Dual Cultivation Techniques?, it seemed that he would not fall into such an embarrassing situation.","Perhaps this was an opportunity.","Later, she should find the time to look for Sixteen and confirm what answer she got during the question-answering session.","Many thoughts flashed through Song Shuhang’s mind, and the corners of his mouth could not help but rise slightly.","??????","Because he was too engrossed in his thoughts about Sixteen, Song Shuhang forgot to keep up his act.","The third wave of information was still being crammed into his brain.","What’s going on? Could it be that he’s already grown numb to the pain? The three-eyed young man frowned slightly.","The intensity of Song Shuhang’s screams had decreased, and that led to the enjoyment that the three-eyed young man was feeling to decrease as well.","The young man stared at Song Shuhang’s face and soon discovered that although he was screaming in pain, the corners of his mouth had risen slightly, as if he was thinking of something joyful.","This expression of pain and happiness gave off a twisted vibe!","Seeing Song Shuhang’s expression, the three-eyed young man’s heart felt stifled.","Is this guy a masochist?","“Is he enjoying the pain?” said the three-eyed young man, his voice unnatural.","“Master, I see that little friend Tyrannical Song’s eyes are dull. I’m afraid he is using a distraction method to decrease the pain he is feeling. He’s likely thinking of some happy things to district himself,” the eyeball-looking butler speculated.","The three-eyed young man said, “That makes sense. Let me read his thoughts.”","As a peerless big shot, he naturally had some mind-reading techniques.","Due to him giving consideration to Song Shuhang’s privacy, when the three-eyed young man met him before, he didn’t use such techniques. Besides, he could achieve the same result just by reading his facial expression.","In addition, Song Shuhang was receiving the stream of information with all the questions, so the three-eyed young man was afraid that if he used the mind-reading technique now, he would end up suffering the same fate.","“Let me see what this guy is thinking.” With that, he gently touched Song Shuhang’s head and activated the mind-reading technique.","After a while, his stomach felt stuffy.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was indeed trying to distract himself. He was using happiness to resist the pain.","Moreover, the source of his happiness was coming from the data stream that was pouring into his brain.","The three-eyed young man touched the armrest of his chair, the deep grooves in it reminding him of the pain he endured previously.","“Hehe... If you’re happy, how can I be happy?” He chuckled.","Little friend Tyrannical Song, let me destroy your happiness!","And so, he accelerated the speed of the data stream.","The total amount of data being poured into Shuhang’s brain would not be changed as he was a big shot who valued his words greatly. If he said that there would be ten waves of data, then there would be ten waves.","But there was nothing wrong with speeding up the process.","Scream, little friend Tyrannical Song!","The speed of the data stream suddenly increased, and the pain that Song Shuhang was experiencing rose sharply, and his screams became more intense.","The three-eyed young man’s mood improved immediately. He found himself quite addicted to listening to the screams of little friend Tyrannical Song.","It was clearly a piercing cry, but to the three-eyed young man, it sounded like music. He felt that he would never grow tired of listening to these screams.","After a few breaths, the third wave of data finally ended","Because the speed of the data stream had been accelerated, the third wave ended earlier than the previous two.","Additionally, this time, the three-eyed young man did not give Song Shuhang a chance to breathe.","“Now, it’s time for the fourth wave. You should already be proud of being able to survive this wave, little friend Tyrannical Song. Even a real Eighth Stage Profound Sage would not be able to withstand the intensity of this fourth wave. Scream, and then... fall!” The three-eyed young man began with the fourth wave.","The speed of the fourth wave was even faster than before.","“Ahhh!” Song Shuhang raised his head and shouted loudly.","Note that there was no longer any acting this time.","His pain diversion technique had already reached its limit, and it was no longer useful.","From now on, Song Shuhang would have to bear the pain by himself.","His voice was hoarse from all the screaming, and due to the extreme pain, he could not divert any attention to think about Sixteen’s question.","This was only the fourth wave, and there were six other waves, which were even more intense, waiting for him.","Even if he had a strong adaptability to pain, he was certain that he would not be able to resist until the tenth wave.","Unless he could divert the pain somehow, he would be done for today.","Eh? Wait, why do I need to endure ten waves of pain?","Amidst the extreme pain, Song Shuhang thought of a solution.","Although the terms of the bet stated that Senior Three Eyes would give him his third eye if he successfully endured all ten waves, he did not hold much desire for it as he did not even know what function it had.","In other words, he could just surrender!","“Senior... I admit... defeat!” Song Shuhang shouted while trembling.","“Unfortunately, you have no option to surrender in this trial. You either lose your consciousness or stay awake until the very end.” The three-eyed young man reached out and pressed his hand on Tyrannical Song’s forehead. “The fifth wave!”","Tyrannical Song survived the fourth wave, and this surprised him a bit. However, Shuhang could clearly not hold on for much longer seeing as he even wanted to admit defeat.","The three-eyed young man was confident that the fifth wave of pain would make Tyrannical Song lose consciousness!"]},{"number":2191,"title":"Chapter 2191 Congratulations, you have won my master’s third eye","paragraphs":["2191 Congratulations, you have won my master’s third eye","The fifth wave was more violent than the first four waves, and it hit him like a violent storm.","As the three-eyed young man expected, Song Shuhang screamed even more fiercely this time. His eyes rolled upward until only the whites were showing, and his mind became blurry from the impact of the data stream. Song Shuhang was now on the verge of losing consciousness!","If he did not take advantage of this opportunity to push through, when would he?","The three-eyed young man worked harder, and increased the speed of the data stream, trying to defeat Tyrannical Song in one go.","Soon, the fifth wave ended.","The three-eyed young man silently looked at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was breathing rapidly, his eyes had rolled up, and his fingers and toes were twitching uncontrollably. Yet, he was still awake, although barely. He had not fallen unconscious!","You were lucky to survive the fifth wave, but you will definitely not be able to survive the sixth wave! The three-eyed young man swore to himself.","He said calmly, “Let’s start with the sixth wave!”","An even crazier wave came crashing into Shuhang’s mind.","His condition worsened even further. His screams became weak, his face went pale, and his body gradually stopped twitching.","He had become a salted fish, and it seemed that he would lose consciousness and enter a coma at any time.","The three-eyed young man increased the speed again, increasing the explosive impact of the data stream.","Soon... the sixth wave also ended.","Song “Salted Fish” Shuhang, who seemed like he could lose consciousness at any moment, persisted until the end.","He clearly looked like he was going to fail at any moment, but he still persisted for two waves.","The three-eyed young man: “...”","This guy is really good at holding on!","Holding on until the very end, aren’t we? I don’t think you can do it, Tyrannical Song!","The intensity of the seventh wave was something that even Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders could barely endure. There was no way Tyrannical Song could endure it.","“Seventh wave, let’s go!” the three-eyed young man shouted.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song slightly adjusted his sitting posture. His screams turned into low muffled hums, the trembling of his body resumed, but his complexion turned rosier.","At the same time, his originally upturned eyes returned to normal.","For some reason, he seemed to have become more energetic...","And soon enough, the seventh wave also came to an end.","The eyeball butler said, “The eighth wave is next, Master.”","The three-eyed young man: “...”","His mood, which had improved after hearing the screams of Tyrannical Song, turned sour once again.","In the sky of the world behind the door, dark clouds emerged.","Song Shuhang asked weakly, “The eighth wave? There are still three more waves, right?”","Shuhang had gradually adapted to the immense pain caused by the information flooding his brain. His talent for rapidly developing a resistance to pain was working at full strength.","Endure the pain, adapt to the pain!","As long as he got used to the pain, Song Shuhang could adapt to it in an extremely short time even if the intensity of the pain increased.","Song Shuhang said firmly, “Come on, Senior. Start with the eighth wave. I can still hold on!”","The three-eyed young man said, “Then, prepare yourself. Don’t blame me if your brain explodes due to this eighth wave.”","After the eighth wave...","Am I seeing things or has Profound Sage Tyrannical Song become more energetic?","The three-eyed young man found it somewhat unbelievable. However, he did not voice his doubts and directly started with the ninth wave.","The intensity of the ninth wave caused Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to start trembling again.","But soon, he was back to normal.","He did not even let out any screams this time. He merely took a deep breath from time to time, showing that he was indeed suffering from the forceful injection of information.","The butler said, “The last wave, Master.”","Song Shuhang said, “The last wave, Senior!”","In the world behind the door, a drizzle began to fall.","The three-eyed young man asked, “Tell me honestly, Tyrannical Song. During the seventh wave, did you use some kind of trick?”","Song Shuhang shook his head. As long as he could adapt to the pain, he didn’t need to use any other trick!","The three-eyed young man went silent for some time and said seriously, “I did not expect you to be able to hold on until the tenth wave.”","“I did not think I would manage to do this either,” replied Song Shuhang seriously. He honestly thought that he would have been done for during the sixth wave.","The three-eyed young man looked at Song Shuhang again and said, “Before starting with the tenth wave, I must remind you of something. The intensity of the tenth wave is not something that can be withstood by a cultivator of your realm. The tenth wave is much more terrifying than the first nine waves combined. As such, I would like you to carefully consider whether or not you want to take on this last trial.”","Song Shuhang said confidently, “Let’s go, Senior. I’m confident that I can endure the pain.”","His self-confidence came from the fact that he had fully adapted to the pain caused by the injection of information.","Endure the pain, adapt to the pain, enjoy the pain.","Even if the tenth wave was stronger than the sum of the first nine waves, Song Shuhang was confident that he could survive.","The three-eyed young man said seriously, “I hope your confidence won’t come to bite you in the ass.”","As he spoke, he reached out and pressed on Song Shuhang’s forehead. “Let’s start with the tenth wave!!”","Shuhang felt as if a nuclear bomb had exploded in his mind, and a wave of indescribable pain assaulted his nerves.","However, the pain lasted only for a moment.","After the severe pain, Song Shuhang felt a refreshing feeling in his mind, which left him feeling extremely comfortable.","His mental energy and divine sense had ascended to a whole new realm!","The refreshing feeling was brought about by the transformation of his divine sense.","Song Shuhang could not help but show an expression of joy.","The three-eyed young man saw this twisted expression of joy, and the hairs on his arms stood on end.","The butler said, “Master, Tyrannical Song has been broken by you.”","The three-eyed young man went silent for a while and then accelerated the speed of the data stream without hesitation.","After fifteen breaths, the tenth wave ended.","Song Shuhang had a relaxed and content expression.","At the end of the transfer, he opened his eyes in confusion and asked, “Is it over already?”","The three-eyed young man: “...”","The butler said, “Yes, it’s over. Congratulations, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, you have won my master’s third eye!”","“It’s over so soon?” Song Shuhang showed a regretful expression. He could feel that if the data stream continued for a while longer, his mental energy and consciousness could evolve once more, realizing a second consecutive evolution!","The three-eyed young man: “...”","After a while, he said, “It’s time for you to go back, Tyrannical Song.”","I’m in a bad mood, and I don’t feel like talking too much. I just want to make this unsightly guy disappear from my sight as soon as possible.","After saying that, he put his third eye in Song Shuhang’s hand, turned around, grabbed the eyeball-looking butler, and gave it a hard squeeze.","“Plop~” A small eyeball was squeezed out of the butler’s pupil.","The three-eyed young man grabbed this new eyeball and skillfully inserted it into his forehead.","The eyeball-looking butler unexpectedly had such a function.","“Senior, what is the use of this eye?” Song Shuhang looked at the eye in the palm of his hand and asked.","“Didn’t you just experience some of its powers?” said the three-eyed young man while nudging Song Shuhang lightly.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang was sent flying through the wooden door, disappearing from the Throne of Wealth Distribution.","After Song Shuhang left, the eyeball butler carefully reminded his master, “Master, the eye you gave away just now is still connected to the database.”","The three-eyed young man: “!!!”","Cancel the connection, quickly cancel the connection!"]},{"number":2192,"title":"Chapter 2192 While I do have many means to fight big shots, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet is indispensable","paragraphs":["2192 While I do have many means to fight big shots, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet is indispensable","Song Shuhang’s consciousness was slapped away by the three-eyed young man. He fell out of the Throne of Wealth Distribution before being transferred back to the Beast Realm in the main world.","It was currently November 30th, 5:00 A.M. China Standard Time.","When Song Shuhang’s consciousness returned to his physical body, he heard loud booms. The sound reminded him of an earthquake or a landslide.","All kinds of anxious calls and screams reached his ears.","What happened? Song Shuhang suddenly opened his eyes.","Is it the end of the world?","Has the evil demon world invaded the main world?","Or have aliens invaded?","When he opened his eyes, he found that he was lying under a three-meter-wide king-size bed...","Song Shuhang: “???”","Why am I under the bed? Shouldn’t I at least be on the bed?","Before he fell into a coma, he remembered that he was still in Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds, but when he opened his eyes, he found himself in a completely different place.","Where am I? What happened?","The loud rumbling had not ceased, and the ground was still shaking violently.","The big bed rolled over, all kinds of furniture fell, the roof collapsed, and large pieces of debris fell toward him.","The virtuous lamia appeared, wrapped Song Shuhang’s body, and propped up a miniature Virtuous Palace to protect her master.","“Where’s Sixteen? Where’s Senior White?” Song Shuhang swept his surroundings with his divine sense. The scanning power of his newly-evolved divine sense was especially powerful.","With a swift sweep of his divine sense, a broad scene appeared in Song Shuhang’s mind.","Sixteen was standing at the door, holding a basin of water in her hands. The door was wide open, and it looked like she had been just about to go in when the earthquake hit them. Sister White Dragon was protecting her.","And then there was... Senior White.","Senior White was wearing a stylish long windbreaker and was lying in front of Sixteen!","Judging from the power of the earthquake, Senior White should have managed to control the force of his fall, at least he did not create a huge hole in the floor.","Senior White got up from the ground, patted the nonexistent dust on his body, and said awkwardly, “It wasn’t me! I did no such thing! Don’t blame me for this!”","Song Shuhang asked, “If you did not trip, then why were you on the ground, Senior White?”","Senior White explained, “It was an earthquake, a very powerful one. There were even some buildings that were not reinforced by magical techniques that collapsed.”","While saying that, he squatted down again, reached out, and knocked on the spot where he was lying down a moment ago.","Then, he placed his palm on it.","He used his ?Desertification? magical technique. Soon after, the area where Senior White had fallen just now turned into a patch of sand.","Senior White reached out and pulled out a root-shaped object from the sand.","Song Shuhang asked, “What is this?”","“A special product of the Beast Realm, the earth dragon fruit. It is said that it only appears when a huge earthquake occurs,” Senior White said. “The earth dragon fruit can be used to consolidate one’s realm. It is very useful for newly-ascended cultivators.”","As he said that, he stretched out his hand and broke off two tree roots, throwing one to Song Shuhang and the other to Sixteen.","This was the White-style sharing of treasures.","Both Song Shuhang and Sixteen had ascended very recently and were in need of such a treasure.","“It can be washed and eaten raw. It tastes very good.” Senior White stretched out his hand and broke off another root of the fruit. He then peeled off its outer skin, revealing its white and tender texture before putting it into his mouth and biting down.","The fruit was very fragrant. As soon as Senior White bit down into it, its fragrance permeated the whole room.","??????","Outside, the rumbling sound began to weaken, and the vibrations came to an end.","Song Shuhang heard the conversations of the Beast Realm cultivators outside.","“Is the earthquake over? Are there any casualties?”","“Over a hundred ordinary people were injured. However, all of them only received minor injuries. Nobody suffered life-threatening injuries.”","“For there to be so few casualties despite the powerful earthquake, it seems like luck was on our side today.”","“Well, the quality of our buildings is good. They have been reinforced pretty well.”","“Additionally, I heard that Fairy Blue Phoenix invited a famous and auspicious character to the Beast Realm for this year’s Garre Holy Mountain’s trial. As such, it is likely that we were blessed with luck due to that person’s presence.”","Song Shuhang could not help looking at Senior White.","Has Senior White’s reputation of being a “lucky person” spread to the Beast Realm?","Senior White waved his hands and said, “Don’t look at me, they aren’t referring to me. They’re talking about you.”","“Me? Auspicious?” Song Shuhang glanced at himself.","He really could not see how he could be related to the word “auspicious”.","“As an existence who has shown his divinity four times in a single year, how can you not be considered lucky?” The voice of the black Scarlet Heaven Sword sounded from the belly of the virtuous lamia.","Song Shuhang silently peeled off the outer skin of the earth dragon fruit in his hand, put it in his mouth, and bit it down.","“By the way, Shuhang, this is for you.” Senior White reached into his pocket, took out a fist-sized gem, and threw it at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang quickly reached out to catch it. It was his lustrous heart, which had been dug out by Senior White earlier. The runes that Senior White had drawn on it were still visible.","“Should I put it back?” Song Shuhang looked at his chest.","When he said that, he felt a beat in his chest. From the looks of it, a new heart had grown back in his chest.","With that, the lustrous heart in his hand had become redundant.","He now had an extra heart. Should he sell it for money or give it away?","When he thought of that, Song Shuhang turned to look at Sixteen’s... chest.","“What are you doing? What are you staring at?!” Sister White Dragon lowered her head, blocking Sixteen’s chest with her huge dragon head.","Sister White Dragon had good intentions, and she was afraid that Song Shuhang’s gaze would inflict psychological damage on Sixteen.","“Is Sixteen’s virtuous heart working well?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yes, it’s working perfectly at the moment.” Sixteen nodded. With the Rebirth Pill as the core, the power of virtue had been able to construct a perfectly-working heart.","Song Shuhang came to Sixteen and put the lustrous heart in her hand. “Just in case, keep this lustrous heart.”","If something went wrong with the virtuous heart, or if the Rebirth Pill lost its effectiveness, then this lustrous heart may come in handy.","Sixteen took the lustrous heart with a complicated expression.","“I’ll give you my heart.” Song Shuhang lowered his head and looked at Sixteen, his voice low and very flirtatious. He was performing the fifth of the nine embarrassing flirtatious moves he had come up with.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Her dragon scale stood on end, just as if she had been electrocuted.","Sixteen smiled and carefully put away the lustrous heart.","Song Shuhang asked, “By the way, are we out of Garre Holy Mountain? Did Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet come with us?”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had made an agreement with him. It had said that it wanted to bravely travel to the end of the world with him and provoke various big shots.","On the other side of the overturned bed, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet stood up and said, “I’m here.”","Song Shuhang laughed and stepped forward to give Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet a warm hug. “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, when I provoke big shots in the future, I’ll be relying on you!”","“Le... Leave it to me.” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was somewhat discouraged after learning about the cards in Song Shuhang’s hand.","[Cheng Lin!] While they were speaking, an angry voice boomed like thunder in the sky. [I can sense your aura, Cheng Lin! Come out!]"]},{"number":2193,"title":"Chapter 2193 I, Tyrannical Song, won’t shoulder this sin!","paragraphs":["2193 I, Tyrannical Song, won’t shoulder this sin!","When Song Shuhang heard the loud voice, a series of different expressions that matched his current mood emerged on his face.","In the end, he chose to ignore the howling voice in the sky.","After all, the unknown fellow daoist in the sky was shouting “Cheng Lin,” and that had nothing to do with Tyrannical Song!","I, Number Tyrannical Song, will not shoulder Cheng Lin’s sins today.","After Sixteen put away the lustrous heart, she exchanged glances with Sister White Dragon, and Sister White Dragon nodded tacitly. Both of them knew about the relationship between Fairy Cheng Lin and Song Shuhang.","Senior White put away the earth dragon fruit and stared at the sky in puzzlement.","F*ck, that startled me. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet secretly let out a breath of relief. It thought that a big shot had come out to confront Song Shuhang just after it agreed to accompany him.","It had just come out of Garre Holy Mountain’s secret realm and didn’t even have the time to bask in the fresh air outside that it already had to face a big shot.","However, since the big shot in the sky had not come to fight Song Shuhang, it could use this opportunity to show off its ability to bring Song Shuhang to fight big shots.","When it thought of this, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet straightened itself, then with gleaming runes on its body, it said in a deep voice, “I thought that the guy in the sky was going to fight us, but he seems to be looking for someone called Cheng Lin. I got excited for nothing, thinking that I would be able to show off my power and let my name spread throughout the universe once more... Little friend Song, no need to worry, though. There will be more opportunities to fight against big shots in the future. You and I can join hands and bravely travel until the end of the universe!”","Song Shuhang wore a polite smile on his face the entire time.","The virtuous lamia turned her head and stared at Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, her beautiful eyes sparkling.","It was the first time that Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had seen the virtuous lamia be so expressive.","Previously, the virtuous lamia had always been playing dead, acting like a robot, or acting like a mindless virtuous entity. When she was in that state, she rarely revealed any of her feelings or thoughts.","The stone tablet felt that there was a deep meaning hidden in the eyes of this virtuous fairy.","However, since she did not have as readable of a face as Song Shuhang, it was impossible to guess her real thoughts.","“Cheng Lin, come out! You have the guts to come here but don’t have the guts to show yourself?” the angry voice continued to shout in the sky.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet coughed lightly and said, “Let me see who this guy is. He’s so arrogant!”","It first wanted to take a look at the big shot who was shouting in the sky and see if they were powerful or not.","While looking for the big shot in the sky, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “By the way, who is Cheng Lin?”","“Who is Cheng Lin? That’s a long story.” Song Shuhang sighed.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “Give me a summary then!”","When he said the words “cannot die again,” he said them through gritted teeth.","Hearing this, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet let out a breath of relief. In other words, Fairy Cheng Lin was definitely not Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang said slowly, “However, there is a problem.”","“What is it?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked in confusion.","Song Shuhang pointed at himself and said, “I’m also Cheng Lin.”","To be precise, the Fairy Cheng Lin, who was so dead that she cannot die again, had forcibly passed her daoist name “Cheng Lin” to him.","Therefore, in addition to the seven daoist names he had in the past and the four Sage Names he now had, Cheng Lin was also his daoist name.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: (╯°Д°)╯(┻━┻","Why do you have such a feminine name like Cheng Lin?!","After all that talk, you just went in a big circle and the big shot in the sky clearly came for you!","Song Shuhang added, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, don’t be too happy just yet. I don’t think we’ll be able to make much of an appearance today. The big shot in the sky is likely mad at the Jade Lake Empress Cheng Lin of the Ancient Heavenly City Era and not at me.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","I told you to give me a quick summary! Would it kill you to say everything at once?!","“What a pity. I had just finished warming up, and I was ready to make a move!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said calmly in the tone of a grandmaster, runes flashing on its body.","“Don’t worry, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. There are many big shots across the universe. We should be able to find one that suits us well quite easily.” Song Shuhang smiled slightly.","Song Shuhang felt himself getting infected with the enthusiasm of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. The thought of wanting to look for big shots to fight emerged in his head.","While they were speaking, a layer of dream-like power enveloped Song Shuhang. This power also enveloped the stone tablet, Sixteen, and Senior White.","This illusory power felt extremely familiar.","It was not his “everything I hear and see seems familiar” disease acting up, but rather it was truly familiar to him.","??????","The dream-like power gently enveloped Song Shuhang and the others, and then it brought them into an illusory world.","In the illusory world, there was an endless grassland.","As the breeze blew, the grass on the grassland moved like waves in the sea. There was the faint fragrance of fresh grass and... the stench of cow dung.","There was also a waft of strong wine fragrance coming from behind them.","Song Shuhang turned his head and saw a familiar big tree.","There was a young man under the tree, wearing a mink coat, a helpless expression on his face.","Beside him was a large wine jar, from which the aroma of the wine came from.","Song Shuhang said, “It’s you.”","When he came to the Beast Realm the last time, he had also been pulled into this illusory world.","It was also the young man in the mink fur coat who received him at that time. He remembered that at that time, there was also Fellow Daoist Tooth Fairy of the Ivory Trigram Series who did three divinations for him.","“Why are you here again, Cheng Lin!” The young man in the mink coat raised the wine glass in his hand and took a sip from it.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Here we go again, they had identified him as Cheng Lin the last time, and this time was no exception.","“Shuhang?” Sixteen looked at Song Shuhang in surprise. At the same time, Sister White Dragon’s eyes narrowed.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet also looked at Song Shuhang doubtfully.","Senior White squeezed his chin, nodded, and said with certainty, “The Immortal, Cheng Lin.”","In their eyes, Song Shuhang was now wearing a tilted daoist cap. His face was covered by the brilliance of an Immortal’s full moon wheel, and he was wearing a loose daoist robe while standing on a white lotus.","His appearance was the same as Cheng Lin’s.","Behind him, the virtuous lamia leaned closely to Song Shuhang, putting her chin on Song Shuhang’s shoulder very intimately.","“Stop.” Song Shuhang crossed his arms. “Although I do not know why every time you pull me into this illusion my appearance will become that of Cheng Lin. However... I am Tyrannical Song!”","“Fairy @#%×, Fairy Golden Dragon.” Daoist Tooth Fairy also appeared, and he greeted the virtuous lamia and Sister White Dragon.","Afterward, he looked at Song Shuhang and said, “You should not have come, Cheng Lin. You should now be clear that there is a group of former Heavenly City members in the Beast Realm who hate you to the bone.”","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","There are times when it is simply too difficult to discuss with someone."]},{"number":2194,"title":"Chapter 2194 Little friend Song, your big brother can only help you so much","paragraphs":["2194 Little friend Song, your big brother can only help you so much","These guys did not listen at all.","No matter how much he tried to explain himself, it was of no use.","At this time, Song Shuhang felt how Mama Yellow Mountain often felt. He felt very tired and just wanted to just look at the sky.","Could it be said that after I inherited Cheng Lin’s daoist name, I also inherited Cheng Lin’s karma?","However, Cheng Lin’s karma involved the huge sin that was the destruction of the Ancient Heavenly City.","No, I, Tyrannical Song, will not bear the consequences of her actions. How can I, a mere Seventh Stage cultivator, bear such large karma?","When he thought of this, Song Shuhang came up with a plan.","He said boldly, “Let them come then!”","“Ah?” The virtuous lamia looked at him with surprise. Shuhang suddenly acting so bold increased his charm by several times.","Song Shuhang clenched his fists and said, “Anyone who hates Cheng Lin to the bone, can just come forward!”","Do you hate Cheng Lin to the bone?","I will give you a chance then!","If you think that Cheng Lin alone is not exciting enough, I can introduce you to Cheng Lin’s brother, the big shot named ‘I really want to take a color photo.’","If even Cheng Lin’s brother can’t satisfy you, I can also introduce to you a mysterious person with a very cute nickname, Little Stripey!","Daoist Ivory Trigram said angrily, “Are you trying to piss us off?”","The young man in the mink coat coughed violently. He raised his wine glass, and after he managed to stop his coughing, he said, “The illusion I created will buy you some time. Cheng Lin, this is the last time that Tooth Fairy and I will help you. Hurry up and leave the Beast Realm!”","Daoist Ivory Trigram and the mink-coated young man looked at Cheng Lin at the same time, gentleness hidden deep within their eyes.","The virtuous lamia glared at the two of them ruthlessly.","“Just go already. Stop wasting time.” The mink-coated young man coughed again.","Daoist Ivory Trigram added, “Cheng Lin... Don’t come to the Beast Realm again.”","Senior White said softly, “It’s useless. It’s already too late.”","Senior White raised the tree of virtue and swung it horizontally.","“Boom~”","In the void, there seemed to be a strange force that was blasted away by Senior White’s virtuous tree and disappeared.","Sister White Dragon said slowly, “Someone has already locked onto Song Shuhang, and they are already attacking him across space.”","Ultra-long-range space-traversing attacks were available only to big shots at the Ninth Stage or above.","Song Shuhang was particularly envious of this ability.","As a Seventh Stage cultivator, his only ultra-long-range means of attack at the moment was his Fourth Stage saber controlling technique that could take an enemy’s head from hundreds of miles away.","Daoist Ivory Trigram said anxiously, “How did they manage to lock onto you so quickly?”","The mink-coated young man smiled wryly while drinking the bitter wine from his glass.","“You two, leave,” Sister White Dragon said slowly. “You do not have to get yourselves involved in the grievances between Cheng Lin and the Ancient Heavenly City. You have your own roles to fulfill.”","“Senior Golden Dragon, what is your role?” The mink-coated young man looked at Sister White Dragon.","“I...” Sister White Dragon raised her dragon head proudly. “I’m already dead. Does a dead person’s role matter?”","Senior White said, “Let’s go. Staying here will only make us a stationary target.”","After he said that, Senior White stroked the sword in his hand lightly. A beam of sword light emerged from the sword and enveloped Song Shuhang and the others.","In the next moment, he brought them out of the illusory world.","Daoist Ivory Trigram and the mink-coated young man silently watched the place where Senior White and his group had been standing. They stared at that spot without saying a word for a long time.","“Sage Monarch White?” the mink-coated young man murmured.","Daoist Ivory Trigram asked, “What about him?”","The mink-coated young man said suddenly, “Sage White really gives me the same feeling as my first love.”","Daoist Ivory Trigram: “...”","He did not know how to react to the words of his good friend. As a fortune-teller, he relied on his mouth to eat and was quite articulate, but at this moment, he felt that he was at a complete loss for words.","After a moment of silence, Daoist Ivory Trigram said in a deep voice, “I’ll watch over Cheng Lin secretly. If push comes to shove, I will make a move.”","Before the mink-coated young man could say anything, Daoist Ivory Trigram disappeared.","“Wait, Tooth Fairy. I just want to say that the beauty of Sage White reminded me of my first love!” the mink-coated young man shouted. He put down his wine glass, and then similarly disappeared from the illusory grasslands.","??????","Senior White’s sword light protected Song Shuhang and the others as they returned to the Beast Realm.","Around them, that layer of illusory power had dispersed.","“Cheng Lin!”","“CHENG LIN!”","“Cheeeeng Liiiiin!”","More than a dozen voices rang in Song Shuhang’s ears at the same time, and each voice was gnashing their teeth in anger while calling Cheng Lin’s name.","Fairy Cheng Lin, what a sinful woman!","“Unsheath!” Senior White said softly.","He stretched out his hand and raised Meteor Sword against the sky.","There was a cloud of green smoke descending from the sky, and behind the cloud of smoke was an illusory figure. They had erected an altar and were casting magical techniques from afar.","Normally, when big shots used ultra-long-range magical techniques, they could unleash powerful and terrifying attacks with a single swing of their hand.","But when they were so serious that they even set up an altar... Then the power of their moves would increase exponentially.","Senior White’s Meteor Sword flew into the air. Blessed with the power of virtue, the sword plunged directly into the green cloud. Sword energy radiated from it, slashing apart the green cloud.","However, that cloud of green smoke was just the prelude.","Next, more than ten different magical techniques came at them from all directions. These attacks were all ultra-long-range attacks directed at Song Shuhang.","There were thick rays of light, shot directly from outside the atmosphere.","There were deadly curses, invisible and intangible, and it was unknown how or when they would activate.","There was a sharp blade that suddenly appeared and swiftly shot toward Song Shuhang.","There was even a big shot that practiced body-tempering techniques that launched a punch at Song Shuhang from millions of miles away.","These big shots from the Ancient Heavenly City who had survived to this day had variegated means of attack, which made Song Shuhang envious.","Song Shuhang shouted, “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet!”","It was time for Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet to show off.","You and I shall join hands to forge our legend, and this legend shall begin by resisting the ultra-long-range attacks of these surviving big shots from the Ancient Heavenly City!","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","Each of these ultra-long-range attacks possessed Ninth-Stage-level might.","Some of these attacks were directly launched by Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders from a great distance, while others were launched by Eighth Stage Profound Sages who made use of Tribulation-Transcender-level magical treasures.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is really the ultimate swindler.","Even though I said that I would take you to fight big shots... For our very first joint operation to involve over ten Tribulation-Transcender-level attacks, isn’t it a bit too much?","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet gritted its teeth.","In the next moment, the words “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone” on its body shone brightly.","Little friend Song, your big brother can only help you so much.","Just go in boldly and do not be afraid of death.","I will support you from behind. If you truly end up in a life-threatening situation, I can dig a hole on the spot and bury you."]},{"number":2195,"title":"Chapter 2195 Scan code for the sweeping","paragraphs":["2195 Scan code for the sweeping","With over ten Tribulation-Transcender-level attacks coming their way, the virtuous lamia was the first one to act.","When Senior White’s sword light brought everyone out of the illusion, the virtuous lamia had already tied up her long hair and put on the flat imperial hat.","As such, when the attacks came, she was able to immediately make her move and create a projection of the Virtuous Palace for defense.","The beam attack that came from outside the atmosphere was the fastest to arrive, and it was the first to hit the Virtuous Palace Projection.","Immediately afterward came a sharp saber light that directly traversed space, a force field that distorted everything around it.","After two breaths of time, the Virtuous Palace Projection collapsed.","While that may seem like an insignificant amount of time, it had bought everyone enough time to prepare their counterattacks.","??????","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet!” Song Shuhang made a grabbing motion with his hands. By making use of his psychic energy, he was able to attract Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet toward his position.","Psychic energy had been explained in the speech that the demonic hamster delivered when it had shown its divinity. The foundation was designed by Senior White Two, and it was aimed toward a certain group of people.","When Song Shuhang attracted Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet with his psychic energy, he felt that his psychic energy and the stone tablet were extremely compatible. Using psychic energy to control the stone tablet felt easy and effortless!","“It’s finally our turn to play, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet,” said Song Shuhang boldly. The big plan in his mind required the cooperation of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Seeing this, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet could only activate the runes on its body to complete its “warm-up” instantly.","The words “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone” dimmed, and a string of small words underneath it that read “Netherworld White” lit up.","The power of these words should not be underestimated as they were personally written by the ruler of the Netherworld and even contained his personal name.","These few words held great power, and they were equivalent to an absolute order.","If Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet were to crash into the Netherworld Realm, these words on its body would allow it to mobilize part of the evil energy and exercise a small portion of the Netherworld Ruler’s authority.","“Come on, Fellow Daoist Tablet!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pressed it against the stone tablet. When he did this, a beam of saber intent descended on its body.","After that, he made a hand seal and sent Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet to directly face the Tribulation-Transcender-level attacks. “Suppress!”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet shouted, “F*ck, have you read the manual? This is not how I’m supposed to be used!”","I’m not a shield! I’m not supposed to be sent out like this to directly face off against enemy attacks!","If you don’t know how to use me, please read the instruction manual first!","“Boom~” The stone tablet’s body directly collided with the long-range beam attack.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet did not even get an opportunity to show off its suppressing powers.","After the dazzling fireworks dissipated, a set of armor appeared on the body of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Completely covered in square-shaped armor, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet looked particularly ferocious.","“Suppress!” An immense suppression force was released from the stone tablet, crushing the distortion force behind one of the attacks, and forcing it to remain in a small area.","??????","Sharp saber light suddenly shot out from the void, slashing toward Song Shuhang. This saber light, which had worked together with the beam from earlier to destroy the Virtuous Palace Projection, had already consumed a lot of its energy.","However, the attack was still dangerous. Song Shuhang would certainly not feel good if he were to take the slash head-on.","“Ah!” Song Shuhang swung his head...","Take my Immortal hair attack!","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair extended to a length of over three meters and shot toward the sharp saber light. Pavilion Master Chu’s main body had long hair, which could slice apart mountains and seas with one swing.","The long hair collided with the sharp saber intent, and after a moment of stalemate, the sharp saber intent was destroyed.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair slowly retracted... and finally wrapped itself around Song Shuhang’s neck.","If Song Shuhang dared to make use of her strand of hair to attack again, her hair would forcefully tighten around his neck. The tighter her hair was wrapped around his neck, the more strength she would be able to provide him with across space","Sister White Dragon reminded them, “Be careful of the curse.”","She did not make a move herself but continued bolstering everyone’s defense. After all, she was also a survivor of the Ancient Heavenly City and preferred to stay neutral.","As soon as Sister White Dragon said that, the dormant curse erupted and entangled Song Shuhang and Senior White. Since Su Clan’s Sixteen was protected by White Dragon, the curse ignored her.","The curse was divided into two halves, but when one half was about to approach Senior White, it suddenly stopped.","In the next moment, it turned around decisively!","All the power of the curse shot straight toward Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang: “...”","What is the meaning of this?","Why do I always feel as if I’m being treated differently?","The raging power of the curse enveloped Song Shuhang.","“Ah, I’m bleeding all over the ground!” The virtuous lamia in her Virtuous Empress Mode recited a line out of nowhere. When she did so, the curse was forced to a dead stop, unable to touch Song Shuhang in the slightest.","Sister White Dragon glanced at the curse and analyzed it. “This is the divine curse of death and decay.”","Why does this name sound so familiar? Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","Sister White Dragon said, “Do you remember the last tribulation that you and Sixteen experienced when transcending the tribulation earlier? This curse is an imitation of that final tribulation, and it is rather troublesome to deal with.”","As soon as she finished speaking, a pair of small hands stretched out from Song Shuhang’s body, grabbing onto the curse.","These small hands belonged to his ghost spirit.","At the same time, the virtuous lamia raised her head and spat out the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Scarlet Heaven Sword slashed at the curse several times, evenly cutting the power of the curse into ten parts.","The ghost spirit rubbed its hands, kneading the power of the curse into ten small balls.","Then, she grabbed one of the balls and devoured it.","The other nine balls were swallowed by the virtuous lamia and stored as food reserves.","Sister White Dragon looked up at the sky and remained silent for a long time.","??????","“Boom~”","Above their heads, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet got punched.","It was that fist that had traversed millions of miles.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said angrily, “Do you really see me as a shield? Even if I’m wearing armor, I’m still a stone tablet!”","As it became angry, the signature of Senior White Two on its body began to shine brightly as if issuing an order.","In the next moment, in their surrounding region, a vast amount of evil energy was mobilized and rushed toward Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Most of this evil energy had infiltrated the Beast Realm little by little thanks to the fat ball. At this time, due to the writing of Senior White Two activating, aside from the evil energy that carried the personal mark of Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball, all the remaining evil energy in the surroundings fell under the stone tablet’s control.","Along with the roar of the stone tablet, the evil energy turned into a suppressing force, blocking the Tribulation-Transcender-level attacks one after the other.","This feeling of being invincible in its home court made Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s blood boil, and it could not help but reminisce about the past.","??????","The first wave of attacks was successfully blocked.","Song Shuhang raised his head and smiled slightly.","It was about time.","He reached out and touched his forehead.","A new eyeball, with an aura not weaker than that of the Scholarly Sage’s eye, shone brightly.","Then, Song Shuhang made another hand seal.","On Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body, a QR Code Golden Core Composition flashed.","This was the grave-sweeping function left by Senior White Two.","There was a note next to the QR code: [Scan the code to sweep the grave of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.]"]},{"number":2196,"title":"Chapter 2196 The moment I become a devil...","paragraphs":["2196 The moment I become a devil...","Although Senior White Two called it “QR Code to sweep the grave”, it was, in fact, Song Shuhang’s Friend QR Code.","With Song Shuhang’s control, the QR Code on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body shone brightly.","As long as one scanned this QR Code with their mental energy, they could add Tyrannical Song as a friend. It was an opportunity that was best not missed!","Of course... Song Shuhang was not so naive to think that the dozen or so big shots from the Ancient Heavenly City would just scan the QR Code with their mental energy.","During the battle, both sides would definitely keep up their guard, and they were unlikely to use their mental energy to randomly scan a QR code from the enemy.","It was here that the eyeball given to him by Senior Three Eyes came into play.","Just when Song Shuhang was thinking this...","[Beep~ Ivory Trigram Tooth Fairy has added you as a friend. Please choose what group to place him in.]","[Ding~ Immortal Amidst Wine has added you as a friend. Please choose what group to place him in.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Someone had actually scanned his QR Code with their mental energy!","[Add them to the Ancient Heavenly City Friend List.] He quickly made the decision to place them in a new group.","Anyway, Song Shuhang activated his new eyeball. Aside from those two unusual big shots that were on friendly terms, the others did not fall victim to their habit of scanning unfamiliar things with mental energy.","With that being the case, he would have to resort to forcefully creating a connection!","Senior Three Eyes did not provide him with an instruction manual after giving him the eyeball, so Song Shuhang could only rely on himself to discover how it worked.","However, he was not completely clueless as he had personally experienced two of the eyeball’s abilities.","These two abilities were “linking” and “forced data sharing”, which Senior Three Eyes had used when torturing... Emh, when betting with Song Shuhang.","By making use of this eye, he could forcefully create a mental connection with the target. After having done that, he could inject the QR Code into their brains.","It was a sort of forced friend mode, almost like a hacker’s ability.","However, there was a limit when creating a connection through the eyeball. Even Senior Three Eyes had to pluck out this eye and paste it on Song Shuhang’s forehead to inject information into his brain.","As such, it was time for the Scholarly Sage’s eye to enter into action.","When Song Shuhang set his plan into motion, Fairy Creation appeared beside him. Her thumb and forefinger formed a circle in front of Song Shuhang’s left eye, fully activating the power of the Sage’s eye.","Song Shuhang was not using the Impregnating Gaze this time. He was simply borrowing its ability to lock onto a target to form a connection. It was the same ability he used during his real-time question-answering session.","Back then, with the buff of the Profound Sage Speech, he was able to form a connection with every practitioner watching the speech!","Now, with the help of Fairy Creation and the Sage’s eye, it was not difficult for him to lock onto these few big shots of the Ancient Heavenly City by following their attacks.","The Scholarly Sage’s eye easily locked onto the big shots and formed a connection with them.","The third eye worked together with the Sage’s eye seamlessly, taking over the connection that had been formed. Afterward, it entered the forced data sharing mode.","The first part of the plan was a success!","Song Shuhang felt that there was now a connection between him and the twelve members of the Ancient Heavenly City that had come to attack him.","“Hahahaha! Take my mental pollution!” Song Shuhang revealed a strange and bitter smile.","However, before forcefully flooding their mind, he needed to strengthen the connection.","In other words, he had to add them as friends first.","Song Shuhang’s Friend QR Code was forcibly injected into the minds of the twelve Heavenly City members","Moreover, Song Shuhang made some extra preparations just to be safe.","Because he did not know if merely injecting the QR Code into the big shots’ minds would work, Song Shuhang also pulled at their mental energies, making them come in contact with the pattern on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body.","The results were remarkable.","[Beep~ Fairy Starscar has added you as a friend. Please choose what group to place her in.]","[Beep~ Lord Dark Moon has added you as a friend...]","[Beep~ Scholar Three Paths has added you as a friend...]","[Beep~ Heavenly King Bamboo Flute has added you as a friend...]","[Beep~ Daoist Chen Dingxuan has added you as a friend...]","[Beep~ Immortal Chef Menu has added you as a friend...]","...","A series of beeps rang in Song Shuhang’s mind. All the members of the Ancient Heavenly City that were affected by the combo of the two eyes, getting forcibly pulled into Song Shuhang’s friend list.","Song Shuhang noticed that one of them was an immortal chef.","Were even immortal chefs so unruly these days?","“Put them all in the Ancient Heavenly City Friend List.” Song Shuhang laughed.","Meanwhile, the twelve big shots frowned. A prompt had sounded in their minds.","[Beep~ You have added Profound Sage Tyrannical Song as a friend and have been moved to the Ancient Heavenly City Friend List.]","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?","Friend?","The twelve big shots did not know how to react for a while.","Immediately afterward, another message sounded in their minds.","[Beep~ Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy, PS: Hello, friends from the Ancient Heavenly City. I am Tyrannical Song, a cute little cultivator. Perhaps you have yet to receive my speech as you may have been in seclusion for a long time, but worry not—]","The postscript was interrupted all of a sudden. The reason was that Song Shuhang’s realm was not high enough, and there was still a word limit every time he added a postscript.","It was the first time he had encountered such a situation. Helpless, Song Shuhang could only send another postscript.","[Beep~ Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy, PS: We have become friends, and you will have a lot of time to get to know me in the future. What I want to tell you is—]","The message abruptly ended again.","When using the postscript function continuously, the word limit became increasingly shorter.","The postscript function was not letting him show off at all!","Song Shuhang was losing his mind. He gritted his teeth and sent one last line.","[Beep~ PS: The moment I become a devil, the world will become hell!]","Song Shuhang: “???”","That was not what he sent.","Song Shuhang looked up and found the virtuous lamia flinging her hair coolly.","At the same time, she also forwarded a copy of this postscript to his Buddy, the Heavenly Emperor."]},{"number":2197,"title":"Chapter 2197 Call me daddy!","paragraphs":["2197 Call me daddy!","Forwarding the message to the Heavenly Emperor was purely to disturb her.","The virtuous lamia was a well-known beauty in the Ancient Heavenly City but also Fairy Cheng Lin’s best friend. Only the heavens knew whose side she would take when faced with her companions from the Ancient Heavenly City.","Song Shuhang raised his head to try to look for any traces of nostalgia or sadness on the virtuous lamia’s face.","However, he failed to detect any such emotion on her face.","[Beep~ Your “Buddy” Heavenly Emperor has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy: Senior Song, this is today’s energy, da! I’ve been very busy recently, so don’t bother me. Wave~]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Huh?","Is that it? And she even waved back?","Did she not see that I was fighting against members of the Ancient Heavenly City?","Moreover, these members were all part of her faction. Even though the Heavenly City had fallen so many years ago, they were still trying to rebuild it.","Can’t you give me a more normal reaction?","After having that thought, Song Shuhang rubbed his temples hard.","He felt that he must be sick, seriously sick. Was he disappointed that the Heavenly Emperor did not traverse space to help the members of the Ancient Heavenly City beat him up?","No matter what the disease was, he felt that it had to be cured.","Still, the most important thing he had to do right now was to follow the plan.","Although the last line had been snatched by the virtuous lamia, what she added was quite interesting.","Because what he was going to do next was not too different from what a devil would do.","“Come, have a taste of hell!” Song Shuhang showed a weird smile again.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet descended from the sky, landing right in front of Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang stretched his hand out and pressed it against its surface. “Tablet With the Saber Mode!”","After he and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet entered the One With the Saber state, he would be significantly strengthened, and this would help him bring even greater pain to the twelve members of the Ancient Heavenly City.","“Buzz~”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet wanted to accuse Song Shuhang of using it as a shield, but when it felt the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?, it stopped in its tracks, obediently entering the Tablet With the Saber state with Song Shuhang.","“Have a taste of what it feels like to have a terabyte of data stuffed into your brain!” The weird smile on Song Shuhang’s face gradually turned into a sinister smile, making him look like a villain.","Most of the data that Song Shuhang was sending to their brains came from the data that Senior Three Eyes had injected into his brain. The data mostly consisted of questions that practitioners from all over the world had asked, but without their relative answers.","But Song Shuhang added some other stuff as well.","He added some memories of Lady Onion that dated to the time she stayed on the top of that mountain for hundreds of years before becoming sentient. He even added the experience of the wind, sun, and rain to the data flow, moving this part of the memory to a critical position.","He wanted to see how the twelve big shots from the Ancient Heavenly City would take the experience of Lady Onion’s life in the wind, sun, and rain.","If the experiment was successful, Song Shuhang would have mastered another terrifying move.","Also, it did not really matter if it failed as it was just a side experiment anyway.","With the empowerment of the Sage’s eye, third eye, and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, a huge data stream flooded the minds of the twelve members of the Ancient Heavenly City.","??????","After a few breaths of time, screams sounded from eleven different locations in the Beast Realm that were quite distant from one another, and one from way above Song Shuhang’s head.","Of the twelve members of the Ancient Heavenly City that attacked Song Shuhang, seven were Eighth Stage Profound Sages.","They were the descendants or disciples of the members that survived after the Ancient Heavenly City collapsed, and they had used Tribulation Transcender magical treasures to launch long-range attacks at Song Shuhang.","The seven Profound Sages screamed the most miserably when data was forcefully injected into their brains.","The intensity of Song Shuhang’s data infusion was on the same level as the tenth wave of Senior Three Eyes’ trial.","In other words, they all had to experience a level of pain that was at the Tribulation Transcender level, leaving their brains trembling from the shock.","The other five, who were Tribulation Transcenders or possessed combat power at that level, also held their heads as they let out painful cries.","Nobody in the universe was immune to this kind of pain.","[Beep~ Tyrannical Song has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Are you in pain? That’s right, you should be. This is the pain I endured before, and a full ten waves at that! Can you understand my pain now?]","The brains of the twelve Ancient Heavenly City members were swollen from the pain. It was as if someone had poured molten iron into their brains.","Among them, the seven Eighth Stage Profound Sages even began to have hallucinations. They discovered that they had turned into a green onion planted on the top of a mountain, exposed to the wind, sun, and rain.","Moreover, they experience the elements not for a day or two but for hundreds of years.","This span of time was enough for them to close up once!","[Beep~]","At this time, a sound that they had come to hate sounded in their minds again.","Was it another message?","This time, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song did not make things difficult for them.","[Beep~ Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is transferring your line to Fairy Cheng Lin.] A message sounded in the minds of the twelve Ancient Heavenly City members.","Cheng Lin?","Cheng Lin!!!","The twelve Ancient Heavenly City members, enduring the pain in their heads, struggled to get up.","There was endless resentment in their hearts toward Cheng Lin.","[Beep, the line transfer has failed~ Fairy Cheng Lin is already dead, burn paper for her if you wish.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","The twelve Ancient Heavenly City members: “...”","Song Shuhang gritted his teeth and remotely transferred 1 point of energy to Fairy Cheng Lin.","[Beep~ Failed to transfer energy, the ‘Blacklist’ member Fairy Cheng Lin refused to receive your message.]","Song Shuhang felt his head start to ache again. The VIP blacklist was simply unreasonable.","Afterward, he tried to remotely transfer energy to Striped Dragon Two’s son,”I really want to take a color photo”, but he also refused to accept the energy sent by Song Shuhang.","In retrospect, I really have to treat Mama Yellow Mountain better, Song Shuhang, who was very tired, thought to himself.","Then, he made one last attempt.","[Beep~ Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is transferring your line to the Heavenly Emperor.] Another message flashed in the minds of the twelve Ancient Heavenly City members.","The Heavenly Emperor?","First, it was Fairy Cheng Lin. Now, it’s the Heavenly Emperor.","Is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song trolling us?","??????","As soon as Song Shuhang used the transfer function, the Heavenly Emperor quickly sent a message.","[The Heavenly Emperor has sent you a message: Low-key, be low-key, Senior Song. Do you not understand how to write the word low-key?]","Song Shuhang: “...”","This is not my fault. It was the members of the Ancient Heavenly City who took the initiative to come to my door and fight with me!","[The Heavenly Emperor has sent you a message: This matter, Senior Song, you can handle it yourself. Don’t transfer it to me. I’m busy, so don’t disturb me.]","After all that, she rejected Song Shuhang’s line transfer.","Song Shuhang rubbed his temples vigorously.","Just as he was struggling with how to deal with this matter, ‘Little Stripey’ on the blacklist suddenly sent him a message: [Did you inherit the daoist name Cheng Lin?]","Striped Dragon Two? Is he trying to stand up for Fairy Cheng Lin?","Song Shuhang thought thrice before replying cautiously: [I guess that’s true to some extent.]","After a while, Striped Dragon Two replied: [Then, call me daddy!]"]},{"number":2198,"title":"Chapter 2198 Are you dead too?","paragraphs":["2198 Are you dead too?","Daddy?","I didn’t expect Striped Dragon Two to have such a hobby...","“Are you going to disappear while buying milk?”","If it was a normal conversation between friends, Song Shuhang would definitely choose to answer like this.","But the other party was Striped Dragon Two, so he naturally would not seek death like that.","Things like seeking death heavily depended on the situation, or so thought Shuhang.","Striped Dragon Two suddenly sent him another message: [Buy milk?]","Song Shuhang: “???”","Wait, what?","I didn’t send any energy or postscript just now, and the virtuous lamia didn’t send a message on my behalf, either.","[Wonderful, good answer.] Striped Dragon Two wrote again.","Immediately afterward, another notification sounded in Song Shuhang’s mind.","[Beep~ Blacklisted “Little Stripey” has transferred the line to “Cheng Lin,” and transferred a ?Saber Technique? to her.]","Striped Dragon Two lived in a mysterious realm, hidden in the depths of Cheng Lin’s ruined immortal cave, and he basically did not interact with the outside world.","Even when he used Song Shuhang’s “Cultivation” group chat to transmit something, it made it go through Cheng Lin first.","This was the case even when imparting a ?Saber Technique?.","[Beep~ Blacklisted “Fairy Cheng Lin” has forwarded you a ?Saber Technique?, PS: The name of the saber technique is “Benevolent Saber,” a saber of mercy.]","Song Shuhang: “???”","As a small insect that had recently evolved into a small mammal, he could not understand the way of thinking of big shots.","He honestly had no idea why Striped Dragon Two had imparted him a ?Saber Technique? at this time.","Should I accept this saber technique?","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has sent you a message: Shuhang, this saber technique contains a trace of Little Stripey’s saber intent. I asked him to give you a way to deal with this problem. There’s no need to thank me~]","No wonder Striped Dragon Two, who had always ignored him, started chatting with him today. It turned out to be Fairy Cheng Lin’s request.","[Nevertheless, I have to thank you, Fairy.] Song Shuhang replied with a postscript.","Fairy Cheng Lin quickly replied: [You’re welcome, and besides... I’m already dead, so the next time you encounter a similar situation, you can chat with me in private. Don’t put irrelevant people on the line; it will make me very embarrassed.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","After sighing, Song Shuhang chose to accept the ?Benevolent Saber?.","The saber of mercy... This name sounded very Buddhist.","How can this saber technique deal with the members of the Ancient Heavenly City?","When Song Shuhang began accepting the ?Benevolent Saber?, Fairy Creation, who was standing beside him, suddenly stepped backwards. That was because a saber intent that reminded her of a bottomless abyss was condensing in Song Shuhang’s body.","This saber intent made Fairy Creation feel oppressed and uncomfortable, so she retreated subconsciously.","“Shuhang, what are you doing?” Senior White turned his head and asked in confusion.","“This... is... not... a benevolent saber...” Song Shuhang fell forward, and like a drowning man, reached his hand out in despair.","What Striped Dragon Two imparted to him through Fairy Cheng Lin was not a saber of mercy at all.","It was a “Saber of Terminal Illness.”","When he began accepting the saber technique, Song Shuhang tasted a thousand different illnesses and pains.","Simple colds and fevers, bone fractures, eye, mouth, ear, and nose diseases, internal organ diseases, blood diseases, mental illnesses, various cancers... There were some scale diseases and horn diseases that humans would never get to experience.","Minor ailments, serious illnesses, and terminal illnesses that Song Shuhang knew and did not know of all came at him at once.","Among them were some diseases that could kill even cultivators and cause their internal energy to become a mess.","Thousands of different diseases, enhanced by Striped Dragon Two’s saber technique, exploded all at once.","The same pain that caused Song Shuhang to collapse was shared with the twelve members of the Ancient Heavenly City through their connection.","The twelve members of the Ancient Heavenly City also failed to resist and were defeated.","If it was just the diseases and the pain, they might have had some hope to endure it, but hidden in that pain was a terrifying saber intent.","This terrifying saber intent disintegrated their will to resist.","At the same time, a huge kirin came crashing down from above the heads of Song Shuhang and others. It was the twelfth member of the Ancient Heavenly City that attacked Song Shuhang and also the first member of the “Tribulation Transcender Attack Force” to notice Cheng Lin’s aura.","If its huge body hit the ground directly, it would be a disaster for this area of the Beast Realm.","The impact of the crash would be no weaker than that of a giant meteorite.","Senior White noticed the kirin that was falling down. He raised his Meteor Sword, ready to stop it.","But then, the kirin’s body suddenly came to a halt. A spatial gate had opened beside him.","A small talon came out of it and slowly came down with the kirin’s body.","The owner of the talon did not fully show itself, but from its aura, it belonged to someone that had surpassed the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","It was likely the talon of an Immortal or of a Tribulation Trascender that had stepped onto their path and was approaching that level.","It was precisely because of this person sitting in the rear that the twelve members of Ancient Heavenly City had the guts to launch an attack on the Jade Lake Empress Cheng Lin.","??????","After a while, the talon gently placed the kirin in front of Senior White and the others.","An eye appeared on the talon.","It looked at Senior White first, paused for a moment, and then blinked in a friendly manner.","Then, it looked at Sixteen and White Dragon, as well as Song Shuhang, who was lying on the ground face-down, and the virtuous lamia.","A woman’s voice sounded from the talon. “Fellow Daoist Golden Dragon, long time no see. How are you?”","“Not very well.” Sister White Dragon rolled her eyes. “Can’t you see that I’m already dead?”","The talon twitched, and it turned to look at the virtuous lamia. “Are you dead too?”","The virtuous lamia nodded vigorously.","The talon sighed and said, “Okay... what about Cheng Lin? Is she not going to come out and meet me?”","Sister White Dragon said calmly, “She’s dead too.”","“Just now, this kirin sensed Cheng Lin’s aura,” the talon said calmly. “So, I just want to know, where is Cheng Lin?”","The virtuous lamia tilted her head, and then she pointed at Song Shuhang.","The talon looked at Song Shuhang on the ground, and it twitched again. “Him? Cheng Lin?”","It put down the kirin, floated towards Song Shuhang, and grabbed him to turn him over."]},{"number":2199,"title":"Chapter 2199 Who are you to hit him?","paragraphs":["2199 Who are you to hit him?","The talon grabbed Song Shuhang and turned him over.","In the next moment, a face with a twisted and pained expression came into everyone’s view. Shuhang’s face was just like the oil painting “The Scream.”","Just by looking at his expression, one could tell how much pain he felt before collapsing to the ground.","The talon was startled by his twisted expression.","But then, the pupil on the little talon widened.","!!","Putting that exaggerated pained expression aside, she noticed that the young man had a kind-looking face.","A familiar face, and an even more familiar ‘aura’.","“Slow-Witted Song!” cried the talon.","These words seemed to carry magical properties as they instantly caused several of the figures present to react.","The little claws of Sister White Dragon unceasingly scratched at the air as if she were trying to rip something apart. Her strong mood swings even affected Sixteen.","On Song Shuhang’s neck, a thin strand of long hair tightened instantly. Song Shuhang, who was lying on the ground, twitched in pain as a result.","The virtuous lamia tilted her head, twisted her tail, and took a step back.","In the next moment, the little talon scratched at Song Shuhang’s face.","The sharp claws were like knives.","There was a piercing sound, and a bunch of sparks flew when they came in contact with Song Shuhang’s face.","The sharp claws failed to cut his skin, only managing to leave five shallow white marks behind.","However, the force behind the attack still affected Song Shuhang, causing his neck to twist at a strange angle.","The runes on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body began shining.","Song Shuhang and it were still in the Tablet With the Saber state, so it had been the one to shoulder most of the damage from the talon’s attack. That was why the talon failed to even break through Song Shuhang’s skin.","“Who are you?” Pavilion Master Chu’s voice sounded.","Her strand of hair aimed straight at the talon.","Who are you to attack Slow-Witted Song?","The talon said angrily, “Slow-Witted Song, give me back my hard-earned money!”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Are they here to ask for their hard-earned money?","Pavilion Master Chu’s momentum instantly weakened, and her sharp hair tip also retracted.","The talon opened, and a huge spatial gate was torn open behind it. Its main body seemed to be making its way through the spatial gate.","Sister White Dragon said, “Calm down, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing. Take a closer look at this young man’s face.”","“How can I calm down? Fairy Golden Dragon, I know that you have always been protecting him, but this time... Huh?” The talon suddenly froze.","After staring at the young man’s face carefully, she found that he wasn’t that similar to Slow-Witted Song.","Moreover...","Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon, four Sage Names emerged in her mind.","It isn’t Slow-Witted Song?","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing observed him carefully again. The eye on the talon approached Song Shuhang’s face, studying him cell by cell.","It really isn’t Slow-Witted Song!","He looked a bit similar at first glance, but after a careful look, she discovered that he was not Slow-Witted Song.","“Is it a reincarnation? No, that can’t be it. It’s definitely not rebirth or reincarnation. But what was with the familiarity just now?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s talon scratched at the air anxiously.","After a while...","“Wait a minute, I did not come for Slow-Witted Song. The one I came here for is Cheng Lin!” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing came back to her senses.","She did not come to fight Slow-Witted Song today; she came looking for Cheng Lin!","As soon as she said the name Cheng Lin, a saber light slashed out from Song Shuhang’s body. This saber light carried the aura of Cheng Lin.","Cheng Lin’s name was like a signal.","Once the signal was sent out, this saber light would be drawn out.","The saber light was as fast as lightning, and when it appeared, the entire area around it seemed to be unable to withstand its power; the ground collapsed and space was distorted!","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing was startled.","Her talon disappeared from its original position—she had used her spatial abilities to escape.","Her figure reappeared a mile away in the sky, but as soon as her talon came out of the gate, it “landed” on the saber light.","It seemed as if the strange saber light had been waiting at the coordinates where she had reappeared for quite some time.","[Karmic lock-on?] Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said in shock.","The saber light contained the principles of karma and seemingly could not be avoided.","The saber light entered her body.","The Immortal energy, magical techniques, and other barriers protecting her body were shattered instantly.","Afterward, thousands of terminal illnesses erupted in her talon.","“Ahhh~ Cheng Lin!” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing uttered a scream that sounded like it was singing. At the same time, large teardrops dripped from the eye on the talon.","When the teardrops fell to the ground, a large hole was created, which immediately turned into a small pond filled with spiritual qi.","??????","The location where Song Shuhang originally was had been reduced to ruin.","Sixteen lifted up Song Shuhang’s body and said, “Shall we take this opportunity to leave?”","“I’ll bring you away.” Senior White waved his hand, and the cuffs of his handsome windbreaker expanded.","It was a spatial skill—the Universe Hiding Sleeve.","Song Shuhang, Sixteen, and Sister White Dragon were all drawn into Senior White’s sleeve while Meteor Sword returned to its sheath.","“I’ll look for a place in the Beast Realm where we can have fun,” said Senior White softly. After that, a half-disc appeared between his fingers.","He used his spatial energy to open a spatial channel, but after some thought, he smiled and closed the spatial channel.","Then, Senior White took out a mask and put it on his face.","After putting on the mask, his body shape started changing, until he assumed Song Shuhang’s appearance.","He willed it, and the virtuous lamia in his sleeve came out and attached herself to his back.","“Perfect.” Senior White rubbed his face and put away the half-disc.","Finally, he found the place where Song Shuhang had fallen before and lay down before closing his eyes.","The virtuous lamia’s tail coiled up as she “sat” obediently beside him.","??????","Soon after, the kirin woke up.","It opened its eyes in pain and saw a man lying on the ground in the distance.","“Where’s Cheng Lin?” It wondered.","“He is Cheng Lin.” A spatial gate opened in the air, and the talon of the teary-eye Zither Master Phoenix Bearing emerged from it.","She looked at the ruins and found that except for Song Shuhang, the others had disappeared.","“Drag him away!” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing gritted her teeth and said.","“Okay.” The kirin came to ‘Song Shuhang’, gently lifted him up, and put him on its back.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","I told you to drag him away! Be more cruel! What’s with your gentle actions?!"]},{"number":2200,"title":"Chapter 2200 Fellow Daoist next door, are you alright?","paragraphs":["2200 Fellow Daoist next door, are you alright?","“I don’t remember you ever being so gentle!” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing glared at the kirin.","Be cruel! Bite his legs! Drag him up from the ground and toss him around, make him afraid!","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing reminded the kirin, “Don’t forget that he is Cheng Lin!”","Although he looked like a young man, he was undoubtedly Cheng Lin as the saber light just now had proven.","“I know, but...” The kirin carefully looked at the young man on his back.","For some reason, even if he knew that this young man was Cheng Lin, he could not bear being cruel to him.","Even after Zither Master reminded him that this young man was Fairy Cheng Lin, the gentleness in his heart remained unchanged.","At the same time, his heartbeat accelerated involuntarily.","What’s this heart-wrenching feeling...","Could it be that I have always been in love with Cheng Lin?","A terrifying thought emerged in the kirin’s mind.","He had always hated Cheng Lin in the past, and the mere mention of her name would be enough to make him mad.","Could this be a case of “the greater the love, the greater the hate”?","During the era of the Ancient Heavenly City, Jade Lake Empress, Cheng Lin, was the perfect dao companion in the hearts of countless fellow daoists.","Could it be that I used to love Empress Cheng Lin so much that I came to hate her when she destroyed the Heavenly City?","The kirin began doubting himself.","The image of Fairy Cheng Lin appeared in his mind.","His recollection of her was that of a woman who wore a crooked daoist cap, whose every action was filled with allure and beauty.","??????","Senior White, who was on the kirin’s back, adjusted himself until he found a comfortable position. Then, he closed his eyes and took this opportunity to enter a state of meditation.","The virtuous lamia obediently ‘sat’ beside him, guarding him silently.","“No, no, no!” The kirin shook his head forcefully.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing looked at him doubtfully.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","“What are we going to do with him?” The kirin asked in a deep voice.","“We shall head back first,” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said. “Then, we’ll gather the other members and will interrogate this... reincarnation of Cheng Lin”","To be honest, she was not sure if this young man was a reincarnation of Cheng Lin. When she observed him earlier, she felt that this young man with four Sage Names was not anyone’s reincarnation.","However, the relationship between him and Cheng Lin was real.","Once the “interrogation” begins, we’ll cross-examine everything!","Thinking of this, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing moved her claw, and a spatial gate opened.","She and the kirin entered the spatial gate and disappeared.","??????","Senior White took the opportunity to close up as the kirin brought him to a secret realm in the Beast Realm.","This secret realm was made up of several fragments of the Ancient Heavenly City.","The kirin brought Senior White to a place called ‘Lock Immortal Prison’, where he would temporarily be imprisoned.","The Lock Immortal Prison was surrounded by 72 spatial confinement techniques chained to form interlocking space locks. Even if it was an Immortal, it would be difficult for them to get out quickly.","However, considering that Empress Cheng Lin had participated in the construction of the Lock Immortal Prison, the kirin chose to keep watch and act as a jailer.","After it gently locked Senior White inside one of the cells, it squatted by the side and watched him silently.","At this time, Senior White was still carrying everyone in his sleeve.","Sixteen wiped off the cold sweat dripping from Song Shuhang’s body due to the pain he was experiencing.","She asked, “Sister White Dragon, is Shuhang alright?”","Sister White Dragon nodded and said, “Yes, he seems to be very healthy overall. As for him not waking up, he is probably busy comprehending that saber...”","The saber intent that slashed out from Song Shuhang’s body just now was so strange that even she could not see through its mysteries.","Song Shuhang’s saber talent was very good, even stronger than his talent in body tempering techniques.","Sister White Dragon could sense that Song Shuhang’s brain was very active at the moment. It was likely taking this opportunity to comprehend the mysteries of the saber intent or accepting the inheritance.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “Fellow Daoist White disguised himself as Shuhang. They brought him into a secret realm where the members of the Heavenly City are hiding.”","Her divine sense quietly peeked through the Universe Hiding Sleeve, taking a look at what was going on in the outside world.","Sister White Dragon asked curiously, “Did Fellow Daoist White discover something? Why did he risk entering the base of the members of the Heavenly City?”","Sixteen speculated based on Senior White’s character, “I think he just found it amusing...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Pavilion Master Chu said, “The space here is locked. I can sense dozens of spatial confinement techniques.”","Sister White Dragon said proudly, “That’s because this is the Lock Immortal Prison. When we designed it, our goal was to create a forbidden area that even Immortals would have a hard time escaping from. It is our proudest creation.”","“You must have never thought that you would, one day, be locked inside this Lock Immortal Prison, falling into your own trap, did you?” Pavilion Master Chu taunted.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","“Senior Chu, what is Senior White doing right now?” Sixteen quickly changed the subject.","After sensing White’s state, Pavilion Master Chu said, “He seems to be... meditating?”","Well, it was Senior White. This was to be expected.","“Eh? There are other people imprisoned in this Lock Immortal Prison,” said Pavilion Master Chu. Her divine sense’s scanning power was limited in this place, so she could not see who was locked up in the cell next door.","When Pavilion Master Chu sensed the other party, the fellow daoist next door also felt her scanning.","Immediately afterward, a familiar male voice sounded. “Eh? Little friend Shuhang, why are you here?”","An acquaintance?","This voice...","Sixteen said, “Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber?”","Thrice Reckless’s voice stood out, just like his personality. As such, Sixteen recognized him right away.","But how did Senior Thrice Reckless end up imprisoned in this Immortal Lock Prison?","What did he do to offend the members of the Ancient Heavenly City?","After learning that Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was also imprisoned here, Sixteen’s first thought was not ‘Why did the Heavenly City members arrest Thrice Reckless?’ but rather ‘What had Senior Thrice Reckless done to provoke them?’","“It’s not little friend Shuhang.” At this time, a female voice sounded. “It’s Fellow Daoist White. He’s using a disguise.”","It was Fairy Skylark’s voice.","“A disguise?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was taken aback. “Senior Skylark, how can you be so sure that it’s Senior White if this is a disguise?”","Skylark smiled coyly and said, “It’s very simple. Apart from Fellow Daoist White, I really can’t think of anyone else who is so handsome even when lying motionless on the ground.”"]}]);
